d her excitement and gratitude towards the pageant organizers and the judges, stating that it was a dream come true for her to win the title. Aishwarya mentioned that the pageant was a platform for her to showcase her talent, and she is thrilled to have been able to do so. She also thanked her family and friends for their support throughout her journey.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other activities like a song launch, actress launch, and dance performance were also organized in this mega beauty pageant, which lasted for four days. Overall, the event was a huge success, and the winners of the pageant expressed their excitement and gratitude towards the organizers for providing them with an opportunity to showcase their talent and achieve their dreams.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-11 : 01:04:58'),
