us categories to showcase their beauty, talent, and personality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Aasha Bisht&#39;s victory in the State Winner category of the G2 category is a testament to her hard work, dedication, and talent. Her achievement is not only a source of pride for herself but also for the state of Uttarakhand.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-20 : 09:04:24'),
(35, 25, 'Allahabad City winner Neha Khare Miss India 2022', 21, 20, 1, '8,8,9,10,10,11,12,12,13,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686829507.png', 'Allahabad City winner Miss India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Neha-Khare-from-Allahabad-won-the-City-Title-in-Miss-India-2022', 'Allahabad City winner Neha Khare Miss India 2022', 'Allahabad City winner Neha Khare Miss India 2022', 'Allahabad City winner Neha Khare Miss India 2022', 'neha khare miss india 2022', 'allahabad city winner neha khare 2022', 'city winner miss India 2022 neha khare ', 'Allahabad City winner Neha Khare Miss India 2022', 'neha khare allahabad winner 2022', 'Neha Khare from Allahabad, won the City Title in Miss India 2022', 'https://newsforever.in/Neha-Khare-from-Allahabad-won-the-City-Title-in-Miss-India-2022', 'Allahabad City winner Neha Khare Miss India 2022, For four days, along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, various other activities were also organized such as song launch, actress launch, dance performances, etc. in this mega beauty pageant.', 'assets/img/blog/1686829523.png', '<p>&quot;Forever Miss, Misses, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2,&quot; India&#39;s most significant national-level beauty pageant, was hosted by Forever Star India at the luxurious Marriott Hotel on Tonk Road in Jaipur, the capital of Rajasthan, on September 16th to 19th.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contestants from different states across the country walked the ramp in stunning dresses and showcased their talents in this thrilling competition. The winners were crowned with magnificent sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates, making it a night to remember.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Neha Khare from Allahabad, Uttar Pradesh, was honored with the Winning Title of City Winner in Miss and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2, in the Miss and Mrs category. Neha was crowned during the event and expressed her feelings of joy and gratitude.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But it wasn&#39;t just about the competition. This mega beauty pageant lasted for four days and featured exciting activities such as song launches, actress launches, dance performances, and of course, the crowning ceremony of the winners. The event was a true celebration of beauty, talent, and fashion, making it an unforgettable experience for everyone involved.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-21 : 07:04:38'),
