er activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-22 : 09:04:55'),
(37, 25, 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 21, 8, 1, '8,9,10,11,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/cb1cccc67c4a74bfad080765e881df2c.jpeg', 'G-1 Categroy Gujarat winner Mrs India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Nisha-Goswami-from-Gujarat-has-won-the-title-of-First-Runner-up-in-G1-category', 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'Mrs India 2022, 1st runner-up Gujarat, G-1 Category winner Nisha Goswami 2022', 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat Mrs. India 2022, Mrs. Nisha Goswami from Gujarat was honored with the first runner-up winning the title in the Miss, Mrs, Teen 2022 Season 2 Category 1 and was crowned.', 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat', 'Nisha Goswami Mrs India 2022 First Runner-up', 'Mrs G-1 Category winner Nisha Goswami', 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'Nisha Goswami from Gujarat has won the title of First Runner-up in G1 category', 'https://newsforever.in/Nisha-Goswami-from-Gujarat-has-won-the-title-of-First-Runner-up-in-G1-category', 'Nisha Goswami First Runner-up in G1 Category Gujarat Mrs India 2022, Mrs Nisha Goswami from Gujarat was honored with the first runner-up winning title in the Miss, Mrs, Teen 2022 Season 2 category 1 and was crowned.', 'assets/img/blog/cb1cccc67c4a74bfad080765e881df2c.jpeg', '<p>The state crowning round of Forever Miss, Mrs and Teen 2022 Season 2, the biggest national-level beauty pageant in India, organized by Forever Star India, was held at the Marriott Hotel on Tonk Road in the capital city of Jaipur from September 16th to 19th.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Winners from different states across the country participated in the event and were crowned with sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates. During the event, the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Nisha Goswami from Gujarat was honored with the first runner-up winning title in the Miss, Mrs, Teen 2022 Season 2 category 1 and was crowned.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This mega beauty pageant lasted for four days and included activities such as the winner&#39;s crowning ceremony, song launch, actress launch, dance performances, and other activities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-22 : 09:04:41'),
(38, 25, 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey', 21, 6, 1, '8,9,10,11,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1686829243.png', 'Miss Amravati  Maharashtra 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Sonia-Pandey-from-Amravati-Maharashtra-won-the-City-Winner-title-in-Miss-India-2022', 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey', 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey', 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey', 'miss amravati 2022', 'sonia pandey miss amravati Maharashtra 2022', 'miss sonia pandey winner 2022 maharashtra ', 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey', 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey', 'Forever Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey ', 'https://newsforever.in/Sonia-Pandey-from-Amravati-Maharashtra-won-the-City-Winner-title-in-Miss-India-2022', 'Miss Amravati 2022 winner Sonia Pandey, Sonia Pandey from Amravati, Maharashtra was honored with the Winning Title of City Winner in the Miss Category at Forever Miss Miss Teen 2022.', 'assets/img/blog/1686745269.png', '<p>Sonia Pandey from Amravati, Maharashtra was honored with the winning title of the city winner in the Miss category at Forever Miss Misses Teen 2022 and crowned during the state winner crowning round of the largest national-level beauty pageant in India, Forever Star India, held at the Marriott Hotel on Tonk Road in Jaipur from September 16 to 19, organized by Forever Miss, Misses and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Winners from different states across the country participated in the event and were crowned with sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates. During the event, the winners also walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;The four-day mega beauty pageant also featured other activities such as song launches, actress launches, and dance performances.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-23 : 12:04:42'),
(39, 25, 'Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner Valsad, Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 21, 6, 1, '8,9,10,11,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1686746435.png', 'Mrs Valsad, Gujarat 2022 ', '', '', '', '', 'Mrs-India-2022-Priya-Ankit-Parmar-City-Winner-from-Valsad-Gujarat', 'Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner Valsad, Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner Valsad, Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner Valsad, Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'mrs india 2022', 'mrs priya ankit gujarat city winner 2022', 'valsad city winner mrs priya ankit 2022', 'priya ankit parmar mrs India 2022', 'Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner Valsad, Gujarat Mrs India 2022', 'Mrs India 2022 Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner from Valsad, Gujarat', 'https://newsforever.in/Mrs-India-2022-Priya-Ankit-Parmar-City-Winner-from-Valsad-Gujarat', 'Priya Ankit Parmar City Winner Valsad, Gujarat Mrs. India 2022, Mega beauty pageant, which lasted for four days, along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, other activities like song launch, actress launch, and dance performance were also special.', 'assets/img/blog/0819e1079f8ab9bff2d9e737244122c8.jpg', '<p>The State Winner Crowning Round of India&#39;s largest national level beauty pageant &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2&quot; was organized by Forever Star India from 16 to 19 September at Hotel Marriott located on Tonk Road in the capital Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In which the winners from different states across the country were crowned by giving sash, crown, trophy, and certificate. Along with this, the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Priya Ankit Parmar of Valsad, Gujarat was awarded the winning title of City Winner in the G1 Mrs category in Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022 and was crowned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In this mega beauty pageant, which lasted for four days, along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, other activities like song launch, actress launch, and dance performance were also special.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-23 : 01:04:52'),
(40, 25, 'Bipasha Mandal winner Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 21, 8, 2, '8,8,9,10,11,12,12,13,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686829279.png', 'Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', '', '', '', '', 'mrs-diva-maharashtra-2022-bipasha-mandal', 'Bipasha Mandal winner Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'mrs diva maharashtra winner 2022, bipasha mandal, mrs dive maharashtra', 'Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022 - Bipasha Mandal winner of Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022, Bipasha Mandal was awarded the winning title of Mrs Diva in G2 category in Forever Mrs India 2022.', 'Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'Bipasha Mandal Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'Bipasha Mandal Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'Bipasha Mandal Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'Bipasha Mandal winner Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022', 'https://newsforever.in/mrs-diva-maharashtra-2022-bipasha-mandal', 'Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022 - Bipasha Mandal winner of Mrs Diva Maharashtra 2022, Bipasha Mandal was awarded the winning title of Mrs Diva in G2 category in Forever Mrs India 2022.', 'assets/img/blog/96ae6b73b8ff0887b0a5d367ae8ebfa6.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The State Winner Crowning Round of India&#39;s largest national level beauty pageant &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2&quot; was organized by Forever Star India from 16 to 19 September at Hotel Marriott located on Tonk Road in the capital Jaipur. The event attracted a huge crowd of participants from across the country, all vying for the coveted title. The pageant was a celebration of beauty, grace, and talent, and showcased the best of what India has to offer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">During the event, the winners from different states across the country were crowned by giving sash, crown, trophy and certificate. The excitement was palpable as the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talent. It was a sight to behold as the contestants put their best foot forward and wowed the judges with their charisma and confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Mrs. Maharashtra Bipasha Mandal was awarded the winning title of Mrs. Diva in G2 category in Forever Miss Mrs. Teen 2022 and was crowned. It was a moment of pride for Mrs. Mandal as she emerged as the winner among the many talented contestants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The four-day event was a grand spectacle, with a host of activities that kept the audience entertained throughout. Along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, other activities like song launch, actress launch, dance performance were also special. The audience was treated to some scintillating performances by some of the most talented artists in the industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The event was a huge success, and the organizers were pleased with the turnout and the response. They expressed their gratitude to everyone who participated in the event and made it a grand success. The contestants too were overwhelmed with the experience and expressed their joy at being a part of such a prestigious event.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 was a celebration of beauty, talent, and grace, and showcased the best of what India has to offer. The event was a testament to the fact that beauty comes in all shapes and sizes, and that every woman has the potential to shine. It was a platform for women to showcase their talent and pursue their dreams, and the winners were a true inspiration to all those who participated</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-23 : 07:04:38');
