(41, 25, 'Soma Nandi 1st Runner-Up Mrs West Bengal 2022', 21, 6, 1, '8,10,11,12,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686828101.png', 'Mrs West Bengal 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-West-Bengal-2022-1st-runner-up-Soma-Nandi-', 'Soma Nandi 1st Runner-Up Mrs West Bengal 2022', 'mrs india 2022, 1st runner-up soma nandi 2022, soma nandi west bengal 2022', 'Soma Nandi 1st Runner-Up Mrs West Bengal 2022: Soma Nandi from west Bengal won Mrs West Bengal 2022 title at 1st Runner Up Position.', 'mrs west bengal 2022', '1st runner-up mrs west bengal 2022 soma nandi', 'soma nandi mrs west bengal 2022', 'Soma Nandi 1st runner-up Mrs West Bengal 2022', 'Soma Nandi 1st runner-up Mrs West Bengal 2022', 'Forever Mrs West Bengal 2022 1st runner up Soma Nandi  ', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-West-Bengal-2022-1st-runner-up-Soma-Nandi-', 'Soma Nandi 1st Runner-Up Mrs West Bengal 2022: Soma Nandi from west Bengal won Mrs West Bengal 2022 title at 1st Runner Up Position.', 'assets/img/blog/1686828115.png', '<p>Forever Star India, the leading beauty pageant organization in India, has organized the State Winner Crowning Round of the &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2&quot; at Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur. The event took place from 16th to 19th September 2022 and saw the crowning of winners from different states across the country.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pageant, which is the largest national-level beauty contest in India, witnessed the participants walking the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcasing their talents. The winners were awarded sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates, and were given the opportunity to represent their states at the national level.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the highlights of the event was the crowning of Mrs Soma Nandi from West Bengal, who was awarded the winning title of First Runnerup in the G2 Category in Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022. Mrs Nandi expressed her gratitude and excitement about the experience, stating, &quot;It is an honour to represent my state at this prestigious pageant. I am grateful to Forever Star India for allowing me to showcase my talents and meet so many wonderful people.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apart from the crowning ceremony, the event also featured other activities such as song launches, actress launches, and dance performances, making it a memorable four-day affair. The pageant organisers expressed their satisfaction with the turnout and congratulated all the winners for their exceptional performances. Forever Star India looks forward to hosting more such events to promote and empower women across the country.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-23 : 08:04:26'),
(42, 25, 'Suhani Sharma Miss Teen Rajasthan State Winner 2022', 21, 8, 2, '8,9,12,12,13,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/18bfaea094e7571f77692a74e8c56488.jpg', 'Miss Teen Rajasthan 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Miss-Teen-2022-Suhani-Sharma-', 'Suhani Sharma Miss Teen Rajasthan State Winner 2022 ', 'miss india 2022, miss rajasthan 2022, state winner 2022, miss teen state winner 2022', 'Suhani Sharma Miss Teen Rajasthan State Winner 2022, Biggest national level beauty pageant in India. The event was held at Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur from September 16 to 19.', 'suhani sharma miss teen india 2022', 'state winner suhani sharma 2022', 'rajasthan state winner miss suhani sharma', 'Suhani Sharma Miss Teen Rajasthan State Winner 2022 ', 'Suhani Sharma Miss Teen Rajasthan State Winner 2022 ', 'Forever Miss Teen 2022 Suhani Sharma ', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Miss-Teen-2022-Suhani-Sharma-', 'Suhani Sharma Miss Teen Rajasthan State Winner 2022, Biggest national level beauty pageant in India. The event was held at Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur from September 16 to 19.', 'assets/img/blog/18bfaea094e7571f77692a74e8c56488.jpg', '<p>The mega beauty pageant took place for four days and included various activities, such as song launches, actress launches, and dance performances, in addition to the crowning ceremony for the winners. Forever Star India organized the state winner crowning round of &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs. and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2,&quot; which is the biggest national-level beauty pageant in India. The event was held at Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur from September 16 to 19.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>During the event, winners from different states across the country were crowned with sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates. They walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talents, adding to the glamour and excitement of the event. Miss Teen Suhani Sharma was awarded the winning title in the Teen category of Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 State Winner and was crowned as the winner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was a massive success, with participants from various states showcasing their skills and competing in different categories. The organizers left no stone unturned to ensure that the participants had a memorable experience, and the audience was entertained thoroughly. The winners were ecstatic to have won, and the event was a stepping stone toward their dreams of pursuing a career in the beauty industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Throughout the four days, the audience was treated to a spectacle of beauty and glamour. The contestants exuded confidence and poise as they walked the ramp, making it difficult for the judges to select the winners. The judges had a tough time selecting the winners as each participant was talented and had unique qualities that set them apart.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apart from the crowning ceremony, there were several other activities organized during the event. The audience was treated to song launches, actress launches, and dance performances, making it a wholesome experience for everyone in attendance. The event was a perfect platform for aspiring models and beauty pageant contestants to showcase their talents and get recognized.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was well-organized, with the organizers taking care of every detail. The contestants were well taken care of, and the event was conducted in a safe and secure environment. The participants were provided with everything they needed, from makeup and costumes to accommodation and transport, making it a hassle-free experience for them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, the event was a massive success, with participants and audience members alike enjoying the spectacle of beauty and glamour. The winners were ecstatic to have won, and the event was a stepping stone toward their dreams of pursuing a career in the beauty industry. Forever Star India and the organizers should be commended for putting together such a well-organized and entertaining event, and we can only hope that the next edition of the beauty pageant is even bigger and better</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-24 : 01:04:32'),
(43, 25, 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi', 21, 8, 1, '8,9,10,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686829326.png', 'Mrs Gujarat 2022 ', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-Gujarat-2022-first-Runner-up-Sejal-Rahul-Trivedi-', 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi', 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi', 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi', 'Mrs Gujarat winner sejal rahul 2022', 'first runner-up sejal rahul trivedi', 'sejal rahul mrs gujarat', 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi', 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi', 'Forever Mrs Gujarat 2022 first Runner-up Sejal Rahul Trivedi ', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-Gujarat-2022-first-Runner-up-Sejal-Rahul-Trivedi-', 'First Runner-up Mrs Gujarat 2022 Sejal Rahul Trivedi, Mrs Sejal Rahul Trivedi from Gujarat, made her state proud by winning the title of First Runner-Up in the G2 category at the Forever Miss Mrs, Teen 2022 beauty pageant.', 'assets/img/blog/1686829341.png', '<p>Mrs Sejal Rahul Trivedi from Gujarat, made her state proud by winning the title of First Runner-Up in the G2 category at the Forever Miss Mrs, Teen 2022 beauty pageant. The event was held from September 16 to 19, 2022, at the Marriott Hotel on Tonk Road in Jaipur, Rajasthan, and was organized by Forever Star India, the country&#39;s largest national-level beauty pageant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Sejal impressed the judges with her poise, grace, and beauty, and was crowned with a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate at the State Winner Crowning Round. She also walked the ramp in a stunning dress and showcased her talents, which included singing and dancing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 was a mega event that attracted participants from different states across the country. The four-day event included a range of activities, such as song launches, actress launches, dance performances, and other cultural events, in addition to the crowning ceremony of the winners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Sejal&#39;s family and friends were elated by her achievement and congratulated her on social media. Her family expressed their pride and joy, saying that they had always known that their daughter was talented and beautiful and that she had worked hard to achieve this success.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Sejal herself was overwhelmed with happiness and gratitude, thanking her family, friends, and supporters for their encouragement and support. She said that winning the title was a dream come true for her and that she hoped to use her platform to inspire other women to follow their dreams and pursue their passions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 was a huge success, and the organizers were pleased with the turnout and the enthusiasm of the participants. They said that the event had provided a platform for young women to showcase their talents and skills and that it had helped to promote the ideals of beauty, grace, and intelligence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, Mrs Sejal&#39;s achievement was a testament to her hard work, dedication, and talent, and it was a proud moment for her family, her state, and her country. Her success will inspire other women to pursue their dreams and to believe in themselves, and it will serve as a reminder of the power of perseverance and determination.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-24 : 02:04:33'),
(44, 25, 'Dr. Latika Devangan winner in G2 category Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh', 21, 20, 1, '8,9,9,10,11,12,12,13,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/1685527390.png', ' Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-India-2022-Chattisgarh-winner-in-G2-category-Dr-Latika-Devangan', 'Dr. Latika Devangan winner in G2 category Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh', 'mrs india 2022, mrs chattigarh 2022, latika devangan mrs chattisgarh winner 2022, mrs chattisgarh latika devangan 2022', 'Dr. Latika Devangan winner in G2 category Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh, The finale day was the most awaited day of the event, as the state winners were to be crowned.', 'mrs chattisgarh 2022', 'latika devangan winner 2022', 'latika devangan g2 category mrs chattisgarh 2022', 'mrs chattisgarh winner latika devangan 2022', 'Dr. Latika Devangan winner in G2 category Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh', 'Forever Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh winner in G2 category Dr. Latika Devangan', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-India-2022-Chattisgarh-winner-in-G2-category-Dr-Latika-Devangan', 'Dr. Latika Devangan winner in G2 category Mrs India 2022 Chattisgarh, The finale day was the most awaited day of the event, as the state winners were to be crowned.', 'assets/img/blog/0ac4ad309337adc9ee53d39fbef92ea7.jpg', '<p>The event witnessed a huge turnout, with people from different parts of the country coming to witness the crowning of state winners. The judging panel consisted of eminent personalities from the fashion and entertainment industry, who evaluated the participants on various parameters, such as their confidence, talent, and presentation skills. The judges were impressed by the participants&#39; performance, which made it a tough competition to select the winners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event kicked off with an opening ceremony where the participants introduced themselves and shared their aspirations. The contestants then went through various rounds, including a talent round, where they showcased their skills in singing, dancing, painting, or any other talent they had. The judges evaluated the contestants based on their creativity, originality, and overall impact.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The finale day was the most awaited day of the event, as the state winners were to be crowned. The excitement among the participants was palpable as they walked the ramp in their beautiful dresses, exuding grace and charm. The judges evaluated them on their poise, posture, and overall presentation. After a tough competition, the state winners were announced, and the winners received their crowns, sashes, and trophies amidst thunderous applause.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. Latika Devangan, who won the Winning Title of State Winner in the G2 category, expressed her excitement and gratitude after winning the title. She said that participating in this pageant was a dream come true for her, and winning the state-level competition had boosted her confidence to a great extent. She also thanked her family, friends, and supporters who had encouraged her throughout the journey.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The organizers of Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 expressed their satisfaction with the event&#39;s success. They said that the event had provided a platform for young girls and married women to showcase their talents and boost their confidence. They added that the event was not just about physical beauty but also about personality, intelligence, and talent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In conclusion, the State Winner Crowning Round of Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 was a huge success, with participants showcasing their talents and winning the hearts of the judges and the audience alike. Dr. Latika Devangan from Chhattisgarh emerged as the Winning Title of State Winner in the G2 category,</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-24 : 09:04:15'),
(45, 25, 'Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022', 21, 20, 1, '5,5,8,8,9,10,11,12,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686746395.png', '2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-India-2022-Leena-Khanna-2nd-Runner-up-from-Punjab-', 'Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022', 'Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022', 'Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022', 'leena khanna 2nd runner-up 2022', '2nd runner-up punjab leena khanna 2022', '2nd runner-up mrs india 2022', 'Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022', 'leena khanna mrs India 2022', 'Forever Mrs India 2022 Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up  from Punjab ', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-India-2022-Leena-Khanna-2nd-Runner-up-from-Punjab-', 'Leena Khanna 2nd Runner-up from Punjab Mrs India 2022, Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 is the largest national-level beauty pageant in India, and it is organized annually by Forever Star India.', 'assets/img/blog/3d50440b34c4b341e64e4cfaf10e7bcc.jpg', '<p>The State Winner Crowning Round of India&rsquo;s largest national level beauty pageant, &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2&quot;, was organized by Forever Star India from 16 to 19 September at Hotel Marriott located on Tonk Road in the capital Jaipur. The winners from different states across the country participated in the event and were crowned by giving sash, crown, trophy, and certificate. The winners also walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talent during the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the most notable winners of the competition was Mrs. Leena Khanna from Punjab, who was awarded the winning title of second runner-up in the G2 category of Forever Miss Mrs. Teen 2022 and was crowned. Leena Khanna competed against other contestants from different states and proved her worth by showcasing her unique talent and beauty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event lasted for four days and was full of various activities and performances. In addition to the crowning ceremony of the winners, there were also other special activities such as song launch, actress launch, and dance performances. The audience was entertained by various cultural performances, and the contestants had the opportunity to showcase their skills and talents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 is the largest national-level beauty pageant in India, and it is organized annually by Forever Star India. The competition aims to provide a platform for young women to showcase their talents and beauty and to encourage them to pursue their dreams. The event has gained immense popularity in recent years and has become a prestigious event for contestants across the country.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The winners of the competition were overjoyed to receive the recognition and expressed their gratitude to the organizers and the judges. The competition was judged by a panel of experts from the beauty and fashion industry, who evaluated the contestants based on various criteria, including their beauty, talent, and confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was a grand success and received praise from the attendees and the media. The organizers were applauded for their efforts in providing a platform for young women to showcase their talents and for promoting beauty and confidence among women. The contestants also received praise for their exceptional performances and their dedication to the competition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 was a spectacular event that showcased the beauty and talent of young women from different states across India. The winners of the competition proved that beauty is not just skin deep and that confidence and talent are equally important in achieving success.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-24 : 09:04:49'),
(46, 25, 'Audition Date Announced Miss India 2023', 21, 0, 2, '8,9,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686746340.png', 'Miss India 2023 audition date ', '', '', '', '', 'Miss-India-2023-audition-date-announced', 'Audition Date Announced Miss India 2023', 'Audition Date Announced Miss India 2023', 'Audition Date Announced Miss India 2023', 'Fashion, Modelling ', 'beauty pageants', 'Mumbai, Delhi ', '', '', 'Miss India 2023 audition date announced', ' https://newsforever.in/Miss India 2023 audition date announced', 'The much-awaited auditions for Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2023 Season 4 are finally here.', 'assets/img/blog/b6754ad244c10ff51e5274026d2ef41b.jpg', '<p>The much-awaited auditions for Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2023 Season 4 are finally here. The auditions will be held virtually on Zoom; this is the first and only platform that offers<strong> live streaming on YouTube and the Forever Star India OTT platform.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong>Here are the upcoming audition dates and times for the different categories, as follows:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>April 27th, 6:30 PM: Miss/Teen</li>\r\n	<li>April 28th, 6:30 PM: Miss, Teen/Mrs India</li>\r\n	<li>April 29th, 6:30 PM: Miss/Teen/Mrs India</li>\r\n	<li>May 2nd, 5:00 PM: Miss/Teen/Mrs India</li>\r\n	<li>May 4th, 3:00 PM: Miss/Teen/Mrs India</li>\r\n	<li>May 6th, 6:00 PM: Miss/Teen/Mrs India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen pageant is an annual event that celebrates beauty, talent, and intelligence. It is a platform for women to showcase their skills, build their confidence, and pursue their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pageant is open to young women aged between 13 and 18 for the Teen category, 18 and unmarried for the Miss category, and for the Mrs. category, it is divided into two groups: G1, for married ladies aged between 20 and 35, and G2, for married ladies aged between 36 and 50.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The auditions will be conducted virtually, allowing women from all parts of India to participate in the pageant. The contestants will be judged based on their poise, grace, and confidence, as well as their talent and intellect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The winners of the Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen pageants will receive a range of prizes, including a crown, swash, frame certificate, trophy, gift hampers, and a chance to represent India in international beauty pageants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pageant has gained immense popularity over the years and has become a launchpad for many young women to pursue careers in the entertainment industry. The pageant has produced several successful models, actors, and entrepreneurs who credit their success to the confidence and exposure they gained through the pageant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, if you are a woman with talent, poise, and grace, do not miss this opportunity to participate in the Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2023 Season 4 auditions. Register today and take the first step towards fulfilling your dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Click here to register yourself</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\">Forever Miss India 2023</a></strong><br />\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-mrs-india-new.php\">Forever Mrs India 2023</a></strong><br />\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\">Forever Miss Teen India 2023</a></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-28 : 03:04:48'),
(47, 25, 'Meet Shilpi Banerjee, our Trainer & Groomer', 21, 29, 2, '8,9,12,12,13,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686829170.png', 'Mrs. FSAI International 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Mrs-FSAI-International-2022-winner-Shilpi-Banerjee', 'Meet Shilpi Banerjee, our Trainer & Groomer', 'Meet Shilpi Banerjee, our Trainer & Groomer', 'Meet Shilpi Banerjee, our Trainer & Groomer', 'shilpi trainer & groomer 2022', 'fsia international 2022', 'shilpi banerjee', 'Meet Shilpi Banerjee, our Trainer & Groomer', 'Shilpi Banerjee Mrs. FSAI International 2022', 'Meet our Trainer & Groomer, Shilpi Banerjee', 'https://newsforever.in/Mrs-FSAI-International-2022-winner-Shilpi-Banerjee', 'Meet Shilpi Banerjee, our Trainer & Groomer, Shilpi Banerjee\'s journey to success has been nothing short of inspiring. As an Army wife, she has faced numerous challenges and obstacles; however, she has always persevered and never given up. She is a true r', 'assets/img/blog/1686829195.png', '<p>Shilpi Banerjee, an Army wife, an educationist, a counsellor, a model, and now a groomer and trainer for Forever Star India Season 4, has been crowned the Mrs FSIA International winner of 2022. This remarkable achievement is a testament to her hard work, dedication, and commitment to excellence in all her endeavours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shilpi Banerjee&#39;s journey to success has been nothing short of inspiring. As an Army wife, she has faced numerous challenges and obstacles; however, she has always persevered and never given up. She is a true role model for women everywhere who aspire to achieve great things in life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aside from being an Army wife, Shilpi Banerjee is also an accomplished educator and counsellor. She has dedicated her life to helping young people achieve their dreams and reach their full potential. Her passion for education and counselling has earned her numerous accolades and recognition from her peers and colleagues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition to her professional achievements, Shilpi Banerjee is also a talented model. She has walked for an international beauty pageant. Her beauty, grace, and poise have made her a sought-after model in the fashion world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, as the groomer and trainer for Forever Star India Season 4, Shilpi Banerjee is helping aspiring models and actors achieve their dreams. She is sharing her knowledge and expertise with the next generation of talent and inspiring them to reach for the stars.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shilpi Banerjee is a remarkable woman who has achieved great success in many different fields. Her dedication, hard work, and commitment to excellence have made her a true inspiration to women everywhere. We congratulate her on her well-deserved victory as the Mrs FSIA International winner of 2022 and wish her all the best in her future endeavours.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-28 : 11:04:11'),
(48, 25, 'Meet Manushi Parmar our Trainer, 1st Runner-up Miss Teen India 2022', 21, 30, 2, '8,9,12,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686745023.png', ' Miss Teen India 2022 Manushi Parmar', '', '', '', '', 'Meet-our-trainer-Manushi-Parmar-1st-Runner-Up-from-Forever-Miss-Teen-India-2022', 'Meet Manushi Parmar our Trainer, 1st Runner-up Miss Teen India 2022', 'Meet Manushi Parmar our Trainer, 1st Runner-up Miss Teen India 2022', 'Meet Manushi Parmar our Trainer, 1st Runner-up Miss Teen India 2022', 'Fashion, Modelling ', 'beauty pageants', 'Mumbai, Delhi ', 'Mrs International, Miss India', ' International beauty pageant', 'Meet our Trainer, Manushi Parmar, 1st Runner Up from Forever Miss Teen India 2022', 'https://newsforever.in/Meet our trainer, Manushi Parmar, 1st Runner Up from Forever Miss Teen India 2022', 'Manushi Parmar came to fame when she participated in the Forever Miss Teen India and emerged as the 1st runner-up. Her grace, poise, and beauty won the hearts of the judges and the audience alike. Since then, she has been making waves on social media with', 'assets/img/blog/b4ae45ec8c393c056917a387888c1ae4.jpg', '<p>Manushi Parmar is a name that needs no introduction. She is a well-known influencer on Instagram, Forever Miss Teen India 1st Runner Up, and now a trainer for the upcoming season 4 of Forever Star India. But that&#39;s not all; she is all set to join her father in the real estate business in the near future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nManushi Parmar came to fame when she participated in the Forever Miss Teen India and emerged as the 1st runner-up. Her grace, poise, and beauty won the hearts of the judges and the audience alike. Since then, she has been making waves on social media with her stunning photos and engaging content. Her Instagram profile boasts a massive following.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nBut Manushi&#39;s ambitions don&#39;t coincide with social media fame. She is a woman with a strong entrepreneurial spirit and has decided to join her father in the real estate business. The decision comes as no surprise since her father has been in the business for a decade and has established a name for himself in the industry. Manushi is excited to take the legacy forward and utilise her skills and knowledge to expand the family business.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nApart from her real estate venture, Manushi is additionally gearing up for her role as a trainer for the upcoming season 4 of Forever Star India. She will be coaching aspiring models and helping them to construct their skills and reach their full potential. Manushi is thrilled to take on this role and hopes to inspire and motivate the contestants to achieve their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nManushi Parmar is a multi-talented woman who has achieved a lot at a young age. Her passion, drive, and determination have helped her reach where she is today. Whether it&#39;s as an influencer, a real estate entrepreneur, or a trainer, Manushi is sure to make her mark and leave a lasting impression. We wish her all the best in her future endeavours!<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 12:04:16'),
(50, 25, 'Dr Garima Sharma 1st Runner-up Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022', 21, 8, 1, '8,8,9,9,12,12,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/be2d6d61d3c4c6243e6792efb1c7a644.jpg', 'Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-Uttar-Pradesh-2022-1st-Runner-Up-Dr-Garima-Sharma', 'Dr Garima Sharma 1st Runner-up Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022', 'Dr Garima Sharma 1st Runner-up Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022', 'Dr Garima Sharma 1st Runner-up Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022', 'mrs uttar pradesh winner 2022', 'garima sharma 1st runner-up uttar pradesh 2022', 'mrs uttar pradesh 2022 garima sharma', 'mrs urrar pradesh 2022 garima sharma', 'Dr Garima Sharma 1st Runner-up Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022', 'Forever Mrs Uttar Pradesh 2022 1st Runner-Up Dr Garima Sharma ', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-Uttar-Pradesh-2022-1st-Runner-Up-Dr-Garima-Sharma', 'Dr Garima Sharma 1st Runner-up Uttar Pradesh  Mrs India 2022, Dr Garima Sharma, hailing from Uttar Pradesh, has made her state proud by winning the title of First Runner-Up in the G1 category at the Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022 beauty pageant held at the Ma', 'assets/img/blog/1686745997.png', '<p>Dr Garima Sharma, hailing from Uttar Pradesh, has made her state proud by winning the title of First Runner-Up in the G1 category at the Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022 beauty pageant held at the Marriott Hotel in Jaipur, Rajasthan, from September 16 to 19, 2022. The event was organised by Forever Star India, the largest national-level beauty pageant in the country. Mrs Sharma stood out among the participants with her poise, grace, and beauty and was crowned with a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate at the State Winner Crowning Round. She, therefore, impressed the judges with her singing and dancing skills while showcasing her talent on the ramp in a stunning dress.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day mega event, Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2, witnessed participants from different states across the country and included a range of activities, such as song launches, actress launches, dance performances, and other cultural events, in addition to the crowning ceremony of the winners. Mrs Sharma&#39;s family and friends expressed their joy and congratulated her on social media, stating that they had always believed in her talent and hard work, leading to this success.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Sharma was overwhelmed with happiness and gratitude and thanked her family, friends, and supporters for their encouragement and support. She expressed her desire to utilise her platform to inspire other women to follow their dreams and pursue their passions. The organisers were pleased with the turnout and enthusiasm of the participants and said that the event had provided a platform for youthful women to showcase their talents and skills while promoting the ideals of beauty, grace, and intelligence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, Mrs. Sharma&#39;s achievement is a testament to her hard work, dedication, and talent, and is a proud moment for her family, state, and country. Her success will inspire other women to pursue their dreams and believe in themselves, reminding us of the power of perseverance and determination.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 02:04:36'),
(51, 25, 'Mrs India 2022 Manisha Tiwari 1st Runner-up Punjab', 21, 8, 1, '5,8,8,9,9,10,11,12,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686829607.png', '1st runner-up Punjab Mrs India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-Punjab-2022-1st-Runner-up-Manisha-Tiwari', 'Mrs India 2022 Manisha Tiwari 1st Runner-up Punjab', 'Mrs India 2022 Manisha Tiwari 1st Runner-up Punjab', 'Mrs India 2022 Manisha Tiwari 1st Runner-up Punjab', 'manisha tiwari 1st runner-up 2022', 'manisha tiwari 1st runner-up mrs india 2022', 'manisha tiwari mrs india 2022', 'Mrs India 2022 Manisha Tiwari 1st Runner-up Punjab', 'punjab 1st runner-up 2022 manisha tiwari', 'Forever Mrs Punjab 2022: 1st Runner-up Manisha Tiwari', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-Punjab-2022-1st-Runner-up-Manisha-Tiwari', 'Mrs. India 2022 Manisha Tiwari 1st Runner-up Punjab, The Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 pageant is a significant national-level beauty pageant in India, attracting participants from various states who compete in different categories to sho', 'assets/img/blog/1686828379.png', '<p>Mrs. Manisha Tiwari, who was the first runner-up of the Mrs. Punjab title in the Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 pageant, has now achieved the State Winner title in the G2 category. The event was organized by Forever Star India and lasted for four days, from September 16 to 19, at the Marriott Hotel in Jaipur. Mrs. Tiwari and other state winners participated in various activities, including a crowning ceremony, a song launch,&nbsp; dance performances, and more. Mrs. Tiwari was awarded a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate for her exceptional performance and talent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Forever Miss, Mrs, and Miss Teen 2022 Season 2 pageant is a significant national-level beauty pageant in India, attracting participants from various states who compete in different categories to showcase their beauty, talent, and personality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs. Tiwari expressed her gratitude and happiness and thanked her family, friends, and supporters for their encouragement and support. She aims to use her platform to inspire other women to follow their dreams and pursue their passions. The organizers were pleased with the turnout and enthusiasm of the participants, saying that the event promoted the ideals of beauty, grace, and intelligence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs. Tiwari&#39;s victory in the G2 category&#39;s State Winner title demonstrates her hard work, dedication, and talent. Her achievement brings pride not only to herself but also to the state of Punjab. Overall, the event was a great success, showcasing the best of beauty and talent from across India.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 02:04:42'),
(52, 25, 'Meet our Turned Trainer and Groomer Anshu Khanna Forever Mrs India Season 2', 21, 30, 1, '8,8,9,9,10,11,12,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/c6b659fe76baf11659ae5d52ce290a7e.jpg', 'Turned Trainer and Groomer Forever Mrs India Season 2', '', '', '', '', 'Meet-Anshu-Khanna-Forever-Mrs-India-Season-2-Winner-Turned-Trainer-and-Groomer', 'Meet our Turned Trainer and Groomer Anshu Khanna Forever Mrs India Season 2', 'mrs india 2022, anshu khanna turned trainer and groomer, mrs india season 2, trainer anshu khanna', 'Meet our Turned Trainer and Groomer Anshu Khanna Forever Mrs India Season 2, Forever Star India is a platform that provides opportunities for women to showcase their talent and fulfill their dreams. Anshu\'s journey from a contestant to a trainer is a testament to the platform\'s commitment to empowering women and helping them achieve', 'traniner and groomer anshu khanna', 'turned trainer and groomer', 'mrs india season 2 trainer and groomer 2022', 'anshu khanna turned trainer and groomer mrs india season 2', 'anshu khanna turned trainer and groomer mrs india season 2', 'Meet Anshu Khanna, Forever Mrs India Season 2 Winner Turned Trainer and Groomer', 'https://newsforever.in/Meet-Anshu-Khanna-Forever-Mrs-India-Season-2-Winner-Turned-Trainer-and-Groomer', 'Meet our Turned Trainer and Groomer Anshu Khanna Forever Mrs India Season 2, Forever Star India is a platform that provides opportunities for women to showcase their talent and fulfill their dreams. Anshu\'s journey from a contestant to a trainer is a test', 'assets/img/blog/a9dcc16c28cff4ff7afcb1671f43b05d.jpg', '<p>Anshu Khanna, the winner of season 2 of Forever Mrs India from Punjab, has now become a trainer &amp; groomer for season 4 of Forever Star India. Anshu is a fun-loving lady who is dedicated to her work and has a positive attitude towards life. She loves to enjoy all the moments and spreads happiness wherever she goes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anshu Khanna has been in the teaching profession for the last 15 years. However, to follow her passion for modelling, she left her job and joined Forever Star India. She participated in season 2 of Forever Mrs India and won the title with grace and confidence. Her journey from a teacher to a model is an inspiration for many women who want to follow their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anshu believes that age is just a number and that anyone can achieve their dreams if they have the dedication and determination to do so. She says that it&#39;s never too late to start something new, and one should never give up on their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a trainer for season 4 of Forever Star India, Anshu is imparting her knowledge and experience to the contestants. She is helping them to groom themselves, build their confidence, and face the challenges of the competition. Mrs Khanna&#39;s positive attitude and friendly nature have made her a favourite among the contestants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anshu Khanna is not only a role model for women who want to follow their passion but also for those who want to maintain a balance between their personal and professional life. She is a mother of two children and manages her work and family with ease. Anshu believes that it&#39;s important to prioritise things in life and give equal importance to both work and family.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India is a platform that provides opportunities for women to showcase their talent and fulfil their dreams. Anshu&#39;s journey from a contestant to a trainer is a testament to the platform&#39;s commitment to empowering women and helping them achieve their goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;Anshu Khanna is an inspiration to many. Her journey from a teacher to a model and now a trainer is proof that age is just a number and one should never give up on their dreams. We wish Anshu all success in her journey and hope that she continues to inspire and motivate many more women in the future.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 03:04:01'),
(53, 25, 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, 19 year old from Maharastra', 21, 30, 2, '8,8,9,10,12,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/84aff00146996e46a0962525e174ebc7.jpeg', 'Maharashtra Shining Star 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Meet-Our-Trainer-Groomer-19-year-old-Rajlaxmi-Chavan-Shrirampur-from-Maharastra', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, 19 year old from Maharastra', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, 19 year old from Maharastra', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, a 19-year-old from Maharastra, Rajlaxmi\'s success story is a testament to the fact that with hard work, dedication, and passion, anything is possible. She has proven that coming from a small village is not a barrier to success, and with the correct attitude and opportunities, anyone is', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer', 'Maharashtra Shining Star 2022', 'trainer from Maharastra 2022', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, 19 year old from Maharastra', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, 19 year old from Maharastra', 'Meet Our Trainer & Groomer: 19-year-old Rajlaxmi Chavan from Maharastra', ' https://newsforever.in/Meet-Our-Trainer-Groomer-19-year-old-Rajlaxmi-Chavan-Shrirampur-from-Maharastra', 'Rajlaxmi Chavan Our Trainer & Groomer, a 19-year-old from Maharastra, Rajlaxmi\'s success story is a testament to the fact that with hard work, dedication, and passion, anything is possible. She has proven that coming from a small village is not a barrier ', 'assets/img/blog/1686827952.png', '<p>Rajlaxmi Chavan, a 19-year-old elderly girl from the&nbsp;village of Shrirampur in Maharashtra, has always dreamed of achieving more at a young&nbsp;age. Despite coming from a family of doctors, Rajlaxmi had a passion for art, culture, and fashion, and she always wanted&nbsp;to create her own unique identity rather than continue with the elderly stereotypes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Her journey started when she participated in Forever Star India Season 1, a popular talent hunt. Rajlaxmi&#39;s talent and hard work paid off when she won the title of Miss Ahmed Nagar at the city level. Encouraged by her success, she continued to work hard and went on to win the state-level competition with the title of Miss Maharashtra Shining Star.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rajlaxmi&#39;s passion for the demonstration and her dedication to her craft did not go unnoticed. She has been invited to become a trainer and groomer for Forever Star India Season 4. This is a significant achievement for a young girl&nbsp;from a diminutive village in Maharashtra who has always dared to dream enormously.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Speaking about her success, Rajlaxmi said, &quot;I always wanted to make a name for myself in the field of fashion and art. Winning the titles of Miss Ahmed Nagar and Miss Maharashtra Shining Star has given me the confidence to pursue my dreams. Being a trainer and groomer for Forever Star India Season 4 is an incredible opportunity for me, and I am looking forward to it with great enthusiasm.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rajlaxmi&#39;s success story is a testament to the fact that with hard work, dedication, and passion, anything is possible. She has proven that coming from a small village is not a barrier to success, and with the correct attitude and opportunities, anyone is capable of achieving their dreams. Rajlaxmi Chavan is an inspiration to young people across the country, and we wish her all the best in her future endeavors.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 09:04:45'),
(54, 25, 'Meet Garima Saxena Our Trainer & Groomer', 21, 30, 2, '8,8,9,9,10,11,11,12,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686745397.png', 'Miss Ahmedabad 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Meet-Our-Trainer-Groomer-Garima-Saxena', 'Meet Garima Saxena Our Trainer & Groomer', 'Meet Garima Saxena Our Trainer & Groomer', 'Meet Garima Saxena Our Trainer & Groomer', 'garima saxena trainer & groomer', 'miss ahmedabad 2022', 'garima saxena 2022', 'miss ahmedabad garima saxena 2022', 'Meet Garima Saxena Our Trainer & Groomer', 'Meet Our Trainer & Groomer Garima Saxena', 'https://newsforever.in/Meet-Our-Trainer-Groomer-Garima-Saxena', 'Meet Garima Saxena Our Trainer & Groomer, Garima\'s success story serves as a reminder that anything is achievable with the correct mindset and approach. Her dedication to personal development and her profession is an inspiration to many, and we can all le', 'assets/img/blog/1686745416.png', '<p>Garima Saxena is a youthful architect who has made a name for herself in the industry not just for her design skills but also for her dedication to personal development. Her journey began when she chose architecture as her profession, which gave her the courage and confidence to construct a roadmap for a healthy and peaceful lifestyle for people.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nHowever, despite her passion for the field, Garima struggled to make a breakthrough in her profession. That was until she enrolled in the FSIA, where she discovered that the problem was not her, but rather the mindset and system. With a newfound perspective, Garima believed that with an intelligent approach, a positive strategy, an optimized environment, and consistency, pretty much anything is achievable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nGarima&#39;s journey toward personal development has not been without its challenges. However, her resilience and determination to achieve her goals have paid off.<br />\r\nShe won the title of Miss Ahmedabad at the city level and later became Miss Gujarat Face of the Year at the state level, an achievement that inspired her to continue pursuing her passions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nGarima believes that it is possible to work on ambitions and passions simultaneously with the correct approach and dedication. As an architect, she incorporates this philosophy into her work by designing spaces that promote wellness and productivity. She believes that every space has the potential to enhance the quality of life of its occupants and strives to make that a reality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nGarima&#39;s success story serves as a reminder that anything is achievable with the correct mindset and approach. Her dedication to personal development and her profession is an inspiration to many, and we can all learn from her example. As Garima continues to trailblaze in her field, we can anticipate more remarkable achievements from her in the future.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 10:04:43'),
(55, 25, 'Tana Puniya winner Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022', 21, 8, 1, '8,12,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686828547.png', 'miss arunachal pradesh 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Miss-Arunachal-Pradesh-2022-winner-Tana-Puniya', 'Tana Puniya winner Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022', 'miss india 2022, miss arunachal pradesh 2022, tana puniya', 'Tana Puniya winner Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022, Tana Puniya was crowned the winner of the Miss Arunachal Pradesh title in the Miss category of Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022. ', 'Miss arunachal pradesh winner 2022', 'tana puniya state winner 2022', 'arunachal pradesh winner tana puniya 2022', 'Tana Puniya winner Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022', 'Tana Puniya winner Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022', 'Forever Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022 winner Tana Puniya', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Miss-Arunachal-Pradesh-2022-winner-Tana-Puniya', 'Tana Puniya winner Miss Arunachal Pradesh 2022, Tana Puniya was crowned the winner of the Miss Arunachal Pradesh title in the Miss category of Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022. ', 'assets/img/blog/1686828617.png', '<p>The state winner crowning circular of India&#39;s biggest national-level beauty pageant, &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 Season 3,&quot; was held by means of Forever Star India at the Hotel Marriott, Tonk Road, in the capital Jaipur on September 16 to 19. The crowning ceremony involved awarding a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate to the winners, who had come from various states across the country. The winners, therefore, had the opportunity to showcase their talents by walking the ramp in beautiful dresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tana Puniya was crowned the winner of the Miss Arunachal Pradesh title in the Miss category of Forever Miss Mrs. Teen 2022. She was elated and expressed her excitement and gratitude towards the pageant organizers and judges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tana Puniya mentioned that it was a dream come true for her to win the title and that the pageant was an excellent platform for her to display her talent. She expressed her appreciation to her family and friends for their support throughout her journey.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event, in addition, additionally included other activities such as a song launch, an actress launch, and a dance performance, and lasted for four days. The winners of the pageant expressed their joy and gratitude towards the organizers for giving them the opportunity to showcase their talent and achieve their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, the event was a massive success, and it was an unforgettable experience for everyone who attended. The participants, judges, and the audience had a great time, and it was a proud moment for the winners to be crowned as the best in their respective categories. Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 Season 3 will always be remembered as a spectacular event that showcased the beauty and talent of Indian women.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 10:04:00'),
(56, 25, 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs Punjab 2022', 21, 8, 1, '8,9,10,11,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/63b8537ee0020d58e08a248b76ebc171.jpg', 'Mrs Punjab 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-Punjab-Shining-Star-2022-winner-Silky-Dewan', 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs Punjab 2022', 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs Punjab 2022', 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs Punjab 2022', 'shining star mrs silky dewan 2022', 'Shining star mrs punjab 2022', 'silky dewan mrs Punjab 2022', 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs Punjab 2022', 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs Punjab 2022', 'Forever Mrs Punjab Shining Star 2022 winner Silky Dewan', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-Punjab-Shining-Star-2022-winner-Silky-Dewan', 'Silky Dewan winner Shining Star Mrs. Punjab 2022, The four-day mega beauty pageant included various activities such as the winner\'s crowning ceremony, song launch, actress launch, dance performances, and other activities. The event was well organized and ', 'assets/img/blog/1686746116.png', '<p>The state crowning circular of Forever Miss, Mrs., and Teen 2022 Season 3, the biggest national-level beauty pageant in India, was held at the Marriott Hotel on Tonk Road in the capital city of Jaipur from September 16th to 19th, 2022.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Winners from different states across the country participated in the event and were crowned with sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates. During the event, the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talents to the judges and the audience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The participants put forth their best efforts in hopes of winning the coveted title, resulting in intense competition. Mrs Silky Dewan from Punjab has eventually crowned the winner of the Mrs. Punjab Shining Star title in the Miss, Mrs., and Teen 2022 Season 3 category G-2 of Mrs Shining Star. Overcome with joy and gratitude, Mrs Dewan expressed her emotions on stage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day mega beauty pageant included various activities such as the winner&#39;s crowning ceremony, song launch, actress launch, dance performances, and other activities. The event was well organized and attracted a large audience from all over the country.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India, the organizers of the event, left no stone unturned in ensuring that the event was a grand success. The event provided a platform for youthful women to showcase their talents, confidence, and beauty. It was a celebration of diversity and a true representation of the beauty of India.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The state crowning circular of Forever Miss, Mrs., and Teen 2022 Season 3 was a spectacular event that brought together talented women from different states across the country. The event was a testament to the beauty and cultural diversity of India.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-29 : 11:04:11');
