ferent states across the country were crowned with a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate. The excitement was palpable as the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talent. It was a sight to behold, as the contestants put their best foot forward and wowed the judges with their charisma and confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs Uttar Pradesh Bhumika Mittal was awarded the winning title in the G2 category in Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022 and was crowned. It had been a moment of pride for Mrs. Mandal, as she had emerged as the winner among the many talented contestants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event had been a grand spectacle, with a host of activities that kept the audience entertained throughout. Along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, other activities like song launches, actress launches, and dance performances were also special.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event had been a huge success, and the organisers had been pleased with the turnout and the response. They expressed their gratitude to everyone who had participated in the event and made it a grand success. The contestants, too, had been overwhelmed with the experience and expressed their joy at being a part of such a prestigious event.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen 2022 Season 3&nbsp;had been a celebration of beauty, talent, and grace, and showcased the best of what India had to offer. The event had been a testament to the fact that beauty came in all shapes and sizes and that every woman had the potential to shine. It had been a platform for women to showcase their talent and pursue their dreams, and the winners had been a true inspiration to all those who had participated.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 01:04:41'),
(58, 25, 'Nicole Fernandes winner National Category Miss Teen India 2022', 21, 20, 2, '8,9,10,11,12,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/3383bc2ee350fce67313c176e734e44c.jpg', 'Miss Teen India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'miss-teen-2022-winner-nicole-fernandes', 'Nicole Fernandes winner National Category Miss Teen India 2022', 'Miss Teen India 2022, Miss India 2022, nicole national winner, national category winner nicole fernandes', 'Miss Teen National Winner Nicole Fernandes was awarded the winning title in the national category in Forever Miss Teen 2022 and had been crowned. It had been a moment of pride for Nicole Fernandes.', 'nicole fernandes national winner', 'miss teen india 2022', 'national category winner nicole fernandes 2022', 'miss india national category winner 2022', 'Nicole Fernandes winner National Category Miss Teen India 2022', 'Forever Miss Teen 2022 Nicole Fernandes, winner of the national category', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-teen-2022-winner-nicole-fernandes', 'Miss Teen National Winner Nicole Fernandes was awarded the winning title in the national category in Forever Miss Teen 2022 and had been crowned. It had been a moment of pride for Nicole Fernandes.', 'assets/img/blog/1687757861.png', '<p>India&#39;s largest national-level beauty pageant, &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 Season 3,&quot; had its National Winner Crowning Round organized by Forever Star India from December 17 to 21 at the Hotel Marriott located on Tonk Road in the capital Jaipur. The event had attracted a huge crowd of participants from across the country, all vying for the coveted title. The pageant had been a celebration of beauty, grace, and talent and had showcased the best of what India had to offer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>During the event, the winners from different states across the country were crowned with a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate. The excitement was palpable as the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talent. It had been a vision to behold, as the contestants had put their best foot forward and wowed the judges with their charisma and confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Miss Teen National Winner Nicole Fernandes was awarded the winning title in the national category in Forever Miss Mrs Teen 2022 and had been crowned. It had been a moment of pride for Nicole, as she had emerged as the winner among the many talented contestants. Nicole expressed her feelings and emotions: &quot;Winning the National Title was not easy for me. As a result, I worked very hard to earn this title. There were many ups and downs in my life. &quot;There were 3 levels that I had cleared: city, state, and national.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event had been a grand spectacle, with a host of activities that kept the audience entertained throughout. Along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, other activities like song launches, actress launches, and dance performances had also been special.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event had been a huge success, and the organizers had been pleased with the turnout and the response. They expressed their gratitude to everyone who participated in the event and made it a grand success. The contestants, too, had been overwhelmed with the experience and expressed their joy at being a part of such a prestigious event.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 02:04:12'),
(59, 25, 'AR Jebina winner G-1 Category Mrs East India 2022', 21, 20, 2, '5,8,8,9,10,11,12,13,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1685449415.png', 'winner Mrs East India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-East-India-2022-AR-Jebina-winner-in-the-G-1-category', 'AR Jebina winner G-1 Category Mrs East India 2022', 'mrs india 2022, ar jebina winner mrs east winner 2022, winner mrs east india 2022, ', 'AR Jebina winner G-1 Category Mrs East India 2022, Mrs East India AR Jebina had been awarded the winning title at the national level in Forever Miss, Mrs Teen 2022, and had been crowned winner of the G-1 category. ', 'mrs east india 2022', 'ar jebina winner mrs east india 2022', 'mrs east india winner 2022', 'mrs east india winner ar jebina 2022', 'mrs east india winner ar jebina 2022', 'Forever Mrs East India 2022: AR Jebina winner in the G-1 category', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-East-India-2022-AR-Jebina-winner-in-the-G-1-category', 'AR Jebina winner G-1 Category Mrs East India 2022, Mrs East India AR Jebina had been awarded the winning title at the national level in Forever Miss, Mrs Teen 2022, and had been crowned winner of the G-1 category. ', 'assets/img/blog/752b7b95e9fd7cb87bca7307c7ade70e.jpg', '<p>India&#39;s largest national-level beauty pageant, &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 Season 3,&quot; had its National Winner Crowning Round organized by Forever Star India from December 17 to 21 at the Hotel Marriott located on Tonk Road in the capital Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event had attracted a huge crowd of participants from across the country, all vying for the coveted title. The pageant was a celebration of beauty, grace, and talent and showcased the best of what India had to offer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>During the event, the winners from different states across the country were crowned with a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate. The excitement was palpable as the winners walked the ramp in beautiful dresses and showcased their talent. It was a vision to behold as the contestants put their best foot forward and wowed the judges with their charisma and confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs East India AR Jebina had been awarded the winning title at the national level in Forever Miss, Mrs. Teen 2022, and had been crowned winner of the G-1 category. It was a moment of pride for AR Jebina, as she had emerged as the winner among the many talented contestants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>AR Jebina had expressed her feelings and emotions: &quot;Winning the National Title was not easy for me. As a result, I worked very hard to earn this title. There were many difficulties in my life.&quot; There were 3 levels that I had cleared: city, state, and national.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event was a grand spectacle, with a host of activities that kept the audience entertained throughout. Along with the crowning ceremony of the winners, other activities like song launches, actress launches, and dance performances were also special.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was a huge success, and the organizers were pleased with the turnout and the response. They expressed their gratitude to everyone who participated in the event and made it a grand success. The contestants were overwhelmed with the experience and expressed their joy at being a part of such a prestigious event.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 02:04:08'),
(60, 25, 'Nidhi Sharma winner G-1 Category Mrs India 2022', 21, 20, 2, '8,11,12,12,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/1685532891.png', 'G-1 category mrs India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Mrs-India-2022-Nidhi-Sharma-winner-in-the-G-1-category', 'Nidhi Sharma winner G-1 Category Mrs India 2022', 'Nidhi Sharma punjab winner 2022, Mrs India 2022, G-1 Category winner, Nidhi Sharma G-1 Category winner', 'Nidhi Sharma winner G-1 Category Mrs. India 2022, Mrs. India Nidhi Sharma won the G-1 category and was given the winning title at the national level. Nidhi Sharma felt overwhelmed with pride since she won over the many talented competitors.', 'Fashion, Modelling ', 'beauty pageants', 'Mumbai, Delhi ', 'Mrs International, Miss India, miss national ', 'National Beauty Pageant ', 'Forever Mrs. India 2022 Nidhi Sharma, winner in the G-1 category', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Mrs-India-2022-Nidhi-Sharma-winner-in-the-G-1-category', 'Nidhi Sharma winner G-1 Category Mrs India 2022, Mrs India Nidhi Sharma won the G-1 category and was given the winning title at the national level. Nidhi Sharma felt overwhelmed with pride since she won over the many talented competitors.', 'assets/img/blog/d21d2d60aebca78f5f926ec7c0a5596b.jpg', '<p>Forever Star India hosted the National Winner Crowning Round of &quot;Forever Miss, Mrs., and Miss Teen 2022 Season 3,&quot; India&#39;s biggest national-level beauty pageant, from December 17 to 21 at the Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in the nation&#39;s capital, Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The competition had drawn a large number of participants from all around the country who were all battling for the prestigious finals. The event highlighted beauty, grace, and talent while showcasing India&#39;s top performers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The winners from various states across the country received a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate during the ceremony. As the winners walked the ramp wearing stunning gowns and displayed their talent, the energy was visible. The contenders put their best foot forward and surprised the judges with their charisma and confidence; it was a sight to behold.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Forever Miss, Mrs. Teen 2022, Mrs. India Nidhi Sharma won the G-1 category and was given the winning title at the national level. Nidhi Sharma felt overwhelmed with pride since she won over the many talented competitors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In her statement, Nidhi Sharma said, &quot;Winning the National Title was not easy for me. I, therefore, put a lot of effort into earning this title. There were numerous challenges in my life. I had successfully completed the city, state, and national levels.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event was a magnificent spectacle with a variety of events that kept the crowd engaged the entire time. Other special events included song launches, actress launches, dance performances, and the crowning of the winners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The organizers were happy with the participation and response because the event was a big success. They gave thanks to everyone who had taken part in the event and helped make it a huge success. The candidates were ecstatic to be a part of such a prominent event and were overcome by the experience.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 03:04:54'),
(61, 25, 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', 21, 20, 1, '8,8,10,12,12,13,13', 'assets/img/blog/1686744673.png', '2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Miss-India-2022-2nd-Runner-Up-Simran-Kaur', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', 'Miss India 2022, miss india 2nd runner-up 2022, simran kaur miss india 2022, simran kaur 2nd runner-up', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022, Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022 Winning the National Title wasn\'t simple for Simran Kaur, she admitted in her statement. I worked exceptionally hard to get this honor; therefore, I do.', '2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', 'Simran Kaur', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022 ', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Miss-India-2022-2nd-Runner-Up-Simran-Kaur', 'Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022, Simran Kaur 2nd Runner-up Miss India 2022 Winning the National Title wasn\'t simple for Simran Kaur, she admitted in her statement. I worked exceptionally hard to get this honor; therefore, I do.', 'assets/img/blog/1686744854.png', '<p>The biggest national-level beauty pageant in India, &quot;Season 3,&quot; was hosted by Forever Star India from December 17 to 21 at the Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in the nation&#39;s capital, Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many competitors from across the country had come to the competition to compete for a spot in the prestigious finals. The performance showcased India&#39;s greatest performers while highlighting beauty, grace, and brilliance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The ceremony included the awarding of a sash, crown, trophy, and certificate to the champions from various states across the nation. The enthusiasm was strong as the winners walked down the runway in gorgeous gowns and showcased their skills. It was impressive to see how the contestants put their best foot forward and astounded the judges with their personalities and fearlessness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Miss India national title had been won by Simran Kaur, who finished as the second runner-up. Simran Kaur was overcome with pride after defeating the many talented competitors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Winning the National Title wasn&#39;t simple for Simran Kaur, she admitted in her statement. I worked exceptionally hard to get this honour; therefore, I do. There have been multiple struggles in my life. I had completed the city, state, and national levels effectively.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event was an amazing sight, with a range of activities that kept the spectators interested the entire time. Other important events included the debuts of songs and actresses, dancing performances, and the announcement of the winners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was a huge success, and the organisers were pleased with the turnout and response. They had expressed gratitude to everyone who had participated in the occasion and made it a big success. The candidates had been overcome by the experience and were overjoyed to be a part of such a significant event.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 04:04:03'),
