(71, 25, 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 21, 20, 1, '9,10,11,12,12,13,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686828976.png', 'Beauty with Brain winner G-2 Category Mrs India 2022', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Winner-2022-Mrs-Sarmistha-Lahiri-won-the-title-Beauty-with-a-Brain-in-the-G-2-category', 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 'Sarmistha Lahiri beauty with brain winner 2022', 'Sarmistha Lahiri G-2 Category Mrs India 2022', 'Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022', 'Forever Winner 2022 Mrs. Sarmistha Lahiri won the title Beauty with a Brain in the G-2 category', ' https://newsforever.in/Forever-Winner-2022-Mrs-Sarmistha-Lahiri-won-the-title-Beauty-with-a-Brain-in-the-G-2-category', 'Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022, Sarmistha Lahiri winner Beauty with a Brain title in G-2 category Mrs India 2022. Mrs Sarmistha Lahiri\'s victory is a reminder that women are capable of achieving great thin', 'assets/img/blog/1686745529.png', '<p>Forever Star India&#39;s Season 3 was not only a beauty pageant but also an opportunity for women to showcase their intellect and talent. Mrs Sarmistha Lahiri&#39;s win in the Beauty with Brain category highlights the importance of intelligence in beauty pageants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs. Lahiri&#39;s hard work and dedication paid off, as she surpassed several other talented competitors to win the title. Her victory is an inspiration for women everywhere who face difficulties in their lives but never give up on their dreams. The event occurred from December 17 to 20 at the Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was not just about beauty and brains but also an opportunity for the contestants to learn from each other and showcase their unique skills. The performances were outstanding, and it was evident that each contestant had put in numerous efforts to be present.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The organizers did an excellent job of ensuring that the event ran smoothly and that the participants had a memorable experience. It was heartwarming to see how the contestants came together and supported each other, irrespective of their backgrounds and hometowns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India&#39;s Season 3 was more than just a beauty pageant; it was a celebration of womanhood and a platform for women to showcase their talent and abilities. It was, in addition, an opportunity for the participants to make new connections and gain exposure, which could open new doors for them in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mrs. Sarmistha Lahiri&#39;s victory is a reminder that women are capable of achieving great things, and beauty pageants are not just about physical appearance but about intellect, talent, and determination. The event was a success, and it has set the bar high for future beauty pageants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India&#39;s Season 3 was a remarkable event that celebrated women&#39;s talent and abilities. Mrs. Sarmistha Lahiri&#39;s victory in the Beauty with Brain category highlights the importance of intelligence and talent in beauty pageants. The event was a huge success, and it is a testament to the hard work and dedication of the organizers, contestants, and everyone involved. It is an event that will be remembered for years to come, and it will inspire women everywhere to pursue their dreams and never quit.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 10:04:40'),
(72, 25, 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 21, 20, 1, '8,8,10,11,11,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686829434.png', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Star-India-Winner-2022-Mrs-Sonam-Kumari-won-the-title-Beauty-with-a-Brain-in-the-G-1-category', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 'sonam kumari, mrs india 2022 beauty with brain, sonam kumari mrs beauty with brain', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain in G-1 Category. The title Beauty with Brain has always been associated with women who possess not only physical beauty but also intelligence and wit.', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain', ' https://newsforever.in/Forever-Star-India-Winner-2022-Mrs-Sonam-Kumari-won-the-title-Beauty-with-a-Brain-in-the-G-1-category', 'Sonam Kumari won Mrs India 2022 Beauty with Brain in G-1 Category. The title Beauty with Brain has always been associated with women who possess not only physical beauty but also intelligence and wit.', 'assets/img/blog/1686829459.png', '<p>Forever Winner 2022 Mrs Sonam Kumari has proven that beauty and brains can indeed go hand in hand. She emerged victorious in the G-2 category of the prestigious national-level beauty pageant, &quot;Season 3,&quot; hosted by Forever Star India in Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The four-day event showcased the best of India&#39;s performers, with contestants from different parts of the country vying for a spot in the finals. Sonam Kumari stood out among the rest with her outstanding personality and fearlessness. She had to overcome numerous challenges in her life, but her hard work and dedication paid off when she was declared the winner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event occurred from December 17 to 20 at the Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The awarding ceremony was a spectacle to behold, with the winners proudly walking down the runway in their gorgeous gowns, receiving their sashes, crowns, trophies, and certificates. The event was not only about beauty but also about celebrating the contestants&#39; brilliance and intellect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aside from the beauty pageant, the event also featured various activities that kept the spectators entertained throughout. There were debuts of songs and actresses, dancing performances, and other exciting announcements. The success of the event was a testament to the organizers&#39; hard work and dedication, and they expressed gratitude to everyone who participated and made it possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For Sonam Kumari, winning the title was not only a personal achievement but also a source of pride for her community and the country. She serves as an inspiration to many young women who aspire to succeed in their chosen fields and break barriers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The title &quot;Beauty with Brain&quot; has always been associated with women who possess not only physical beauty but also intelligence and wit. It sends a strong message that women can excel in all areas, including those traditionally dominated by men. It is a reminder that women should be celebrated not only for their looks but also for their accomplishments and contributions to society.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Forever Winner, 2022 Mrs Sonam Kumari&#39;s victory in the national-level beauty pageant highlights the importance of celebrating women&#39;s beauty, brilliance, and fearlessness. It shows that women can break barriers and excel in all areas, and their achievements should be recognized and celebrated. It is a step towards creating a world where women are not judged by their looks but by their accomplishments and contributions to society.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-04-30 : 10:04:35');
