(73, 25, 'Meet Sunidhi Khare our Trainer & Groomer', 21, 30, 2, '8,8,9,10,11,12,12,13,14,14', 'assets/img/blog/1685530988.png', 'our trainer & Groomer ', '', '', '', '', 'Meet-Our-Trainer-Groomer-Sunidhi-Khare', 'Meet Sunidhi Khare our Trainer & Groomer', 'miss meet sunidhi khare our trainer & groomer', 'Meet Sunidhi Khare our Trainer & Groomer, Miss International FSIA 2022, Miss Maharashtra 2022, and Miss Mumbai 2022.', 'Fashion, Modelling ', 'beauty pageants', 'Mumbai, Delhi ', 'Mrs International, Miss India, miss national ', ' International beauty pageant', 'Meet Our Trainer & Groomer Sunidhi Khare', 'https://newsforever.in/Meet-Our-Trainer-Groomer-Sunidhi-Khare', 'Meet Sunidhi Khare our Trainer & Groomer, Miss International FSIA 2022, Miss Maharashtra 2022, and Miss Mumbai 2022.', 'assets/img/blog/1687243978.png', '<p>Sunidhi Khare, a multifaceted fashion celebrity, has joined Forever Star India Season 4 as a trainer and groomer. Her extensive experience in the fashion industry has made her a valuable addition to the team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before joining Forever Star India, Sunidhi was a fashion designer who believed that fashion is not just about looking good, but also about feeling good and being comfortable in one&#39;s skin. Her designs reflected her bold, confident, and elegant personality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apart from being a fashion designer, after she join FSAI Sunidhi won the titles of Miss International FSIA 2022, Miss Maharashtra 2022, and Miss Mumbai 2022. She had made a name for herself in the modeling industry by working with top fashion labels and walking the ramp at major fashion events.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sunidhi&#39;s journey in the fashion industry has been nothing short of remarkable. From designing unique pieces to modeling for top fashion brands, she has been able to showcase her skills and talent in various ways. Her work has been appreciated by the fashion community, and her unique approach to fashion has won her a loyal following.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a trainer and groomer for Forever Star India, Sunidhi will be sharing her expertise and knowledge with the contestants. Her experience in the industry will be invaluable to the contestants as they learn about the nuances of the fashion world. She will also be guiding them on how to present themselves in the best possible way and how to bring out their true personalities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sunidhi&#39;s passion for fashion and her dedication to the industry make her an inspiration for aspiring designers and models. Her story shows that with hard work, determination, and a unique vision, anyone is capable of achieving their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sunidhi Khare is a fashion celebrity who has made a mark in the industry with her unique approach to fashion. Her journey in the industry has been remarkable, and her experience as a designer and model will be invaluable to the contestants of Forever Star India Season 4. We wish her all the best for her new role and look forward to seeing her contribute to the growth and development of the fashion industry.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-05-01 : 07:05:10'),
(84, 25, 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail', 21, 30, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1687243561.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Miss-India-2023-Mrs-India-2023-Full-Video-Detail', 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail', 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail', 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail', 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail', 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail', '', '', '', '', 'https://newsforever.in/Miss-India-2023-Mrs-India-2023-Full-Video-Detail', 'Miss India 2023 / Mrs India 2023 Full Video Detail\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/fa60ecd8d540a228acb959aa4066b56c.jpg', '<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-05-30 : 10:05:26'),
(85, 25, 'Forever Star India Announces Season 3 of Forever Miss, Mrs & Miss Teen India 2023, Set to Showcase India\'s Beauty and Talent', 21, 0, 1, '8,9,10,11,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1685614475.png', 'Miss Mrs Miss Teen India 2023 Announcement', '', '', '', '', 'miss-mrs-miss-teen-india-2023-season-3-announcement-to-showcase-beauty-and-talent', 'Forever Star India Announces Season 3 of Forever Miss, Mrs & Miss Teen India 2023, Set to Showcase India\'s Beauty and Talent', 'miss india 2023, mrs india 2023, miss teen india 2023, announcement, beauty pageant, miss india news, mrs india news, miss teen india news, latest news miss india', 'Forever Star India Announces Season 3 of Forever Miss, Mrs & Miss Teen India 2023, Set to Showcase India\'s Beauty and Talent', 'Miss Mrs Miss Teen India 2023 Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 Announcement', 'Mrs India 2023 Announcement', 'Miss Teen India 2023 Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 Announcement', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-mrs-miss-teen-india-2023-season-3-announcement-to-showcase-beauty-and-talent', 'Forever Star India Announces Season 3 of Forever Miss, Mrs & Miss Teen India 2023, Set to Showcase India\'s Beauty and Talent', 'assets/img/blog/1687243067.png', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Innovative and Exciting: Forever Star India Introduces Live-Streamed Crowning Ceremony for Forever Miss, Mrs &amp; Miss Teen India 2023 Season 3</li>\r\n	<li>Forever Star India&#39;s FSIA Platform Empowers Participants with National-Level Tournaments and Award Shows</li>\r\n	<li>Forever Miss, Mrs &amp; Miss Teen India 2023 Season 3 to Crown Winners from Over 250 Cities Across India</li>\r\n	<li>Forever Star India to Unveil Winners of Miss World, Miss Universe, and Miss Asia at Forever Miss, Mrs &amp; Miss Teen India 2023 Season 3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jaipur.</strong> Forever Star India, the renowned organization, is gearing up to host the highly anticipated event of the year, Forever Miss, Mrs &amp; Miss Teen India 2023 Season 3. This grand beauty pageant will showcase the talent and beauty of women from across the country. The first finale of Season 3 is scheduled to take place in the first week of July and will witness over 250 city-level crowning ceremonies, out of 8000 auditions across India 5000 participants were enrolled. these 250 winners will be shortlisted out of 5000 participants. The winners of these city-level events will then advance to the Grand Finale at the end of September, where the International, National, and State Crowning will take place.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What sets this season apart is the innovative approach adopted by Forever Star India. In a unique twist, the crowning ceremony in July will be live-streamed on the YouTube OTT platform, allowing participants to celebrate their achievements alongside their families from the comfort of their homes. This groundbreaking concept has never been seen before and adds an extra layer of excitement to the pageant. Additionally, the personal crowning moments of the winners shared through their own apps or social media IDs, will earn top rankings on Google, making Forever Miss, Mrs &amp; Miss Teen India 2023 Season 3 the ultimate platform for aspiring beauty queens.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Moreover, Forever Star India&#39;s platform ensures that all winners gain international recognition. Only through this esteemed organization can participants secure a spot on the list of authentic winners, prominently displayed in the top rankings on Google. It is a tremendous opportunity for women from every corner of the country to establish their names in the global beauty industry. Forever Star India is also set to announce the winners of Miss World, Miss Universe, and Miss Asia this year, further solidifying its position as a leading platform for beauty pageants.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India&#39;s platform, FSIA, goes beyond beauty pageants. It serves as India&#39;s largest community of like-minded individuals, offering a space for participants and awardees to interact and connect. FSIA provides a platform for individuals to showcase their skills and talents, with participants being able to create and update their profiles regularly. These verified profiles are visible to all members, enhancing networking opportunities within the community. Every verified member of FSIA receives an e-certificate and a hard copy certificate, delivered right to their doorstep, recognizing their achievements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is not just limited to beauty pageants; it also organizes national-level tournaments and award shows. This online platform caters to those exceptional individuals who possess unique talents but struggle to find the perfect opportunity to showcase them. Through FSIA, citizens of India can display their strengths and abilities to the entire nation on a digital platform. The platform offers numerous benefits and opportunities to all its members, ensuring that their talents receive the recognition they deserve.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As the date of Forever Miss, Mrs &amp; Miss Teen India 2023 Season 3 draws near, participants and viewers alike eagerly await the spectacle that will celebrate the beauty, grace, and talent of the women of India. Forever Star India continues to shine as the torchbearer of the country&#39;s beauty pageant industry, empowering individuals and making dreams come true on a grand stage.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-01 : 01:06:56'),
(86, 25, 'Get Ready for the Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023 Season 4 Honoring India Awards Finest Heroes', 23, 5, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1686659812.png', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023', '', '', '', '', 'super-woman-and-super-hero-award-2023-india-finest-heroes', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023 Season 4 Honoring India’s Awards Finest Heroes', 'super woman awards 2023, super hero awards 2023, finest award show in india, biggest award show in india, award show 2023, latest awards news, latest news, news forever', 'Get Ready for the Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023 Season 4 Honoring Indias Awards Finest Heroes. Forever Star India is Inviting Super Woman and Super Heroes of India for Biggest Awards Show in India.', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023', 'Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023 Season 4 Honoring India’s Awards Finest Heroes', 'https://newsforever.in/super-woman-and-super-hero-award-2023-india-finest-heroes', 'Get Ready for the Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023 Season 4 Honoring Indias Awards Finest Heroes. Forever Star India is Inviting Super Woman and Super Heroes of India for Biggest Awards Show in India.', 'assets/img/blog/77763772923d71498b8a477da554dd42.jpeg', '<p>Forever Star India is proud to present the highly anticipated Super Woman and Super Hero Award 2023 Season 4 The grand ceremony is set to take place during the first week of July. Building on the success of Season 3, which established the awards as India&rsquo;s number one accolade community, this year&rsquo;s event has received an overwhelming response. With a staggering 8,200 registrations across 70 categories, the selection process has been rigorous: From these entries, 900 individuals were chosen as titleholders in different cities throughout India. Among these titleholders, 1,500 nominees are currently being considered for the final 750 awards, which will be announced during the ceremony in July. The remaining awards will be presented during a separate ceremony in late September</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India is known for its commitment to showcasing new and unique concepts with each of its shows, and this ceremony is no exception. Numerous innovative elements have been incorporated into the event. One of the most significant features is that each of the 1,500 awardees, representing every category and city in India, will have the opportunity to celebrate their achievements from the comfort of their own homes: The ceremony will be livestreamed worldwide on YouTube, as well as on various OTT platforms, allowing awardees to share this special moment with their families, relatives, and friends which provides authenticity and have a lifetime validity to access on platforms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Furthermore, the awardees will receive not only recognition but also honors. Their FSIA (Forever Star India Awards) social media IDs will be ranked highly on Google, emphasizing their accomplishments. In addition, the personal clips from their ceremonies will be featured as the top-ranking content on Google. Such uniqueness and authenticity are exclusive to this prestigious award show. Forever star India comes up with a benefit to provide YouTube ranking along with Google ranking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition to these remarkable features, each awardee will also receive extensive news coverage on a global scale. Their names will be included in over a hundred news links, ensuring their achievements reach audiences worldwide. With these initiatives, FSIA (Forever Star India Awards) has solidified its position as the world&rsquo;s largest award and beauty presentation group, creating a close-knit community on various social media platforms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among participants and viewers continue to grow. Stays tuned for updates and prepare to witness the extraordinary achievements of these extraordinary individuals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apart from all these, Individuals and non-individuals who want&nbsp;to start or restart their career and unable to do something on their own have a chance to highlight themselves in the Industry. &nbsp;This is not just an award show, it&rsquo;s an emotion of people who are interested to build their careers.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-06 : 12:06:05'),
(87, 25, 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 21, 6, 0, '8,9,10,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1686219446.png', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023', '', '', '', '', 'surat-finalist-miss-india-2023-rubi-valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023', 'Surat Finalist Rubi Valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 'Miss Surat Finalist 2023 Rubi Valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand', 'https://newsforever.in/surat-finalist-miss-india-2023-rubi-valand', 'Surat Finalist Miss India 2023 Rubi Valand, Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Rubi Valand has reserved her place in as Surat Finalist. ', 'assets/img/blog/1687242563.png', '<p><strong>Surat</strong>. Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Rubi Valand has reserved her place in as Surat Finalist. Rubi Valand, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all girls who wants to become a model in future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/rubi-valand-miss-india-2023-id-38433\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1687858014.png\" xss=removed></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. Crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Miss Rubi Valand that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-08 : 01:06:59'),
(88, 25, 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023 Daljeet Kaur', 21, 6, 2, '8,10,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1686659718.png', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023', '', '', '', '', 'gurdaspur-finalist-mrs-india-2023-daljeet-kaur', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023 Daljeet Kaur', 'gurdaspur finalist 2023, mrs gurdaspur 2023 finalist, daljeet kaur, mrs gurdaspur daljeet kaur', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023 - Daljeet Kaur, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future. She Qualified for the City Finale in Mrs India 2023.', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023 Daljeet Kaur', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023', 'Mrs Gurdaspur Finalist Daljeet Kaur', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023 Daljeet Kaur', 'https://newsforever.in/gurdaspur-finalist-mrs-india-2023-daljeet-kaur', 'Gurdaspur Finalist Mrs India 2023 - Daljeet Kaur, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future. She Qualified for the City Finale in Mrs India 2023.', 'assets/img/blog/1686659736.png', '<p><strong>Gurdaspur</strong>. Announcements of city level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Daljeet Kaur has reserved her place in as Gurdaspur Finalist. Daljeet Kaur, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Mrs India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. Crowning of City Winners of Mrs India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Mrs Daljeet Kaur that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-09 : 03:06:56'),
(89, 25, 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023 Kusum Jadhavar', 21, 0, 1, '1,8,9,10,11,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686394307.png', 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023', '', '', '', '', 'osmanabad-finalist-mrs-india-2023-kusum-jadhavar', 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023 Kusum Jadhavar', 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023 Kusum Jadhavar', 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023 Kusum Jadhavar', 'mrs india 2023', 'kusum jadhavar', 'osmanabad finalist 2023', 'finalist mrs india 2023', 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023 Kusum Jadhavar', 'Osmanabad Finalist Mrs India 2023 Kusum Jadhavar', 'https://newsforever.in/osmanabad-finalist-mrs-india-2023-kusum-jadhavar', 'Osmanabad. Announcements of city-level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Kusum Jadhavar has reserved her place in as Osmanabad Finalist. Kusum Jadhavar is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in the', 'assets/img/blog/1687241997.png', '<p>Osmanabad. Announcements of city-level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Kusum Jadhavar has reserved her place in as Osmanabad Finalist. Kusum Jadhavar is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Mrs. India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. The crowning of City Winners of Mrs. India 2023 will be Streamed Live on the Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs. India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country to participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Mrs. Kusum Jadhavar that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-10 : 01:06:16'),
