e announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Miss India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country to participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Miss <strong>Mehak Rawal</strong> that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-13 : 02:06:55'),
(101, 25, 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi', 21, 6, 1, '5,8,9,10,11,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1688022435.png', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023', '', '', '', '', 'belgaum-finalist-miss-india-2023-sanjana-karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023, Sanjana Karoshi city winner 2023, miss city winner sanjana karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi, Belgaum. Announcements of city-level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Sanjana Karoshi has reserved her place as Belgaum Finalist. Sanjana Karoshi, is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in the future.', 'belgaum finalist miss india 2023', 'sanjana karoshi miss india 2023', 'city winner 2023 sanjana karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi', 'https://newsforever.in/belgaum-finalist-miss-india-2023-sanjana-karoshi', 'Belgaum Finalist Miss India 2023 Sanjana Karoshi, Belgaum. Announcements of city-level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Sanjana Karoshi has reserved her place as Belgaum Finalist. Sanjana Karoshi, is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation t', 'assets/img/blog/1688022527.png', '<p><strong>Belgaum</strong>. Announcements of city-level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and <strong>Sanjana Karoshi </strong>has reserved her place as <strong>Belgaum</strong> Finalist. <strong>Sanjana Karoshi</strong>&nbsp;is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. The crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on the Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/sanjana-karoshi-miss-india-2023-id-40780\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688022605.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Miss India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country to participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Miss <strong>Sanjana Karoshi </strong>that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-13 : 03:06:20');
