(102, 25, 'Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 21, 6, 1, '8,9,10,11,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1687775329.png', 'Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs India 2023', '', '', '', '', 'visakhapatnam-finalist-mrs-india-2023-t-raja-rajeswari', 'Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 'Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 'Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs. India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari, Visakhapatnam Announcements of city-level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari has reserved her place as Visakhapatnam Finalist.', 'Mrs Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 'Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari City Winner 2023', 'Vishakhapatnam City Winner Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari 2023', 'Visakhapatnam City Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 'Visakhapatnam City Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 'Mrs Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari', 'https://newsforever.in/visakhapatnam-finalist-mrs-india-2023-t-raja-rajeswari', 'Visakhapatnam Finalist Mrs. India 2023 Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari, Visakhapatnam Announcements of city-level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari has reserved her place as Visakhapatnam Finalist.', 'assets/img/blog/1687775306.png', '<p><strong>Visakhapatnam</strong>. Announcements of city-level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and <strong>Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari </strong>has reserved her place as <strong>Visakhapatnam</strong> Finalist.&nbsp;<strong>Dr.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>T. Raja Rajeswari</strong>&nbsp;is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Mrs. India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. The crowning of City Winners of Mrs. India 2023 will be Streamed Live on the Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/t-raja-rajeswari-mrs-india-2022-id-37641\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://fsia.in/mrsindia_profile/37641T. Raja RajeswariWhatsApp Image 2023-02-22 at 12.05.02.jpeg\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Mrs. India and Mrs. India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Mrs.&nbsp;<strong>Dr. T. Raja Rajeswari </strong>that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-13 : 03:06:01'),
