 which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Mrs.&nbsp;<strong>Nazmee Khan </strong>that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-13 : 03:06:49'),
