in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Mrs. India and Mrs. India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Mrs.&nbsp;<strong>Aloka Debnath </strong>that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-13 : 03:06:09'),
(105, 25, 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 21, 6, 1, '8,10,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1686742639.png', 'City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', '', '', '', '', 'city-level-crowning-ceremony-2023', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'city level crowning, miss india city crowning, mrs india city crowning, miss teen city crowning, crowning ceremony', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023 in First week of July. India\'s Biggest Beauty Pageant is organizing City Winner Virtual Crowning Ceremony in July.', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'Miss India City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'Mrs India City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023', 'https://newsforever.in/divya-krishna-won-the-miss-andhra-pradesh-2022-state-winner', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning Ceremony 2023 in First week of July. India\'s Biggest Beauty Pageant is organizing City Winner Virtual Crowning Ceremony in July.', 'assets/img/blog/1686742667.png', '<p><strong>Forever Star India</strong>: Beauty Pageants की मेजबानी करने के लिए भारत में मान्यता प्राप्त सबसे बड़े प्लेटफार्मों में से एक अपने टैलेंट को दिखाने के लिए उचित प्लेटफार्म खोजने के लिए संघर्ष करने वाली लड़कियों के लिए विशेष रूप से बनाए गए सबसे बड़े प्लेटफार्मों में से एक FSIA है, जिसे Forever Star India के रूप में भी जाना जाता है। हाल ही में, इस मंच को National and International Beauty Pageants की मेजबानी करने के लिए सबसे बड़े Platform के रूप में स्वीकार किया गया था।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nFounder राजेश अग्रवाल के अनुसार, International Beauty Pageants आयोजित करने का मुख्य उद्देश्य दुनिया भर की महिलाओं को प्रेरित करना और उन्हें वैश्विक स्तर पर अपनी अनदेखी क्षमताओं को प्रकट करने के लिए प्रोत्साहित करना है। उन्होंने आगे कहा, \"FSIA का प्रमुख लक्ष्य महिलाओं को प्रोत्साहित करना, उनके आत्मविश्वास में सुधार करना और उन्हें उन गुणों को प्रदर्शित करने की अनुमति देना है जो बाद में मनोरंजन की दुनिया में सर्वश्रेष्ठ स्थान हासिल करने में उनकी सहायता करेंगे।\" छिपी क्षमताओं वाली कई युवतियां अपने उपहारों को दुनिया के साथ साझा करने के लिए उपयुक्त मंचों से अनभिज्ञ हैं। Forever Star India हमेशा उनके लिए है! यह लड़कियों को FSIA नामक App एक Digital Platform के माध्यम से पूरे देश के सामने अपनी प्रतिभा दिखाने का शानदार अवसर प्रदान करता है! साथ ही, साइट में एक यूट्यूब चैनल भी है जहां यह उन महिलाओं की प्रतिभा का जश्न मनाती है जो मनोरंजन और फैशन की हमेशा बदलती दुनिया में असाधारण करियर बनाना चाहती हैं।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>सफलता की कहानी</strong><br>\r\nForever Star India के Projects Miss India and Mrs India ने पिछले सीजन 2 में शानदार सफलता हासिल की है। पहले ही सीजन में होटल मैरियट जयपुर में City Level और National Level की 350 से ज्यादा Crowning का आयोजन किया गया।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>पूरे भारत से 250+ क्राउन के साथ दूसरे सीज़न के City Level पर एक World Record बनाया गया था। सभी का सबसे महत्वपूर्ण पहलू यह था कि City Level के इन विजेताओं ने इससे पहले कभी भी अपने घर से Youtube और FSIA OTT पर परिवार और दोस्तों के साथ अपनी जीत का जश्न नहीं मनाया था।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>साथ ही Jaipur Marriott Hotel में आयोजित एक भव्य समारोह में 160 National और International Winners की घोषणा कर एक और World Record स्थापित किया गया।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>CEO and Founder के साथ बातचीत</strong><br>\r\nकंपनी के CEO and Founder श्री राजेश अग्रवाल ने इसे शुरू करने का कारण बताया। उन्होंने अपने बयान में दावा किया कि यह Platform महिला सशक्तिकरण को बढ़ावा देने के लिए बनाया गया है। वर्तमान में FSIA, Award, Beauty Pageant और Fashion Industries में सबसे बड़े Industries में से एक है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>कंपनी के CEO राजेश अग्रवाल ने कहा, \"हम मूल रूप से एक Website संचालित करते थे, लेकिन OTT Platform और एक App में हमने जीत हासिल की है।\" भारत में शुरू हुई यात्रा अब दुनिया भर में अपनी जड़ें जमा चुकी है। इस साल से यह Platform Movies, Web Series और Music Album के लिए Award भी देगा। मुझे खुशी है कि 139 विभिन्न Countries में FSIA Franchisee की पेशकश की जाएगी।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Director जया के साथ बातचीत</strong><br>\r\nDirector जया चौहान ने एफएसआईए मंच की प्रशंसा करते हुए कहा, \"संगठन हर दिन नई अवधारणाओं पर प्रभावी ढंग से काम करता है। इस साल शो को बेहद नए Unique Ideas के साथ प्लान किया जा रहा है। हमारे Beauty Pageants और Awards के लिए Registration की संख्या अभूतपूर्व रही है। हमें यह दावा करने में बहुत गर्व होता है कि FSIA दुनिया का एकमात्र और सबसे बड़ा मंच है जो FSIA के साथ काम करके उनकी untapped creative potential को प्रदर्शित करने और उनके कौशल को सुधारने का अवसर प्रदान करता है। हमें आपको यह सूचित करते हुए प्रसन्नता हो रही है कि पिछले वर्ष के Winners और Awards Winners के लगभग 25-30 सदस्यों को FSIA Team में शामिल होने का अवसर प्रदान किया गया है।\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>आइए जानते हैं FSIA की विभिन्न और Live Project और इसकी कार्य प्रक्रिया के बारे में</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Project - Forever Miss India/Mrs India 2023</strong><br>\r\nMiss India और Mrs India 2023 Title के लिए Registration की अवधि Official तौर पर जनवरी 2023 से शुरू हुई थी। अपने पिछले दो सत्रों में इस Beauty Pageant ने कई रिकॉर्ड तोड़े और कई राज्यों और शहरों का ध्यान आकर्षित किया। International Competitors को अब स्थानीय, State और National Competitors के साथ Competition करने की अनुमति दी जा रही है, Competition रूढ़िवादिता को तोड़ने और नए रिकॉर्ड बनाने के लिए तैयार है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Project Miss Teen India 2023</strong><br>\r\n18 वर्ष से कम आयु की लड़कियों को इस विशेष Beauty Pageant में भाग लेने और अपना कौशल दिखाने की अनुमति है। जिनकी उम्र 18 वर्ष से कम है, वे घर से Audition दे सकते हैं। इस Platform का मुख्य आकर्षण यह तथ्य है कि Training या Grooming session के अलावा, Participant इस Platform पर Special Crowning Event में भी भाग ले सकते हैं। Website का एक Official Youtube Channel है और OTT Platform पर Live Content Stream करता है। मंच का बड़ा आकर्षण World Miss Teen India का खिताब है, जो Miss Teen India Beauty Pageant के अतिरिक्त है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Project - Super Women/Super Heroes Awards</strong><br>\r\nइस Project को पहले ही 70 से अधिक विभिन्न श्रेणियों में पुरस्कार मिल चुके हैं। जैसे ही सीजन 4 का पंजीकरण शुरू हुआ, इसे पूरे भारत से भारी प्रतिक्रिया मिली। यह पुरस्कार समारोह दूसरों से बहुत विशिष्ट है क्योंकि यह एकमात्र मंच है जो नामांकन के लिए दो विकल्प प्रदान करता है: \"Nomination for the Title\" और & \"पुरस्कार के लिए नामांकन\" । प्रतिभागियों को Highest Google रैंकिंग प्राप्त होती है, और लाइव इवेंट इन पुरस्कारों की विशेष हाइलाइट्स में से एक है। साथ ही, OTT, Community और Social Networking Platforms पर अपने यूजर्स को Lifetime Membership देने वाला यह पहला और एकमात्र प्लेटफॉर्म है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Project - FSIA Awards</strong><br>\r\nहालांकि Forever Star India को National Award शो आयोजित करने के लिए पहचाना जाता है, लेकिन अब इसने International Community में भी नाम हासिल कर लिया है। International FSIA Awards के लिए, इस प्लेटफॉर्म को दुनिया भर में Registration के लिए भारी प्रतिक्रियाएं मिल रही हैं। मंच अपना नाम बना रहा है और विश्व स्तर पर लाखों लोगों का दिल जीत रहा है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>प्रोजेक्ट – Miss FSIA/ Mrs FISA</strong><br>\r\nप्रतियोगिता वैश्विक स्तर पर Unique है क्योंकि यह 2022 में भारत में शुरू होने वाली पहली Worldwide Beauty Pageant थी, और इस वर्ष, 139 से अधिक देशों ने प्रतिस्पर्धा करने के लिए Registration कराया। Registration खुलते ही Website और App Participants और Franchise फॉर्म से भर गए। Event Planners ने इस साल Finale and Grand Finale Show की मेजबानी के लिए चुना है, जहां दुनिया भर के कई शानदार चेहरे Ramp Walk करेंगे और अपनी क्षमताओं का प्रदर्शन करेंगे। शो को Youtube जैसे OTT प्लेटफॉर्म पर Live Stream किया जाएगा।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Google Ranking</strong><br>\r\nप्रत्येक प्रतिभागी को Google Ranking के माध्यम से Social Media पर शीर्ष स्थान दिया गया है जो उन्हें दुनिया के हर कोने तक पहुँचाने में लाभान्वित करता है। Google Ranking के संबंध में, FSIA एकमात्र ऐसा मंच है जो अपने Participants, Winners और Fashion Industry के प्रभावशाली व्यक्तित्वों को उच्च रैंकिंग देता है। प्रत्येक सदस्य सबसे अधिक उपयोग किए जाने वाले Keyword के साथ Google पर highlight प्राप्त करता है, जिससे उन्हें शीर्ष पर रहने और उनकी कार्य संस्कृतियों की पहचान करने में सहायता मिलती है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Fsia App</strong><br>\r\nFsia App इस प्लेटफॉर्म का Special Attraction है। सभी शो इस App के साथ-साथ Youtube Channel पर भी Live Stream किए जाते हैं। टीम प्रत्येक उम्मीदवार को Social Media प्लेटफॉर्म तक अलग पहुंच भी प्रदान करती है ताकि वे दर्शकों से जुड़ सके और साथ ही अपने अनुभव और उपलब्धियों को उनके साथ साझा कर सकें। आपको बता दें कि यह दुनिया का पहला ऐप है जहां सभी शो को न केवल Live Stream किया जाता है बल्कि सभी Beauty Contest के लिए एक अनूठा Social Media Community Platform बनाया जाता है।</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-14 : 02:06:52'),
(106, 25, 'India\'s first Water less Face Wash | Aqua Water less face wash | Best Dirt Removal Face Wash in India', 21, 0, 2, '5,14', 'assets/img/blog/1690198869.png', 'Aqua Waterless Face Wash', '', '', '', '', 'aqua-waterless-dirt-removal-face-wash', 'India\'s first Water less Face Wash | Aqua Water less face wash | Best Dirt Removal Face Wash in India', 'India\'s first Water less Face Wash | Aqua Water less face wash | Best Dirt Removal Face Wash in India', 'India\'s first Water less Face Wash | Aqua Water less face wash | Best Dirt Removal Face Wash in India', 'Aqua Waterless Face Wash', 'Dirt Removal Face Wash', 'Best Dirt Removal Face Wash in India', 'Aqua Waterless Face Wash', 'Aqua Waterless Face Wash', 'Aqua Waterless Face Wash | Best Dirt Removal Face Wash in India', 'https://newsforever.in/aqua-waterless-dirt-removal-face-wash', 'Aqua Waterless Face Wash is popular as Best Face Wash in India. Easy to use, Easy to Carry, and Face Wash that fights acne.', 'assets/img/blog/1686827139.png', '<p>Aqua Waterless Face Wash contains 100% natural and organic Aloe vera extract and Argan extract which are chemically inert. In addition to its lightweight, it does not contain any synthetic fragrances nor do any of our products contain animal byproducts such as petrochemicals. The face wash is a skin care product used to cleanse the face by removing dirt, excess oil, and impurities from the skin. It is an important part of the daily skincare routine and helps in keeping the skin clean and fresh.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is India&#39;s first waterless aqua face wash which thoroughly cleanses your face without a single drop of water. Aloe vera has antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and skin-healing properties. It is also known to fight the harmful effects of pollution and UV rays on the skin. Its unique slush-like texture and pleasant fragrance absorb quickly into the skin and instantly recharge moisture with a refreshing cooling effect. It is unique and 100% and quickly cleanses your skin. Just dab a little, apply all over the face, and wipe off.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aloe Vera in the waterless face wash helps fight the effects of pollution and sun tan on your skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The waterless face wash is an effective way to clean your polluted and dusty face without water and get instant freshness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It has oil control and non-harmful extracts to keep you looking fresh for hours. You can use waterless face wash regularly to get oil-free and clean skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Face washes contain gentle exfoliating particles or chemical exfoliates to remove dead skin cells and unclog pores. They can be helpful for improving skin texture and radiance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waterless face wash can be useful when traveling, camping, or in situations where access to water is limited. Start with dry skin. Remove any makeup or surface dirt with a makeup remover wipe or cleansing oil, if necessary.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How To Use:- Take an appropriate amount of Aqua Waterless Face Wash on your hand and then gently rub it all over your face and neck and wipe off with a clean tissue or wipe. and instant glow your face after use.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-15 : 02:06:45'),
(107, 25, 'Miss Mrs and Miss Teen India Announces City Level Crowning in July 2023', 21, 6, 1, '8,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1686831870.png', 'Miss Mrs and Miss Teen India 2023 City winners Crowning', '', '', '', '', 'miss-mrs-miss-teen-india-city-winners-crowning-in-july-2023', 'Miss Mrs and Miss Teen India Announces City Level Crowning in July 2023', 'miss india city crowning, mrs india 2023 city crowning, miss teen city crowning, city winners 2023, miss india 2023, mrs india 2023, miss teen india 2023', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning of Miss India 2023, Mrs India 2023, and Miss Teen India 2023 in July 2023. All the City winners will Join the Crowning Ceremony Online Virtually.', 'Miss Mrs and Miss Teen India Announces City Level Crowning', 'Miss India 2023 City Level Crowning', 'Mrs India 2023 City Level Crowning', 'Miss Teen India 2023 City Level Crowning', 'Miss Mrs and Miss Teen India Announces City Level Crowning', 'Miss Mrs and Miss Teen India Announces City Level Crowning in July 2023', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-mrs-miss-teen-india-city-winners-crowning-in-july-2023', 'Forever Star India Announces City Level Crowning of Miss India 2023, Mrs India 2023, and Miss Teen India 2023 in July 2023. All the City winners will Join the Crowning Ceremony Online Virtually.', 'assets/img/blog/1686831891.png', '<p>Forever Miss, Mrs And Miss Teen India is a prestigious beauty pageant held annually in India. It serves as a platform for young women to showcase their talent, intelligence, and beauty. The winner of Miss India goes on to represent the country at international pageants such as Miss, Mrs FSIA, Miss, Mrs Universe, and Miss, Mrs International.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pageant has various stages, starting from City Level Auditions and Selections, leading to zonal competitions and ultimately culminating in the National Pageant. Contestants are judged based on various criteria, including their physical appearance, intelligence, personality, communication skills, and overall presence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen India have a rich history and have produced several notable winners who have achieved success in the entertainment industry and beyond. The pageant is a significant platform for young women aspiring to make a mark in modeling, acting, and related fields.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen India will held on city level crowning in July 2023 and up-to-date information regarding, I recommend visiting the official website of www.fsia.in or following their social media channels.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-15 : 03:06:55'),
(108, 25, 'India\'s First Water less  Rose Mint Face wash | Glowing face after use| Men & women Pollution Out Face wash Face Wash | All Skin Types 60mL', 21, 0, 2, '', 'assets/img/blog/1686915388.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'india-s-first-water-less-rose-mint-face-wash-rub-and-wipe-suitable-for-all-skin-type-bright-and-fresh-skin-men-Women-Glowing-Skin-Deep-Clean', 'India\'s First Water less  Rose Mint Face wash | Glowing face after use| Men & women Pollution Out Face wash Face Wash | All Skin Types 60mL', 'India\'s First Water less  Rose Mint Face wash | Glowing face after use| Men & women Pollution Out Face wash Face Wash | All Skin Types 60mL', 'India\'s First Water less  Rose Mint Face wash | Glowing face after use| Men & women Pollution Out Face wash Face Wash | All Skin Types 60mL', 'water less facewash', 'rose mint facewash', 'organic water less face wash', 'dark spots remove water less facewash', 'India\'s First Water less  Rose Mint Face wash | Glowing face after use| Men & women Pollution Out Face wash Face Wash | All Skin Types 60mL', 'India\'s First Water less  Rose Mint Face wash | Glowing face after use| Men & women Pollution Out Face wash Face Wash | All Skin Types 60mL', 'https://newsforever.in/india-s-first-water-less-rose-mint-face-wash-rub-and-wipe-suitable-for-all-skin-type-bright-and-fresh-skin-men-Women-Glowing-Skin-Deep-Clean', 'Blush & Bloom Rose Mint Waterless Facewash Rub & Wipe, suitable for all skin types, Bright & Fresh skin Men & Women, Glowing Skin, Deep Clean, All Skin Types 60mL', 'assets/img/blog/1686915431.png', '<p>Rose extracts in the waterless face wash are full of antioxidant; it prevents damaged skin cells and encourages the regeneration of skin tissues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mint extracts in water-less face wash help fight pollution effects and maintain well-textured skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The waterless face wash is an effective way to clean your polluted and dusty face without water and get freshness immediately.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Blush &amp; Bloom waterless face is an idle product for skin care. This is made to use anywhere any time; you don&rsquo;t need to have water to wash your face. Rose mint waterless face wash is enriched with rose &amp; mint extract which helps to clean the face deeply even without water. The waterless face wash is a unique skin care product that is designed without harmful chemicals, silicon, &amp; paraben. Waterless face wash provides you with instantly glowing skin in a few seconds. It clears dust, pollution, and impurities deeply without the use of a single drop of water. The first use of waterless face wash will make you love your skin. The pleasant fragrance absorbs immediately and instantly moisture with a cooling effect. It has oil control and non-damaging extracts for fresh looks for hours. You can use the waterless face wash regularly to get oil-free and clear skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How To Use:- Take an appropriate amount of Aqua Waterless Face Wash on your hand and then gently rub it all over your face and neck and wipe off with a clean tissue or wipe. and instant glow your face after use.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-16 : 02:06:54'),
(109, 25, 'Glowing Facewash Enriched With Aloevera & Niacinamide For Remove Dark Spots, dust, Ance & pigmentation Deep Cleansing Face Wash Pack of 1 (100ml)', 21, 0, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1686992093.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'glowing-facewash-enriched-with-aloevera---niacinamide-for-remove-dark-spots', 'Glowing Facewash Enriched With Aloevera & Niacinamide For Remove Dark Spots, dust, Ance & pigmentation Deep Cleansing Face Wash Pack of 1 (100ml)', 'glowing facewash, aloevera facewash, dark spots remove facewash, ', 'Glowing Facewash Enriched With Aloevera & Niacinamide For Remove Dark Spots, dust, Ance & pigmentation Deep Cleansing Face Wash Pack of 1 (100ml)', 'facewash', 'dark spots facewash', 'dust remove face wash', 'deep cleansing facewash', 'aloevera facewash', 'Glowing Facewash Enriched With Aloevera & Niacinamide For Remove Dark Spots', 'https://newsforever.in/glowing-facewash-enriched-with-aloevera---niacinamide-for-remove-dark-spots', 'Glowing Facewash Enriched With Aloevera & Niacinamide For Remove Dark Spots, dust, Ance & pigmentation Deep Cleansing Face Wash Pack of 1 (100ml)', 'assets/img/blog/1686993267.png', '<p>Green tea extract and aloe Vera in Forever glowing face wash, plays an important role in providing smooth and glowing skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever glowing face wash helps to reduce oxidative stress and gives protection from early aging signs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kojic Acid used in forever glowing face wash helps to lighten dark spots, blemishes, and pigmentation and minimizes the reappearance of patches on the skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever glowing face wash is good for wrinkle reduction; provides improved skin texture and glowing and clear skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is a perfect formula for open pores improvement, protects your skin from dust, pollution, and sun tanning, and prevents skin infections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe glowing face wash is an ultimate skin care product that is made to clear dead skin without harming the skin and pores. This ultra glow face wash will be helpful to keep your pores clear, prevents form skin issues, and provide you clear skin Forever glowing face wash is a unique formula to provide ultra glow to your skin. It is the combination of natural elements like Kojic acid, beta arbutin, and Niacinamide. These factors are good for enlightening dark spots, minimizing discoloration, reduce pigmentation. Reduce open pores and enrich the bright skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>USE&nbsp;DIRECTIONS:&nbsp;-&nbsp;1. Wet your face with normal or lukewarm water. 2. Apply an adequate amount of face wash. 3. Gently rub on the wet skin area in a circular motion for 1-2 minutes. 4. Wash off your face, once it is done. 5. Swipe your face with a soft towel or tissue.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-17 : 12:06:33'),
(110, 25, 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 21, 6, 1, '8,10,12,13,14', 'assets/img/blog/1687005254.png', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', '', '', '', '', 'miss-india-2023-city-winners-crowning-ceremony-announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement - Forever Star India has announced the Crowning Ceremony of Miss India 2023 in July, 2023.', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-india-2023-city-winners-crowning-ceremony-announcement', 'Miss India 2023 City Winners Crowning Ceremony Announcement - Forever Star India has announced the Crowning Ceremony of Miss India 2023 in July, 2023.', 'assets/img/blog/1687005278.png', '<p><strong>Miss India 2023 City Winners Announcement: The Countdown Begins</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The wait is finally over! The city winners of Miss India 2023 will be announced in July, 2023. The grand finale will be held in Jaipur, Rajasthan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 2023 pageant has been a star-studded affair, with contestants from across India vying for the coveted title. The contestants have undergone a rigorous training schedule, which has included workshops on public speaking, modeling, and personal development.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The judges for the pageant include Top Industry Experts. They will be joined by fashion designers, choreographers, and beauty experts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The winners of Miss India 2023 City Winners will compete for the State and National Crowning Ceremony, which will be held later this year. The Miss India pageant is one of the most prestigious beauty pageants in the world. It has helped to launch the careers of many successful models and actresses,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 2023 pageant is sure to be a star-studded affair, and the winner will be a worthy representative of India on the global stage.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-17 : 03:06:34'),
(111, 25, 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo conditioner, Ultrashine, Healthy Hair Growth, Hair Fall Rescue Conditioner, Scalp Care, Keratin formula for Damaged Hair, Advanced Hair Fall Solution Shampoo Conditioner 300ml', 21, 0, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1687239278.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'pro-keratin-professional-shampoo-conditioner-ultrashine-healthy-hair-growth-hair-fall-rescue-conditioner', 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo conditioner, Ultrashine, Healthy Hair Growth, Hair Fall Rescue Conditioner, Scalp Care, Keratin formula for Damaged Hair, Advanced Hair Fall Solution Shampoo Conditioner 300ml', 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo conditioner, Ultrashine, Healthy Hair Growth, Hair Fall Rescue Conditioner, Scalp Care, Keratin formula for Damaged Hair, Advanced Hair Fall Solution Shampoo Conditioner 300ml', 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo conditioner, Ultrashine, Healthy Hair Growth, Hair Fall Rescue Conditioner, Scalp Care, Keratin formula for Damaged Hair, Advanced Hair Fall Solution Shampoo Conditioner 300ml', 'shampoo', 'conditioner', 'pro keratin shampoo', 'pro keratin shampoo and conditioner', 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo conditioner, Ultrashine, Healthy Hair Growth', 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo conditioner, Ultrashine, Healthy Hair Growth, Hair Fall Rescue Conditioner, Scalp Care, Keratin formula for Damaged Hair, Advanced Hair Fall Solution Shampoo Conditioner 300ml', 'https://newsforever.in/pro-keratin-professional-shampoo-conditioner-ultrashine-healthy-hair-growth-hair-fall-rescue-conditioner', 'Pro Keratin Professional Shampoo Conditioner, Ultra shine, Healthy Hair Growth, Hair Fall Rescue Conditioner, Scalp Care, Keratin formula for Damaged Hair, Advanced Hair Fall Solution Shampoo Conditioner 300ml', 'assets/img/blog/1687239933.png', '<p>Pro-Keratin shampoo conditioner contains pre-Moroccan Argon oil that gives hair smoothness, and silkiness and reduces hair fall.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keratin formula promotes the repair of damaged hair, nurtures the scalps, and gives you strong hair.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pro-Keratin Shampoo has argan oil which helps in reducing dryness, frizziness of hair and protects your hair from styling issues, and boosts hair growth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pro-Keratin Shampoo helps rejuvenate coarsely and strengthen your looks to silky and perfect hair</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pro-Keratin shampoo conditioner is suggested to use twice a week or as per your type of hair. Do not use warm water to wash your hair as it can cause damage to hair and increase scalp infections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Leaves Grow Max is A smoothening and restoring hair conditioner to help protect limp hair and keep flaky scalp in check. It is ideal for dandruff-prone hir. Gives hair airy volume and freshness. The hair conditioner helps to keep dandruff in check and prevents flakes from sticking to strands.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It contains antioxidants that protect the scalp. Keep the roots clean and improve blood circulation to the scalp.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-19 : 02:06:31'),
(112, 25, 'Jhunjhunu Finalist Miss India 2023 Monodipa Sarkar', 21, 6, 1, '5,8,9,10,12,13', 'assets/img/blog/1687257369.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'jhunjhunu-finalist-miss-india-2023-monodipa-sarkar', 'Jhunjhunu Finalist Miss India 2023 Monodipa Sarkar', 'miss jhunjhunu finalist, miss india 2023 city finalist, monodipa sarkar miss india 2023 city finalist', 'Jhunjhunu Finalist Miss India 2023 Monodipa Sarkar, Jhunjhunu Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Monodipa Sarkar has reserved her place in as Jhunjhunu Finalist. Monodipa Sarkar, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future.', 'miss jhunjhunu city finalist', 'miss india 2023 monodipa sarkar', 'monodipa sarkar Jhunjhunu city Finalist 2023', 'miss jhunjhunu finalist 2023', 'jhunjhunu finalist miss india 2023 monodipa sarkar', 'jhunjhunu finalist miss india 2023 monodipa sarkar', 'https://newsforever.in/jhunjhunu-finalist-miss-india-2023-monodipa-sarkar', 'Jhunjhunu Finalist Miss India 2023 Monodipa Sarkar, Jhunjhunu. Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Monodipa Sarkar has reserved her place in as Jhunjhunu Finalist. Monodipa Sarkar, who is a beautiful lady and she is a', 'assets/img/blog/1687257417.png', '<p>Jhunjhunu.Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Monodipa Sarkar has reserved her place in as Jhunjhunu<strong> </strong>Finalist. Monodipa Sarkar, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/monodipa-sarkar-miss-india-2023-id-38022\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://fsia.in/missindia_profile/38022Monodipa Sarkar IMG-20230415-WA0012.jpg\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city.Crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves.Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant.Forever Star India congratulates Miss Monodipa Sarkar that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-20 : 01:06:06'),
