ty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves.Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant.Forever Star India congratulates Miss Alisha Shephali that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-20 : 02:06:15'),
(114, 25, 'Reclame Black Shampoo, Hair Growth, Damage Repair and Hair Fall Control, Enriched With Argan Oil & Virgin Olive Oil, Hydrating Therapy, Moisture for Thin Hair Formula', 21, 0, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1687264793.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'reclame-black-shampoo-hair-growth-damage-repair-and-hair-fall-control', 'Reclame Black Shampoo, Hair Growth, Damage Repair and Hair Fall Control, Enriched With Argan Oil & Virgin Olive Oil, Hydrating Therapy, Moisture for Thin Hair Formula', 'reclame shampoo, black shampoo, damage hair repair, hair fall control', 'Reclame Black Shampoo, Hair Growth, Damage Repair and Hair Fall Control, Enriched With Argan Oil & Virgin Olive Oil, Hydrating Therapy, Moisture for Thin Hair Formula', 'shampoo', 'black shampoo', 'natural black shampoo', 'shampoo for men and women', 'reclame black shampoo, hair growth, damage repair and hair fall control', 'Reclame Black Shampoo, Hair Growth, Damage Repair and Hair Fall Control, Enriched With Argan Oil & Virgin Olive Oil, Hydrating Therapy, Moisture for Thin Hair Formula', 'https://newsforever.in/reclame-black-shampoo-hair-growth-damage-repair-and-hair-fall-control', 'Reclame Black Shampoo, Hair Growth, Damage Repair, and Hair Fall Control, Enriched With Argan Oil & Virgin Olive Oil, Hydrating Therapy, Moisture for Thin Hair Formula', '', '<p>Reclame Black Shampoo, Hair Growth, Damage Repair, and Hair Fall Control, Enriched With Argan Oil &amp; Virgin Olive Oil, Hydrating Therapy, Moisture for Thin Hair Formula</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The shampoo is made with absolutely pure and natural ingredients; it is paraben and silicone free.<br />\r\nThe smooth texture is good for hair &amp; Scalp health. And make your hair strong and shiny.<br />\r\nReclame Black Shampoo is a complete hydrating therapy for your hair care.<br />\r\nReclame Black Shampoo is suitable for every hair type, anyone can apply this shampoo for deep moisture and shiny hair.<br />\r\nThe combination of Moroccan, Argon oil &amp; Virgin olive oil in Reclame black shampoo improves hair smoothness and silkiness and prevents hair loss.<br />\r\nMoroccan oil helps to maintain scalp health and balance the required PH balance.<br />\r\nWheat protein plays an important role in shampoo, this is to clean and protect the scalp from infections and provide strong hair.<br />\r\nReclame Black Shampoo is a perfect formula to give volume to your hair and maintain them as clean, shiny, and strong.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Directions of use: 1. Wet your hair with normal or lukewarm water. 2. Apply a sufficient amount of shampoo. 3. Gently massage the scalp for 1-2 minutes. 4. Avoid direct contact with your eyes. 5. Rinse your hair with lukewarm water once the shampoo is thoroughly absorbed in the scalp. 6. Follow the conditioner usage as per your daily hair care. Using Grow Max conditioner with Reclame black shine shampoo will give you great results.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-20 : 03:06:12'),
