remonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves.Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant.Forever Star India congratulates Miss Dr. Rhea Monteiro that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-20 : 10:06:16');
