(117, 25, 'Grow Max Hair Conditioner, Dandruff free hair Care, Hair Repair, Enriched With Green Tea Ext. & Olive Oil, For Men & Women 200ml', 21, 0, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1687346647.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'grow-max-hair-conditioner-dandruff-hair-care-hair-repair-enriched-with-green-tea-ext-olive-oil-for-men-women', 'Grow Max Hair Conditioner, Dandruff free hair Care, Hair Repair, Enriched With Green Tea Ext. & Olive Oil, For Men & Women 200ml', 'Grow Max Hair Conditioner, Dandruff free hair Care, Hair Repair, Enriched With Green Tea Ext. & Olive Oil, For Men & Women 200ml', 'Grow Max Hair Conditioner, Dandruff free hair Care, Hair Repair, Enriched With Green Tea Ext. & Olive Oil, For Men & Women 200ml', 'Hair Conditioner', 'Conditioner for Dandruff Free Hair', 'Anti Hair Fall Conditioner', 'Nourish Conditioner', 'Grow Max Hair Conditioner', 'Grow max Hair Conditioner, Dandruff free hair Care, Hair Repair, Enriched With Green Tea Ext. & Olive Oil, For Men & Women 200ml', 'https://newsforever.in/grow-max-hair-conditioner-dandruff-hair-care-hair-repair-enriched-with-green-tea-ext-olive-oil-for-men-women', 'Grow max Hair Conditioner, Dandruff free hair Care, Hair Repair, Enriched With Green Tea Ext. & Olive Oil, For Men & Women 200ml', 'assets/img/blog/1687347161.png', '<p>Antioxidants are added in the condition to protect your scalp; roots clean and maintain a healthy scalp and hair.<br />\r\nGROW MAX conditioner comes up with smoothening and protection from heat, dust and improved blood circulation in the scalp.<br />\r\nGreen tea ext and olive oil are the best-combined formula which makes this conditioner useful and you can notice the volume of hair and reduced hair fall.<br />\r\nGROW MAX conditioner is a dandruff-prone element and prevents flakes from sticking to strands.<br />\r\nDirections of Use: 1. Shampoo your hair and rinse excess water. 2. Take enough amount of condition in your hand and mash between the palms for better application. 3. Apply on the length of your hair from mid-length to the tip and spread evenly. 4. Avoid applying on the roots of and scalp. 5. Comb your hair with your fingers and leave for 2-3 minutes. 6. Rinse the water till the conditioners wave off from your hair.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Leaves Grow Max is a smoothening and restoring hair conditioner to help protect limp hair and keep flaky scalp in check. It is ideal for dandruff-prone hair. Gives hair airy volume and freshness. The hair conditioner helps to keep dandruff in check and prevents flakes from sticking to strands.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It contains antioxidants that protect the scalp. Keep the roots clean and improve blood circulation to the scalp.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-21 : 02:06:10'),
(118, 25, 'Kutch Finalist Miss India 2023 Preeti Mangu Anandani', 21, 6, 1, '12,13,15,18,19,20,22,23,27', 'assets/img/blog/1687348714.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'kutch-finalist-miss-india-2023-preeti-mangu-anandani', 'Kutch Finalist Miss India 2023 Preeti Mangu Anandani', 'miss kutch finalist, miss india 2023 finalist, miss preeti mangu anandani city finalilst', 'Kutch Finalist Miss India 2023 Preeti Mangu Anandani, Kutch Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Preeti Mangu Anandani has reserved her place in as Kutch Finalist.', 'Kutch Finalist Miss India 2023 Preeti Mangu Anandani', 'Miss Preeti Mangu Anandani City Finalist', 'Miss Preeti Mangu Anandani City Finalist 2023', 'Miss Kutch City Finalist 2023', 'Miss Preeti Mangu Anandani City Finalist Miss India 2023', 'Kutch Finalist Miss India 2023 Preeti Mangu Anandani', 'https://newsforever.in/kutch-finalist-miss-india-2023-preeti-mangu-anandani', 'Kutch Finalist Miss India 2023 Preeti Mangu Anandani, Kutch Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Preeti Mangu Anandani has reserved her place in as Kutch Finalist.', 'assets/img/blog/1687348734.png', '<p>Kutch. Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Preeti Mangu Anandani has reserved her place in as Kutch Finalist. Preeti Mangu Anandani, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in the first week of July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city.Crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves.Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant.Forever Star India congratulates Miss Preeti Mangu Anandani that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-21 : 02:06:44'),
