(163, 25, 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules', 31, 32, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1687776359.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'hair-therapy-tablet-hair-growth-supplement-for-men-and-women-hair-growth-capsules', 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules', 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules', 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules, BENEFITS - Hair therapy rejuvenates hair follicles and helps in preventing hair loss.', 'hair therapy tablet', 'hair growth tablet for women', 'hair growth supplement', 'men and women hair growth tablet', 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules', 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules', 'https://newsforever.in/hair-therapy-tablet-hair-growth-supplement-for-men-and-women-hair-growth-capsules', 'Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men & Women Hair Growth Capsules, BENEFITS - Hair therapy rejuvenates hair follicles and helps in preventing hair loss.', 'assets/img/blog/1687776933.png', '<p>Hair Therapy Tablet, Hair Growth Supplement For Men &amp; Women Hair Growth Capsules</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BENEFITS - Hair therapy rejuvenates hair follicles and helps in preventing hair loss.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hair therapy is designed to increase Keratin production naturally &amp; gives you a clean scalp and smooth hair.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hair therapy helps to improve the tensile strength of hair naturally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hair therapy contains natural oils, vitamin extracts, calcium, magnesium &amp; biotin which are essential to maintain healthy hair.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a pure &amp; natural product made with perfect hair care ingredients; these are useful for everyone of age.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>USAGE - Hair therapy is recommended to have one tablet daily anytime during the day after meals. The impact can be seen within 7-10 days of use. You would be able to notice the strong hair and smooth scalps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>OUTCOMES - Regular use can prevent scalp infections, dandruff &amp; damaged hair issues. The use of hair therapy can help you get strong and thick hair naturally. No artificial elements are added to the tablets which can cause side effects to your hair.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hair therapy Tablets are a perfect clinically proven formula to prevent all hair problems, the generation of an unhealthy lifestyle is facing. Hair therapy Tablets s are the solution to the frequent problem of hair loss because dandruff, sticky scalps, medical conditions, heredity, or a normal part of aging can be common issues people face. The Tablets are useful to improve the effects of stress, tension, and improper diet &amp; sleep. Features Hair therapy Tablets are created considering the general problems of people of every age facing hair loss, slow hair growth, damaged hair &amp; poor hair quality. The Tablets work to stimulate the hair follicle and help to increase Keratin production naturally and you will get smooth hair. Highlights Hair therapy Tablets are a high-quality supplement for any age of adult whether men or women both. The Tablets are clinically proven hair care health supplement formulas. However, it is not a medicine. Hair therapy Tablets are a great complement to cure thin hair, re-growth, and provide volume to the hair.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-26 : 01:06:49');
