(168, 25, 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami', 23, 5, 1, '27,27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1687955434.png', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami', '', '', '', '', 'best-author-in-bikaner-nomination-kiran-swami', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami', 'best author, best authorin bikaner, best author nomination 2023, Kiran Swami  best authorin bikaner  nomination 2023', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami has been nominated for Best Author in Bikaner by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami', 'The Real Super Woman Award 2023', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination 2023', 'Kiran Swami Best Author in Bikaner', 'Kiran Swami Best Author in Bikaner Nomination 2023', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami', 'https://newsforever.in/best-author-in-bikaner-nomination-kiran-swami', 'Best Author in Bikaner Nomination goes to Kiran Swami has been nominated for Best Author in Bikaner by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from acr', 'assets/img/blog/1687955929.png', '<p>Kiran Swami has been nominated for Best Author in Bikaner by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. Kiran Swami is a well-respected author and meditation teacher in Bikaner. She is passionate about helping people achieve happiness and reduce stress, and her work has touched the lives of many.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nomination for Best Author in Bikaner is a testament to Kiran Swami&#39;s dedication to her craft and her commitment to helping others. We are confident that she will be a worthy recipient of this award And She would be a valuable addition to the award ceremony.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Real Super Woman Award ceremony will be held on July 15, 2023 in Jaipur. We wish Kiran Swami the best for her future endeavors!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/teacher-super-women-awards-2023-kiran-swami-bikaner\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1687955862.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony will be Streaming Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the participants can create their own profile which can be updated on a regular basis. The verified profiles of all members will be visible to everyone. Every Verified Member will get an E-certificate and Hard Copy Certificate that will be delivered to your doorstep. These award shows have been organized for all multi talents of India. Each and every member of Forever Star India Awards will be entitled to numerous benefits and opportunities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-28 : 03:06:00'),
