(172, 25, 'Best Social Activist in Delhi Nomination goes to Dr Mamta Mohan Singh', 23, 5, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1688040929.png', 'Best Social Activist in Delhi Nomination goes to Dr Mamta Mohan Singh', '', '', '', '', 'best-social-activist-in-delhi-nomination-dr-mamta-mohan-singh', 'Best Social Activist in Delhi Nomination goes to Dr Mamta Mohan Singh', 'Best Social Activist in Delhi Nomination goes to Dr Mamta Mohan Singh', 'Dr. Mamta Mohan Singh has been nominated for Best Social Activist in Delhi by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'Best Social Activist in Delhi Nomination goes to Dr Mamta Mohan Singh', 'The Real Super Woman Award 2023', 'Dr Mamta Mohan Singh Best Social Activist Nomination 2023', 'Best Social Activist in Delhi 2023', 'Best Social Activist Nomination The Real Super Woman Award 2023', 'Best Social Activist in Delhi Nomination goes to Dr Mamta Mohan Singh', 'https://newsforever.in/best-social-activist-in-delhi-nomination-dr-mamta-mohan-singh', 'Dr. Mamta Mohan Singh has been nominated for Best Social Activist in Delhi by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'assets/img/blog/1688041004.png', '<p><strong>Dr. Mamta Mohan Singh</strong> has been nominated for <strong>Best Social Activist</strong> in Delhi by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. Dr. Mamta mohan Singh, Educators, Social worker, Ambassador in World Human Rights Protection Commission, New Delhi, India, has counseled 5000 and ongoing women and children in the nation. She has been able to transform many lives and made them understand that education is the only answer to everything for each of us.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nomination for Best Social Activist in Delhi goes to Dr Mamta mohan Singh. Dr Mamta mohan Singh Working to improve the education system, and help people understand the value of education since 21 years. We are confident that its Social Activist would be a valuable addition to the award ceremony.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Real Super Woman Award ceremony will be held on July 15, 2023 in Jaipur. We wish Dr Mamta mohan Singh the best for her future endeavors!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/social-activist-super-women-awards-2023-dr.-mamta-mohan-singh-delhi\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688041038.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony will be Streaming Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the participants can create their own profile which can be updated on a regular basis. The verified profiles of all members will be visible to everyone. Every Verified Member will get an E-certificate and Hard Copy Certificate that will be delivered to your doorstep. These award shows have been organized for all multi talents of India. Each and every member of Forever Star India Awards will be entitled to numerous benefits and opportunities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-06-29 : 03:06:37'),
