(175, 25, 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 21, 6, 0, '12,13,15,18,19,20,22,27', 'assets/img/blog/1688206808.png', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', '', '', '', '', 'solapur-finalist-miss-india-2023-vijaylaxmi-hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe - City Level Finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Vijaylaxmi Hirwe has reserved her place in as Solapur Finalist.', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe', 'https://newsforever.in/solapur-finalist-miss-india-2023-vijaylaxmi-hirwe', 'Solapur Finalist Miss India 2023 Vijaylaxmi Hirwe - City Level Finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Vijaylaxmi Hirwe has reserved her place in as Solapur Finalist.', 'assets/img/blog/1688206825.png', '<p><strong>Solapur.</strong> Announcements of city level finalists of <strong>Miss India 2023</strong> have started and <strong>Vijaylaxmi Hirwe</strong> has reserved her place in as <strong>Solapur Finalist</strong>. Vijaylaxmi Hirwe, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies. Dr. Vijayalaxmi Masters in Dental Surgery by Profession and by passion Martial Artist Astrologer, Tarot Reader, Meditation Expert, Spiritual Healer, Chakra Healer, Face Reader and Motivational Speaker. Life goal is live like light, shining bright in darkness of programmed life of everyone. she love fashion world since childhood.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in this July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. Crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/./assets/img/blog/Solapur_Finalist_Miss_India.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Miss Vijaylaxmi Hirwe that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-01 : 01:07:04'),
(176, 25, 'Best Music Artist in Pune Nomination goes to Nivedita Datta', 23, 5, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1688376731.png', 'Best Music Artist in Pune Nomination goes to Nivedita Datta', '', '', '', '', 'best-artist-music-in-pune-nomination-nivedita-datta', 'Best Music Artist in Pune Nomination goes to Nivedita Datta', 'best music artist in pune, nivedita datta, music artist nivedita datta, super woman awards 2023, nivedita dutta nominated as best music artist', 'Nivedita Datta has been nominated for Best Artist Music in Pune by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. ', 'Best Music Artist in Pune Nomination goes to Nivedita Datta', 'Nivedita Datta Best Music Artist in Pune', 'Best Music Artist in Pune Nivedita Datta', 'Nivedita Datta Best Music Artist in Pune Nomination 2023', 'Nivedita Datta Best Music Artist Nomination in Pune 2023', 'Best Music Artist in Pune Nomination goes to Nivedita Datta', 'https://newsforever.in/best-artist-music-in-pune-nomination-nivedita-datta', 'Nivedita Datta has been nominated for Best Artist Music in Pune by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. ', 'assets/img/blog/1688376764.png', '<p><strong>Nivedita Datta</strong> has been nominated for <strong>Best Music Artist</strong>&nbsp;in Pune by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. Nivedita Datta, Freelance Singer, Composer Music trainer Musical journey started with representing India worldwide in semi Classical Music in olso Norway under UNESCO Cultural exchange program during 1998 then after Performed in various stage shows. Was selected under top 32 finalist in C2B voice India a reality show. A full time SINGER, Music trainer in vocal as well as instrument. Event organizer Now also into Music composing And Music production. Founder of ND Music Productions composed many original songs in bengali and hindi which are now streaming in all music platforms like jio savan, gaana.com. Amazon music. spotify.com etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nomination for Best Artist in Pune goes to Nivedita Datta. Nivedita Datta Recently been selected by Mondragon University Spain as a indian women independent artist for a research work on Indian culture and improvisation of songs for a spanish magazine and in that regard conducted a cross cultural international Musical seminar on 22nd of March 2023 at Raah Literacy. We are confident that its Artist Music would be a valuable addition to the award ceremony.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Real Super Woman Award ceremony will be held on July 15, 2023 in Jaipur. We wish Nivedita Datta the best for her future endeavors!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/artist-super-women-awards-2023-nivedita-datta-pune\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688376677.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony will be Streaming Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the participants can create their own profile which can be updated on a regular basis. The verified profiles of all members will be visible to everyone. Every Verified Member will get an E-certificate and Hard Copy Certificate that will be delivered to your doorstep. These award shows have been organized for all multi talents of India. Each and every member of Forever Star India Awards will be entitled to numerous benefits and opportunities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-03 : 12:07:50'),
