(180, 25, 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul Khair Fatma', 23, 5, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1688448114.png', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul Khair Fatma', '', '', '', '', 'best-doctor-in-allahabad-nomination-dr-ummul', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul Khair Fatma', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul Khair Fatma', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul Khair Fatma', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad 2023', 'Dr Ummul Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination 2023', 'Dr Ummul Nominated 2023', 'Dr Ummul Best Doctor in Allahabad ', 'Best Doctor in Allahabad Nomination goes to Dr Ummul', 'https://newsforever.in/best-doctor-in-allahabad-nomination-dr-ummul', 'Dr Ummul has been nominated for Best Doctor in Allahabad by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'assets/img/blog/1688448393.png', '<p><strong>Dr Ummul</strong> has been nominated for <strong>Best Doctor</strong> in Allahabad by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. Dr. Ummul for being nominated as the Best Doctor in Allahabad! She is a highly respected and experienced doctor who has been practicing in Allahabad for many years. She is known for her excellent bedside manner, her dedication to her patients, and her commitment to &nbsp;roviding the best possible care.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nomination for Best Doctor in Allahabad goes to Dr Ummul. Dr Ummul is a general physician, which means that she can treat a wide range of medical conditions. She is also an expert in women&#39;s health, and she is a popular choice for obstetricians and gynecologists in Allahabad.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Real Super Woman Award ceremony will be held on July 15, 2023 in Jaipur. We wish Dr Ummul the best for her future endeavors!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/verified_user_details_women.php?id=38760\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688448420.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony will be Streaming Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the participants can create their own profile which can be updated on a regular basis. The verified profiles of all members will be visible to everyone. Every Verified Member will get an E-certificate and Hard Copy Certificate that will be delivered to your doorstep. These award shows have been organized for all multi talents of India. Each and every member of Forever Star India Awards will be entitled to numerous benefits and opportunities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-03 : 08:07:05'),
