te winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/janvi-pinakinbhai-suthar-miss-india-2023-id-39634\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688467089.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves.Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates <strong>Miss</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Janvi Pinakinbhai Suthar</strong> that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-04 : 01:07:46'),
(187, 25, 'Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar Nomination goes to Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', 23, 5, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1688468271.png', 'Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar Nomination goes to Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', '', '', '', '', 'best-business-woman-in-ahmed-nagar-nomination-dr-mayuri-netaji-thakare', 'Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar Nomination goes to Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', 'best business woman 2023, best business woman in ahmed nagar, dr mayuri netaji nomination 2023, super woman awards 2023', 'Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare has been nominated for Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar Nomination goes to Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', 'Ahmed Nagar Nomination 2023 Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', 'Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare Nominated Best Business Woman 2023', 'Best Business Woman Nomination 2023', 'Ahmed Nagar Nomination Best Business Woman 2023 Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', 'Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar Nomination goes to Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare', 'https://newsforever.in/best-business-woman-in-ahmed-nagar-nomination-dr-mayuri-netaji-thakare', 'Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare has been nominated for Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'assets/img/blog/1688468288.png', '<p><strong>Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare </strong>has been nominated for <strong>Best Business Woman</strong> in Ahmed Nagar by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare for being nominated as the Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nomination for Best Business Woman in Ahmed Nagar goes to Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Real Super Woman Award ceremony will be held on July 15, 2023 in Jaipur. We wish Dr Mayuri Netaji Thakare the best for her future endeavors!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/verified_user_details_women.php?id=40808\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688468154.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony will be Streaming Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the participants can create their own profile which can be updated on a regular basis. The verified profiles of all members will be visible to everyone. Every Verified Member will get an E-certificate and Hard Copy Certificate that will be delivered to your doorstep. These award shows have been organized for all multi talents of India. Each and every member of Forever Star India Awards will be entitled to numerous benefits and opportunities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-04 : 02:07:05'),
