(192, 25, 'Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda', 21, 6, 1, '12,13,15,18,19,20,22,23,27', 'assets/img/blog/1688553207.png', 'Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda', '', '', '', '', 'jamshedpur-finalist-miss-india-2023-mayuri-nanda', 'Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda', 'miss jamshedpur 2023. miss jamshedpur finalist 2023, miss india 2023, miss mayuri nanda jamshedpur city finalist 2023', 'Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda, Jamshedpur Announcements of city level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Mayuri Nanda has reserved her place in as Jamshedpur.', 'Miss Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda', 'Miss Jamshedpur 2023 Mayuri Nanda', 'Miss Mayuri Nanda Jamshedpur City Finalist 2023', 'Miss Jamshedpur City Finalist 2023', 'Miss Mayuri Nanda Jamshedpur City Finalist Miss India 2023 ', 'Miss Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda', 'https://newsforever.in/jamshedpur-finalist-miss-india-2023-mayuri-nanda', 'Jamshedpur Finalist Miss India 2023 Mayuri Nanda, Jamshedpur Announcements of city level finalists of Mrs India 2023 have started and Mayuri Nanda has reserved her place in as Jamshedpur.', 'assets/img/blog/1688553190.png', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jamshedpur</strong>. Announcements of city level finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and <strong>Mayuri Nanda </strong>has reserved her place in as Jamshedpur. Mayuri Nanda, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future. She had completed her graduation as well as Post graduation in mass communication.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in this July, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. Crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state win