(195, 25, 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary', 23, 5, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1688557900.png', 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary', '', '', '', '', 'best-event-manager-in-thane-nomination-sangeeta-chaudhary', 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary', 'best event manager 2023, best event manager in thane, best event manager nominated sangeeta chaudhary, super woman awards 2023', 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary has been nominated for Best Event Manager in Thane by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India.', 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary', 'Sangeeta Chaudhary Best Event Manager 2023', 'Best Event Manager in Thane 2023', 'Sangeeta Chaudhary Nominated Event Manager 2023', 'Thane City Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary Best Event Manager 2023', 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary', 'https://newsforever.in/best-event-manager-in-thane-nomination-sangeeta-chaudhary', 'Best Event Manager in Thane Nomination goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary has been nominated for Best Event Manager in Thane by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organ', 'assets/img/blog/1688557882.png', '<p><strong>Sangeeta Chaudhary</strong> has been nominated for <strong>Best Event Manager</strong> in Thane by the Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is a prestigious awards ceremony that honors outstanding individuals and organizations from across India. Sangeeta Chaudhary for being nominated as the Best Event Manager in Thane! &quot;The Pyramid of Success&rdquo;, was created with a vision to provide innovative solutions to create brand and consumer experiences, through engaging designs and experiences within effective communication. Sangeeta Chaudhary&rsquo;ve catered to an array of clients from addressing their brand building and advertising essentials to envisioning, conceptualizing and executing successful experiential events.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nomination for Best Event Manager in Thane goes to Sangeeta Chaudhary.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Real Super Woman Award ceremony will be held on July 15, 2023 in Jaipur. We wish Sangeeta Chaudhary the best for her future endeavors!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/event-manager-super-women-awards-2023-sangeeta-chaudhary-thane\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1688557787.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony will be Streaming Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the participants can create their own profile which can be updated on a regular basis. The verified profiles of all members will be visible to everyone. Every Verified Member will get an E-certificate and Hard Copy Certificate that will be delivered to your doorstep. These award shows have been organized for all multi talents of India. Each and every member of Forever Star India Awards will be entitled to numerous benefits and opportunities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-05 : 02:07:45'),
