(308, 25, 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023', 23, 4, 1, '8,12,13,27,29,30,32', 'assets/img/blog/1690528755.png', 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023', '', '', '', '', 'shubham-khandelwal-honored-as-best-actor-in-jaipur', 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023', 'shubham khandelwal best actor 2023, best actor in jaipur 2023, super heros awards 2023', 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023, Shubham\'s outstanding contributions and remarkable accomplishments in the entertainment area have earned this well-deserved recognition.', 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023', 'Best Actor 2023 in Jaipur', 'Shubham Khandelwal Best Actor in Jaipur 2023', 'Best Actor in Jaipur 2023 Awards', 'Best Actor in Jaipur 2023 Awards Shubham Khandelwal', 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023', 'https://newsforever.in/shubham-khandelwal-honored-as-best-actor-in-jaipur', 'Shubham Khandelwal Honored as Best Actor in Jaipur 2023, Shubham\'s outstanding contributions and remarkable accomplishments in the entertainment area have earned this well-deserved recognition.', 'assets/img/blog/1690529474.png', '<p>Jaipur, Recently Super Hero&#39;s awards 2023 was organized by Forever Star India Group through online mode. During this, Shubham Khandelwal was given the award for Best Actor in Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shubham&#39;s outstanding contributions and remarkable accomplishments in the entertainment area have earned this well-deserved recognition. Expressing his gratitude upon receiving the award, Shubham said, &quot;I am humbled and honored to be recognized as the Best Actor in Jaipur. This award is a testament to the hard work and dedication of my entire team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In super hero&#39;s award, Shubham initially became title holder of the award from Jaipur. His remarkable journey continued as he surpassed the other candidates and secured the prestigious title of Best Actor in Jaipur. The selection process is thorough, with team of FSIA meticulously scrutinizing all the information and achievements provided by each nominee. It is a rigorous and comprehensive procedure to ensure deserving candidates receive the recognition they deserve.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/best-actor-in-jaipur-awardee-shubham-khandelwal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1690529559.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Super hero&#39;s Awards celebrate the core qualities of manhood and promote the empowerment of men on a global scale. Despite initially being a national platform, it has quickly expanded overseas. Forever Star India has successfully organized three previous seasons of the Super Hero&#39;s Awards, and this upcoming event will mark the fourth season. The physical awards ceremony is scheduled to be held at the Marriott hotel in Jaipur, Rajasthan, on September 24th, 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony Streamed&nbsp;Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-07-27 : 10:07:05'),
