e surpassed the other candidates and secured the prestigious title of Best Business Woman in Patna. The selection process is thorough, with team of FSIA meticulously scrutinizing all the information and achievements provided by each nominee. It is a rigorous and comprehensive procedure to ensure deserving candidates receive the recognition they deserve.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/best-business-woman-in-patna-awardee-vandana-kumari\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1690974828.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Super Woman&#39;s Awards celebrate the core qualities of womanhood and promote the empowerment of woman on a global scale. Despite initially being a national platform, it has quickly expanded overseas. Forever Star India has successfully organized three previous seasons of the Super Woman&#39;s Awards, and this upcoming event will mark the fourth season. The physical awards ceremony is scheduled to be held at the Marriott hotel in Jaipur, Rajasthan, on September 24th, 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Award Ceremony Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. Winners of this ceremony will have Google Top Rank to their Individual Profile, and the Award Ceremony will also rank Top on YouTube and Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Awards is the biggest online platform that organizes National Level Tournaments and Award shows. This platform is especially for people who stand out in the crowd but can&#39;t find the perfect opportunity to flaunt their abilities. With the help of Forever Star India Awards, the citizens of India can showcase their strengths and skills to the whole country on a digital platform.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-08-02 : 02:08:34'),
(326, 25, 'फॉरएवर स्टार इंडिया अवॉर्डस इंडिया\' में शिरकत करेंगी मलाइका अरोड़ा', 23, 5, 1, '8,12,13,15,16,19,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1693298689.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Malaika-Arora-to-attend-Forever-Star-India-Awards-India', 'फॉरएवर स्टार इंडिया अवॉर्डस इंडिया\' में शिरकत करेंगी मलाइका अरोड़ा', 'फॉरएवर स्टार इंडिया अवॉर्डस इंडिया\' में शिरकत करेंगी मलाइका अरोड़ा', 'फॉरएवर स्टार इंडिया अवॉर्डस इंडिया\' में शिरकत करेंगी मलाइका अरोड़ा', 'forever star india awards', 'fsia awards', '', '', '', '', 'https://newsforever.in/Malaika-Arora-to-attend-Forever-Star-India-Awards-India', 'जयपुर. गुलाबी नगर में \'फॉरएवर लीव्स\' की ओर से होने वाले \'फॉरएवर स्टार इंडिया अवॉर्डस सीजन-4 में बॉलीवुड दीवा मलाइका अरोड़ा खास मेहमान के रूप में शिरकत करेंगी।', '', '<p>जयपुर. गुलाबी नगर में &#39;फॉरएवर लीव्स&#39; की ओर से होने वाले &#39;फॉरएवर स्टार इंडिया अवॉर्डस सीजन-4 में बॉलीवुड दीवा मलाइका अरोड़ा खास मेहमान के रूप में शिरकत करेंगी।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>आयोजक राजेश अग्रवाल ने बताया कि इस अवॉर्ड नाइट में सुपर हीरो, बिजनेस और एफसीया इंडिया के बेस्ट अचीवर्स एक मंच इंटरनेशनल अवॉर्ड शामिल होंगे। पर होंगे। 24 सितम्बर को होने शो में 100 से अधिक अवॉडीज वाला यह शो चार टाइटल्स में शामिल होंगे, जिनकी गूगल रैंकिंग, होगा, जिनमें सुपर वुमन अवॉर्ड, एफसीया आईडी जनरेट की जाएगी।</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-08-29 : 12:08:46'),
(327, 25, 'फॉरएवर मिस - मिसेज, टीन इंडिया सीजन तीन का आयोजन 23 सितंबर को', 21, 20, 1, '8,9,12,13,15,16,17,18,19,22,24,25,26', 'assets/img/blog/1693307560.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Miss-Mrs-Teen-India-Season-3-to-be-held-o-23rd-September', 'फॉरएवर मिस - मिसेज, टीन इंडिया सीजन तीन का आयोजन 23 सितंबर को', 'फॉरएवर मिस - मिसेज, टीन इंडिया सीजन तीन का आयोजन 23 सितंबर को', 'फॉरएवर मिस - मिसेज, टीन इंडिया सीजन तीन का आयोजन 23 सितंबर को', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Miss-Mrs-Teen-India-Season-3-to-be-held-o-23rd-September', 'फॉरएवर लीव्स द्वारा फॉरएवर मिस, मिसेज, टिन इंडिया 2023 सीजन 3 का आयोजन 23 सितंबर को टोंक रोड स्थित एक होटल में किया जा रहा है। जिसमें देशभर से 100 से ज्यादा मिस, मिसेज और टीन कैटेगरी की मॉडल्स हिस्सा लेंगी।', '', '<p style=\"text-align:center\">Forever Star India&#39;s Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India 2023</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>फॉरएवर लीव्स द्वारा फॉरएवर मिस, मिसेज, टिन इंडिया 2023 सीजन 3 का आयोजन 23 सितंबर को टोंक रोड स्थित एक होटल में किया जा रहा है। जिसमें देशभर से 100 से ज्यादा मिस, मिसेज और टीन कैटेगरी की मॉडल्स हिस्सा लेंगी। डायरेक्टर राजेश अग्रवाल (एस्ट्रो राज) और शो डायरेक्टर जया चौहान ने बताया कि इस शो में पांच टाइटल्स मैं मॉडल्स की क्राउनिंग की जाएगी. इनमें फॉरएवर मिस इंडिया, फॉरएवर मिसेज इंडिया, फॉरएवर मिस टिन इंडिया, मिस एफसीया &nbsp;इंटरनेशनल और मिसेज एफसीया इंटरनेशनल शामिल हैं। इस ग्रैंड फिनाले का समापन 24 सितंबर को अवार्ड्स समारोह के साथ होगा, जिसमें भारत के बेस्ट अचीवर्स एक साथ एक ही मंच पर मलाइका अरोड़ा और आर्मी ऑफिसर्स के द्वारा अवार्ड्स लेंगे</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-08-29 : 02:08:34'),
(328, 25, 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur on 24th September 2023 for Award Show', 23, 5, 1, '1,8,27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1693649058.png', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur', '', '', '', '', 'malaika-arora-in-jaipur-24-september-2023-for-award-show', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur on 24th September 2023 for Award Show', 'malaika arora, award show, malaika rora in jaipur, award show in jaipur, awards 2023, malaika arora in award show', 'Bollywood sensation Malaika Arora will felicitate awardees from across the country on 24th September at Hotel Marriott, Jaipur', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur on 24th September 2023', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur for Award Show', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur on 24th September 2023 for Award Show', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur on 24th September 2023 for Award Show', 'Malaika Arora in Jaipur on 24th September 2023 for Award Show', 'https://newsforever.in/malaika-arora-in-jaipur-24-september-2023-for-award-show', 'Bollywood sensation Malaika Arora will felicitate awardees from across the country on 24th September at Hotel Marriott, Jaipur', 'assets/img/blog/1693648975.png', '<h1><q><em><strong>Bollywood sensation Malaika Arora will felicitate awardees from across the country on 24th September at Hotel Marriott, Jaipur</strong></em></q></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Bollywood Queen Malaika Arora Khan is coming to Jaipur on 24th September 2023, the occasion is the award show being organized by Forever Star India Awards. Forever Star India Awards is going to organize Super Women Awards 2023, Super Hero Awards 2023, Business Awards 2023, and FSIA International Awards 2023. This is the 4th season of the award show to be counted among the famous awards of the country. The last 3 seasons have been amazing, if seen Forever Star India is the first award show to reach this milestone in such a short span of time. Earned name in the country and abroad and has created its own identity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These are in more than 70 categories like Doctors, Teachers, Athletics, Motivational Speakers, Trainers, Businessman, Business Women, Influencers, YouTubers, Government Employees, Models, NGOs, Small and Medium Enterprises, Startups, Writers, Anchors, Actors, and Healthcare Awards will be given. Talents from across the country who are looking for a platform, who want the world to know what achievements they have achieved, and who deserve recognition will participate in this awards show.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bollywood actress Malaika Arora Khan and Lieutenant General Anil Kapoor will attend the awards show as celebrity guests, along with the winners of Forever Star India&#39;s Miss India, Mrs. India, and Miss Teen India 2023. The award show will be live streamed on Forever Star India&#39;s official YouTube channel and on Forever Star India&#39;s application.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although a lot of applications have come for nomination, Forever Star India is going to stop taking new registrations soon, but after Malaika Arora was announced as the celebrity guest, we have to start the registration again for a few days.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If we talk about the USP (Unique Selling Point) of the show, then Forever Star India Awards also gives some such benefits to its awardees, which hardly any other award show in the whole world gives. So let&#39;s talk about some of the benefits which are given to the awardees:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n <li><strong>Unique Hard Copy Certificate:</strong> Forever Star India gives each of its awardees a unique hard copy certificate which is prepared by specialized craftsmanship; it mentions the achievement along with the photo of the awardees.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Top Google Ranking:</strong> Forever Star India provides each awardee with a unique profile, which is directly accessible by all awardees. The awardee can login to his/her profile and mention his/her achievements. Forever Star India provides top Google ranking to the profile of these awardees so that the awardees are known across the country according to their profile and achievements.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Business Exposure:</strong> Forever Star India Awards is a platform where people from different business areas come together; the awardees introduce themselves to each other regarding their business and interest part and get a great opportunity to expand their business.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Live Streaming:</strong> The awards ceremony is streamed live on YouTube, so you can tell your relatives, business friends, and family, and have all your known people virtually join you at the awards.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Media Coverage:</strong> You will meet renowned media houses from all over the country in this awards show; they will personally interact with you and know how you have achieved this position. More than 100 news coverage of your individual and group will be published in print media.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Hardly any other award show in the world gives so many benefits, and above all, the chance to get an award from Bollywood actress Malaika Arora does not come again and again in life. This is a great opportunity to receive an award from Malaika Arora in Jaipur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nominations are open only for a short time; you can also put your achievements in front of the world on a world famous platform, and give mileage to your career. To know the registration process, call or WhatsApp now on the given numbers: +91- 9772018999, +91- 9358538999</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The entry pass for this award show being organized at Hotel Marriott in Jaipur is also now available; to get information related to the pass and to get the pass, contact the given numbers: +91-9983599666</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-08-31 : 10:08:13'),
(329, 25, 'Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen FSIA International Beauty pageant Grand Finale 2023', 21, 29, 1, '8,12,15,16,17,18,19,24,26,27', 'assets/img/blog/1693642039.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Miss--Mrs-and-Miss-Teen-FSIA-International-Beauty-pageant-Grand-Finale-2023', 'Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen FSIA International Beauty pageant Grand Finale 2023', 'miss, mrs and miss teen, beauty pageant, ', 'Forever Miss, Mrs, Teen India-2023 Season 3 will be organized on 23rd September at a hotel located on Tonk Road, in which more than 100 Miss, Mrs and Teen category models from all over the country will participate.', 'beauty pageant 2023', 'grand finale 2023', 'miss international beauty pageant', 'mrs international', 'beauty pageant grand finale 2023', 'Miss, Mrs and Miss Teen FSIA International Beauty pageant Grand Finale 2023', 'https://newsforever.in/Miss,-Mrs-and-Miss-Teen-FSIA-International-Beauty-pageant-Grand-Finale-2023', 'Forever Miss, Mrs, Teen India-2023 Season 3 will be organized on 23rd September at a hotel located on Tonk Road, in which more than 100 Miss, Mrs and Teen category models from all over the country will participate.', 'assets/img/blog/1693642648.png', '<p>Forever Miss, Mrs., Teen India-2023 Season 3 will be organized on 23rd September at a hotel located on Tonk Road, in which more than 100 Miss, Mrs., and Teen category models from all over the country will participate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Organizer Rajesh Agarwal (Astro Raj) and show director Jaya Chauhan said that models will be crowned in five titles in the show, which include Forever Miss India, Forever Mrs. India, Forever Miss Teen India, Miss FSIA International and Mrs. FSIA International. Just before the finale evening, all the participants will have a creative shoot. All models will be crowned with grand and high-end styles. Each model will be awarded a crown, sash, trophy, and gift hamper. In this pageant, celebrity trainer Tana Punia will be seen giving tips on wellness, personality development, diction, and communication to the models.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In this pageant, celebrity trainer Tana Poonia will be seen giving tips on wellness, personality development, diction, and communication to the models.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Groomer and Choreographer Shailja Suri and Assistant Choreographer Shilpi will guide the models to align and choreograph their fashion sequences and on-stage appearances. The grand finale will conclude with the award ceremony on 24 September.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-09-01 : 11:09:36');
