(330, 25, 'Miss FSIA 2023 Grand Finale  on 23rd September 2023', 21, 0, 1, '8,12,15,18,19,22,24,26,27,29,32', 'assets/img/blog/1694074430.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Miss-FSIA-Grand-Finale-2023-International-Beauty-Pageant', 'Miss FSIA 2023 Grand Finale  on 23rd September 2023', 'Miss FSIA 2023 Grand Finale  on 23rd September 2023', 'Miss FSIA 2023 Grand Finale  on 23rd September 2023', 'Miss FSIA grand finale 2023', 'Miss FSIA beauty pageant 2023', 'Miss FSIA international beauty pageant', 'Miss FSIA 2023', 'Miss FSIA national beauty pageant ', 'Miss FSIA Grand Finale 2023 | International Beauty Pageant', 'https://newsforever.in/Miss-FSIA-Grand-Finale-2023-International-Beauty-Pageant', 'In Jaipur, 100 models from all over the country will promote fashion by showcasing their talent in miss categories and trying to reach the international level by wearing the crown.', 'assets/img/blog/1694074398.png', '<p>In Jaipur, 100 models from all over the country will promote fashion by showcasing their talent in miss categories and trying to reach the international level by wearing the crown. Forever Miss FSIA-2023 Season-3 will be organized by Forever Leaves in Jaipur on September 23 at Hotel Marriott, Tonk Road. During this, more than 100 Miss category models from across the country will be present here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Miss FSIA beauty pageant is one of the most prestigious and famous beauty pageants in India. It serves as a platform for young Indian women to showcase their beauty, talent, and intelligence. This is the 3rd season of the contest and it has been a stepping stone for Indian women to enter the world of modeling, acting, and various other careers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the pageant, celebrity trainer Tana Poonia will be seen giving tips to the models on wellness, personality development, diction, and communication, while groomer and choreographer Shailja Suri and assistant choreographer Shilpi will align and choreograph the models and guide them for on-stage appearance. Celebrity anchors Ajit Singh and Jainika will host the show. The grand finale will conclude with the awards ceremony on September 24.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-09-04 : 12:09:43'),
(331, 25, 'Mrs India 2023 Grand Finale on 23rd September 2023', 21, 29, 1, '12,16,18,19,22,23,25,26,27,29', 'assets/img/blog/1693995407.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Mrs-India-2023-Grand-Finale-on-23rd-September-2023', 'Mrs India 2023 Grand Finale on 23rd September 2023', 'Mrs India 2023 Grand Finale on 23rd September 2023', 'In Jaipur, 100 models from all over the country will promote fashion by showcasing their talent in miss categories and trying to reach the international level by wearing the crown.', 'mrs india grand finale', 'mrs india 2023', 'grand finale mrs india', '23rd september 2023 mrs india grand finale', 'mrs india grand finale in jaipur', 'Mrs India 2023 Grand Finale on 23rd September 2023', 'https://newsforever.in/Mrs-India-2023-Grand-Finale-on-23rd-September-2023', 'In Jaipur, 100 models from all over the country will promote fashion by showcasing their talent in miss categories and trying to reach the international level by wearing the crown.', 'assets/img/blog/1693995672.png', '<p>In Jaipur, 100 models from all over the country will promote fashion by showcasing their talent in miss categories and trying to reach the international level by wearing the crown. Forever Mrs India-2023 Season-3 will be organized by Forever Leaves in Jaipur on September 23 at Hotel Marriott, Tonk Road. During this, more than 100 Miss category models from across the country will be present here.<br>\r\nForever Mrs India beauty pageant is one of the most prestigious and famous beauty pageants in India. It serves as a platform for young Indian women to showcase their beauty, talent, and intelligence. This is the 3rd season of the contest and it has been a stepping stone for Indian women to enter the world of modeling, acting, and various other careers.<br>\r\nIn the pageant, celebrity trainer Tana Poonia will be seen giving tips to the models on wellness, personality development, diction, and communication, while groomer and choreographer Shailja Suri and assistant choreographer Shilpi will align and choreograph the models and guide them for on-stage appearance. Celebrity anchors Ajit Singh and Jainika will host the show. The grand finale will conclude with the awards ceremony on September 24.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-09-06 : 01:09:19'),
(332, 25, 'Forever Star India Awards is Now Registered Brand under Government of India', 23, 4, 1, '18,27,28,29,30,31,32', 'assets/img/blog/1694079777.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Forever-Star-India-Awards-is-Now-Registered-Brand-under-Government-of-India', 'Forever Star India Awards is Now Registered Brand under Government of India', 'Forever Star India Awards is Now Registered Brand under Government of India', 'Forever Star India Awards is Now a Registered Brand under the Government of India. Forever Star India Awards Season 4, organized by Forever Leaves in the capital Jaipur, will be held on September 24 at Hotel Marriott, Tonk Road.', 'star india awards', 'registered brand under government of india', 'September 24 at Hotel Marriott', 'star india awards season 4', ' Now Registered Brand under Government of India', 'Forever Star India Awards is Now Registered Brand under Government of India', 'https://newsforever.in/Forever-Star-India-Awards-is-Now-Registered-Brand-under-Government-of-India', 'Forever Star India Awards is Now a Registered Brand under the Government of India. Forever Star India Awards Season 4, organized by Forever Leaves in the capital Jaipur, will be held on September 24 at Hotel Marriott, Tonk Road.', 'assets/img/blog/1694080260.png', '<p><strong>Forever Star India Awards Season 4, organized by Forever Leaves in the capital Jaipur, will be held on September 24 at Hotel Marriott, Tonk Road. Forever Star India Awards is registered with the Government and its Register No. 4797359. It is approved by the government. There is 4th season of Forever Star India Awards and awardees from all over India will be honored in it. Malaika Arora will participate in it as a celebrity guest actress. Organizer Rajesh Agarwal (Astro Raj) said that this time India&#39;s best achievers will be seen together on one stage in this award night. There are four titles of this award show, which include the Super Woman Award, Super Hero Award, Business Award, and FCIA International Award. More than 100 awardees in different categories of these four titles will be awarded with trophies, mementos, and plaques at the award ceremony.</strong></p>\r\n', 1, '2023-09-07 : 12:09:24'),
(333, 25, 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat', 21, 6, 1, '8,12,13,15,18,19,20,22,23,27', 'assets/img/blog/1694245753.png', 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat', '', '', '', '', 'beawar-finalist-miss-india-2023-shefali-prajapat', 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat', 'miss beawar finalist 2023, miss india 2023, miss shefali prajapat city finalist 2023', 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat, Announcements of city level Top 3 finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Shefali Prajapat has reserved her place in as Beawar. ', 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat', 'Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat Finalist', 'Miss Shefali Prajapat City Finalist 2023', 'Miss Beawar Finalist 2023', 'Miss Shefali Prajapat City Finalist 2023', 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat', 'https://newsforever.in/beawar-finalist-miss-india-2023-shefali-prajapat', 'Beawar Finalist Miss India 2023 Shefali Prajapat, Announcements of city level Top 3 finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Shefali Prajapat has reserved her place in as Beawar. ', 'assets/img/blog/1694245827.png', '<p><strong>Beawar</strong>. Announcements of city level Top 3 finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and <strong>Shefali Prajapat </strong>has reserved her place in as <strong>Beawar</strong>. <strong>Shefali</strong>, who is a beautiful lady and she is a motivation to all ladies who wants to become a model in future. <strong>Shefali</strong> is a finalist in the Miss India 2023 pageant, representing the <strong>Beawar</strong> district of <strong>Rajasthan</strong>. Shefali Prajapat is a talented and accomplished woman who is sure to make a great impact in the Miss India 2023 pageant. She is a role model for many and is an inspiration to all who know her.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The announcement of the city winners of Miss India 2023 is going to happen in this September, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. Crowning of City Winners of Miss India 2023 will be Streamed Live on Official YouTube Channel and OTT Platform of FSIA. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stages, state winners and national winners will be announced in September 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/shefali-prajapat-miss-india-2023-id-39203\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1694245709.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>FSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform that broadcasts all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies live. To be held in 2023, Miss India and Mrs India is the third season of Forever Star India, in which selected models from all over the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for maximum number of crowning in its last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates <strong>Miss </strong><strong>Shefali</strong> that she has been able to reach here on the strength of her hard work and talent. We would like to wish her all the best to go to the state, national, and international level.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-09-08 : 10:09:38'),
(334, 25, 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma', 21, 6, 1, '8,12,13,15,18,21,24,26', 'assets/img/blog/1694247100.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'Jaipur-Finalist-Miss-India-2023-Urmila-Sharma', 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma', 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma', 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma, Announcements of city level Top 3 finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Urmila Sharma has reserved her place in Jaipur. ', 'urmila sharma miss india 2023', 'Jaipur finalist top 3 urmila sharma', 'miss urmila city finalist 2023', 'Miss jaipur finalist 2023', 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma', 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma', 'https://newsforever.in/Jaipur-Finalist-Miss-India-2023-Urmila-Sharma', 'Jaipur Finalist Miss India 2023 Urmila Sharma, Announcements of city level Top 3 finalists of Miss India 2023 have started and Urmila Sharma has reserved her place in Jaipur. ', 'assets/img/blog/1694247071.png', '<p>Jaipur. The announcement of the top 3 city level finalists of Miss India 2023 has started and Miss Urmila Sharma has reserved her place for Jaipur. Miss Urmila Sharma, is a beautiful woman and she is an inspiration for all the women who want to become models in the future. Miss Urmila Sharma is a finalist in the Miss India 2023 pageant, representing the Jaipur district of Rajasthan. Miss Urmila Sharma is a talented and accomplished woman who will definitely make a great impact at the Miss India 2023 pageant. He is a role model for many and an inspiration to all who know him.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Miss India 2023 city winners are going to be announced this September, all the contestants are very excited and working hard to win from their city. The coronation of Miss India 2023 city winners will be live-streamed on FSIA&#39;s official YouTube channel and OTT platforms. City winners will compete to become state winners in the next stage, state winners and national winners will be announced on 23 September 2023.<br />\r\nFSIA is the world&#39;s first and only beauty pageant platform to livestream all its auditions, training rounds, talent rounds, and crowning ceremonies. Miss India and Mrs. India Forever, to be held in 2023, is the third season of Star India, in which selected models from across the country participate and empower themselves. Forever Star India has created a world record for the most number of coronations in the last 2 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a matter of great pride to be a part of India&#39;s biggest beauty pageant. Forever Star India congratulates Miss Urmila Sharma for reaching this milestone with her hard work and talent. We would like to wish them all the best as they go to the state, national and international levels.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-09-08 : 11:09:16'),
