(378, 25, 'Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023 Tanya Gupta', 21, 20, 1, '8,12,13,15,18,19,20,22,23,27', 'assets/img/blog/1696674641.png', 'Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023 Tanya Gupta', '', '', '', '', 'miss-india-2nd-runner-up-2023-tanya-gupta', 'Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023 Tanya Gupta', 'miss india 2023, miss india 2nd runner up 2023, miss tanya gupta 2nd runner up 2023, forever star india 2023', 'Tanya Gupta won the coveted title of Forever Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023, Tanya Gupta, who is from the culturally diverse country of India, underwent an incredible journey to win this national beauty crown.', 'Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023 Tanya Gupta', 'Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023', 'Miss Tanya Gupta 2nd Runner Up 2023', 'Miss India 2023 2nd Runner Up', 'Miss Tanya Gupta 2nd Runner Up Miss India 2023', 'Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023 Tanya Gupta', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-india-2nd-runner-up-2023-tanya-gupta', 'Tanya Gupta won the coveted title of Forever Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023, Tanya Gupta, who is from the culturally diverse country of India, underwent an incredible journey to win this national beauty crown.', 'assets/img/blog/1696674237.png', '<p><strong>Jaipur. Tanya Gupta</strong> won the coveted title of Forever <strong>Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023</strong>, <strong>Tanya Gupta</strong>, who is from the culturally diverse country of India, underwent an incredible journey to win this national beauty crown.<br />\r\nThe event, which took place at the upscale Hotel Marriott in Jaipur&#39;s Tonk Road, was a display of the ability, composure, and charisma of young women from all across the country. <strong>Tanya Gupta</strong> was able to win the judges&#39; and audience&#39;s hearts with her outstanding beauty and grace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Organizer <strong>(CEO) Rajesh Agarwal</strong>, also known as <strong>Astro Raj</strong>, and show director Jaya Chauhan gave each model a crown, ribbon, trophy, and keepsake to honor their accomplishment during the crowning event, which was nothing short of regal and luxurious.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bollywood actress <strong>Malaika Arora</strong> and Lt. General Anil Kapoor was the celebrity guest invited to the award ceremony. Along with these, Forever&#39;s Miss India Winners, Mrs. India Winners, and Miss Teen India Winners were also invited as guests of honor. He encouraged the awardees with his motivational speech and also wished them good luck for their future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Following the coronation, a glam picture shoot was planned to highlight <strong>Tanya</strong>&#39;s new title and capture her in all her beauty. Her triumph highlights not only her attractiveness but also her talent and self-assurance, making her stand out as an aspirational role model for young women all around the country.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tanya Gupta</strong>&#39;s journey to win the title of Forever <strong>Miss India 2nd Runner Up 2023</strong> is evidence of her commitment and tenacity. She now carries the beauty, talent, and confidence that the Forever Star India beauty pageant stands for with grace as she dons her crown.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-10-07 : 01:10:58'),
