(380, 25, 'Mrs Punjab Runner Up 2023 G2 Daljeet Kaur', 21, 8, 1, '12,13,16,18,19,20,22,23,27', 'assets/img/blog/1702889356.png', 'Mrs Punjab Runner Up 2023 G2 Daljeet Kaur', '', '', '', '', 'mrs-punjab-runner-up-2023-g2-daljeet-kaur', 'Mrs Punjab Runner Up 2023 G2 Daljeet Kaur', 'mrs punjab runner up 2023 g2, mrs daljeet kaur state runner up 2023, mrs punjab 2023, forever star india 2023', 'Daljeet Kaur, who won the title of Forever Mrs Punjab 1st Runner Up 2023 G2, was in the spotlight when married women\'s grace and elegance took center stage at the Forever Star India Beauty Contest 2023 Season 3.', 'Mrs Punjab Runner Up 2023 G2 Daljeet Kaur', 'Mrs Punjab Runner Up 2023', 'Mrs Daljeet Kaur State Runner Up', 'Mrs Punjab 2023 1st Runner Up', 'Mrs Daljeet Kaur Runner Up Mrs Punjab 2023', 'Mrs Punjab Runner Up 2023 G2 Daljeet Kaur', 'https://newsforever.in/mrs-punjab-runner-up-2023-g2-daljeet-kaur', 'Daljeet Kaur, who won the title of Forever Mrs Punjab 1st Runner Up 2023 G2, was in the spotlight when married women\'s grace and elegance took center stage at the Forever Star India Beauty Contest 2023 Season 3.', 'assets/img/blog/1702889375.png', '<p><strong>Daljeet Kaur</strong>, who won the title of Forever <strong>Mrs </strong><strong>Punjab 1st Runner Up 2023</strong><strong> G2</strong>, was in the spotlight when married women&#39;s grace and elegance took center stage at the Forever Star India Beauty Contest 2023 Season 3. Intralife Pharma and Forever Leaves thoughtfully planned this prestigious State beauty pageant to honor married women from all over the nation for their accomplishments, composure, and beauty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event gave married women a stage to shine and challenge preconceived notions of beauty, and it took place in all its glory at the famous Hotel Marriott on Tonk Road in Jaipur. <strong>Daljeet Kaur</strong> won over the judges&#39; and audience&#39;s hearts with her extraordinary charm and personality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Organizer <strong>(CEO)</strong> <strong>Rajesh Agarwal</strong>, also known as <strong>Astro Raj</strong> and show director Jaya Chauhan had given each model a crown, ribbon, trophy, and keepsake to honor their accomplishment during the crowning event, which was nothing short of regal and luxurious.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bollywood actress <strong>Malaika Arora</strong> and Lt. General Anil Kapoor was the celebrity guest invited for the award ceremony. Along with these, Forever&#39;s Miss India Winners, Mrs. India Winners, and Miss Teen India Winners were also invited as guests of honour. He encouraged the awardees with his motivational speech and also wished them good luck for their future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Following the coronation, a glam photo shoot was planned to highlight <strong>Daljeet Kaur</strong><strong>&#39;s</strong> new title and capture her beauty and grace in all their grandeur. Her triumph represents not only beauty but also talent and self-assurance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Daljeet Kaur</strong><strong>&#39;s</strong> path to win the title of Forever <strong>Mrs </strong><strong>Punjab 1st Runner Up</strong><strong> 2023 G2</strong> is evidence of her tenacity and commitment. She epitomizes the spirit of beauty, self-assurance, and talent that the Forever Star India beauty pageant supports as she wears her crown with pride. For married women all around the country, her success acts as motivation.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-10-09 : 11:10:51'),
