the Forever Star India beauty pageant supports as she wears her crown with pride. For married women all around the country, her success acts as motivation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Samata&#39;s journey does not end here. With her new title, she aims to further her advocacy work, focusing on issues such as women&#39;s education, health, and empowerment. She plans to collaborate with local organizations and participate in initiatives that uplift and support women in Uttar Pradesh.</p>\r\n', 1, '2023-10-12 : 12:10:32'),
