(434, 25, 'Forever Leaves has made the best liver detox in India', 31, 32, 1, '5,27,33', 'assets/img/blog/1705742250.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'best-liver-detox', 'Forever Leaves has made the best liver detox in India', 'Forever Leaves has made the best liver detox in India', 'The name of that medicine is \"Forever Lives Liver Detox Plus.\" The pills are often marketed as a dietary supplements designed to support liver health and function. ', 'best liver detox tablet', 'liver detox plus', 'liver care tablet', 'forever leaves liver detox tablet', 'liver repair formula', 'Forever Leaves has made the best liver detox in India', 'https://newsforever.in/best-liver-detox', 'The name of that medicine is \"Forever Lives Liver Detox Plus.\" The pills are often marketed as a dietary supplements designed to support liver health and function. ', 'assets/img/blog/1705744362.png', '<h2><span style=\"color:#2ecc71\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>In Short</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>A wonderful medicine that can help you live a long life.</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>A medicine that can save your liver that can purify your liver, blood, and every part of your body?</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Which medicine completely detoxifies and cleanses your liver?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The name of that medicine is &quot;Forever Lives Liver Detox Plus.&quot; The pills are often marketed as a dietary supplements designed to support liver health and function. It is important to note that the concept of &quot;detoxifying&quot; the liver through supplements is somewhat controversial, as the liver is a highly efficient organ. Which naturally detoxifies the body.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here are some general points about Forever Leaves Liver Detox Plus Tablets:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Potential benefits:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Support for Liver Health: Some of the ingredients in these pills are claimed to aid liver function and promote overall liver health.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Antioxidant Support: Some ingredients may have antioxidant properties, which may help combat oxidative stress in the liver.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ingredients commonly found in liver detox tablets:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Milk Thistle (silymarin):</strong> Often a key ingredient, milk thistle has antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties that may benefit the liver.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>N-Acetylcysteine (NAC):</strong> Known for its antioxidant properties, NAC may support the production of glutathione, an important antioxidant in the body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Turmeric (Curcumin):</strong> Has anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties; It is believed to aid liver health.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Artichoke:</strong> Some studies suggest that artichoke extract may help protect the liver and support its regeneration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dandelion Root:</strong> Traditionally used to support liver function, dandelion root has detoxifying properties.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Uses:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>GENERAL LIVER SUPPORT:</strong> Liver Detox Plus tablets are often used by individuals who wish to support the overall health and function of their liver.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Detoxification programs:</strong> Some people use these supplements during detoxification programs or after excessive alcohol consumption or poor dietary habits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Liver conditions:</strong> In some cases, healthcare professionals may recommend liver support supplements for individuals with certain liver conditions. However, this should be done under medical supervision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Consult with a health care professional: Before starting any supplement regimen, especially for liver health, it is important to consult with a health care professional to make sure it is appropriate for your individual needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Quality of supplements: Make sure the supplements are of high quality, preferably from reputable brands. Some ingredients may interact with medications or cause adverse effects in some individuals.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-01-19 : 11:01:07'),
(435, 25, 'Celebrating Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 23, 35, 0, '27,29,30,31,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1705913983.png', 'Celebrating Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', '', '', '', '', 'womans-day-special', 'Celebrating Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'women\'s day, award show, special Event, women empowerment, celebrating women, inspirational women, female achievements, honor and appreciation', 'Celebrating Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024 - In a celebration of Female Resilience, Achievement, and Empowerment, the Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024 unfolded in a dazzling display of Glamour and Inspiration.', 'Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'Celebrating Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/womans-day-special', 'Celebrating Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024 - In a celebration of Female Resilience, Achievement, and Empowerment, the Woman\'s Day Special Award Show 2024 unfolded in a dazzling display of Glamour and Inspiration.', 'assets/img/blog/1705913995.png', '<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#365f91\">&quot;A day dedicated to the phenomenal women who make life extraordinary.&quot;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#365f91\">&quot;Honoring the extraordinary women who make every day special.&quot;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">In a celebration of female resilience, achievement, and empowerment, the Woman&#39;s Day Special Award Show 2024 unfolded in a dazzling display of glamour and inspiration. The annual event, held at a prestigious venue, brought together influential women from various walks of life to honor their remarkable contributions. Let&#39;s delve into the highlights of this star-studded evening that echoed the theme of unity and progress.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>In Short</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Dazzling array of influential women from various fields graced the red carpet.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Exceptional women recognized for outstanding contributions across diverse sectors.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Recipients of Woman&#39;s Day Special Awards shared personal stories of triumph and resilience.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Honoring change-makers addressing pressing societal issues on an international scale.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Event theme centered around unity, strength, and progress for women worldwide.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Acknowledgment of the indispensable role women play in shaping a better future for all.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Honoring Trailblazers</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">In a star-studded evening filled with glamour and inspiration, the Woman&#39;s Day Special Award Show 2024 shone a spotlight on outstanding women who have made significant contributions to various fields. The event, held at a prestigious venue, celebrated the resilience, achievements, and empowerment of women around the world.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Red Carpet Extravaganza</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The red carpet dazzled with the presence of influential women from diverse backgrounds, ranging from entertainment and sports to business and activism. Celebrities and honorees alike donned empowering ensembles, making bold statements that echoed the theme of the evening: unity, strength, and progress.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Iconic Moments and Emotional Tributes</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The award show was marked by iconic moments and heartfelt tributes. Emotions ran high as recipients of the Woman&#39;s Day Special Awards took the stage to share their stories of triumph over adversity. The audience was moved by powerful speeches and emotional performances that underscored the importance of recognizing and celebrating the achievements of women.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Trailblazing Women in Entertainment</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The entertainment segment featured performances by some of the industry&#39;s leading women, captivating the audience with their talent and charisma. Notable actresses, musicians, and comedians graced the stage, showcasing the diverse contributions of women in the world of entertainment.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Empowering Keynote Addresses</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Renowned speakers delivered empowering keynote addresses, emphasizing the need for continued support and advocacy for women&#39;s rights and gender equality. The Woman&#39;s Day Special Award Show 2024 served as a platform to inspire change and foster a sense of unity among women from all walks of life.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Global Impact Awards</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">A special segment of the evening was dedicated to honoring women who have made a global impact through their philanthropic efforts, advocacy work, and initiatives aimed at addressing pressing societal issues. The Global Impact Awards recognized these trailblazers for their commitment to creating positive change on a global scale.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Closing the Gender Gap</u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Throughout the event, speakers and award recipients highlighted the ongoing challenges women face in various fields and stressed the importance of closing the gender gap. The Woman&#39;s Day Special Award Show 2024 served as a call to action, encouraging individuals and organizations to actively contribute to creating a more inclusive and equal world for women.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">As the night came to a close, attendees left the event inspired and motivated, carrying the spirit of celebration and empowerment into their respective spheres of influence. The Woman&#39;s Day Special Award Show 2024 undoubtedly left an indelible mark on the collective journey toward a more equitable and just society.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Register Here: <a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2024</strong></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Or</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Connect with Us for More Details of Nomination and Awards: +91- 9983274999, +91-9358538999</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-01-21 : 11:01:34'),
(436, 25, 'Discover the Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo', 31, 33, 1, '5,27,42,59,61', 'assets/img/blog/1706099695.png', 'Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo', '', '', '', '', 'best-anti-dandruff-shampoo', 'Discover the Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo', 'anti dandruff shampoo, best anti dandruff shampoo, chemical free shampoo', 'Discover the Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo - Forever Leaves has just launched Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo that is 100% Chemical Free and Protects your Hair from Dandruff.', 'Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo', 'Chemical Free Shampoo', 'Anti Dandruff Shampoo', 'Reclame Black Shampoo', 'Chemical Free Shampoo', 'Discover the Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo', 'https://newsforever.in/best-anti-dandruff-shampoo', 'Discover the Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo - Forever Leaves has just launched Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo that is 100% Chemical Free and Protects your Hair from Dandruff.', 'assets/img/blog/1706099924.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Fusion of Ancient Wisdom and Modern Hair Care</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Introducing India&#39;s Best Anti Dandruff Shampoo, Naturally Nurturing your Scalp</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>In Short:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">A Shampoo that Makes your Hair Shiny and Strong</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">A Surprising Shampoo that Reduces Hair Breakage and also Removes Dandruff from the Roots</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Hydrating Therapy Unleashed: Moisture Infused Formula Targets Thin Hair for Enhanced Results</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Discover the Power of Natural Oils: Argan and Virgin Olive Oil Combine Forces for Ultimate Hair Wellness</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">In an unprecedented development for hair care enthusiasts, a cutting-edge anti-dandruff shampoo has emerged in the market, Reclame Black Shampoo, which offers a multifaceted formula enriched with the goodness of Argan Oil and Virgin Olive Oil. Promising not only the elimination of dandruff but also a comprehensive solution for hair growth, damage repair, and hair fall control, this innovative product has attracted the attention of beauty experts and consumers.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Power of Argan and Virgin Olive Oil:</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">At the heart of this revolutionary shampoo is the dynamic duo of Argan Oil and Virgin Olive Oil. Known for their nourishing properties, these natural oils work synergistically to provide intensive hydration, leaving hair soft, silky, and visibly healthy. Argan oil is celebrated for its ability to promote hair growth, while virgin olive oil contributes to damage repair, making this shampoo a one-stop solution for many hair concerns.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Hydrating Therapy for Thinning Hair:</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Thin and delicate hair often needs extra care, and Reclame Black Shampoo provides exactly that with its hydrating therapy. The moisture-rich formula targets thinning hair, providing the nourishment it needs to strengthen hair and reduce the risk of breakage. The result is a fuller, more shiny appearance that boosts confidence and enhances the overall health of the hair.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Comprehensive Hair Wellness:</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Designed to address a spectrum of hair issues, this anti-dandruff shampoo goes beyond conventional solutions. Its unique blend of ingredients not only fights dandruff but also supports hair growth, repairs damage, and controls hair fall. Users can now streamline their hair care routine with a single product that caters to multiple needs, simplifying their daily regimen without compromising on results.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>User Testimonials:</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Early users of the anti-dandruff shampoo are singing its praises, with reports of noticeable improvements in hair texture, reduced dandruff, and enhanced manageability. Many have expressed satisfaction with the natural oil enrichment, citing a healthier and shinier appearance after regular use.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Availability:</span></strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Reclame Black Anti-Dandruff Shampoo enriched with Argan Oil and Virgin Olive Oil is now available on online platforms. Beauty enthusiasts are encouraged to experience the transformative effects of this groundbreaking product and take their hair care routine to new heights.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">For media inquiries or further information, please contact: +91 9772051999 </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Forever Leaves is thrilled to introduce this innovative solution to the world, setting a new standard in comprehensive hair wellness. Embrace the future of hair care with a product that addresses diverse needs, delivering results that speak for themselves.</span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-01-24 : 02:01:41'),
(437, 25, 'Boost Joint Health with Joint Therapy Tablet Morning-Evening', 31, 32, 1, '5,27,43', 'assets/img/blog/1706269021.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'best-joint-support', 'Boost Joint Health with Joint Therapy Tablet Morning-Evening', 'Boost Joint Health with Joint Therapy Tablet Morning-Evening', 'If you are looking for pills to aid knee joint health, your search is complete at Joint Therapy Table, which has a double combination of Morning and Evening. These are taken to help relieve joint pain throughout your body.', 'joint therapy tablet', 'joint pain tablet', 'joint support tablet for joint pain', 'joint support supplement for joint pain', 'knee joint support tablet', 'Boost Joint Health with Joint Therapy Tablet Morning-Evening', 'https://newsforever.in/best-joint-support', 'If you are looking for pills to aid knee joint health, your search is complete at Joint Therapy Table, which has a double combination of Morning and Evening. These are taken to help relieve joint pain throughout your body.', 'assets/img/blog/1706269205.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">If you are looking for pills to aid knee joint health, your search is complete at Joint Therapy Table, which has a double combination of Morning and Evening. These are taken to help relieve joint pain throughout your body.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>In Short</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&quot;Morning Rays, Evening Hues &ndash; Joint Therapy Tablets, the Perfect Duo for Joint Muse.&quot;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&quot;Two Tablets, One Mission &ndash; Boost Your Joint Health, Embrace the Joint Therapy Tradition.&quot;</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Joint therapy tablet is your key to maintaining healthy and flexible joints. Our advanced formula is backed by scientific research and carefully selected ingredients to deliver comprehensive joint support. Whether you&#39;re an athlete, suffer from joint discomfort, or just want to proactively care for your joints, our supplement is designed for you. Don&#39;t let joint pain slow you down - choose Joint therapy tablet for a healthier, more active lifestyle.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Unmatched Innovation in Joint Care</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In a major stride towards improving joint health, a groundbreaking Joint Therapy Tablet has been introduced to the market, promising a new era in managing joint-related issues. Packed with advanced ingredients and cutting-edge technology, this tablet aims to redefine the landscape of joint care.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Scientifically Formulated for Optimal Results</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Crafted after extensive research and development, the Joint Therapy Tablet boasts a scientifically formulated blend of key ingredients known for their efficacy in supporting joint function and mobility. From essential vitamins to potent antioxidants, each component is carefully selected to provide comprehensive support for joints.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Direction to Use:</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Joint Therapy Tablet has a morning-evening combination, to use it, you can take 1 tablet from the morning bottle after having food and 1 tablet from the evening bottle after having food and before sleeping.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Amazing Benefits of Joint Therapy Tablets:</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Joint therapy tablets are dietary products designed to promote and maintain joint health. They typically contain a combination of ingredients that aim to support joint function, reduce inflammation, and alleviate discomfort associated with conditions like arthritis or general wear and tear on the joints. Here are some common ingredients found in joint support supplements along with their potential benefits:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Glucosamine:</u></strong> A natural compound found in joint therapy tablets. It is commonly used in joint supplements to aid joint health.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Chondroitin:</u></strong> Often paired with glucosamine, chondroitin is a component of cartilage and is believed to help with joint flexibility.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>MSM (Methylsulfonylmethane):</u></strong> A sulfur compound that may play a role in maintaining the integrity of connective tissues.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Turmeric/Curcumin:</u></strong> Known for its anti-inflammatory properties, turmeric or its active component curcumin may help alleviate joint pain.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Omega-3 Fatty Acids:</u></strong> Found in fish oil, these fatty acids have anti-inflammatory properties that may benefit joint health.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Vitamin D and Calcium:</u></strong> These nutrients are essential for maintaining bone health, which indirectly supports joint health.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>BoswelliaSerrata:</u></strong> Extracted from the Boswellia tree, it&#39;s believed to have anti-inflammatory effects that could help with joint pain.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><u>Hyaluronic Acid:</u></strong> Found in synovial fluid, hyaluronic acid is thought to help lubricate joints and reduce friction.</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Joint therapy tablet has been prepared by mixing all these ingredients. It is prepared naturally. With its unparalleled formulation and proven benefits, the Joint Therapy Tablet is set to revolutionize the way we care for our joints. Don&#39;t miss the opportunity to experience the future of joint health &ndash; embrace the Joint Therapy Tablet and take a step towards a more active, comfortable, and fulfilling life.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Buy from Flipkart with amazing Offers: <a href=\"https://www.flipkart.com/forever-leaves-joint-support-tablet-glucosamine-chondroitin-msm-cartilage/p/itm1f6554813ac29?pid=VSLFXK3SFJEYGSJ6\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Buy Joint Therapy Tablet</strong></a></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-01-26 : 01:01:51'),
(438, 25, 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 31, 33, 2, '5,14,27', 'assets/img/blog/1706611659.png', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', '', '', '', '', 'best-cosmetic-brand-in-india', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 'top cosmetic brands in india, popular beauty brands in india, best cosmetic brand in india, beauty industry leaders in india, trending beauty brands, iconic indian beauty brands, leading skincare brands in india, top cosmetic picks by indian consumers, be', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India - Forever Leaves, a pioneer in the beauty and cosmetics industry, has been honored with the prestigious title of \"Esteemed Cosmetic Brand in India.\"', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India', ' https://newsforever.in/best-cosmetic-brand-in-india', 'Best Cosmetic Brand in India - Forever Leaves, a pioneer in the Beauty and Cosmetics Industry, has been honored with the Prestigious Title of \"Esteemed Cosmetic Brand in India.\"', 'assets/img/blog/1706611981.png', '<h2 style=\"font-style:italic; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><strong>Forever Leaves Awarded as Best Cosmetic Brand in India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#eeeeee; border:1px solid #cccccc; padding:5px 10px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#365f91\">&quot;Awarded, Adored, and Always Beautiful: Forever Leaves, the Crown Jewel of Indian Cosmetics&quot;</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:#eeeeee; border:1px solid #cccccc; padding:5px 10px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#365f91\">&ldquo;Blossoming Beauty and Eternal Elegance&rdquo;</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Jaipur, 30-Jan-2024</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> - <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Forever Leaves, a pioneer in the beauty and cosmetics industry, has been honored with the prestigious title of &quot;Esteemed Cosmetic Brand in India.&quot; This recognition comes as a testament to the brand&#39;s unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Forever Leaves has consistently set industry benchmarks with its wide range of skincare, haircare, and cosmetic products. The brand&#39;s dedication to harnessing the power of natural ingredients and cutting-edge technology has resonated well with consumers, making it a household name in India and beyond.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The award ceremony, held at Jaipur on 24 September, brought together industry leaders, influencers, and beauty enthusiasts to celebrate Forever Leaves&#39; remarkable achievements. The brand was commended for its ethical practices, sustainable initiatives, and contributions to the ever-evolving beauty landscape in India.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Mr. Rajesh Agarwal, spokesperson for Forever Leaves, expressed gratitude for the recognition, stating, &quot;Receiving the &#39;Esteemed Cosmetic Brand in India&#39; award is a tremendous honor for us. It reflects our team&#39;s relentless efforts in creating products that not only enhance beauty but also promote overall well-being. We are committed to continuing our journey of excellence and bringing the best in skincare and cosmetics to our valued customers.&quot;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Forever Leaves has gained a loyal customer base by consistently delivering products that cater to diverse skin types and concerns. From anti-aging solutions to eco-friendly packaging, the brand has embraced a holistic approach to beauty, setting itself apart in an increasingly competitive market.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">In addition to its product offerings, Forever Leaves has actively engaged in social responsibility initiatives, supporting causes related to women&#39;s empowerment, environmental conservation, and animal welfare.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">As Forever Leaves takes pride in being recognized as the &quot;Esteemed Cosmetic Brand in India,&quot; it looks forward to continuing its mission of empowering individuals to embrace their natural beauty and live confidently.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><strong>For Distributorship inquiries, please contact:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><strong>care@foreverleaves.in</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><strong>+91-9772051999</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><strong><u>About Forever Leaves:</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Forever Leaves is a leading cosmetic brand dedicated to providing high-quality skincare, haircare, and cosmetic products. With a focus on natural ingredients, innovation, and sustainability, the brand has earned the trust and loyalty of customers across India. Forever Leaves is committed to empowering individuals to look and feel their best while contributing to a healthier and more beautiful world.</span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-01-30 : 01:01:23'),
(439, 25, 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 23, 5, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1708085583.png', 'Forever Star India Awards Season 5 is going to be held on March 10 at Entertainment Paradise', '', '', '', '', 'star-india-award', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'bhagyashree, star india award 2024, award ceremony in jaipur, forever star india awards 2024, bollywood actress in jaipur, bhagyashree in jaipur, bhagyashree will give awards, jaipur award ceremony', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) as a Celebrity Guest', 'https://newsforever.in/star-india-award', 'Star India Awards 2024 (Season-5) - Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will come to Jaipur, Awards will be given in the categories of business, social work, sports, health, and fashion.', 'assets/img/blog/1708085756.png', '<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#17365d\">&ldquo;Actress Bhagyashree will come to Jaipur: Awards will be given in the categories of business, social work, sports, health, and fashion&rdquo;</span></em></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#17365d\">&ldquo;Forever Star India Awards Season 5 is going to be held on March 10 at Entertainment Paradise (EP)&rdquo;</span></em></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Forever Star India Awards Season 5 by Forever Star Group is going to be held on 10th March at Entertainment Paradise (EP) in Jaipur. In this, different talents from all over India will come on one stage. Awards will be given in many categories like Business, Social Work, Sports, Health, Entrepreneur, Fashion, Lifestyle.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Organizer and Founder Director of Forever Star Group, Astro Rajesh Agarwal said that this is the fifth season of this award function after four successful seasons. This award function will be organized while celebrating Women&#39;s Day with politicians and army officers.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><img alt=\"Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend Star India Awards 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/./assets/img/blog/cover_2.jpg\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><em><u><span style=\"color:#17365d\">Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree will attend this Award Function as a Celebrity Guest</span></u></em></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Bollywood actress Bhagyashree will attend this award function as a celebrity guest. Women and men who have done excellent and noteworthy work in various fields will be honored by Bhagyashree. On the occasion of International Women&#39;s Day, this award ceremony is being organized keeping in mind the message of women empowerment.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Registration for Super Woman Awards 2024 and Super Hero Awards is open till 5th March 2024, if you also want to be a part of India&#39;s biggest award show, then do not delay in applying.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Register for Super Woman Award 2024 here: <a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\">Super Woman Award</a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Register for Super Hero Award 2024 here: <a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\">Super Hero Award</a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">For information about award registration and nomination, you can get more information by calling or WhatsApp on the helpline numbers: +91-9983274999, +91-9549736999</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-02-16 : 02:02:18'),
(440, 25, 'Best Women Care Tablets Lead the Way in Holistic Health Solutions, Revolutionizing Female Wellness', 31, 32, 1, '27,44', 'assets/img/blog/1708603189.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'best-women-care-tablet', 'Best Women Care Tablets Lead the Way in Holistic Health Solutions, Revolutionizing Female Wellness', 'w care tablet, women care tablet', 'Best Women Care Tablets Lead the Way in Holistic Health Solutions, Revolutionizing Female Wellness', 'women care tablet', 'w care tablet', 'v care tablet for women', 'best women health tablet', 'useful tablet for women ', 'Best Women Care Tablets Lead the Way in Holistic Health Solutions, Revolutionizing Female Wellness', 'https://newsforever.in/best-women-care-tablet', 'Empowering Women with a Comprehensive Solution for Uterine Health, Vaginal Well-being, and Menstrual Regularity', 'assets/img/blog/1708603545.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Subtitle:</strong> Empowering Women with a Comprehensive Solution for Uterine Health, Vaginal Well-being, and Menstrual Regularity</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In our continuous effort to support women&#39;s health and wellness, we are excited to introduce the W Care Tablet, a specially formulated supplement designed to address a range of women&#39;s health issues. Recognizing the unique health challenges women face, the W Care Tablet emerges as a holistic solution aimed at promoting healthy uterine function, offering relief from vaginal diseases, and aiding in the management of menstrual disorders.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Key Benefits of W Care Tablet:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Uterine Health:</strong> Crafted with ingredients known for their beneficial effects on the uterine environment, the W Care Tablet supports the overall health and functioning of the uterus, making it a valuable ally in maintaining reproductive health.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Vaginal Wellness:</strong> Understanding the discomfort and health issues arising from vaginal diseases, this tablet includes components that are useful in combating these conditions, aiming to restore balance and well-being.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Menstrual Regularity:</strong> For those experiencing menstrual disorders, the W Care Tablet offers a natural approach to help regulate menstrual cycles, alleviate pain, and reduce symptoms associated with conditions like PMS and PMDD.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Combatting White Leucorrhoea:</strong> Addressing the concerns related to white leucorrhoea, the tablet is formulated to help manage this condition, providing relief and contributing to vaginal health.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Probiotics for Women:</strong> Recognizing the importance of a healthy microbiome, the W Care Tablet includes probiotics specifically selected for their benefits to women&#39;s intimate health, supporting a balanced vaginal flora.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Intimate Itching, Burning, and Irritation Control</strong>: With ingredients known for their soothing properties, the tablet offers relief from the discomfort of itching, burning, and irritation, promoting a sense of comfort and well-being.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">We are committed to providing safe, effective, and scientifically-backed health solutions for women. The W Care Tablet is a testament to our dedication to enhancing women&#39;s health through innovation and research.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">For best results, it&#39;s recommended to consult with a healthcare professional to ensure the W Care Tablet is right for you, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, have existing health conditions, or are taking other medications.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong>Embrace a holistic approach to your health with the W Care Tablet &mdash; because every woman deserves to feel her best, every day.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-02-22 : 02:02:12'),
(441, 25, 'Youth Icon of the Year 2024 Award Goes to Kramik Yadav', 23, 36, 1, '14,27,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1710504060.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'youth-icon-of-the-year-2024-kramik-yadav', 'Youth Icon of the Year 2024 Award Goes to Kramik Yadav', 'Youth Icon of the Year 2024 Award Goes to Kramik Yadav', 'Mr Kramik Yadav is the first Indian Asian to represent & win 2nd Runner-Up at Caballero Universal, inspiring youth to start careers in modelling. Now, I am working as a showstopper for many big designers and an inspiration to youngsters.', 'Youth icon of the year 2024', 'Kramik Yadav youth icon of the year 2024', 'Youth Icon 2024 Kramik Yadav', 'Kramik Yadav Named Youth Icon of the Year at Forever Star India Awards', 'Youth icon of the year Kramik Yadav', 'Youth Icon of the Year 2024 Award Goes to Kramik Yadav', 'https://newsforever.in/youth-icon-of-the-year-2024-kramik-yadav', 'Mr Kramik Yadav is the first Indian Asian to represent & win 2nd Runner-Up at Caballero Universal, inspiring youth to start careers in modelling. Now, I am working as a showstopper for many big designers and an inspiration to youngsters.', 'assets/img/blog/1710504244.png', '<p>Jaipur, India &ndash; March 10, 2024 &ndash; Forever Star India Awards, in association with Intra Life and Forever Lives, proudly present the fifth season of the esteemed Hero Awards. This nationally recognized program has been organized by the visionary Mr. Rajesh Aggarwal and directed by Jaya Chauhan.<br />\r\nHeld at the picturesque Rose Garden of Entertainment Paradise, Jaipur on March 10, 2024, the Super Women &amp; Super Hero Awards Season 5 celebrated the achievements of over 130 outstanding men and women from various fields. Hailing from major cities like Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Chennai, and beyond, these women were honored in over 70 categories including business, fashion, modeling, education, astrology, and medicine.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><strong>Mr. Kramik Yadav is the first Indian Asian to represent &amp; win 2nd Runner-Up at Caballero Universal, inspiring youth to start careers in modeling. Now working as a showstopper for many big designers and an inspiration to youngsters.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/./assets/img/blog/kramik_4.jpg\" style=\"height:494px; width:878px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The primary objective of the Hero Awards is to honor India&#39;s top achievers. In line with this mission, the event welcomed distinguished guests including renowned Bollywood actress Bhagyashree and Honorable Colonel Pratap Singh Rathore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was ably hosted by the charismatic Ajit Singh who kept the audience enthralled throughout the evening. Attendees were treated to captivating performances including a mesmerizing violin recital and the launch of a special calendar.<br />\r\nA highlight of the evening was the unique opportunity for the achievers to gain global recognition, underscoring the event&#39;s commitment to showcasing Indian talent on the international platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Rajesh Aggarwal, organizer of the show, said, &ldquo;Super Women &amp; Hero Awards Season 5 continues to be an icon of inspiration, shining a light on the incredible achievements of men and women across India.&rdquo; &ldquo;We are honored to provide a platform that celebrates their contributions and inspires future generations.&rdquo;<br />\r\nWith its unique blend of recognition, entertainment, and empowerment, Super Women &amp; Heroes Awards Season 5 reaffirmed its position as a premier event on India&#39;s cultural calendar.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This unprecedented award ceremony marks the event in our country where the recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also achieve top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each award winner&#39;s profile will display prominently at the top of search engine results, ensuring lasting visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, thereby guaranteeing a continuous tribute to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-15 : 03:03:22');
