(445, 25, 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 - Dr. Lopamudra Sahu Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1710842006.png', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 - Dr. Lopamudra Sahu Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-doctor-in-rourkela-2024-dr-lopamudra-sahu', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 - Dr. Lopamudra Sahu Awarded', 'best doctor in rourkela 2024, best doctor in rourkela dr lopamudra sahu, doctor lopamudra sahu, best doctor, doctors award 2024', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 - Dr. Lopamudra Sahu, Internal Medicine Expert from Rourkela has been Nominated by Forever Star India for Super Woman Awards 2024.', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 Dr. Lopamudra Sahu', 'Dr. Lopamudra Sahu Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024', 'Doctor in Rourkela 2024', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 Doctor Lopamudra Sahu', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 - Dr. Lopamudra Sahu Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-doctor-in-rourkela-2024-dr-lopamudra-sahu', 'Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 - Dr. Lopamudra Sahu, Internal Medicine Expert from Rourkela has been Nominated by Forever Star India for Super Woman Awards 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1710842612.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India &ndash; March 10, 2024</strong> &ndash; Dr Lopamudra Sahu has been honoured with the prestigious title of Best Doctor in Rourkela for the year 2024. This accolade was bestowed upon her at the annual Forever Star India Awards, recognizing her outstanding contributions to the field of medicine and her unwavering commitment to patient care.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1710842654.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>&quot;Dr. Lopamudra Sahu, (MBBS, PGDGM, Advanced Certification in Internal Medicine) Mrs India Diva Queen 23, Mrs Asia Glamorous Queen 2023, Mrs India Homemakers State Director, Odisha, Geriatric Medical Specialist by profession with more than 9 years of work experience in this noble profession. Being a social worker stepped forward for the noble cause of underprivileged children, women, and the elderly population. Awardees: Mrs. India Legacy Fashion Icon (22-23), Woman Change Maker of the Year Award 23 by Global Empire Events. Warriors of Positive Change 2024 by Brahma Kumaris. Best Doctor Award, NHMMI Hospital Raipur (2019)&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Sahu, a leading figure in the medical community, has been praised for her exceptional skills, dedication, and compassionate approach towards her patients. Her innovative treatment methods and relentless pursuit of excellence have set a new benchmark in healthcare within the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Sahu expressed her gratitude for the recognition, stating, &quot;I am deeply honoured to receive this award. It is a testament to the hard work and dedication of my entire team. I am committed to continuing my efforts to provide the best possible care to my patients and contribute to the advancement of medical science.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This recognition is a testament to Dr. Sahu&#39;s relentless pursuit of excellence and her unwavering commitment to her patient&#39;s well-being. Her contributions have not only elevated the standards of healthcare in Rourkela but have also inspired many aspiring medical professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Forever Star India Awards continue recognising and celebrating exceptional talents across various domains, fostering a culture of excellence and dedication. Dr Lopamudra Sahu&#39;s achievement as the Best Doctor in Rourkela 2024 is a shining example of the positive impact that dedicated professionals can make in their communities.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-19 : 01:03:24'),
