hods rely on statistics and past performances, Astro-Raj&#39;s approach adds an element of mystery and attraction to <a href=\"https://www.astro-raj.com/ipl-tips.php\">IPL predictions</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As cricket fans gear up for the <a href=\"https://www.astro-raj.com/ipl-t20-cricket-prediction-2017.php\">IPL T20 2024</a> season, Astro-Raj&#39;s predictions serve as a fascinating source of discussion and speculation. Followers anxiously await each prediction, eager to see how celestial alignments align with the on-field action and shape the fate of their favorite teams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether one believes in astrology or not, Astro-Raj&#39;s predictions add an interesting dimension to the IPL excitement. Stay tuned to Astro-Raj&#39;s updates to get a unique astrological perspective on the ups and downs of IPL T20 2024 matches and discover the cosmic influences in cricket&#39;s biggest spectacle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Contact for astrology prediction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To get <a href=\"https://www.astro-raj.com/ipl-toss-prediction-astrology.php\">Astro Raj&#39;s IPL 2024 T20</a> match predictions, simply contact 8003400999 via WhatsApp. Stay ahead of the game and enhance your cricket-watching experience with Astro Raj&#39;s expert insights into the world of IPL cricket.</strong></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-20 : 01:03:43'),
(447, 25, 'Best Hairstylist in Hyderabad Award goes to Maya P Kumar', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1710933107.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'best-hairstylist-in-hyderabad-award-goes-to-maya-p-kumar', 'Best Hairstylist in Hyderabad Award goes to Maya P Kumar', 'best hairstylist maya p kumar, best hairstylist award goes to maya p kumar', 'Best Hairstylist in Hyderabad Award goes to Maya P Kumar - Maya P Kumar is running a salon and has completed 7 years. She aims to provide beauty and awareness towards self care.', 'best hairstylist in 2024', 'maya p kumar best hairtylist in hyderabad', 'hairstylist in hyderabad', 'maya p kumar best hairtylist', 'Best Hairstylist women in Hyderabad ', 'Best Hairstylist in Hyderabad Award goes to Maya P Kumar', 'https://newsforever.in/best-hairstylist-in-hyderabad-award-goes-to-maya-p-kumar', 'Best Hairstylist in Hyderabad Award goes to Maya P Kumar - Maya P Kumar is running a salon and has completed 7 years. She aims to provide beauty and awareness towards self care.', 'assets/img/blog/1710933501.png', '<p><em><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024 - Forever Star India Awards, in collaboration with Intra Life &amp; Forever Leaves, proudly presents the fifth season of the esteemed Super Women/Hero Awards. Recognized on a national level, the event was organized by the visionary Mr. Rajesh Agarwal and directed by Jaya Chauhan.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Super Women &amp; Super Hero Award season 5, held at the picturesque Rose Garden in Entertainment Paradise, Jaipur, on March 10th, 2024, celebrated the achievements of over 130 outstanding men &amp; women from various fields. Hailing from prominent cities like Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Chennai, and beyond, these women were acknowledged across 70+ categories, spanning business, fashion, Modelling, education, astrology, and medicine, among others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1710933596.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Maya P Kumar is running a salon and has completed 7 years. She aims to provide beauty and awareness towards self-care. She is a hair stylist professionally. People admire my work, she says, adding that her goal is to provide beauty and awareness of self-care because &quot;your appearance is directly related to confidence&quot;. So I am working hard in this direction. I am from Jamshedpur city and have settled in Hyderabad.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The primary aim of the Super Women/Hero Awards remains to felicitate India&#39;s top achievers. In line with this mission, the event welcomed distinguished guests, including the renowned Bollywood actress Bhagyashree, and the esteemed Colonel Pratap Singh Rathore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was hosted with finesse by the charismatic Ajit Singh, who kept the audience enthralled throughout the evening. Attendees were treated to captivating performances, including a mesmerizing violin play and the launch of an exclusive calendar.<br />\r\nOne of the highlights of the evening was the unique opportunity for achievers to gain global recognition, underscoring the event&#39;s commitment to showcasing Indian talent on an international stage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&quot;Super Women/Hero Awards Season 5 continues to be a beacon of inspiration, shining a spotlight on the incredible achievements of men &amp; women across India,&quot; said Mr. Rajesh Agarwal, the show organizer. &quot;We are honored to provide a platform that celebrates their contributions and inspires future generations.&quot;<br />\r\nWith its unparalleled blend of recognition, entertainment, and empowerment, the Super Women/Hero Awards Season 5 reaffirmed its position as a premier event on India&#39;s cultural calendar.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThis groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-20 : 02:03:52'),
