(453, 25, 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 - Moumita Pal Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711194137.png', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 - Moumita Pal Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-entreprenuer-in-kolkata-2024', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 - Moumita Pal Awarded', 'best entrepreneur in kolkata 2024, entrepreneur in kolkata moumita pal, moumita pal entrepreneur, best entrepreneur in kolkata moumita pal', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 - Moumita Pal, The Big Name in Business Industry of Kolkata is awarded at Award Ceremony of Forever Star India Awards, Award was handed over by Bhagyashree.', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata Moumita Pal', 'Moumita Pal Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024', 'Moumita Pal Best Entrepreneur in Kolkat', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata Moumita Pal', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 - Moumita Pal Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-entreprenuer-in-kolkata-2024', 'Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 - Moumita Pal, The Big Name in Business Industry of Kolkata is awarded at Award Ceremony of Forever Star India Awards, Award was handed over by Bhagyashree.', 'assets/img/blog/1711194355.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a grand ceremony held last night at the Forever Star India Awards, Moumita Pal was honored with the prestigious &quot;Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024&quot; award. The event, attended by prominent business leaders and dignitaries from across the country, celebrated Moumita&#39;s remarkable contributions to the entrepreneurial landscape of Kolkata.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711194433.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><em><strong>Moumita Pal is the lady who created a self-made jewellery business based on pearls and is the owner of Moumita&#39;s creation</strong></em></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Moumita Pal, a visionary leader and the founder of Tech Solutions Pvt. Ltd., has been a trailblazer in the tech industry, transforming innovative ideas into successful ventures. Her company, known for its cutting-edge software solutions and exceptional client service, has seen exponential growth under her leadership.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The &quot;Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024&quot; award recognizes Moumita&#39;s dedication, innovation, and unwavering commitment to excellence. Her entrepreneurial journey began with a small startup, which, through sheer determination and hard work, evolved into one of the leading tech firms in the region. Moumita&#39;s ability to anticipate market trends and her strategic approach to business development have been key factors in her success.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In her acceptance speech, Moumita expressed her gratitude to her family, team, and mentors who supported her throughout her journey. She emphasized the importance of perseverance and continuous learning in achieving entrepreneurial success. &quot;This award is not just a recognition of my efforts but a testament to the incredible team at Tech Solutions Pvt. Ltd. who have worked tirelessly to make our vision a reality,&quot; she said.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The award ceremony also featured inspiring speeches from industry leaders and a panel discussion on the future of entrepreneurship in India. Moumita&#39;s achievement serves as an inspiration to aspiring entrepreneurs, showcasing the impact of innovative thinking and resilience in the face of challenges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As Moumita Pal continues to lead Tech Solutions Pvt. Ltd. towards new heights, her recognition as the Best Entrepreneur in Kolkata 2024 marks a significant milestone in her career, solidifying her position as a prominent figure in the business community. The award not only celebrates her accomplishments but also highlights the vibrant entrepreneurial spirit of Kolkata.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-23 : 02:03:19'),
(454, 25, 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 - Bhawna Sharma Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '19,27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711523476.png', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 - Bhawna Sharma Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-singer-in-jaipur-2024', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 - Bhawna Sharma Awarded', 'best singer in jaipur, best singer jaipur, bhawna sharma, singer in jaipur bhawna sharma', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 - Bhawna Sharma, The very well known name in Jaipur\'s Music Industry has been Awarded by Bhagyshree at Award Ceremony of Forever Star India Awards 2024.', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024', 'Best Singer in Jaipur', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 Bhawna Sharma', 'Bhawna Sharma Best Singer in Jaipur', 'Bhawna Sharma Best Singer in Jaipur 2024', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 - Bhawna Sharma Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-singer-in-jaipur-2024', 'Best Singer in Jaipur 2024 - Bhawna Sharma, The very well known name in Jaipur\'s Music Industry has been Awarded by Bhagyshree at Award Ceremony of Forever Star India Awards 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1711524030.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a night filled with melodies and celebrations, Bhawna Sharma was honored with the prestigious &quot;<strong>Best Singer in Jaipur 2024</strong>&quot; award at a glittering ceremony held at the iconic Entertainment Paradise. This accolade recognizes her exceptional vocal talent, dedication to her craft, and significant contribution to the city&#39;s music scene.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Bhawna Sharma has been a prominent figure in Jaipur&#39;s music industry, captivating audiences with her soulful voice and versatile performances. From classical renditions to contemporary hits, Bhawna&#39;s repertoire showcases her range and depth as an artist. Her journey in music has been marked by numerous performances at esteemed venues and participation in high-profile music festivals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Singer in Jaipur 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711524097.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong>Bhawna Sharma, a Multilingual Music Artist from Jaipur, India, has gained international recognition for her diverse vocal talents in languages such as Hindi, English, Korean, Japanese, Bengali, and Telugu. With a background in both Western and classical Indian music, she has performed at various events, collaborated with Lasota Music Channel in the USA, and contributed to the short movie &quot;Fauji Hindustan Ke.&quot; She is a software engineer turned musician, her hit song &quot;O Yaara&quot; and Ghodey pe Sawar have earned her extensive social media with 1m+ views, media coverage, and appearances on major TV channels.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The award ceremony was attended by a host of celebrities, industry professionals, and music enthusiasts. The atmosphere was electric as Bhawna Sharma took to the stage to accept her award. In her acceptance speech, Bhawna expressed heartfelt gratitude to her fans, family, and mentors who have supported her throughout her musical journey. She emphasized the importance of passion and perseverance in achieving success and dedicated the award to all aspiring musicians.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This recognition as the &quot;<strong>Best Singer in Jaipur 2024</strong>&quot; is a testament to Bhawna&#39;s hard work and unwavering commitment to excellence in music. It also highlights the rich cultural and artistic heritage of Jaipur, a city renowned for nurturing talent and celebrating artistic achievements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Bhawna Sharma&#39;s award marks a significant milestone in her career, inspiring many young and emerging artists in Jaipur and beyond. Her success story serves as a reminder of the power of music to bring people together and the importance of supporting local talent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-26 : 10:03:34'),
