(456, 25, 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711534530.png', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev', '', '', '', '', 'best-celebrity-cosmetologist-in-bengaluru', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev', 'best celebrity cosmetologist and trichologist in bengaluru east, best celebrity cosmetologist in bengaluru, best trichologist in bengaluru, dr rupali sehdev', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East 2024 - Dr. Rupali Sehdev, from Bengaluru has been awarded by Forever Star India for commendable work in field of Cosmetology and Trichology in Bengaluru.', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East 2024', 'Dr Rupali Sehdev Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East - Dr Rupali Sehdev', 'https://newsforever.in/best-celebrity-cosmetologist-in-bengaluru', 'Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East 2024 - Dr. Rupali Sehdev, from Bengaluru has been awarded by Forever Star India for commendable work in field of Cosmetology and Trichology in Bengaluru.', 'assets/img/blog/1711535139.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In recognition of her exceptional contributions to the field of cosmetology and trichology, Dr. Rupali Sehdev has been honored with the prestigious title of &quot;<strong>Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East 2024</strong>&quot;. The award, presented at a glittering ceremony held on [Date], celebrates Dr. Sehdev&#39;s innovative approaches to skincare and haircare, catering to a diverse clientele including celebrities and prominent personalities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">With years of dedicated practice and a commitment to excellence, Dr. Rupali Sehdev has carved a niche for herself in the beauty and wellness industry. Her expertise extends across advanced skincare treatments, hair restoration therapies, and personalized consultations that have garnered acclaim from her clients and peers alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong>Beauty Vedam Skin, Hair &amp; Lifestyle Clinic | Laser Clinic Dr. Rupali Sahdev, Founder of Acupuncture Clinic, is an internationally trained, award-winning celebrity beauty therapist and trainer. Over 15 years of experience in the industry.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Celebrity Cosmetologist and Trichologist in Bengaluru East 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711535180.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Upon receiving the award, Dr. Sehdev expressed gratitude for the recognition and emphasized her ongoing dedication to enhancing beauty through science-backed treatments. She remains a sought-after expert known for her holistic approach and transformative results, making a significant impact in Bengaluru&#39;s thriving beauty scene.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This accolade further solidifies Dr. Rupali Sehdev&#39;s reputation as a leader in cosmetology and trichology, setting benchmarks for excellence and innovation in the field. Her commitment to quality care and client satisfaction continues to inspire and elevate standards within the industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-27 : 01:03:17'),
(457, 25, 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 - Bhavna Nilesh Madlani Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711537464.png', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 - Bhavna Nilesh Madlani Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-business-woman-in-jamnagar', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 - Bhavna Nilesh Madlani Awarded', 'best businesswoman in jamnagar, bhavna nilesh madlani, businesswoman in jamnagar, bhavna nilesh madlani awarded as best businesswoman', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 - Bhavna Nilesh Madlani Awarded from Jamnagar has got fame as Businesswoman. She has been awarded by Forever Star India as Best Businesswoman.', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 Bhavna Nilesh Madlani', 'Bhavna Nilesh Madlani awarded as Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024', 'Bhavna Nilesh Madlani awarded as Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 - Bhavna Nilesh Madlani Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-business-woman-in-jamnagar', 'Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024 - Bhavna Nilesh Madlani Awarded from Jamnagar has got fame as Businesswoman. She has been awarded by Forever Star India as Best Businesswoman.', 'assets/img/blog/1711539477.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a remarkable celebration of entrepreneurial excellence, Bhavna Nilesh Madlani has been awarded the prestigious title of Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024. This accolade recognizes her outstanding contributions to the business community and her unwavering commitment to innovation and growth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Bhavna Nilesh Madlani, a dynamic entrepreneur, has significantly impacted Jamnagar&#39;s business landscape through her visionary leadership and dedication to excellence. Her business acumen, strategic thinking, and relentless pursuit of success have set her apart as a leading figure in the region&#39;s business community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong>&quot;The Self Made Woman who is an Owner, Founder, Head Chef, and the Manager of &ldquo;YOUR TASTE&rdquo; Catering and Events, She&rsquo;s been in this business for 12 years. She Specially catered for Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani ( Reliance) as well as the Ambani family, Sant Morari Bapu, Shri Shri Ravishankar, and Maharaj, and doing all kinds of events including weddings, parties, get-togethers, etc, and providing multiple national and international cuisines is like cherry on the top. She provides us YOUR TASTE with BEST QUALITY of food.&quot;</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711539521.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The award was presented at a grand ceremony attended by prominent business leaders, dignitaries, and community members. Bhavna&#39;s achievements were lauded for their contribution to the local economy, job creation, and her role as a mentor and inspiration to aspiring entrepreneurs, especially women.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In her acceptance speech, Bhavna expressed her gratitude for the recognition and shared her vision for the future. &quot;This award is a testament to the hard work and dedication of my team and the support of my family. I am committed to continuing our journey of growth, innovation, and contributing positively to our community.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Bhavna&#39;s business ventures have not only brought economic prosperity to Jamnagar but have also set a benchmark for ethical business practices and corporate social responsibility. Her focus on sustainability and community engagement has garnered widespread admiration and respect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As the <strong>Best Businesswoman in Jamnagar 2024</strong>, Bhavna Nilesh Madlani serves as an inspiration to many, exemplifying the power of perseverance, leadership, and a vision for a brighter future. Her journey is a testament to what can be achieved with passion, hard work, and a commitment to excellence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The entire community of Jamnagar celebrates Bhavna&#39;s success and looks forward to her continued contributions to the city&#39;s growth and development.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-27 : 02:03:45'),
