(459, 25, 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024 - Laxmi Chauhan Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '8,27,28,29,30,31,32,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711623838.png', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024 - Laxmi Chauhan Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-fashion-designer-in-ghaziabad', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024 - Laxmi Chauhan Awarded', 'best fashion designer in ghaziabad, laxmi chauhan, best fashion designer in ghaziabad 2024, fashion designer in ghaziabad award', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024 - Laxmi Chauhan, the God Gifted Fashion Designer, and Youth Icon has been awarded at Super Woman Award 2024.', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad Laxmi Chauhan', 'Fashion Designer Laxmi Chauhan Awarded as Best Fashion Designer 2024', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024 - Laxmi Chauhan Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-fashion-designer-in-ghaziabad', 'Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024 - Laxmi Chauhan, the God Gifted Fashion Designer, and Youth Icon has been awarded at Super Woman Award 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1711624426.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a glittering ceremony held at the prestigious Forever Star India Awards, Laxmi Chauhan has been honored with the title of <strong>Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024</strong>. This recognition celebrates her exceptional talent, creativity, and contribution to the fashion industry in the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Laxmi Chauhan, known for her innovative designs and keen sense of style, has made significant strides in the fashion world. Her work, characterized by a unique blend of traditional and contemporary elements, has garnered widespread acclaim. Over the years, Laxmi has built a reputation for her meticulous attention to detail and her ability to create stunning, bespoke pieces that resonate with her clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Forever Star India Awards, held annually, aim to recognize and celebrate outstanding achievements across various fields. This year&rsquo;s event saw a gathering of industry leaders, celebrities, and dignitaries who came together to honor the best in their respective domains. Laxmi Chauhan&rsquo;s award highlights her dedication to her craft and her unwavering commitment to pushing the boundaries of fashion design.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Hailing from the vibrant city of Ghaziabad, Laxmi Chauhan has carved a niche for herself with her signature style, characterized by intricate detailing, luxurious fabrics, and timeless elegance. Her collections have graced runways and red carpets, earning her a dedicated following of fashion aficionados worldwide.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In her acceptance speech, Laxmi expressed her gratitude to the organizers, her family, and her clients. She said, &ldquo;This award is not just a recognition of my work, but also a testament to the support and encouragement I have received from my family, friends, and clients. I am deeply honored and motivated to continue creating designs that inspire and empower.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Laxmi Chauhan&rsquo;s journey in the fashion industry has been nothing short of inspiring. Starting with a small boutique in Ghaziabad, she has steadily grown her brand, attracting a loyal clientele and expanding her reach. Her collections, often showcased at major fashion events, have been praised for their originality and craftsmanship.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As the Best Fashion Designer in Ghaziabad 2024, Laxmi Chauhan sets a new benchmark for excellence in the local fashion scene. Her award not only recognizes her individual achievements but also shines a spotlight on the vibrant and dynamic fashion industry in Ghaziabad.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Congratulations to Laxmi Chauhan on this well-deserved honor. We look forward to seeing more of her incredible designs and the continued growth of her brand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-28 : 02:03:48'),
(460, 25, 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam - Dr. Zareena Jasmine Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711628293.png', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam - Dr. Zareena Jasmine Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-humanitarian-alternative-practitioner-in-ernakulam', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam - Dr. Zareena Jasmine Awarded', 'best humanitarian alternative practitioner in ernakulam, best humanitarian alternative practitioner, dr zareena jasmine, humanitarian practitioner dr zareena jasmine', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam - Dr. Zareena Jasmine from Ernakulam Awarded as Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam.', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam 2024', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam Dr Zareena Jasmine', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam - Dr. Zareena Jasmine Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-humanitarian-alternative-practitioner-in-ernakulam', 'Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam - Dr. Zareena Jasmine from Ernakulam Awarded as Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam.', 'assets/img/blog/1711628678.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - Dr. Zareena Jasmine has been honored with the prestigious title of Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam. Recognized for her outstanding contributions to alternative medicine and her unwavering dedication to the well-being of her patients, Dr. Jasmine&#39;s award is a testament to her exceptional skills and compassionate care.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Jasmine, a renowned practitioner in alternative medicine, has been at the forefront of integrating holistic healing methods with modern medical practices. With over 20 years of experience in the field, she has helped countless individuals achieve better health through natural and non-invasive treatments. Her expertise spans various modalities, including Ayurveda, Homeopathy, and Naturopathy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong>&quot;Acupuncture specialist Zareena Jasmin. &nbsp;You are a woman entrepreneur who came from Lakshadweep as the daughter-in-law of Kerala and became a support for lakhs of people. The first acupuncture doctor came with the message that no one should be denied treatment because of lack of money.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"Best Humanitarian Alternative Practitioner in Ernakulam\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711628720.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;Dr Zareena Jasmine is the founder of Kerala&#39;s first multi-specialty alternative clinic, and she has many titles as an Acupuncture Specialist.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition to being an acupuncture therapist, Zareena Jasmin has been able to make her mark in many fields such as teacher, influencer, motivational speaker, and entrepreneur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The doctor, who believes that he is God&#39;s mission and is lucky to be able to give someone life and help through him, has been able to bring light to many lives in a very short period through his multi-specialty alternative clinic, Back to Balance &quot;Holistic Wellness Research Center&quot;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>TIn her acceptance speech, Dr. Jasmine expressed her gratitude for the recognition and emphasized the importance of holistic health approaches in today&#39;s fast-paced world. &quot;This award is not just a personal achievement but a validation of the effectiveness of alternative medicine in promoting overall health and well-being. I am deeply humbled and inspired to continue my journey in providing compassionate care to my patients,&quot; she said.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. Jasmine&#39;s clinic, located in the heart of Ernakulam, is a haven for those seeking natural and effective treatments. Her personalized approach, coupled with her deep understanding of alternative therapies, has earned her a loyal patient base and numerous accolades. Patients commend her for her empathetic listening, thorough consultations, and tailored treatment plans that address the root causes of health issues rather than just the symptoms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This award highlights Dr. Zareena Jasmine&#39;s exemplary contributions to the field of alternative medicine and her commitment to humanitarian service. Her innovative practices and dedication to patient care continue to set new standards in the healthcare community, making her a true beacon of hope and healing in Ernakulam.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its unparalleled blend of recognition, entertainment, and empowerment, the Super Women/Hero Awards Season 5 reaffirmed its position as a premier event on India&#39;s cultural calendar.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-28 : 03:03:19'),
(461, 25, 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024 - Savita Verma Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711711090.png', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024 - Savita Verma Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-social-worker-in-bahraich-2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024 - Savita Verma Awarded', 'best social worker in bahraich, social worker in bahraich savita verma, awarded best social worker savita verma, social worker in bahraich', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024 - Savita Verma of Bahraich has worked to Make Thousands of Poor Daughters and Women Self Reliant by making them Skilled, Savita Verma is also the Director and Teacher of Aastha Welfare NGO.', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/best-social-worker-in-bahraich-2024', 'Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024 - Savita Verma of Bahraich has worked to Make Thousands of Poor Daughters and Women Self Reliant by making them Skilled, Savita Verma is also the Director and Teacher of Aastha Welfare NGO.', 'assets/img/blog/1711711763.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024 - In a momentous event that highlighted the invaluable contributions of social workers to the community, Savita Verma was honored with the title of &quot;Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024.&quot; This prestigious award, presented by the Forever Star India Awards, recognizes her relentless dedication and impactful work in the field of social welfare.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Savita Verma has been a beacon of hope and support for the underprivileged and marginalized communities in Bahraich. Her initiatives, ranging from education drives to healthcare campaigns, have significantly improved the quality of life for many residents. Verma&#39;s efforts in women&rsquo;s empowerment and child welfare have been particularly noteworthy, making a tangible difference in the lives of countless individuals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><em><strong>Savita Verma awarded as Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024</strong></em></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711711829.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The award ceremony, held at the Entertainment Paradise in Jaipur, saw a gathering of dignitaries, social workers, and community leaders. Bollywood Actress Bhagyashree graced the occasion as the celebrity guest, adding a touch of glamour to the prestigious event. In her speech, Bhagyashree lauded Verma&rsquo;s unwavering commitment and the positive change she has brought to society.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In her acceptance speech, Savita Verma expressed her gratitude to the community and the Forever Star India Awards for recognizing her efforts. She dedicated the award to her team and all the volunteers who have supported her mission. &quot;This award is not just mine; it belongs to everyone who has believed in our cause and worked tirelessly to make Bahraich a better place,&quot; said Verma.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Verma&#39;s journey in social work began over a decade ago, driven by a passion to serve and uplift those in need. Her organization has implemented various programs aimed at providing education, healthcare, and livelihood opportunities to the less fortunate. Her innovative approach and unwavering dedication have earned her the respect and admiration of both peers and beneficiaries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Forever Star India Awards continue to celebrate the unsung heroes of society, bringing their remarkable contributions to the forefront. Savita Verma&rsquo;s recognition as the Best Social Worker in Bahraich 2024 is a testament to the enduring impact of her work and an inspiration for others to follow in her footsteps.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-29 : 02:03:29'),
(462, 25, 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 - Anishika Singh Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711713032.png', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 - Anishika Singh Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-fitness-coach-in-vadodara-east-2024', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 - Anishika Singh Awarded', 'best fitness coach in vadodara east, anishika singh, fitness coach in vadodara, fitness coach award 2024, fitness coach achievement', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 - Anishika Singh awarded as Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 Award at Super Woman Award 2024.', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara', 'Anishika Singh Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 Anishika Singh', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 Award goes to Anishika Singh', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 - Anishika Singh Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-fitness-coach-in-vadodara-east-2024', 'Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 - Anishika Singh awarded as Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024 Award at Super Woman Award 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1711713523.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a remarkable celebration of excellence and dedication, Anishika Singh has been awarded the prestigious title of <strong>Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024</strong>. This accolade recognizes her exceptional contributions to the fitness industry and her unwavering commitment to promoting health and wellness within the community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Anishika&#39;s journey in the fitness industry began over a decade ago. With a background in sports science and nutrition, she has transformed countless lives through her holistic approach to fitness. Her training regimes, which encompass strength training, cardio workouts, and mindfulness practices, have garnered widespread acclaim for their effectiveness and sustainability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong>Who says everything ends after marriage? Fitness coach Anishika Singh inspires us to build a career through hard work. Even after marriage, If a woman is rude then she can become like this.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711713567.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Speaking at the event, Anishika expressed her gratitude, saying, &quot;I am deeply honored to receive this award. It is a testament to the hard work and dedication of my team and the trust and support of my clients. Fitness is not just about physical health; it&rsquo;s about mental well-being and a balanced lifestyle. I am committed to continuing this journey and helping more people achieve their fitness goals.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Her clients, ranging from beginners to professional athletes, have lauded her for her motivational spirit and personalized attention. Testimonials from her clients highlight her ability to tailor fitness plans that cater to individual needs, making fitness accessible and enjoyable for everyone. The award also underscores Anishika&#39;s contributions beyond the gym. She is actively involved in community fitness initiatives, including free workout sessions in local parks, fitness camps for underprivileged children, and wellness seminars. Her efforts have significantly raised awareness about the importance of fitness and a healthy lifestyle in Vadodara East.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As Anishika Singh takes home the title of <strong>Best Fitness Coach in Vadodara East 2024</strong>, she continues to inspire many with her dedication, expertise, and unwavering commitment to fitness and well-being. This accolade not only celebrates her professional achievements but also her positive impact on the community. Congratulations to Anishika Singh for this well-deserved recognition. Here&rsquo;s to a future filled with more fitness milestones and healthier lives!</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-29 : 03:03:04'),
(463, 25, 'India\'s First Waterless Facewash Hits the Market', 31, 33, 1, '', 'assets/img/blog/1711793724.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'waterless-facewash', ' India\'s First Waterless Facewash Hits the Market', 'waterless facewash, india\'s 1st water less facewash, aqua waterless facewash', 'Forever Leaves Aqua waterless facewash has emerged as a testament to innovation and sustainability in the skin care industry. By removing water from its formulation, this pioneering face wash not only conserves precious resources but also delivers unparalleled efficacy and purity.', 'waterless facewash', 'waterless facewash with aloevera', 'aqua facewash', 'india\'s 1st waterless facewash', 'forever leaves water less facewash', ' India\'s First Waterless Facewash Hits the Market', 'https://newsforever.in/waterless-facewash', 'Forever Leaves Aqua waterless facewash has emerged as a testament to innovation and sustainability in the skin care industry. By removing water from its formulation, this pioneering face wash not only conserves precious resources but also delivers unparal', 'assets/img/blog/1711794476.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">India is witnessing an unprecedented moment in the skin care sector as Forever Leaves makes its debut, introducing the country&#39;s first Aqua Waterless Face Wash infused with the nourishing goodness of Aloe Vera and Argan Extract. Notably, this revolutionary product is proudly a formula free of parabens and silicones, signaling a new era of conscious beauty choices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Forever Leaves Aqua waterless facewash has emerged as a testament to innovation and sustainability in the skin care industry. By removing water from its formulation, this pioneering face wash not only conserves precious resources but also delivers unparalleled efficacy and purity.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The inclusion of Aloe Vera and Argan Extract adds a powerful blend of natural benefits to Forever Leaves Aqua. Aloe Vera, reputed for its soothing and hydrating properties, works to replenish and revitalize the skin, leaving it feeling refreshed and revitalized. Meanwhile, Argan Extract, rich in antioxidants and essential fatty acids, nourishes and protects the skin, promoting a healthy, radiant complexion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Furthermore, Aqua Waterless Facewash differentiates itself by adhering to a strict ethos of clean beauty. With a commitment to transparency and integrity, the product is formulated without the use of parabens and silicones, ensuring it remains gentle and non-toxic for all skin types.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">CEO of Forever Leaves commented, &ldquo;We are thrilled to introduce Aqua Waterless Face Wash to the Indian market.&rdquo; &ldquo;We aim to redefine skin care by offering a product that not only enhances beauty but also upholds our dedication to the environment and personal well-being.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As consumers increasingly prioritize sustainability and transparency in their skincare choices, Forever Leaves has emerged as a leader in the pursuit of aqua-conscious beauty solutions. With its blend of natural ingredients, waterless formulation, and commitment to purity, it promises to revolutionize skin care routines across the country.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In an era defined by conscious consumption and ethical living, Aqua Waterless Face Wash stands as a symbol of progress, inviting individuals to adopt a skincare ritual that not only cares for their skin but also the planet. also respects what we call home.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-30 : 01:03:10');
