(464, 25, 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 - Rachna Awasthi Awarded', 23, 5, 1, '27,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711795078.png', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 - Rachna Awasthi Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-astrologer-in-lucknow-2024', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 - Rachna Awasthi Awarded', 'best astrologer in lucknow, rachna awasthi, astrologer in lucknow rachna awasthi, best astrologer in lucknow', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 - Rachna Awasthi is a well known Astrologer Numerologist and Tarot Card Reader from Lucknow has been awarded at Super Woman Awards 2024.', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 Rachna Awasthi', 'Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 Rachna Awasthi', 'Rachna Awasthi Awarded as Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 - Rachna Awasthi Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-astrologer-in-lucknow-2024', 'Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024 - Rachna Awasthi is a well known Astrologer Numerologist and Tarot Card Reader from Lucknow has been awarded at Super Woman Awards 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1711795731.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - Forever Star India Awards, in collaboration with Intra Life &amp; Forever Leaves, proudly presents the fifth season of the esteemed Super Women/Hero Awards. Recognized on a national level, the event was organized by the visionary Mr. Rajesh Agarwal and directed by Jaya Chauhan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Rachna Awasthi, a name synonymous with accuracy and insight in the astrological community, has been guiding individuals with her profound knowledge and expertise for over a decade. Her unique approach combines traditional astrological practices with modern methodologies, making her predictions highly reliable and sought after.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Rachana Awasthi &nbsp;is a well known Astrologer, Numerologist and Tarot Card Reader who has been in the occult field for the last 5+ years and has served 1L+ clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711795787.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Awasthi&#39;s journey in astrology began at a young age, inspired by her family&#39;s deep-rooted belief in the stars and their influence on human life. Over the years, she has honed her skills through rigorous study and practical experience, earning a reputation as one of the most trusted astrologers in Lucknow. Her clientele includes individuals from various walks of life, all of whom vouch for her insightful readings and practical advice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Forever Star India Awards 2024, known for its meticulous selection process, chose Awasthi for her exceptional accuracy in predictions, her ability to offer practical solutions, and her unwavering commitment to her clients. The award serves as a testament to her expertise and the high regard she commands in the astrological community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As the Best Astrologer in Lucknow 2024, Rachna Awasthi continues to inspire and guide those seeking answers and direction. Her award not only acknowledges her past achievements but also sets a high standard for aspiring astrologers in the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-30 : 01:03:11'),
(465, 25, 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja Awarded', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711954221.png', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja Awarded', '', '', '', '', 'best-sword-dancer-in-ahmadabad-2024', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja Awarded', 'best sword dance in ahmedabdad, shruti jadeja, sword dancer in ahmedabdad shruti jadeja', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja, Renowned as the Epitome of Grace and Skill in the Intricate Art of Sword Dancing, leaving an Indelible Mark on the Cultural Landscape of the Region.', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024', 'Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024', 'Shruti Jadeja Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad Shruti Jadeja', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 Shruti Jadeja', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja Awarded', 'https://newsforever.in/best-sword-dancer-in-ahmadabad-2024', 'Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja, Renowned as the Epitome of Grace and Skill in the Intricate Art of Sword Dancing, leaving an Indelible Mark on the Cultural Landscape of the Region.', 'assets/img/blog/1711954757.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024 - Forever Star India Awards, in collaboration with Intra Life &amp; Forever Leaves, proudly presents the fifth season of the esteemed Super Women/Hero Awards. Recognized on a national level, the event was organized by the visionary Mr. Rajesh Agarwal and directed by Jaya Chauhan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Super Women &amp; Super Hero Award season 5, held at the picturesque Rose Garden in Entertainment Paradise, Jaipur, on March 10th, 2024, celebrated the achievements of over 130 outstanding men &amp; women from various fields. Hailing from prominent cities like Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Chennai, and beyond, these women were acknowledged across 70+ categories, spanning business, fashion, Modelling, education, astrology, and medicine, among others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In the realm of dance, there are individuals who not only excel in their craft but also impart their expertise to aspiring dancers, shaping the future of the art form. In the vibrant city of Ahmedabad, nestled in the heart of Gujarat, one such luminary shines brightly &ndash; Shruti Jadeja. Renowned as the epitome of grace and skill in the intricate art of sword dancing, Shruti Jadeja has not only mesmerized audiences with her performances but has also shared her knowledge with hundreds of enthusiasts, leaving an indelible mark on the cultural landscape of the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:justify\"><u><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 - Shruti Jadeja</strong></span></u></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711955045.png\" /></a></strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Shruti Jadeja, a native of Ahmedabad, has been practicing sword dancing since the age of eight. Her journey has been one of perseverance and passion, marked by countless hours of practice and a commitment to preserving and evolving this ancient art. &quot;Winning this title is a dream come true. It&rsquo;s a testament to the hard work and dedication that goes into mastering this beautiful art form. I hope to inspire others to explore and appreciate the rich cultural heritage of sword dancing,&quot; Shruti said in her acceptance speech.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Shruti Jadeja&#39;s journey has been one of perseverance and passion, marked by countless hours of practice and a commitment to preserving and evolving this ancient art. &quot;Winning this title is a dream come true. It&rsquo;s a testament to the hard work and dedication that goes into mastering this beautiful art form. I hope to inspire others to explore and appreciate the rich cultural heritage of sword dancing,&quot; Shruti said in her acceptance speech.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Best Sword Dancer in Ahmedabad 2024 award not only celebrates Shruti Jadeja&#39;s remarkable talent but also shines a spotlight on the rich cultural tapestry of Ahmedabad, encouraging a new generation to embrace and perpetuate its vibrant traditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This groundbreaking award ceremony marks the event in our nation where recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also attain top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each awardee&#39;s profile will prominently feature at the pinnacle of search engine results, ensuring enduring visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, guaranteeing perpetual homage to their achievements.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-31 : 10:03:37'),
(466, 25, 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 | Hema Vijay Thakur', 23, 35, 1, '8,26,27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711957473.png', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-artist-in-nashik-2024', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 | Hema Vijay Thakur', 'best artist in nashik, hema vijay thakur, best artist in nashik hema vijay thakur, artist in nashik hema vijay thakur', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 - Hema Vijay Thakur is an International Artist in Fusion Warli Art, and been Nominated by Forever Star India as the Top Most Artist in Nashik.', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024', 'Best Artist in Nashik Hema Vijay Thakur', 'Hema Vijay Thakur Best Artist in Nashik 2024', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 Hema Vijay Thakur', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 Hema Vijay Thakur', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 | Hema Vijay Thakur', 'https://newsforever.in/best-artist-in-nashik-2024', 'Best Artist in Nashik 2024 - Hema Vijay Thakur is an International Artist in Fusion Warli Art, and been Nominated by Forever Star India as the Top Most Artist in Nashik.', 'assets/img/blog/1711958504.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a momentous celebration of artistic talent and creativity, Hema Vijay Thakur has been honored with the prestigious title of &quot;Best Artist in Nashik 2024.&quot; This accolade recognizes her outstanding contributions to the world of art, her innovative techniques, and her ability to captivate audiences with her compelling creations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Hema Vijay Thakur, a prominent figure in the Nashik art community, has consistently demonstrated excellence through her diverse portfolio, which includes a wide range of mediums and styles. Her work, characterized by vibrant colors, intricate details, and emotive themes, has earned her a well-deserved reputation as a visionary artist.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong>She is an international artist in Fusion Warli Art, and she has exhibited her work globally. Hema V. Thakur was born in a small village &lsquo;Undirkhed&rsquo; in Jalgaon District and brought up in Bhusawal City in the Maharashtra state of India.&nbsp;Hema&rsquo;s first international exhibition was held in New York, at the New York Art Expo In 2016 where around 2000 solo artists participated along with different groups of artists, photographers, and sculpturists. From all the Solo artists Hema was chosen among the 7 Artists with Unique Art. In May 2017 Hema was awarded as one of the Top 16 Contemporary.</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"Best Artist in Nashik 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711958562.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Thakur&#39;s journey as an artist has been marked by numerous accolades and exhibitions both locally and internationally. Her artworks, which often depict themes of nature, human emotions, and cultural heritage, have been showcased in renowned galleries and have garnered critical acclaim.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The &quot;Best Artist in Nashik 2024&quot; award is a testament to Hema Vijay Thakur&#39;s unwavering passion for art and her contribution to the cultural landscape of Nashik. Her work continues to inspire budding artists and enrich the community with its profound beauty and significance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In her acceptance speech, Hema expressed her gratitude for the recognition and shared her passion for art. &quot;Art is not just a form of expression; it is a way of life. It is an honor to be recognized for something that I love and dedicate my life to. I am grateful to everyone who has supported me on this journey,&quot; she said.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Hema&#39;s journey as an artist began at a young age, and over the years, she has evolved her craft, experimenting with various techniques and pushing the boundaries of traditional art forms. Her work often reflects her deep connection to nature, culture, and human emotions, making her pieces relatable and evocative.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This award is not just a testament to Hema&#39;s talent but also an inspiration to aspiring artists in Nashik and beyond. It underscores the importance of nurturing artistic talents and the significant role that art plays in enriching our lives and society. As the Best Artist in Nashik 2024, Hema Vijay Thakur continues to inspire and influence the art community with her exceptional work. Her future projects are eagerly anticipated, and she remains a beacon of creativity and innovation in the world of art.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-03-31 : 11:03:26'),
(467, 25, 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024 | Dr Abhishek Sharma', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711963346.png', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-dentist-doctor-in-fatehpur-shekhawati-2024', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024 | Dr Abhishek Sharma', 'best dentist doctor in fatehpur shekhawati, abhishek sharma, best dentist doctor in fatehpur shekhawati dr abhishek sharma, dr abhishek sharma, dentist in fatehpur shekhawati', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024 - Dr Abhishek Sharma Nominated for \"Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024\" and award was handed over by Bollywood Actress Bhagyshree.', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024', 'Abhishek Sharma Best Dentist in Fatehpur Shekhawati', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati Dr Abhishek Sharma', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024 | Dr Abhishek Sharma', 'https://newsforever.in/best-dentist-doctor-in-fatehpur-shekhawati-2024', 'Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024 - Dr Abhishek Sharma Nominated for \"Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024\" and award was handed over by Bollywood Actress Bhagyshree.', 'assets/img/blog/1711964240.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a resounding acknowledgment of excellence in dental care, Dr. Abhishek Sharma has been acclaimed as the Best Dentist in Fatehpur Shekhawati for the year 2024. This prestigious recognition comes as a testament to his unwavering commitment and exceptional skill in providing top-notch dental services to the community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Abhishek Sharma, known for his compassionate approach and expertise, has garnered widespread praise for his dedication to dental health. His clinic, renowned for its state-of-the-art facilities and patient-centric care, stands as a beacon of quality in the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><em><strong>Dr. Abhishek Sharma &quot;Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur&nbsp;Shekhawati 2024&quot;</strong></em></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><em><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1711964285.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Sharma, a distinguished practitioner with years of experience, has consistently demonstrated excellence in various aspects of dental health, from routine check-ups and cleanings to complex dental surgeries. His practice is equipped with state-of-the-art technology, ensuring patients receive the most advanced and effective treatments available.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Sharma&rsquo;s clinic offers a wide range of services, including cosmetic dentistry, orthodontics, pediatric dentistry, and oral surgery. His holistic approach to dental care ensures that patients not only achieve optimal oral health but also enjoy a comfortable and pleasant experience during their visits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As Dr. Abhishek Sharma continues to set new benchmarks in dental care, the community of Fatehpur Shekhawati can rest assured that they have access to one of the finest dental practitioners in the region. His recognition as the Best Dentist Doctor in Fatehpur Shekhawati for 2024 is well-deserved and a reflection of his dedication to excellence in the field of dentistry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&quot;I am deeply honored to receive this award,&quot; remarked Dr. Abhishek Sharma, expressing gratitude for the recognition. &quot;It is a privilege to serve the people of Fatehpur Shekhawati and to contribute to their oral health and well-being.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As the Best Dentist in Fatehpur Shekhawati 2024, Dr. Abhishek Sharma continues to uphold his commitment to excellence, promising continued innovation and compassionate care for years to come.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-01 : 12:04:01'),
(468, 25, 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024 | Nishanthi Uma', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1711966974.png', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-esthetician-in-chennai-city-south-2024', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024 | Nishanthi Uma', 'best esthetician in chennai city south, nishanthi uma, best esthetician in south chennai, esthetician in chennai south nishanthi uma', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024 - Nishanthi Uma is an Esthetician, Internationally Certified by Dubai Health Authority, her passion for Skincare and Beauty Shows in her Dedication to providing excellent client service in South India.', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai Nishanthi Uma', 'Nishanthi Uma Best Esthetician in Chennai 2024', 'Best Esthetician Chennai 2024 Nishanthi Uma', 'Nishanthi Uma Best Esthetician in Chennai 2024', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024 | Nishanthi Uma', 'https://newsforever.in/best-esthetician-in-chennai-city-south-2024', 'Best Esthetician in Chennai City South 2024 - Nishanthi Uma is an Esthetician, Internationally Certified by Dubai Health Authority, her passion for Skincare and Beauty Shows in her Dedication to providing excellent client service in South India.', 'assets/img/blog/1711967396.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Jaipur, India - March 10, 2024</strong> - In a resounding acknowledgment of her exceptional skills and dedication, Nishanthi Uma has been crowned the Best Esthetician in Chennai City South for the year 2024. This prestigious recognition comes as a testament to her expertise and unwavering commitment to delivering unparalleled skincare services.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Nishanthi Uma&#39;s journey to the pinnacle of esthetics has been marked by a passion for enhancing natural beauty and a deep understanding of skincare techniques. Her clientele speaks volumes about her profi