(486, 25, 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024 | Reshma Jain', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713009360.png', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-vastu-expert-and-relationship-healer-in-mumbai-2024', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024 | Reshma Jain', 'best vastu expert and relationship healer in mumbai 2024, reshma jain, best vastu expert in mumbai 2024, best relationship healer in mumbai 2024,  best vastu expert and relationship healer in mumbai 2024, best vastu expert in mumbai award 2024', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024 - Reshma Jain\'s Guidance to Married Women and Mothers to Strengthen Relationships and Create Harmonious Relationships with the Power of Vastu and Energy (Aura) Healing.', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024 Reshma Jain', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai', 'Reshma Jain Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024 | Reshma Jain', 'https://newsforever.in/best-vastu-expert-and-relationship-healer-in-mumbai-2024', 'Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024 - Reshma Jain\'s Guidance to Married Women and Mothers to Strengthen Relationships and Create Harmonious Relationships with the Power of Vastu and Energy (Aura) Healing.', 'assets/img/blog/1713009749.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:justify\"><u><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Reshma Jain won S&quot;Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai 2024&quot; Title</strong></span></u></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">At a glittering ceremony held in Jaipur on March 10, 2024, Reshma Jain was honored with the prestigious Super Woman Award as the Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai. Organized by Forever Star India, the event celebrated excellence across various sectors and recognized individuals for their outstanding contributions and achievements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Reshma Jain has been honored as the Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai for 2024. This prestigious accolade celebrates her unparalleled expertise in Vastu Shastra and her exceptional ability to heal and improve relationships through her profound knowledge and empathetic approach.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713009778.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Reshma Jain, the Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai and renowned expert in Vastu and Relationship Healing, has made significant strides in her field, helping many individuals and families achieve harmony and balance in their lives. His innovative approach and dedication to his work have earned him this well-deserved accolade.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Reshma Jain&#39;s journey in the realm of Vastu and relationship healing is marked by years of dedicated practice, extensive study, and a genuine passion for helping others. Her unique approach combines ancient Vastu principles with modern-day solutions, enabling her to create harmonious living spaces and foster positive relationships for her clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The awards ceremony was graced by Bollywood actress Bhagyashree, who was present as the celebrity guest. Bhagyashree, famous for her charm and decency, added a touch of glamor to the program by handing over the award to Reshma Jain. This honor not only highlights Reshma&#39;s expertise and commitment but also serves as an inspiration to many in the field of Vaastu and holistic healing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><u><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Healing Hearts and Strengthening Bonds</span></strong></u></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In addition to her Vastu expertise, Reshma Jain is renowned for her relationship healing services. Her compassionate and insightful guidance has helped countless individuals and couples navigate challenges, resolve conflicts, and build stronger, more fulfilling relationships. Her holistic approach addresses emotional, mental, and spiritual dimensions, ensuring comprehensive and lasting healing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As a Vastu expert, Reshma meticulously analyzes homes and workplaces, offering tailored solutions that enhance prosperity, health, and overall well-being. Her clients have consistently praised her for transforming their environments, leading to significant improvements in various aspects of their lives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Reshma Jain&#39;s commitment to excellence and integrity has earned her the trust and admiration of her clients. Her ability to blend traditional wisdom with contemporary needs makes her a sought-after expert in Mumbai and beyond. Her recognition as the Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai for 2024 is a testament to her unwavering dedication and outstanding contributions to her field.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As Reshma continues to impact lives positively, she remains committed to her mission of bringing harmony, prosperity, and happiness to her clients. Her vision for the future includes expanding her services to reach even more people, helping them unlock the full potential of their spaces and relationships.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Reshma Jain&#39;s recognition as the Best Vastu Expert and Relationship Healer in Mumbai for 2024 highlights her remarkable contributions and unwavering dedication to improving the lives of her clients. Her unique blend of Vastu Shastra and relationship healing continues to make a significant impact, fostering harmony and well-being for all.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-13 : 03:04:44'),
(487, 25, 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 23, 35, 2, '27,30,31,38,40', 'assets/img/blog/1713165029.png', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', '', '', '', '', 'super-woman-award', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'super woman award 2024, award ceremony 2024, forever star india award, awards night 2024, super woman 2024 award ceremony, super woman awards night', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August - A Prestigious Event celebrating the Achievements of Extraordinary Women, Witness Inspiring Stories. Nominations from India and around the world are invited.', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August', 'https://newsforever.in/super-woman-award', 'Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony in August - A Prestigious Event celebrating the Achievements of Extraordinary Women, Witness Inspiring Stories. Nominations from India and around the world are invited.', 'assets/img/blog/1713165191.png', '<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Nominations for Super Woman Award 2024 Season 5 have started</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Exclusive Awards Ceremony to be held in August</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">The Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony is a prestigious event that honors and celebrates the achievements of remarkable women from various fields. Held twice a year, this exclusive ceremony is a testament to the dedication and perseverance of women who have made significant contributions to their respective fields.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Introduction:</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">In a world where women are breaking barriers and redefining success on their terms, the Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony stands as a tribute to their indomitable spirit. Scheduled to take place in August, this event promises to be a celebration of excellence, resilience, and empowerment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">The first ceremony of the year took place in March, featuring the esteemed presence of Bollywood actress Bhagyashree as the celebrity guest. Her inspiring words and graceful presence added a special touch to the event, making it a memorable experience for all attendees.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">The upcoming ceremony, scheduled for August 2024, promises to be equally remarkable. What sets this ceremony apart is its accessibility - you can attend and participate in the event from the comfort of your home. This unique feature allows individuals from across the globe to be part of this celebration of women&#39;s achievements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Top Google Ranking</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">One of the most significant benefits of the Super Woman Award Ceremony is the visibility it provides to its recipients. Videos of individual award ceremonies are showcased on Google, often ranking at the top for relevant keywords. This exposure not only recognizes the awardees&#39; accomplishments but also serves as a source of inspiration for others.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Moreover, FSIA Membership offers an exclusive opportunity to create a unique <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/\">Forever Star India Website</a></strong> tailored to your field of work. These websites are designed to rank highly on Google, further enhancing the visibility and credibility of the awardees.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/./assets/img/blog/1705737023.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Highlighting Extraordinary Achievements:</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">The Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony will shine a spotlight on women who have achieved remarkable feats in various fields. From business and entrepreneurship to social activism, art, and beyond, these women have not only excelled in their respective domains but have also inspired others with their journeys.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Recognizing Unsung Heroes:</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">One of the most inspiring aspects of the <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Award</a></strong> is its focus on recognizing unsung heroes. Many women work tirelessly behind the scenes, making significant contributions to their communities and society at large. This ceremony provides a platform to honor their dedication and commitment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Empowering Future Generations:</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Beyond just honoring achievements, the Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony aims to empower future generations of women. By showcasing the stories of these exceptional women, the event seeks to inspire others to dream big and pursue their goals with courage and determination.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Celebrating Diversity and Inclusion:</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Diversity and inclusion are key themes of the Super Woman Award 2024 Ceremony. The event celebrates women from all walks of life, representing different backgrounds, cultures, and perspectives. This inclusivity is a testament to the belief that every woman has a unique story and deserves to be celebrated.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Nominations for the Super Woman Award 2024 are not limited to India; they are open to talented women from around the world. This global approach ensures that the most deserving individuals are recognized for their exceptional contributions and achievements.</span></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Conclusion:</u></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">The <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Award 2024</a></strong> Ceremony is more than just an event; it is a testament to the power of women to change the world. By recognizing and celebrating their achievements, this ceremony inspires us all to strive for excellence and create a more inclusive and equitable society. Join us in August as we honor these extraordinary women and celebrate their remarkable journeys.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Join us in August 2024 for a celebration like no other, as we honor and applaud the super women of our time!</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-14 : 10:04:40'),
(488, 25, 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 | Acharya Prerna A Jain', 23, 35, 1, '8,27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713174722.png', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-astrologer-in-jaipur-2024', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 | Acharya Prerna A Jain', 'best astrologer award in jaipur, best astrologer award, acharya prerna  wins best astrologer award in jaipur, best astrologer in jaipur, best astrologer in jaipur 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 - Acharya Prerna A Jain honored with Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 Award by Forever Star India.', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024', 'Best Astrologer Award in Jaipur 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur', 'Acharya Prerna A Jain wins Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024', 'Acharya Prerna A Jain Astrologer in Jaipur', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 | Acharya Prerna A Jain', 'https://newsforever.in/best-astrologer-in-jaipur-2024', 'Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 - Acharya Prerna A Jain honored with Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024 Award by Forever Star India.', 'assets/img/blog/1713175148.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In a city renowned for its rich cultural heritage and spiritual essence, Acharya Prerna A Jain has been honored with the prestigious title of &quot;<strong>Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024</strong>.&quot; This accolade highlights her exceptional skills and dedication in the field of astrology, marking her as a beacon of wisdom and guidance for countless individuals seeking clarity and direction in their lives.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-family:Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Grande,sans-serif\"><u><strong><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Acharya Prerna A Jain Won &quot;Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024&quot; Award</span></span></strong></u></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In a grand celebration of outstanding achievements, Acharya Prerna was honored with the Super Woman Award as the <strong>Best Astrologer in Jaipur</strong>, Rajasthan for the year 2024. The prestigious awards ceremony, organized by Forever Star India, took place on March 10, 2024, in the culturally rich city of Jaipur. Bollywood actress Bhagyashree graced the event as the celebrity guest, adding to the evening&#39;s splendor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Acharya Prerna A Jain, with her profound knowledge and intuitive insights, has been transforming lives for over a decade. Her expertise encompasses various branches of astrology, including Vedic astrology, numerology, palmistry, and tarot reading. Clients from all walks of life have found solace and solutions to their problems through her accurate predictions and practical advice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><img alt=\"Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713175207.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Honoring Excellence in Astrology</strong></span></span></u></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">What sets Acharya Prerna apart is not just her deep understanding of astrological sciences but also her compassionate approach. She takes the time to listen and understand the unique circumstances of each individual, offering personalized solutions that are both effective and empathetic. Her clients often describe their experiences with her as life-changing, attributing their personal and professional successes to her guidance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Forever Star India: Celebrating Achievement of Acharya Prerna A Jain</span></span></strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Forever Star India is renowned for acknowledging and celebrating the accomplishments of individuals who excel in their respective fields. The Super Woman Award highlights the significant contributions of women who have made remarkable strides and set high standards in their domains.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This award recognizes not only her professional achievements but also her commitment to making a positive impact on society. Acharya Prerna A Jain regularly conducts workshops and seminars, sharing her knowledge and helping others to harness the power of astrology for self-improvement and personal growth. She is also known for her philanthropic activities, offering free consultations to those in need and supporting various charitable causes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>A Star-Studded Event</strong></span></span></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The awards ceremony was a glittering affair, held in the picturesque city of Jaipur, known for its historical significance and architectural beauty. The event saw a gathering of distinguished personalities from various industries, creating a platform for recognizing excellence. The presence of Bollywood actress Bhagyashree added a touch of glamour and prestige to the occasion as she presented the award to Acharya Prerna A Jain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Receiving the &quot;Best Astrologer in Jaipur 2024&quot; award is a testament to Acharya Prerna A Jain&rsquo;s dedication, skill, and the trust she has built within the community. It reinforces her position as a leading figure in the astrological realm, inspiring many to explore the ancient wisdom of astrology and its benefits.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Acharya Prerna A Jain: A Beacon in Best Astrologer in Jaipur</strong></span></span></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Acharya Prerna&#39;s journey to winning the Super Woman Award is a story of passion, expertise, and unwavering commitment to her craft. Her success as an astrologer in Jaipur has inspired many and highlighted the importance of astrology in contemporary society. She has not only achieved personal milestones but has also contributed significantly to the well-being and enlightenment of her clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></span></span></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We extend our heartfelt congratulations to Acharya Prerna for winning the Super Woman Award as the Best Astrologer in Jaipur, Rajasthan&nbsp;2024. Her remarkable journey and achievements underscore the importance of dedication, knowledge, and passion in the field of astrology.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-15 : 01:04:20'),
(489, 25, 'Avisha Namdeo won Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713177513.png', 'Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-digital-marketing-agency-in-raipur-2024', 'Avisha Namdeo won Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024', 'best digital marketing agency in raipur 2024, avisha namdeo best digital marketing agency in raipur 2024, best digital marketing agency in raipur', 'Avisha Namdev\'s journey to becoming the epitome of excellence as the best digital marketing agency in Raipur 2024 is a testament to her vision, creativity and unwavering dedication.', 'Best digital marketing agency in raipur 2024', 'Avisha Namdeo\'s Best Digital Marketing agency in Raipur 2024', 'Best digital marketing agency Raipur', 'Avisha Namdeo best digital marketing agency in Raipur 2024 ', 'Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024 by Avisha Namdeo', 'Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/best-digital-marketing-agency-in-raipur-2024', 'Avisha Namdev\'s journey to becoming the epitome of excellence as the best digital marketing agency in Raipur 2024 is a testament to her vision, creativity and unwavering dedication.', 'assets/img/blog/1713177778.png', '<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Avisha Namdeo Wins Super Woman Award as Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Raipur, Chhattisgarh &ndash; Avisha Namdeo has been awarded the prestigious Super Woman Award for Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024. The recognition was bestowed during an elegant awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India, celebrating outstanding achievements in various fields.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Leading the Way in Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Avisha Namdeo has established herself as a formidable force in the digital marketing industry. Her agency is known for delivering exceptional results, utilizing innovative strategies, and setting new standards in the field. This award highlights her dedication, expertise, and the significant impact her agency has made in Raipur and beyond.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>A Night of Celebration Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The awards ceremony took place on 10 March 2024, in the vibrant city of Jaipur. The event was a grand celebration attended by eminent personalities from various industries. Adding glamour to the evening was Bollywood actress Bhagyashree, who graced the occasion as the celebrity guest, making the night even more memorable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Forever Star India: Celebrating Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Forever Star India is renowned for its commitment to recognizing and celebrating excellence across different sectors. The Super Woman Award is a testament to their dedication to honoring outstanding contributions and inspiring future generations. By awarding Avisha Namdeo, they have acknowledged the crucial role of digital marketing in today&rsquo;s business landscape.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Avisha Namdeo: Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Avisha Namdeo&rsquo;s journey in the digital marketing world has been marked by creativity, innovation, and a relentless pursuit of excellence. Winning the Super Woman Award as Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024 is a well-deserved recognition of her hard work and commitment. Her agency has consistently delivered top-notch services, helping businesses grow and succeed in the digital age.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>The Importance of Recognition Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This award not only celebrates Avisha Namdeo&rsquo;s achievements but also underscores the importance of digital marketing in the modern business environment. It serves as an inspiration to other professionals in the field, encouraging them to strive for excellence and make meaningful contributions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Join us in congratulating Avisha Namdeo on this remarkable achievement and wishing her continued success. Her recognition as the Best Digital Marketing Agency in Raipur 2024 is a testament to her dedication and expertise in the field.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-15 : 01:04:04'),
(490, 25, 'Nikhaar Boutique wins Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot 2024', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713259479.png', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', '', '', '', '', 'best-traditional-fashion-desinger-in-rajkot', 'Nikhaar Boutique wins Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot 2024', 'best traditional fashion designer in rajkot, nikhaar boutique, best fashion designer in rajkot, traditional fashion designing in rajkot, best traditional fashion designer', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot - At the Award Ceremony of the Super Woman Awards, Nikhaar Boutique was awarded with Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot 2024 Award.', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot', 'https://newsforever.in/best-traditional-fashion-desinger-in-rajkot', 'Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot - At the Award Ceremony of the Super Woman Awards, Nikhaar Boutique was awarded with Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot 2024 Award.', 'assets/img/blog/1713260186.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><u><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Nikhaar Boutique Won Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot 2024</strong></span></u></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Nikhaar Boutique has been awarded the prestigious Super Woman Award for Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot, 2024. The recognition came during a grand awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India, celebrating excellence in various fields.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713260262.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Celebrating Excellence in Best Traditional Fashion</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Nikhaar Boutique has been a standout name in the fashion industry, especially known for its exquisite traditional designs. This award acknowledges the boutique&#39;s dedication to preserving and innovating within the realm of Best traditional fashion, offering designs that blend heritage with contemporary flair.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>A Night to Remember of Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The awards ceremony took place on 10 March 2024 in the culturally rich city of Jaipur. The event was a glamorous affair, attended by notable personalities from various industries. The highlight of the evening was the presence of Bollywood actress Bhagyashree, who served as the celebrity guest, adding star power to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Forever Star India: Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot Honoring Achievements</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Forever Star India is renowned for recognizing and celebrating outstanding achievements across different sectors. The Super Woman Award is a testament to their commitment to honoring excellence and inspiring future generations. By awarding Nikhaar Boutique Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot, they have highlighted the significant contributions made by women in the fashion industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Nikhaar Boutique: A Tradition of Excellence</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Nikhaar Boutique&rsquo;s journey has been marked by a commitment to quality, craftsmanship, and innovative design. Winning the Super Woman Award as <strong>Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot</strong> is a well-deserved recognition of their efforts. The boutique has continually traditionally set high standards, making a lasting impact on the industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Importance of Recognition</span></span></strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>This award not only celebrates the achievements of Nikhaar Boutique but also encourages them to continue their work in promoting <strong>Best Traditional Fashion Designer</strong>. Such recognition serves as an inspiration to other designers and fashion enthusiasts, motivating them to pursue excellence in their craft.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Join us in congratulating Nikhaar Boutique on this remarkable achievement and wishing them continued success. Their recognition as the Best Traditional Fashion Designer in Rajkot for 2024 is a proud moment for the fashion industry and an inspiration for many.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-16 : 12:04:33'),
(491, 25, 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024 | Saumya Sahu', 23, 35, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713262380.png', 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-fashion-designer-in-lucknow-2024', 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024', 'best fashion designer in lucknow 2024, saumya sahu, fashion designer saumya sahu, best fashion designer, super woman award, fashion designer 2024 award saumya sahu', 'Best Fashion Designer at Lucknow 2024 - From the Soil of Uttar Pradesh, Saumya Sahu has been nominated and won Best Fashion Designer at Lucknow 2024 Award at Super Woman Award 2024.', 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024', 'Saumya Sahu Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024', 'Fashion Designer in Lucknow Award', 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024 Saumya Sahu', 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024', 'Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/best-fashion-designer-in-lucknow-2024', 'Best Fashion Designer at Lucknow 2024 - From the Soil of Uttar Pradesh, Saumya Sahu has been nominated and won Best Fashion Designer at Lucknow 2024 Award at Super Woman Award 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1713262907.png', '<h1><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Saumya Sahu honored with &quot;Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024&quot; Award</strong></span></span></u></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Saumya Sahu has been awarded the prestigious Super Woman Award as the <strong>Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024.</strong>&nbsp;This honor recognizes her outstanding contribution and excellence in the field of fashion design. Award and Certificate was handed over by Bollywoood Celebrity Guest Bhagyashree.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>How Saumya achieve the Milestone for the Nominations of&nbsp;&quot;Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow&quot;</strong></span></u></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Saumya&#39;s journey in fashion design began with a passion for creating unique and elegant attire that blends traditional elements with contemporary aesthetics. Her dedication to quality craftsmanship and her keen eye for detail have set her apart in the competitive world of fashion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Over the years, Saumya has built a reputation for her exquisite collections that showcase a perfect fusion of cultural heritage and modern trends. Her designs are known for their intricate embroidery, luxurious fabrics, and flattering silhouettes that cater to diverse tastes and occasions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713262940.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Saumya Sahu: A Visionary in Fashion Creator</strong></span></span></u></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Soumya Sahu&#39;s dedication to her art and her innovative approach towards being the <strong>Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow</strong> has earned her this well-deserved recognition. His designs are known for their beauty, creativity, and attention to detail, making him exceptional in the fashion industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The &quot;Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow 2024&quot; award highlights Saumya&#39;s exceptional talent and her relentless pursuit of excellence. This recognition is a testament to her creativity, hard work, and commitment to pushing the boundaries of fashion design.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As the Best Fashion Designer in Lucknow for 2024, Saumya Sahu continues to set new standards in the fashion world, inspiring aspiring designers and fashion lovers with her innovative and elegant creations. Her work not only celebrates the rich cultural heritage of Lucknow but also reflects a modern and sophisticated style that resonates with a global audience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><u><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Award Night to Remeber</strong></span></span></u></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The awards ceremony in Jaipur was a night of glitz and glamour, which brought together some of the most inspiring personalities from various fields. Bhagyashree&#39;s presence added an extra touch of star power to the event, making it an unforgettable evening.&nbsp;The award ceremony, held in Jaipur, was attended by prominent figures in the fashion industry, celebrities, and fashion enthusiasts. Saumya&#39;s latest collection was also showcased, receiving rave reviews from attendees and fashion critics alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saumya Sahu&#39;s journey and achievements serve as an inspiration for aspiring fashion designers. His story is a testament to the impact of passion, hard work, and dedication in achieving excellence in a chosen field.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saumya expressed her gratitude for the award, stating, &quot;I am incredibly honored to receive this recognition. Fashion is not just my profession; it is my passion. I am grateful to everyone who has supported me on this journey, and I look forward to continuing to create designs that inspire and delight.&quot;</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-16 : 01:04:47'),
(492, 25, 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant)', 21, 6, 1, '12,13,15,16,17,18,19,20,22,23,27', 'assets/img/blog/1713342474.png', 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant)', '', '', '', '', 'forever-star-india-beauty-pageant', 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant)', 'forever star india, beauty pageant, miss india, mrs india, miss teen india, grand finale, beauty contest, india, talent rounds, training session, winners, youtube, google ranking, ceremony', 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant) - Discover the glitz and glamour of the Forever Star India Beauty Pageant, showcasing the best of Indian beauty and talent. Learn about the journey, participants, and winners of this prestigious event that celebrates beauty, culture, and diversity.', 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant)', 'History and Evolution of Forever Star India Beauty Pageant', 'Training and Preparation for Contestants', 'Meet the Winners: Miss India, Mrs. India, Miss Teen India', 'Joining Forever Star India', 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant)', 'https://newsforever.in/forever-star-india-beauty-pageant', 'Forever Star India (Beauty Pageant) - Discover the glitz and glamour of the Forever Star India Beauty Pageant, showcasing the best of Indian beauty and talent. Learn about the journey, participants, and winners of this prestigious event that celebrates be', 'assets/img/blog/1713343384.png', '<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Forever Star India presents Miss India, Mrs India, Miss Teen India 2024 (Season-4)</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>Finale in August</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>The Grand Finale of India&#39;s Biggest Beauty Contest Season 4 Set for August</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The much-anticipated grand finale of Season 4 of India&#39;s Biggest Beauty Contest <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\">Miss India</a></strong>, <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/forever-mrs-india-new.php\">Mrs India</a></strong>, and <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\">Miss Teen India 2024</a></strong> is all set to dazzle in August. With participants converging from all corners of the country, the event promises to be a spectacular showcase of beauty, talent, and grace.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Expert Training for Participants</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Participants have been undergoing rigorous training sessions, guided by industry experts. These sessions not only focus on enhancing their beauty but also on honing their talents. The contestants are gearing up for the talent rounds, with preparations in full swing to ensure they shine on the grand stage.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Exclusive Crown Ceremony</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">A special training session has been organized to make the crowning ceremony truly exclusive. This session will provide valuable insights and tips to make the crowning moment unforgettable for the winners.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Selection of City Winners</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Winners from almost every city in the country will be selected to represent their cities in Miss India, Mrs. India, and Miss Teen India categories. These winners are not just contestants; they are future icons, ready to make their mark on the world stage.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Top Rankings on Google and YouTube</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The winners&#39; journey doesn&#39;t end on the stage. Their exclusive videos will be uploaded on YouTube, where they are expected to rank among the top searches on Google. This exposure will not only showcase their talents but also open doors to a world of opportunities.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Tie-ups with Companies and Brands</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">To further boost their careers, tie-ups with renowned companies and brands have been planned for all the winners. This collaboration will provide them with a platform to kickstart their journey in the glamour industry.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Grand Finale in December</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">While the excitement builds up for the August event, the grand finale is being planned for December. This will be the culmination of months of hard work, dedication, and dreams, as the winners take their well-deserved place in the spotlight.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Stay tuned for more updates on this glamorous event as we countdown to the grand finale of Season 4 of India&#39;s Biggest Beauty Contest!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Connect with Our Team for More Details: +91-9772014999, +91-9983599666</span></span></strong></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-16 : 11:04:11'),
(493, 25, 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 - Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713356066.png', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-astrologer-in-chennai-2024', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024', 'best astrologer in chennai 2024, dr bk thirupathi raja, super hero award ceremony 2024, bk thirupathi raja best astrologer in chennai 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 - Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja awarded with Prestigious Title Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 at Super Hero Award 2024.', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja', 'Astrologer in Chennai 2024 Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/best-astrologer-in-chennai-2024', 'Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 - Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja awarded with Prestigious Title Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 at Super Hero Award 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1713356348.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In an important celebration of divine knowledge and insight, Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja was awarded the prestigious title of &quot;<strong>Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024&quot;</strong>. This prestigious honor presented by the Super Hero Awards was held amidst the grandeur of Jaipur on March 10, 2024. It included the gracious presence of Bollywood actress Bhagyashree, who presented the award to Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Thirupathi Raja, a seasoned astrologer with over two decades of experience, has become a trusted name in Chennai and beyond. His accurate predictions and personalized consultations have garnered a wide following, with clients from various walks of life seeking his expertise. Known for his compassionate approach and deep understanding of Vedic astrology, he has helped countless individuals find clarity and direction in their personal and professional lives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Bk Thirupathi Raja&#39;s journey to becoming an icon of astrological excellence is a testament to his profound knowledge, unwavering dedication, and intuitive wisdom. His ability to understand cosmic mysteries and provide guidance and solace to countless individuals has earned him widespread recognition and admiration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In his acceptance speech, Dr. Thirupathi Raja expressed his gratitude for the recognition and dedicated the award to his clients and supporters. &quot;This award is a testament to the trust and faith that people have placed in me. I am deeply humbled and honored to receive this recognition. My journey in astrology has been guided by a passion to help others, and this award motivates me to continue my work with even greater dedication.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713356370.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As an Astrologer, Dr. B.K. Thirupathi Raja<strong>&nbsp;&quot;Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024</strong>&quot;, acts as a guiding light, providing clarity and direction to those seeking answers in the divine realm. His compassionate approach and deep understanding of astrological principles have endeared him to clients from all walks of life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Thirupathi Raja&#39;s contributions to astrology extend beyond individual consultations. He has authored several books on Vedic astrology, conducted numerous workshops, and appeared on various television and radio programs, sharing his knowledge and insights with a wider audience. His philanthropic efforts, including free astrological camps for underprivileged communities, have further solidified his reputation as a compassionate and socially responsible astrologer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As the recipient of the Best Astrologer in Chennai 2024 Award, Dr. BK Thirupathi Raja joins the ranks of esteemed astrologers who have made significant impacts in the field. This recognition not only celebrates his achievements but also underscores the enduring relevance and importance of astrology in modern life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This unprecedented award ceremony marks the event in our country where the recipients not only receive prestigious honors but also achieve top rankings on both Google and YouTube. Each award winner&#39;s profile will display prominently at the top of search engine results, ensuring lasting visibility and recognition. Furthermore, the moment of receiving the award will be immortalized through a video clip uploaded on YouTube and various OTT platforms, thereby guaranteeing a continuous tribute to their achievements.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-17 : 03:04:31');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(494, 25, 'Actor Debasis Senapaty wins Best Multi Talent Artist In Bhubaneswar 2024', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713434343.png', 'Best Multi Talent Artist In Bhubaneswar 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-multi-talent-artist-in-bhubaneswar-2024', 'Best Multi Talent Artist In Bhubaneswar 2024', 'Best Multi-Talent Artist In Bhubaneswar 2024, Best Multi-Talent Artist In Bhubaneswar, Best Multi-Talent Artist 2024', 'Best Multi-Talent Artist Actor Debasis Senapati was awarded the prestigious title of Best Multi-Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024. The grand awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India took place on March 10, 2024, in Jaipur.', 'Best Multi Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024', ' best multi talent artist in bhubaneswar Debasis Senapaty', 'best artist in Bhubaneswar 2024', 'Best multi talent artist debasis sepapaty\'s', 'Best Multi talent artist', 'Best Multi-Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/best-multi-talent-artist-in-bhubaneswar-2024', 'Best Multi-Talent Artist Actor Debasis Senapati was awarded the prestigious title of Best Multi-Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024. The grand awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India took place on March 10, 2024, in Jaipur.', 'assets/img/blog/1713434818.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In celebration of versatility and creativity, actor Debasis Senapati was awarded the prestigious title of <strong>Best Multi-Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024</strong>. The grand awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India took place on 10<sup>th</sup> March&nbsp;2024, in the picturesque city. Jaipur. The gracious presence of renowned Bollywood actress Bhagyashree added an extra touch of glamor and prestige to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713434867.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Recognizing artistic talent, Best multi-talented artist in Bhubaneswar 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Actor Debasis Senapathy&#39;s journey to becoming the epitome of multi-talent artistry and the <strong>Best Multi-Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024</strong> is a testament to his versatility, dedication, and passion for the art. Be it stage, screen or canvas, his talent knows no bounds, he enthralls the audience with his performances and creations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Celebrating the Best Multi-Talent Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024 moment</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>At the Super Hero Awards, actor Debasis Senapati was honored with the prestigious Best Multi-Talent Artist award, symbolizing his significant contribution to the world of arts and entertainment. The award was handed over by eminent actress Bhagyashree, adding a layer of prestige to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>An awards night to remember the best multi-talented artiste in Bhubaneswar 2024 Babes Senapati</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The awards ceremony, carefully organized by Forever Star India, was a celebration of talent, creativity, and inspiration. Actor Debasis Senapati being recognized as the Best Multi-Talented Artist in Bhubaneswar 2024 highlights his exceptional skills and his positive impact on the artistic community.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Congratulations to actor Debasis Senapati Best multi-talented artiste in Bhubaneswar 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>As we heartily congratulate actor Debasis Senapati, we also applaud Forever Star India for its dedication to recognizing and celebrating talent in the arts. Here the continued success of actor Debasis Senapati and his positive impact on the world of entertainment will undoubtedly continue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned for more updates on actor Debasis Senapathy&#39;s journey and the ever-evolving landscape of artistic expression.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-18 : 01:04:54'),
(495, 25, 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024 | Acure Pharma', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713941090.png', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat', '', '', '', '', 'best-iron-supplement-in-gujarat', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024 | Acure Pharma', 'best iron supplement in gujarat 2024, best iron supplement in gujarat award, best iron supplement, best iron supplement manufacturer in gujarat, best iron supplement supplier in gujarat 2022', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024 - Acure Pharma was awarded at Prestigious Award Ceremony of Super Hero Awards 2024 organized by Forever Star India.', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024 | Acure Pharma', 'https://newsforever.in/best-iron-supplement-in-gujarat', 'Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024 - Acure Pharma was awarded at Prestigious Award Ceremony of Super Hero Awards 2024 organized by Forever Star India.', 'assets/img/blog/1713443315.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><strong>BEST IRON SUPPLEMENT IN GUJARAT 2024</strong></u></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Acure Pharma was awarded the prestigious title of Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024. The grand awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India took place on March 10, 2024. Vibrant city of Jaipur. The gracious presence of renowned Bollywood actress Bhagyashree added an extra touch of glamor and prestige to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1713443339.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Recognizing Health Innovation&#39;s Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Acure Pharma is dedicated to producing the best iron supplements with the best quality in Gujarat. Has made a significant impact on the health and wellness scenario in Gujarat. His commitment to excellence and innovation has earned him widespread praise and admiration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Acure Pharma was awarded the prestigious Best Iron Supplement in Gujarat 2024 at the Super Hero Awards, symbolizing their significant contribution to the healthcare industry. The award was handed over by renowned actress Bhagyashree, adding a layer of prestige to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>How Acure Pharma became Leader in&nbsp;Iron Supplement Supplier in Gujarat?</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Acure Pharma&#39;s journey to becoming the leading iron supplement supplier in Gujarat can be attributed to several key factors:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quality Products</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Innovative Solutions</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Strategic Partnerships</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Marketing and Awareness Campaigns</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Customer Feedback and Improvement</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Compliance and Certification</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Community Engagement</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Technological Advancements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">By focusing on these areas, Acure Pharma managed to position itself as the leader in iron supplement supply in Gujarat, earning the trust and loyalty of both healthcare professionals and consumers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Unforgettable Awards Night of Forever Star India</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The awards ceremony, carefully organized by Forever Star India, was a celebration of innovation, dedication, and empowerment. Bollywood Actress Bhagysahree has joined the awards night and make the night unforgattable.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Stay tuned for more updates on Acure Pharma&rsquo;s journey and the ever-evolving landscape of healthcare innovation.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-18 : 03:04:32'),
(496, 25, 'Super Hero Award 2024: Honoring Real-Life Heroes', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39', 'assets/img/blog/1713443372.png', 'Super Hero Award 2024', '', '', '', '', 'super-hero-award-2024', 'Super Hero Award 2024: Honoring Real-Life Heroes', 'super hero award 2024, real-life heroes, honoring heroes, award ceremony, heroes recognition, heroism award, community heroes, hero nominees, heroism recognition, heroism celebration, heroism tribute, heroism honor', 'Celebrate real-life heroes at the Super Hero Award 2024. Join us as we honor those who have shown exceptional courage and kindness in their communities.', 'Super Hero Award 2024', 'Super Hero Award 2024', 'Super Hero Award 2024', 'Super Hero Award 2024', 'Super Hero Award 2024', 'Super Hero Award 2024', ' https://newsforever.in/super-hero-award-2024', 'Celebrate real-life heroes at the Super Hero Award 2024. Join us as we honor those who have shown exceptional courage and kindness in their communities.', 'assets/img/blog/1713443624.png', '<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"color:#943634\">Super Hero Award Ceremony to be held in August</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"color:#943634\">Celebrating Courage and Heroism</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>A Virtual Celebration of Real-Life Heroes</u></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Forever Star India is thrilled to announce the upcoming Super Hero Award 2024, set to take place in August via an online ceremony. This prestigious event celebrates the remarkable achievements and contributions of real-life heroes who have demonstrated extraordinary courage, resilience, and dedication in their respective fields.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Forever Star India is honoring individuals who have exhibited exceptional bravery, courage, and kindness in their communities. This year, the award ceremony will be held online in August, allowing people from around the world to participate and celebrate these real-life heroes.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Recognizing Unsung Heroes</u></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">There are 70+ Categories to apply for i.e. Astrologer, Beautician, Businessman, Digital Marketer, Entrepreneur, Fashion Designer, Fitness Coach, Doctor, Influencer, Journalist, Life Coach, Makeup Artist, Principal, Sports, Teacher, Writer, Yoga Trainer and many more. In our previous seasons we have the Celebrity Guests in our house the Beautiful Malaika Arora, and Forever Beauty of Bollywood Bhagyashree.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Honoring Exceptional Contributions</u></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The Super Hero Award recognizes ordinary individuals who have done extraordinary deeds. Whether it&#39;s saving a life, standing up against injustice, or making a positive impact in their community, these heroes inspire us all to be better and do more.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">One of the highlights of the <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\">Super Hero Award 2024</a></strong> is the recognition of unsung heroes who often go unnoticed but make a significant difference in the lives of others. Forever Star India aims to shine a spotlight on these individuals and their remarkable stories.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">The online ceremony will feature inspiring stories, guest speakers, and special performances to honor the award recipients. It will be a celebration of courage, kindness, and the indomitable spirit of humanity.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Join Us in Celebrating Heroes</u></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">We invite you to join us in celebrating these real-life heroes at the Super Hero Award 2024. Stay tuned for more updates on the event, including the announcement of award categories, nominees, and special guests.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Nominations for the Super Hero Award 2024 are now open, and the public is encouraged to nominate individuals they believe deserve to be recognized for their extraordinary acts. Whether it&#39;s a neighbor, a friend, or a stranger who has touched your heart, this is your chance to honor them and share their story with the world.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Nominate a Super Hero for Award</u></strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Do you know someone who deserves to be recognized as a superhero? Nominate them for the <strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\">Super Hero Award 2024</a></strong> and give them the recognition they truly deserve. Together, let&#39;s celebrate the heroes among us and inspire others to follow in their footsteps.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Connect with Us on: +91-9358538999, +91-9772018999</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-18 : 03:04:11'),
(497, 25, 'Dr. Tej Parkash wins Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali Award 2024', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41,47', 'assets/img/blog/1713608030.png', 'Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali', '', '', '', '', 'best-homeopathy-doctor-in-mohali', 'Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali', 'best homeopathy doctor in mohali, dr tej parkash best homeopathy doctor in mohali, homeopathy doctor in mohali', 'Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali - Dr. Tej Parkash was honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award as the Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali for the year 2024.', 'Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali', 'Dr. Tej Parkash Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali', 'Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali', 'Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali 2024', 'Dr. Tej Parkash Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali 2024', 'Dr. Tej Parkash Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali', 'https://newsforever.in/best-homeopathy-doctor-in-mohali', 'Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali - Dr. Tej Parkash was honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award as the Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali for the year 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1713608437.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In a heartfelt celebration of healing and dedication, Dr. Tej Parkash was honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award as the Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali for the year 2024. The grand awards ceremony was organized by Forever Star India on 10th March 2024 in the charming city of Jaipur. Adding an extra layer of honor to the event, the award was presented by none other than respected Bollywood actress Bhagyashree and Colonel Pratap Singh.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Dr. Tej Prakash, Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali, Recognizing the Excellence of Treatment</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dr. Tej Parkash&#39;s unwavering commitment to holistic treatment and patient care has made a deep impact on the community in Mohali. His dedication to the principles of homeopathy and his compassionate approach to treatment have earned him widespread respect and admiration.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Celebrating Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali Moment</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">At the awards ceremony, Dr. Tej Prakash was honored with the prestigious Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali Award, symbolizing his significant contribution to the field of alternative medicine. The award was handed over by the guest of honor Bhagyashree and Colonel Pratap Singh, adding a layer of prestige to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali A Night to Remember</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">organized by Forever Star India, the event was a celebration of healing, dedication, and empowerment. The recognition of Dr. Tej Prakash as the Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali 2024 highlights his exceptional skills and the positive impact he has on the health and well-being of his patients.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><strong style=\"font-size:16px\">Congratulations Dr. Tej Parkash</strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>&nbsp;Best Homeopathy Doctor in Mohali</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As we extend our heartfelt congratulations to Dr. Tej Parkash, we also commend Forever Star India for its dedication to recognizing and celebrating talent in the field of medicine. This will undoubtedly continue the continued success of Dr. Tej Parkash and his positive impact in the field of healthcare.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Stay tuned for more updates on Dr. Tej Prakash&#39;s journey and the transformative power of homeopathy in treatment and wellness.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-20 : 01:04:56'),
(498, 25, 'Kunal wins Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024 Award', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1713782730.png', 'Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-pharma-company-in-nashik-2024', 'Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024', 'best pharma company in nashik, pharma company, nashik, kunal runwal', 'Mr Kunal was awarded for Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024 by Super Hero Award- In testimony to innovation and dedication, Kunal Runwal was awarded the prestigious Super Hero Award as the Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024.', 'Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024', 'Pharma Company in Nashik', 'Best Pharma Company in Nashik', 'Kunal Runwal\'s Achievement in Pharma Industry', 'Best Pharma Company in Nashik', 'Mr Kunal was awarded for Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024 by Super Hero Award', 'https://newsforever.in/best-pharma-company-in-nashik-2024', 'Mr Kunal was awarded for Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024 by Super Hero Award- In testimony to innovation and dedication, Kunal Runwal was awarded the prestigious Super Hero Award as the Best Pharma Company in Nashik 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1713783052.png', '<p>In testimony to innovation and dedication, Kunal Runwal was awarded the prestigious Super Hero Award as the Best Pharma Company in Nashik for the year 2024. The grand awards ceremony carefully organized by Forever Star India took place on March 10, 2024. In the vibrant city of Jaipur. Adding an additional layer of honor to the event, the award was presented by respected Bollywood actress Bhagyashree.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>Celebrating Pharmaceutical Innovation in Nashik</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kunal Runwal&#39;s leadership and vision have placed his company at the forefront of the pharmaceutical industry in Nashik. His commitment to quality, research, and development has earned his company widespread recognition and praise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>Celebrating Best Pharma Company Award Moment</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>At the awards ceremony, Kunal Runwal received the prestigious award of &ldquo;Best Pharma Company&rdquo;, symbolizing his company&#39;s significant contribution to the healthcare sector. The award was handed over by the guest of honor Bhagyashree and Colonel Pratap Singh, adding layer of prestige to the event.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>An Award Night to Remember</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Organized by Forever Star India, the event was a celebration of innovation, excellence, and empowerment. Kunal Runwal&#39;s recognition as the &ldquo;Best Pharma Company&rdquo; in Nashik for 2024 highlights his company&#39;s extraordinary achievements and positive impact on the community.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>Congratulations to Kunal Runwal!</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>As we heartily congratulate Kunal Runwal, we also commend Forever Star India for its dedication to recognizing and celebrating excellence in the pharmaceutical industry. This is a result of Kunal Runwal&#39;s continued success and continued innovation and advancement of healthcare in Nashik.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned for more updates on Kunal Runwal&#39;s company and the ever-evolving landscape of pharmaceuticals.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-22 : 01:04:56'),
(499, 25, 'Prabhat Desai wins Best Astrologer in Sangli', 23, 36, 1, '27,28,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1714127246.png', 'Best Astrologer in Sangli', '', '', '', '', 'best-astrologer-in-sangli', 'Prabhat Desai wins Best Astrologer Award in Sangli', 'best astrologer in sangli, prabhat desai best astrologer, best astrologer in sangli 2024, prabhat desai best astrologer in sangli 2024', 'Prabhat Desai won the Super Hero Award as the Best Astrologer in Sangli in 2024. The grand awards ceremony was organized by Forever Star India in the city of Jaipur on March 10, 2024.', 'Best Astrologer in Sangli', 'Prabhat Desai Best Astrologer in Sangli', 'Prabhat Desai Best Astrologer 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Sangli Prabhat Desai', 'Best Astrologer in Sangli 2024', 'Best Astrologer in Sangli', 'https://newsforever.in/best-astrologer-in-sangli', 'Prabhat Desai won the Super Hero Award as the Best Astrologer in Sangli in 2024. The grand awards ceremony was organized by Forever Star India in the city of Jaipur on March 10, 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1714127848.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Prabhat Desai was awarded the prestigious Super Hero Award as the <strong>Best Astrologer in Sangli</strong> for the year 2024. The grand awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India took place on March 10, 2024, in the culturally vibrant city of Jaipur. Adding an extra layer of prestige to the event, the award was presented by renowned Bollywood actress Bhagyashree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Prabhat Desai&#39;s deep knowledge of astrology and his intuitive understanding of cosmic forces have made him a trusted guide to many people in Sangli. His accurate predictions and compassionate guidance have earned him widespread respect and admiration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1714128202.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>It is a proud moment for Prabhat Desai to receive the divine honor of Best Astrologer&nbsp;in Sangli</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">At the center of the awards ceremony, Prabhat Desai was honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award, symbolizing his significant contribution to the field of astrology. The award was graciously handed over by the guest of honor Bhagyashree, adding an extra touch of grandeur to the occasion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Celebrating the moment of the Best Astrologer in Sangli 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Carefully organized by Forever Star India, the event serves as a celebration of cosmic wisdom, intuition, and recognition. Prabhat Desai&#39;s acceptance as the <strong>Best Astrologer in Sangli for 2024</strong> highlights his extraordinary expertise and positive impact on the lives of many people.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Congratulations to the Best Astrologer In Sangli Prabhat Desai!</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As we heartily congratulate Prabhat Desai, we also commend Forever Star India for its commitment to honoring excellence in astrology. This is a testament to Prabhat Desai&#39;s continued success and his unwavering dedication to guiding others on their divine journeys.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Stay tuned for more updates on Prabhat Desai&#39;s cosmic journey and the transformative power of astrology.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-26 : 01:04:33'),
(500, 25, 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1714214917.png', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', '', '', '', '', 'how-to-apply-for-the-national-award-2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'national award 2024, indian national awards 2024, award show 2024, award ceremony in 2024, national level award ceremony in 2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024 - Forever Star India is inviting Nominations for Super Hero Award 2024, Super Woman Award 2024, and Business Award 2024, to be organized in August 2024.', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/how-to-apply-for-the-national-award-2024', 'How to Apply for the National Award 2024 - Forever Star India is inviting Nominations for Super Hero Award 2024, Super Woman Award 2024, and Business Award 2024, to be organized in August 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1714215182.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#16a085\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><q>Forever Star India&#39;s National Award Ceremony in August, 2024</q></span></span></strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#16a085\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><q>Nominations are Invited in 70+ Categories</q></span></span></strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">The National Award 2024 is a prestigious recognition that honors individuals who have made significant contributions to their field. Whether you are an artist, scientist, educator, or social worker, the National Award celebrates excellence and innovation in various fields. If you aspire to receive this esteemed award in 2024, here&#39;s a comprehensive guide on how to apply:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 1: Eligibility Criteria</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Before you begin the application process, ensure that you meet the eligibility criteria set forth by the National Award committee. The criteria may vary depending on the category of the award, so be sure to carefully review the guidelines provided.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 2: Choose the Right Category</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">The National Award encompasses various categories, including but not limited to arts, science, literature, education, and social work. Determine the category that best aligns with your achievements and expertise.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 3: Gather Your Documentation</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Prepare a comprehensive portfolio that highlights your achievements, contributions, and impact in your field. This may include:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Resume/CV: Provide a detailed overview of your professional background, qualifications, and accomplishments.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Work Samples: Include samples of your work, such as publications, research papers, artworks, or project reports.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Letters of Recommendation: Obtain letters of recommendation from peers, mentors, or industry experts who can attest to your contributions and achievements.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Supporting Documents: Include any additional documents that support your application, such as awards, certificates, or media coverage.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 4: Complete the Application Form</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Visit the official website of the National Award to access the application form. Fill out the form accurately and completely, providing all the required information and documentation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 5: Submit Your Application</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Once you have completed the application form and gathered all the necessary documentation, submit your application as per the instructions provided. Ensure that you meet the deadline for submissions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 6: Await the Decision</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">After submitting your application, the National Award committee will review your submission and evaluate your candidacy. The selection process may involve a thorough assessment of your portfolio and an interview.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>Step 7: Receive the Award</u></strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">If your application is successful, you will be notified by the National Award committee and invited to receive the award at a prestigious ceremony. The award not only recognizes your achievements but also serves as a testament to your dedication and excellence in your field.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Registration Links are Below</span></u></strong></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2024</strong></span></a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Super Hero Award 2024</span></a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Business Award 2024</span></a></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">In conclusion, applying for the National Award is a significant milestone in your career journey. By following these steps and showcasing your achievements, you can increase your chances of receiving this esteemed recognition in 2024. Good luck!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">For Any Query Connect with our Support Team: +91-9772018999</span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-04-27 : 02:04:03'),
(501, 25, 'Sanjay Ratudiya wins Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,38,39,41', 'assets/img/blog/1714984399.png', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh', '', '', '', '', 'best-social-worker-in-chittorgarh', 'Sanjay Ratudiya wins Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award', 'best social worker in chittorgarh award, best social worker in chittorgarh 2024, sanjay rathudiya, social worker sanjay rathudiya, best social worker in chittorgarh 2024 award', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh (Sanjay Ratudiya) - At Super Hero Award Ceremony Sanjay Ratudiya has been awarded with Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award 2024.', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award', 'Sanjay Ratudiya Recognized as Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh', 'Award Ceremony of Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh 2024', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh', 'https://newsforever.in/best-social-worker-in-chittorgarh', 'Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh (Sanjay Ratudiya) - At Super Hero Award Ceremony Sanjay Ratudiya has been awarded with Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1714986590.png', '<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Sanjay Ratudiya Received Best Social Worker in Chittorgarh Award</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Sanjay Raturia has been honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award for his outstanding contribution as the best social worker in Chittorgarh, Rajasthan in 2024. The prestigious award ceremony organized by Forever Star India took place. On 10 March 2024 in the historical city of Jaipur. Adding to the event&#39;s grandeur, renowned Bollywood actress Bhagyashree graced the occasion as the celebrity guest.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1714986225.png\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>A Ray of Hope and Compassion (Sanjay Rathudiya)</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Sanjay Ratudiya&#39;s unwavering commitment to serving the community has impacted the lives of countless people and inspired positive change. Through his tireless efforts and kind spirit, he has emerged as a beacon of hope for those in need, epitomizing selflessness and altruism.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Celebrating the Best Social Activist Award Moment</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">At the heart of the awards ceremony, Sanjay Ratudia was honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award, a testament to his exemplary service and remarkable impact on society. His dedication to the upliftment of the underprivileged and promoting community development has left an indelible mark in Chittorgarh and beyond.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>An Awards Night of Celebration and Gratitude</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The awards ceremony served as a platform to celebrate the remarkable achievements of individuals like Sanjay Ratudiya, whose dedication to social welfare has brought about a profound change in the lives of many. It was an evening filled with heartfelt appreciation and gratitude for those who have dedicated themselves to making the world a better place.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Congratulations to Social Worker Sanjay Ratudiya!</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As we heartily congratulate Sanjay Ratudiya, we also express our gratitude to Forever Star India for recognizing and honoring exemplary individuals like him. Here are Sanjay&#39;s constant efforts to spread kindness, compassion, and positive change in the community.</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-05-06 : 12:05:38'),
(502, 25, 'Uttam Bhansali wins Best Film Producer in Mumbai', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1715068822.png', 'Best Film Producer in Mumbai 2024', '', '', '', '', 'best-film-producer-in-mumbai-2024', 'Best Film Producer in Mumbai 2024', 'best film producer in mumbai, uttam bhansali wins best film producer in mumbai, best film producer in mumbai 2024', 'Best Filmmaker in Mumbai Uttam Bhansali has been honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award for his outstanding contribution as the Best Filmmaker in Mumbai, Maharashtra in 2024.', 'Uttam Bhansali Wins Best Film Producer', 'Best Film Producer in Mumbai, Maharashtra 2024', 'Uttam Bhansali Best Film Producer in 2024', 'Best Film Congratulations to Uttam Bhansali for becoming the best Producer in Mumbai in Mumbai', 'Uttam Bhansali Best Filmmaker in Mumbai', 'Best Film Producer in Mumbai 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/best-film-producer-in-mumbai-2024', 'Best Filmmaker in Mumbai Uttam Bhansali has been honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award for his outstanding contribution as the Best Filmmaker in Mumbai, Maharashtra in 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1715070249.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Uttam Bhansali receives the Best Filmmaker Superhero Award in Mumbai, Maharashtra 2024!</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Uttam Bhansali has been honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award for his outstanding contribution as the Best Film Producer in Mumbai, Maharashtra in 2024. The glittering awards ceremony, organized by Forever Star India was showcased on March 10, 2024, in the vibrant city of Jaipur with the esteemed presence of Bollywood actress Bhagyashree as the celebrity guest.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1715070327.png\" style=\"height:494px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Uttam Bhansali, a visionary in the world of cinema</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Uttam Bhansali&#39;s Best Film Producer&#39;s dedication, passion, and innovative spirit have taken him to the pinnacle of success in the film industry. His visionary approach to filmmaking has garnered critical acclaim and widespread appreciation, making him a true trailblazer in Mumbai&#39;s vibrant cinematic landscape.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>An Award Night to Remember</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The awards ceremony was a glittering event, which honored the extraordinary talent and achievements of individuals like Uttam Bhansali Best Film Producer, who shaped the future of Indian cinema. It was a night full of excitement, anticipation, and a celebration of creativity and artistry in filmmaking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Congratulations to Uttam Bhansali for becoming the best Producer in Mumbai</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>As we heartily congratulate Uttam Bhansali Best Film Producer, we also appreciate Forever Star India for recognizing and honoring excellence in the world of cinema. Herein lies Uttam&#39;s continued success and his contribution to the rich tapestry of Indian cinema.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned for more updates on Uttam Bhansali&#39;s cinematic journey and inspiring stories of future film greats!</p>\r\n', 1, '2024-05-06 : 11:05:07'),
(503, 25, 'Youngest Impactful Visionary For Social Change in Raichur - Siraj Ahmed Jafferi', 23, 36, 1, '27,29,30,31,34,35,38,39,40,41', 'assets/img/blog/1715163168.png', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary For Social Change in Raichur', '', '', '', '', 'youngest-impactful-visionary-for-social-change-in-raichur', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary For Social Change in Raichur - Siraj Ahmed Jafferi', 'youngest impactful visionary for social change in raichur, siraj ahmed jafferi, youngest impactful visionary for social change in raichur,  youngest impactful visionary for social change', 'Siraj Ahmed Jafferi has been honored with Youngest Impactful Visionary For Social Change in Raichur at prestigious Super Hero Award 2024.', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change in Raichur', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change in Raichur', 'Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change in Raichur 2024', 'https://newsforever.in/youngest-impactful-visionary-for-social-change-in-raichur', 'Siraj Ahmed Jafferi has been honored with Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change in Raichur at prestigious Super Hero Award 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1715164041.png', '<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Siraj Ahmed Jafferi</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>&nbsp;Receives Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change in Raichur 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Join us in applauding the remarkable achievements of Siraj Ahmed Jafferi, who has been honored with the prestigious Super Hero Award for being the Youngest Impactful Visionary For Social Change in Raichur, Karnataka in 2024! The awe-inspiring awards ceremony organized by Forever Star India was held on March 10, 2024, in the vibrant city of Jaipur with the presence of Bollywood actress Bhagyashree as the celebrity guest.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://fsia.in/business-awards.php\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/assets/img/imagelibrary/1715164095.png\" style=\"height:495px; width:825px\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Empowering Communities, Inspiring Change</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Siraj Ahmed Jafferi&#39;s dedication to Youngest Impactful Visionary For Social Change in Raichur has left an indelible mark on Raichur, Karnataka. As one of the region&#39;s youngest influential visionaries, she has led many initiatives aimed at addressing critical social issues, promoting inclusivity, and creating a brighter future for all.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Young Visionaries Making Waves in Raichur Rays of Hope and Inspiration BySiraj Ahmed Jafferi</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Super Hero Award recognizes Siraj Ahmed Jafferi&#39;s unwavering commitment to bringing about positive change in society and serving as a beacon of hope and inspiration for the coming generations. His tireless efforts and transformative vision have impacted countless lives and changed communities for the better.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Congratulations, Youthful Visionary Making Waves in Raichur Siraj Ahmed Jafferi!</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">As we celebrate the extraordinary achievements of Siraj Ahmed Jafferi, we also express our heartfelt gratitude to Forever Star India for providing a platform to honor real-life heroes like him. Here&#39;s to the continuing influence of Siraj Ahmed Jafferi and his continued pursuit of a better world for all!</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\"><strong>Stay Tuned for More Updates on Siraj Ahmed Jafferi&#39;s Inspiring Journey and the latest news on the Youngest Impactful Visionary for Social Change in Raichur</strong></span></h3>\r\n', 1, '2024-05-08 : 01:05:50');
