nt-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">सलाह</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">व्यापक</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">दर्शकों</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">के</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">लिए</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">उपलब्ध</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">है।</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">एस्ट्रो</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">राज</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">की</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">पिछली</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">भविष्यवाणियां</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">सटीक</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">साबित</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">होने</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">के</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">बाद</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">सभी</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">की</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">निगाहें</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">लोकसभा</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">चुनाव</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> 2024 </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">के</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">परिणामों</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">पर</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">होंगी</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">कि</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">क्या</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">उनका</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">नवीनतम</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">पूर्वानुमान</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">सही</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">साबित</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">होता</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">है।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-06-03 : 04:06:07'),
(508, 25, 'Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India, Launched the New Feature of FSIA Social Media', 21, 20, 2, '15,16,17,18,19,20,21,22,23,27,29,30,31', 'assets/img/blog/1720427184.png', 'Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India, Launched the New Feature of FSIA Social Media', '', '', '', '', 'rajesh-agarwal-ceo-founder-forever-star-india-explained-new-feature-of-fsia-social-media', 'Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India, Launched the New Feature of FSIA Social Media', 'fsia social media, fsia new feature, rajesh agarwal, seo rajesh agarwal, founder rajesh agarwal, fsia ceo and founder, fsia new feature announcement, forever star india, fsia, new social media feature fsia, fsia social media feature', 'Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India has announced New Social Media Feature of FSIA, Every Verified Member Now can share thoughts on FSIA Social Media.', 'New Social Media Feature of FSIA', 'Rajesh Agarwal CEO and Founder of Forever Star India', 'Rajesh Agarwal CEO of Forever Star India', 'Rajesh Agarwal Founder of Forever Star India', 'Rajesh Agarwal announced New Social Media Feature of FSIA', 'Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India, Launched the New Feature of FSIA Social Media', 'https://newsforever.in/rajesh-agarwal-ceo-founder-forever-star-india-explained-new-feature-of-fsia-social-media', 'Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India has announced \"New Social Media Feature of FSIA\", Every Verified Member Now can share thoughts on FSIA Social Media.', 'assets/img/blog/1720427240.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India Awards (FSIA), announced a new feature on the FSIA Social Media platform in a press conference today. This new feature has been introduced to improve social media engagement and user experience.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#7030a0\">Top Ranked FSIA Social ID on Google gives Verified Members a Global Identity, thereby taking their Personal and Professional Career to New Heights</span></span></strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Rajesh Agarwal told that Forever Star India is a social media platform of verified members, where members from different walks of life, regions, languages, cultures, fields of work, and experiences share a platform. With the help of this feature, users can post their awards, certificates, and recognitions directly on FSIA social media platform. This feature will be beneficial not only for FSIA members but also for their supporters and followers.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#7030a0\">Forever Star India has emerged as a Leading Platform in providing Top Google Rankings to its Verified Members</span></span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Agarwal said, &quot;Our goal has always been to provide our members with the best possible platform where they can showcase their achievements. With this new social media feature, we will be able to provide even more visibility and recognition to our members.&quot;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">He further said that &quot;Just like any user can create their ID on other social media platforms, only verified members can create their ID on Forever Star India. These verified members are those who are achievers, are reputed, and make excellent contributions in their field of work. These members can explain their identity on their Forever Star India social media ID, show their achievements to the world, and showcase their creative and videos.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#7030a0\">Forever Star India has become the First Platform to bring such Unique Social Media Concepts on its Website</span></span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Forever Star India has become a global brand, playing an important role in creating an identity for its community members on Google like social media. Forever Star India has been a pioneer in giving global recognition to its members. Community members rank top on Google with their titles, which gives them global exposure and also creates their distinct identity in the world&quot;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">On the launch of the new feature of FSIA, there was a lot of enthusiasm and praise among the members and supporters. Many members found this feature innovative and helpful and expressed hope to strengthen their professional network through it.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#7030a0\">Soon Forever Star India is going to bring many more New Features on its Website along with providing E-Commerce opportunity which will prove to be icing on the cake</span></span></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">Rajesh Agarwal also informed that many more new updates and improvements are being made on the FSIA social media platform which will be rolled out in the coming months. &ldquo;Our team is constantly working on new features and improvements to provide our users with a seamless and enriched experience,&rdquo; he said.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Forever Star India Awards, which recognises excellence and achievements in different sectors across the country every year, is now focusing on further strengthening its social media presence. The launch of this new feature is another step in the same direction.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2024-07-07 : 11:07:24');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(509, 25, 'ANNOUNCEMENT: Forever Miss/Mrs./Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', 21, 6, 2, '12,13,15,16,17,18,19,20,22,23,27,76', 'assets/img/blog/1720769685.png', 'Forever Miss Mrs Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', '', '', '', '', 'forever-miss-mrs-teen-india-2024-city-finale-in-august', 'ANNOUNCEMENT: Forever Miss/Mrs./Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', 'forever miss india 2024, forever mrs india 2024, forever miss teen india 2024, miss india 2024 announcement, mrs india 2024 announcement, miss teen india 2024 announcement, city finale announcement, miss india 2024 city finale, mrs india 2024 city finale,', 'Forever Star India\'s Miss India 2024, Mrs India 2024 and Miss Teen India 2024 city finale will be held in August 2024.', 'Forever Miss/Mrs./Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', 'Forever Miss India 2024 City Finale in August', 'Forever Mrs. India 2024 City Finale in August', 'Forever Miss Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', 'Forever Miss/Mrs./Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', 'Forever Miss Mrs Teen India 2024 City Finale in August', 'https://newsforever.in/forever-miss-mrs-teen-india-2024-city-finale-in-august', 'Forever Star India\'s Miss India 2024, Mrs India 2024 and Miss Teen India 2024 city finale will be held in August 2024.', 'assets/img/blog/1720769833.png', '<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">India&#39;s largest women empowerment platform &quot;Forever Star India&quot; has announced the city finale of the 4th season of Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India.</span></span></strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#0070c0\">City winners will be announced from 23 August to 25 August 2024</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#0070c0\">Winners will be selected from 200 Cities of India</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#0070c0\">Crowning Ceremony will be held in 200 Episodes</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">For the first time in India, a beauty contest will be broadcast in 200 episodes. Winners from 200 cities will be crowned &quot;City Winners&quot;. One episode of one city will be recorded and broadcast.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u>USP of Forever Star India&rsquo;s Beauty Pageant:</u></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n	<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u><strong>Celebrity Endorsements:</strong></u> Famous Bollywood personalities like Bhayashree and Malika Arora have participated so far and in the coming time, more big names will be made a part of this show.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n	<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u><strong>Extensive Training Programs:</strong></u> Forever Star India is a specially designed platform for all common people. Here the best experts of India prepare you with training, grooming, and etiquettes. So that you feel comfortable on the ramp and can perform your best.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n	<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u><strong>Diverse Age Categories:</strong></u> Forever Star India invites applications in the categories of Miss, Mrs. and Miss Teen India. This means that girls from 12 to 50 years of age who want to make a career in modeling and acting or want to fulfill their dreams can become a part of this beauty contest.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n	<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u><strong>High Visibility for Participants:</strong></u> FSIA ID of all City Winners, State Winners, and National Winners are given top rank on Google with their title keywords so that the winners get proper exposure. Also, videos of all the winners are uploaded on YouTube which gives special recognition to all the models</span></span></span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n	<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u><strong>Media Coverage:</strong></u> Forever Star India winners get the opportunity to gain global recognition. News of all winners is published by top media houses in multiple news websites and press media.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n	<h3><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u><strong>Community and Networking:</strong></u> Forever Star India works like a community. People from different professions and cities can communicate here and take their profession forward for growth.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Winners to Crown in Exclusive 200 Episodes:</span></u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Forever Star India is going to create history, for the first time in history; the crowning ceremony of 200 winners will be organized in 200 episodes. There will be an individual episode for each city winner, which will include their crowning, as well as winning speech, introduction, family celebration. This will be the first time when the crowning ceremony of a city winner will be promoted on such a large scale. A proper episode will be designed for each city winner. Then this specially designed episode will be given top rank on Google through YouTube and website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Celebrate Special Moment with Your Love Ones:</span></u></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Forever Star India will organize this grand ceremony in August 2024, where all the winners will be crowned online. The winner&rsquo;s trophy and merit certificate will be handed over to them by their close family members. Gather your family, dress up impressively and get ready to make memories that will last a lifetime as you are going to be a part of this incredible occasion.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><q><span style=\"color:#c00000\">The State and National level Crowning Ceremony is scheduled for December 2024, in which more than 200 city winners will participate and compete to become the winner at the next level.</span></q></span></strong></h4>\r\n', 1, '2024-07-11 : 10:07:44'),
(510, 25, 'Top Professional Award 2025 Honours Visionary Leaders Driving Innovation and Impact', 23, 41, 2, '29,30,31,76,84', 'assets/img/blog/1756360464.png', 'Top Professional Award 2025', '', '', '', '', 'top-professional-award-2025', 'Top Professional Award 2025 Honours Visionary Leaders Driving Innovation and Impact', 'award winners list, top professional award 2025, Indian achievers award, Forever Star India, super woman 2025, award winners list 2025, professional achievers 2025, infinity achiever 2025, forever achiever 2025, top professional award 2025 winners list, I', 'Forever Star India released the list of Top Professional Award 2025, announcing over 70 special achievers at the Super Woman Award 2025, Forever Achiever 2025 and Infinity Achiever 2025 Awards.', 'Top Professional Award 2025', 'Professional Award 2025 Winners', 'Award Winners List 2025', 'Achievers Award 2025', 'Prestigious Award List 2025', 'Top Professional Award 2025 Honours Visionary Leaders Driving Innovation and Impact', 'https://newsforever.in/top-professional-award-2025', 'Forever Star India released the list of Top Professional Award 2025, announcing over 70 special achievers at the Super Woman Award 2025, Forever Achiever 2025 and Infinity Achiever 2025 Awards.', 'assets/img/blog/1756360877.png', '<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><em>Forever Star India released the list of Top Professional Award 2025, announcing over 70 special achievers at the Super Woman Award 2025, Forever Achiever 2025 and Infinity Achiever 2025 Awards. The award show honoured professionals from diverse fields, including education, healthcare, social services and arts for their remarkable work.</em></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong> released the Top Professional Award 2025 list, announcing dedicated professional achievers within the categories of Super Woman 2025, Forever Achiever 2025, and Infinity Achiever 2025. The grand program honoured professionals from diverse fields, including education, healthcare, social services and art for their remarkable work. The Forever Star India awardees list 2025 included entrepreneurs, teachers, artists, healthcare and social workers who have made invaluable contributions in shaping the Indian society today. This award show gave national recognition to the Indian achievers. In the Forever Star India Award List 2025, Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata was honoured with the title of Forever Achiever, while Director Sushmitha Somireddy from Rajahmundry was honoured with the title of Infinity Achiever for her exceptional contribution in the Director category.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Top Professional Award 2025\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc7gWRKJLOzrbbkB7ZEo9_5zwL97T7XpBGQwHa58P6tq-4qL8z6K4s9SS9B_kZkjJXolXRYuMI63yJZYzWJlreJPypzyCQVWwjNtDtW7FoTikD4kJ1Q7LCnubnIzgU3KaorcLfTHw?key=e6EvIFO60KYup5NbRwGq8w\" style=\"height:351px; width:624px\" /></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">According to Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder, Forever Star India, the aim of this initiative of Forever Star India Awards was not only to honour the professionals for their achievements but also to provide long-term recognition through Google listing. Among the honoured names were Dr. S Prabha Wati (Sports, Port Blair), Swati Mallikarjun Tarde (Social Activist, Pune), Swetal Bhavin Patel (Healthcare, Ahmedabad), Nneha Rohit Soni (Healing and Counselling, Indore), Shikha Baid (Baker, Jaipur), Dr. Susan Bushi (Businesswoman, Khammam), Priyanka Singh Chauhan (Motivational Speaker, Gurugram), Karuna Mishra (Social Activist, New Delhi), Dr. Richa Satsangi (Life Coach, Noida), Anjali Damahe (Businesswoman, Saharsa), Dr. Kalyani Bade (Healthcare, Mumbai), Dr. Kettaki Kasbekar (Multi Talent, Pune), Badhya Lama (Teacher, East Sikkim), Dr. Sudeshna Maity (Dietitian, Kolkata), Swetha Vallabhajosyula (Trainer, Hyderabad), Krishna Kumari (Engineer, Vijayawada), Nikita Bhojwani (Academic Skills, Vadodara), Dr. Khushbu Pawan Sachdev (Entrepreneur, Indore), Preeti Sindhwani (Astrologer, Gurugram), Ritika (Digital Marketer, Ganganagar), Nikita Chandak (Fashion Stylist, Ahmedabad), Sayontoni Bhattacharya (Artist, Faridabad), Sunita Naudiyal (Social Activist, Delhi), Anamika (Advocate, Gurugram), Dr. Sudha U P V (Scientist, Kannur), Manpreet Kaur (Entrepreneur, Pune), Dr. Sarita Beniwal (Academic Skills, Jaipur), Mini M (Administration, Trichur), Dr. Lavina Jaswani (Psychologist, Jaipur), Julee Jasmin (Artist, Mumbai), Renu (Social Activist, Jaipur), Varsha Chawla (Multi Talent, Rohtak), Mita Banerjee (Advocate, Kolkata), Nandini Naidu (Businesswoman, Pune), Jyoshna Rani Behera (Art &amp; Culture, Koraput), U P V Yesoda (NGO, Kannur), Nafeesa Begum (Businesswoman, Hyderabad), Sangeeta Laskar (Dietitian, Amritsar), Vruushali Mirajjgaonkar (Entrepreneur, Pune), Kiran Goswami (Influencer, Chittorgarh), Dr. Marisha Ani Das (Professor, Chennai), Azra (Lawyer, Chennai), Enakshmi Nandi (Professor, Nadia), Bobita Chasha (Entrepreneur, Dibrugarh), Ms Shalini H Moon (Nurse, Wardha), Sonu Rathore (Entrepreneur, Gautam Buddha Nagar), J Packia Selvi (Academic Skills, Chennai), Yamini Sharma (Astrologer, Dehradun), Durga Mundhra (Entrepreneur, Jaipur), Sapna Nagar Bharadwaj (Academic Skills, Indore), Shikha (Life Coach, New Delhi), Kavitha Joseph (Director, Bengaluru), Dr. Herina Patel (Doctor, Surat), Mosam Parekh (Art &amp; Culture, Bharuch), Rachana Vashistha (Human Resources, New Delhi), Dr. Deepa Rani Shekar (Reiki Healing, Bengaluru), Monika Jain (Social Activist, Mount Abu), Malini Bhattacharya (Doctor, Kolkata), Seeshadri Singh (Sports, Jaipur), Rajni Kr Srivastava (Social Activist, Faridabad), Aastha Mathur (Spiritual Healing, Jaipur), Dr. Ranjana Jha (Businesswoman, Pune), Saumya Pandey (Life Coach, Bengaluru), Ghazala Atif Maste (Social Activist, Mumbai), Ananya Dasgupta (Social Activist, Gurugram), Sumitra Gurey (Social Activist, Kolkata), Manisha Shah (Interior Designer, Kolkata), Dr. Nehalben Vitthal Bhai Gajera (Healthcare, Gandhinagar), Rashmi Swarnakar (Artist, Raipur), and Seema Gudadhe (Yoga Trainer, Mumbai). These Indian Professionals Award 2025 winners received global recognition based on their profiles, which rank at the top on Google.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards</strong> were held in line with the tagline, &ldquo;<strong>पहचान के साथ सम्मान</strong>&rdquo; and honoured Indian achievers. The list of more than 70 proud Top Professional Award 2025 winners reflects Forever Star India&#39;s vision. The awards ceremony is not just an honour in the form of trophies and titles, but a symbol of long-term credibility, as it is a platform to recognise the awardees at the national level. Following its powerful tagline, &ldquo;पहचान के साथ सम्मान&rdquo;, the event served as a strong source of inspiration to professionals recognised under the Indian Achievers Award by Forever Star India. Announcing the proud winners&#39; list reflects the vision of Forever Star India, as the awards ceremony goes beyond trophies and titles and carries forward the legacy of setting Forever Star India for long-term professional credibility and even national-level recognition.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-08-27 : 09:08:12'),
(512, 25, 'Over 5,000 Aspiring Models Will Try Their Luck in the Fashion Industry', 21, 20, 2, '8,9,11,12,13,18,21,22,26,27', 'assets/img/blog/1756555909.png', 'Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry', '', '', '', '', 'aspiring-models-fashion-industry', 'Over 5,000 Aspiring Models Will Try Their Luck in the Fashion Industry', 'Unique ID, Makeup Artist, Fashion Designer, Professional Training, Personal Mentorship, Forever Miss Universe 2025, Professional Models, Forever Star India, Founder, CEO Rajesh Agarwal, aspiring models in fashion industry', 'More than 5000 Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry from 139 countries across the world cleared the auditions and reserved their place for the finale.', 'Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry', 'Aspiring Models in the Beauty Pageant Industry', 'Professional Models', 'Forever Miss Universe 2025', 'Models in the Fashion Industry from cities, states, and countries', 'Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry', 'https://newsforever.in/aspiring-models-fashion-industry', 'More than 5000 Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry from 139 countries across the world cleared the auditions and reserved their place for the finale.', 'assets/img/blog/1756555925.png', '<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><em>5000 Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry from 139 countries across the world cleared the auditions and reserved their place for the finale.</em></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">For the first time in the country, Forever Star India is going to organize a grand event of Forever Miss Universe-2025 in December at Zee Studio, located in Sitapura, Jaipur. In the show, each participant will be given a unique ID along with global recognition. Renowned fashion designers and makeup artists from India will showcase their skills and collections. More than 5000 Aspiring Models in the Fashion Industry from cities, states, and countries will participate in this event, out of which only the best 250 models will be able to compete for the final round. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Forever Star India&#39;s Founder and CEO, Rajesh Agarwal, and Director, Jaya Chauhan, will give personal mentorship to each participant. They will hone their talent by giving them grooming tips and professional training. They will be trained to become the best professional models at the international level. This is a golden opportunity for those associated with the fashion industry or those who want to join it, which will prove to be a milestone in their professional career. The finalists will be crowned as the top winners of &#39;Forever Miss Universe 2025&#39; by Forever Star India and will be given the title, tag, memento, sash, bouquet, and&nbsp;future&nbsp;career opportunities within the fashion industry. The registration and auditions process has started. Interested participants can try their luck in the field of fashion industry by registering themselves and their loved ones on Forever Star India&#39;s website www.fsia.in.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-08-29 : 02:08:13'),
(513, 25, 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale Organised in 70 Plus Cities, Delivering Glamour, Empowerment, and Visibility Nationwide', 21, 6, 2, '8,9,13,19,20,22,23,76', 'assets/img/blog/1756556574.png', 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale', '', '', '', '', 'miss-india-2025-city-finale', 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale Organised in 70 Plus Cities, Delivering Glamour, Empowerment, and Visibility Nationwide', 'Forever Miss India 2025, Miss India City Finale 2025, Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale, Beauty and talent competition India, Miss India contest 2025, India’s biggest beauty pageant, Miss India career opportunities, Forever Star India, CEO and Founder R', 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale has been recognized for its landmark celebration, as it organizes engaging contests of talent, beauty, and empowerment across various cities in India.', 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale', 'Beauty and talent competition India', 'India’s Biggest Beauty Pageant', 'Miss India Career Opportunities', 'Miss India contest 2025', 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale Organised in 70 Plus Cities, Delivering Glamour, Empowerment, and Visibility Nationwide', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-india-2025-city-finale', 'Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale has been recognized for its landmark celebration, as it organizes engaging contests of talent, beauty, and empowerment across various cities in India.', 'assets/img/blog/1756556805.png', '<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><em>Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale has been recognised for its landmark celebration, as it organizes engaging contests of talent, beauty, and empowerment across various cities in India. In one of its grand events, which was organised and administered by Forever Star India, winners from over 70 cities were honoured as Forever Miss India 2025.&nbsp;</em></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Indian beauty pageant industry witnessed a transformative shift as Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale was organised by Forever Star India in various cities. This contest was different from traditional beauty contests as the initiative was designed not only to celebrate charm but also to empower participants with respect, recognition, and long-term visibility. The Forever Miss India contest 2025 received thousands of applicants representing diverse backgrounds and in multiple categories. Furthermore, following strict selection rounds, the winners were announced not only based on their beauty and style but also for their confidence, determination, and ability to inspire.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Under the visionary leadership of Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India, and the strategic direction of Director Jaya Chauhan, the event was a great success, creating numerous career opportunities for Miss India industry events. The event followed the vision of Forever Star India, &ldquo;पहचान के साथ सम्मान&rdquo;. The city finale winners were given a platform to highlight their journey, achievements, and individuality. The differentiating segment for Forever Star India, making it India&rsquo;s biggest beauty pageant, was that, along with honour, the winners within the category were promoted by developing their Google profiles. The profiles developed provided wide opportunities to build networks throughout the field of beauty pageants and the fashion industry.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://newsforever.in/./assets/img/blog/Banner_2.jpg\" style=\"height:370px; width:550px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Forever Miss India City Finale 2025 proudly celebrated its city winners across India, with Archana Prasad (Malappuram - Winner), Priyanshi Raj Singh (Udham Singh Nagar - Winner), Sutariya Nivedi Jitendrabhai (Mahesana - Winner), Supriya Laha (Birbhum - Winner), Sumona Ghosh (Thane - Winner), Rashmi Arya (Moradabad - Winner), Krishna Kumari (Vijayawada - Winner), Nikita Khataniar (Guwahati - Winner), Dipanwita Chatterjee (Howrah - Winner), Sowmya Kotha (Hyderabad - 2nd Runner Up), Ayushi Dhengula (Hyderabad - Winner), Divyanshi Rawat (Lucknow - Winner), Dhwani (Mumbai - 2nd Runner Up), Swarnlata (New Delhi - Winner), Bhavya Chaurasia (Chhatarpur - Winner), Serene Gajbhiye (Bhopal - Winner), Akshaya (Nandyal - Winner), Diksha (Bahadurgarh - Winner), Pallavi Kumari (Monghyr - Winner), Gayathri (Sangrur - Winner), Anushka Singh (Satna - Winner), Anshika Gupta (Kanpur Nagar - Winner), Gamana Sathwika (Tirupati - Winner), Isha Rani (Lohardaga - Winner), Aishwarya Bhattacharya (Kolkata - Winner), Santoshi Kumari (Nalanda - Winner), Saptaparni Chatterjee (Howrah - 1st Runner Up), Barkha Choudhary (Jabalpur - 1st Runner Up), Shineka Manivannan (Erode - Winner), Kariisma (Nellore - Winner), and Kavya Mudgal (West Delhi - Winner) shining as outstanding representatives of their cities.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">It can be said that Forever Miss India 2025 City Finale proved to be a promising platform that goes beyond pageantry, embracing the spirit of empowerment, diversity, and national recognition. Having over 70 cities involved, the program has increased local pride, helped young women to dream bigger, and given them the strength to step into the world of glamour and success. With the winners now set to advance to the national level, the event remains a ray of hope, rendering Forever Miss India one of the most influential beauty and talent platforms in the nation.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-08-30 : 03:08:20'),
(514, 25, 'Nivedita Rajawat Crowned as the Best Fashion Model from the City of Jodhpur', 21, 6, 2, '8,11,12,16,19,20,76', 'assets/img/blog/1756558887.png', 'Best Fashion Model of Jodhpur', '', '', '', '', 'best-fashion-model-jodhpur', 'Nivedita Rajawat Crowned as the Best Fashion Model from the City of Jodhpur', 'Best Fashion Model, Nivedita Rajawat, Jodhpur achievers, women empowerment, beauty pageant winners 2025, Indian women leaders, inspiring mothers, fitness and education, Jodhpur news', 'Nivedita Rajawat, Best Fashion Model of Jodhpur, shines as an inspiring achiever in education, fitness & motherhood, supported by FSIA leaders.', 'Best Fashion Model of Jodhpur', 'Beauty Pageant Winners 2025', '', 'Indian Women Leaders', 'Jodhpur achievers', 'Nivedita Rajawat Crowned as the Best Fashion Model from the City of Jodhpur', 'https://newsforever.in/best-fashion-model-jodhpur', 'Nivedita Rajawat, Best Fashion Model of Jodhpur, shines as an inspiring achiever in education, fitness & motherhood, supported by FSIA leaders.', 'assets/img/blog/1756558905.png', '<p><em><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Nivedita Rajawat has proudly brought immense pride to her city by being crowned as the best fashion model of Jodhpur (G-1). It is a personal success as well as one of dedication, balance, and endurance. Her academic experiences, lively personality, and encouraging life story have positioned Nivedita as a role model for empowered women who can excellently juggle family, career, and personal dreams.</span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The genius work of the visionary leader Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder of Forever Star India, and master mind who worked behind the scenes, Jaya Chauhan, Director of this&nbsp;platform, has been a vital contributor to making the event successful. With this win, Nivedita Rajawat has not only added a jewel to Jodhpur&rsquo;s crown but also established herself as a role model for women across India. Her journey from the classroom to the national stage is a story of inspiration, resilience, and empowerment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Nivedita is a postgraduate in Chemistry; she has always been a believer in the strength of education, and she continues to influence young minds as a teaching aspirant. Her professional life is characterized by her focus on education, inspiring, and encouraging others, in particular, women, to accept the essence of self-development. Together with her academic plan, she has also been a great deal enthusiastic in terms of fitness, dancing, and reading activities, which characterize her ideology in holistic living. Her way of living shows a good mixture of discipline, creativity as well and self-care. Motherhood has been the most characteristic highlight of Nivedita. The position has given her patience, determination, and kindness, and has made her a capable and caring woman. She has taken each of the duties most elegantly, showing that motherhood can be an almighty motivational force instead of a constraint. Her experience appeals to many women who struggle to make a life and career work balance as they follow their dreams.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-08-30 : 04:08:26'),
(515, 25, 'Jaipur Pink City Star Meenakshi Honored at Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', 21, 6, 2, '8,11,13,19,20,23,76', 'assets/img/blog/1756559296.png', 'Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', '', '', '', '', 'most-prestigious-beauty-pageant-event-jaipur', 'Jaipur Pink City Star Meenakshi Honored at Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', 'Jaipur Pink City Star Meenakshi Honored at Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', 'Jaipur Pink City Star Meenakshi Honored at Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', 'Jaipur Pink City Star Meenakshi ', 'National Competition for Married Women', 'Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', 'Inspire Married Women ', 'Best Fashion Model of Jaipur', 'Jaipur Pink City Star Meenakshi Honored at Most Prestigious Beauty Pageant Event', 'https://newsforever.in/most-prestigious-beauty-pageant-event-jaipur', 'Forever Star India crowned Meenakshi as the city winner from Jaipur, and has emerged as a huge platform for women\'s empowerment in India.', 'assets/img/blog/1756559325.png', '<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">An enthusiastic girl, Meenakshi, loves listening to songs since childhood, and for her career, she studied business administration and worked in the corporate world. Such fields have grown her into a hard-knock, diverse woman. Meenakshi emerged victorious as the city winner by representing her own city. Pink City girl Meenakshi is a dynamic personality who thrives on embracing challenges and transforming them into meaningful experiences. Participated in the beauty pageant event called &lsquo;City Winner&rsquo; organized by Forever Star India, which is associated with pan-India, and won the title Mrs. Jaipur 2025. This event is a city-level beauty pageant event organized by Forever Star India as part of their national competition for married women.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">In the words of CEO and Founder Rajesh Agarwal, Forever Star India is the only beauty pageant platform in the world that works as a community and has immense potential for future exposure. Additionally, the director of Forever Star India, Jaya Chouhan, added a few more points on becoming a winner with Forever Star India. Becoming the city winner is a significant milestone in Meenakshi&#39;s life and places her at the forefront of the fashion industry. She feels proud to represent her city and state on various platforms and to make a positive impact on society. This title is not just for the crown, but a reflection of her journey filled with passion, perseverance, and an inspiring pursuit of greatness. She is currently engaged in managing a home and raising her children. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Unfortunately, Meenakshi felt stuck during her journey, as managing both life and career responsibilities was a challenging aspect of her life. However, with crucial support from her father and husband, who assisted her in developing self-confidence. Furthermore, Forever Star India provided her the correct platform to bring back her confidence, and she started pursuing her dreams again.<br />\r\nIn her acceptance speech, Meenakshi emphasized her commitment to social work and highlighted her ongoing efforts to inspire married women to rediscover themselves and work towards their goals and to challenge conventional stereotypes related to beauty and age. Her dedication to these causes underscores her passion for creating a positive impact both within and beyond her professional realm. At last, Meenakshi would like to thank and show gratitude towards her father, husband, and to forever star India for the success.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-08-30 : 04:08:26'),
(516, 25, 'Miss Forever Universe (MFU) Set for Glamorous Grand Finale in December', 21, 20, 2, '8,11,12,35,61,76', 'assets/img/blog/1756902140.png', 'Miss Forever Universe Grand Finale December', '', '', '', '', 'miss-forever-universe-grand-finale-december', 'Miss Forever Universe (MFU) Set for Glamorous Grand Finale in December', 'Miss Forever Universe, Forever Miss Universe Grand Finale Jaipur, Global fashion and modeling competition, Beauty pageant registration, Founder and CEO, Mr. Rajesh Agarwal, Director Ms. Jaya Chauhan, Forever Star India', 'Miss Forever Universe (MFU) Grand Finale will dazzle Jaipur this December with global models, fashion designers, and beauty queens competing for the crown.', 'Miss Forever Universe Grand Finale December', 'Forever Miss Universe Grand Finale Jaipur', 'Global Fashion and Modeling Competition', 'Beauty pageant registration', ' Forever Star India', 'Miss Forever Universe (MFU) Set for Glamorous Grand Finale in December', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-forever-universe-grand-finale-december', 'Miss Forever Universe (MFU) Grand Finale will dazzle Jaipur this December with global models, fashion designers, and beauty queens competing for the crown.', 'assets/img/blog/1756902169.png', '<p><em><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Miss Forever Universe (MFU) Grand Finale will dazzle Jaipur this December with global models, fashion designers, and beauty queens competing for the crown.</span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The stage for Miss Forever Universe (MFU) is all set to host its grand finale in the Pink City, Jaipur, this December. The glamorous event, organised by Forever Star India, will take place at Zee Studio located in Sitapura, Jaipur. The event is in association with the Hotel Royal Orchid beauty pageant event in Jaipur, which is all set to witness the crowning of winners from renowned pageants, including Forever Miss India, Mrs. India, and Miss Teen India. The grand stage will bring together a constellation of talent from across the globe, with over 5,000 models participating. However, only 250 selected finalists will advance to the final round.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Forever Star India&rsquo;s Founder and CEO, Mr. Rajesh Agarwal, along with Director Ms. Jaya Chauhan, will provide personalized mentorship, grooming sessions, and professional training to the finalists, helping refine their talents ahead of the finale. Adding to the grandeur, internationally acclaimed fashion designers will showcase their exclusive collections while globally recognized makeup artists will display their expertise live at the venue. The entire event will be broadcast live across various social media platforms, offering global visibility to all participants. Following the winners of the global fashion and modeling competition, each winner will be awarded a unique global identity through a personalized ID, enhancing their recognition and reach within the fashion and beauty industry.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The crowned Forever Miss Universe 2025 will be presented with a title sash, crown, bouquet, memento, certificate of excellence, and several exciting gifts. The event, Forever Miss Universe Grand Finale Jaipur, will provide several networking opportunities to aspirants who dream of making a name in the world of fashion and beauty can register through the official website www.fsia.in and grab this golden opportunity to shine on a global platform. All interested candidates can apply for under Forever Beauty Pageant registration through the official website of Forever Star India only.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-09-03 : 02:09:39'),
(518, 25, 'For the First Time in India, Grand Finale of Miss Forever Universe 2025 to be Organised at ZEE Studio, Jaipur', 21, 29, 2, '1,8,10,11,12,13,14,19,76', 'assets/img/blog/1757327905.png', 'Grand Finale of Miss Universe 2025', '', '', '', '', 'grand-finale-miss-universe-2025-jaipur', 'First Time in India, Grand Finale of Miss Forever Universe 2025 to be Organised at ZEE Studio, Jaipur', 'grand finale of miss universe 2025, ZEE Studio Jaipur events, fashion and glamour show Jaipur, global fashion event Jaipur 2025, beauty pageant India 2025, Indian fashion industry events Forever Star India, Rajesh Agarwal, CEO and Founder, Jaya Chauhan Di', 'For the first time in India, Miss Forever Universe 2025 Grand Finale will be held at ZEE Studio, Jaipur, featuring top designers, global artists & 250 finalists.', 'Grand Finale of Miss Universe 2025', 'Fashion and Glamour Show Jaipur', 'Global Fashion Event Jaipur 2025', 'Beauty Pageant India 2025', 'Indian Fashion Industry Events', 'For the First Time in India, Grand Finale of Miss Forever Universe 2025 to be Organised at ZEE Studio, Jaipur', 'https://newsforever.in/grand-finale-miss-universe-2025-jaipur', 'For the first time in India, Miss Forever Universe 2025 Grand Finale will be held at ZEE Studio, Jaipur, featuring top designers, global artists & 250 finalists.', 'assets/img/blog/1757327947.png', '<p><em><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The Grand Finale of Miss Forever Universe 2025 is going to be held in Jaipur, the Pink City of India. The audience would experience the grand celebration of the crowning ceremonies of the winners. The ceremony will be hosted by the ZEE Studio Jaipur events, along with the collaboration of Forever Star India.&nbsp;</span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">The upcoming Miss Forever Universe 2025 Grand Finale in Jaipur is set to create history, offering participants a platform where beauty, talent, and empowerment converge. Registrations are now open on the official website www.fsia.in, giving aspiring contestants a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to represent themselves on a global stage. Hotel Royal Orchid, which is the official hospitality partner, will host numerous international fashion designers and highly acclaimed makeup artists who will present their collections and creativity on the stage. It is projected that over 5,000 models will be involved in the event, yet only 250 will get the chance to walk on the big finale stage. Every competitor will have their individual global ID and live social media coverage, which will provide them an international recognition and a career in the fashion industry.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Talking about the event, Rajesh Agarwal, Founder and CEO of Forever Star India, and Jaya Chauhan, Director of FSIA, emphasized that the pageant is created to help them acquire professional training, personal mentoring, and a world-class platform. The winners will not just win titles, crowns, certificates, and mementos but also be connected to a global fashion network, which will boost the fame of India as an international beauty pageant destination.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-09-08 : 01:09:50'),
(519, 25, 'Forever Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale: A Night of Celebrations', 21, 42, 1, '8,16,18,85', 'assets/img/blog/1762156469.png', 'Forever Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale', '', '', '', '', 'mrs-india-grand-finale-2025', 'Forever Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale: A Night of Celebrations', 'Forever Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale: A Night of Celebrations', 'Forever Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale: A Night of Celebrations', 'Forever Mrs India 2025 ', 'Mrs India beauty Pageant', 'Beauty Contest', 'Mrs India 2025', 'Fashion Shows', 'Forever Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale: A Night of Celebrations', 'https://newsforever.in/forever-mrs-india-grand-finale-2025', 'Forever Mrs. India 2025 Grand Finale by Forever Star India at Zee Studio, Jaipur, celebrated beauty, confidence, and courage in a dazzling night of empowerment and elegance.', 'assets/img/blog/1762156500.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Glamour, Grace, and Inspiration to Light Up Zee Studio, Jaipur</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The much-awaited Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale, organized by Forever Star India, is prepared to illuminate the stage at Zee Studio, Jaipur, this December with glamour, grace and notion. Married women from across the country. Will come together for this esteemed event, which ambitions to celebrate their confidence, accomplishments, and individuality in a night that promises to exemplify grace and empowerment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>A Celebration Beyond Beauty &ndash; Honoring Womanhood and Leadership</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The grand finale will be a real celebration of womanhood, tenacity, and leadership in preference to simply a beauty pageant. The Forever <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-mrs-india-new.php\"><strong>Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale</strong></a> is predicted to be a brilliant fusion of subculture and modernity as contestants from diverse states show their skills, intelligence, and cultural pride. Every moment will reflect the spirit of &ldquo;crowns, confidence and braveness&rdquo;, from lovely ethnic rounds to charming night gowns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>The Splendor of Zee Studio, Jaipur</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The fantastic set at Zee Studio, Jaipur will provide the best backdrop for the event&rsquo;s royal theme. The evening is anticipated to sparkle with celebrities, fashion icons and industry leaders who will gather to witness this grand party.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Training and Preparation Behind the Spotlight</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The finalists will be present to process extensive training, grooming, and personal improvement sessions organized Forever Star India, as they prepare to show off their poise, passion and reason on approaching Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Crowning Moments of Strength and Inspiration Await</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As the winners are crowned amid cheers and applause this December, their journeys will represent more than simple beauty - they may constitute strength, determination and the power to encourage. The event will also feature dazzling performances, heartfelt speeches and moments of pride destined to be remembered for years to come.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Forever Star India&rsquo;s Mission of Empowerment</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With its challenge to empower and recognize married women throughout the nation, Forever Star India continues its dedication to redefining beauty and success.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>A Legacy of Confidence and Elegance</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The upcoming Mrs India 2025 Grand Finale in December at Zee Studio, Jaipur is poised to stand as a shining example of elegance, empowerment and everlasting confidence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-11-02 : 09:11:06'),
(520, 25, 'Meera Shrivastav Honored with Super Woman Award 2025', 43, 44, 1, '30,31,84,87', 'assets/img/blog/1762168853.png', 'Meera Shrivastav won Super Women Award 2025', '', '', '', '', 'meera-shrivastav-honored-superwoman-award-2025', 'Meera Shrivastav Honored with Super Woman Award 2025', ' Super Woman Award 2025', 'Forever Star India honored Meera Shrivastav from Gwalior with the Super Woman Award for her inspiring work in social service and women empowerment.', 'Super Women Award', 'Super Women Award 2025', 'Award Ceremony', 'Award Show', '', 'Meera Shrivastav Honored with Super Woman Award 2025', 'https://newsforever.in/meera-shrivastav-honored-superwoman-award-2025', 'Forever Star India honored Meera Shrivastav from Gwalior with the Super Woman Award for her inspiring work in social service and women empowerment.', 'assets/img/blog/1762169004.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Gwalior / A grand ceremony for the prestigious Super Woman Award was organized by Forever Star India. The event honored women from across the nation who have made outstanding contributions in diverse fields such as education, healthcare, business, technology, law, social service, and art. In this ceremony, Gwalior resident Meera Shrivastav was honored with the <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><strong>Super Woman Award</strong></a> for her remarkable work in the field of social service. Meera celebrated the joy of receiving the award with her family, clearly reflecting that strength and inspiration to achieve success come from one&rsquo;s family. Forever Star India Awards has taken a significant initiative to strengthen the unity of Indian families through such family celebrations. Meera holds a B.Ed. degree and an M.A. in Economics and Sociology. She served as the President of the Student Union (1977&ndash;78) and as an Executive Member of the University Council. With over 43 years of teaching experience, she is currently working as the Administrator of the Postgraduate College of Nursing, Gwalior. A three-time cancer survivor, Meera has launched numerous initiatives for cancer awareness and women empowerment in collaboration with the Cancer Hospital and Research Institute, Gwalior. The struggles and achievements of women like Meera stand as powerful examples of strength and determination for society.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2025-11-03 : 01:11:57');
