(548, 25, 'Miss Teen Alwar 2025: Hanshika Bhardwaj Crowned', 51, 52, 1, '18,22,95,98,120', 'assets/img/blog/1762852645.png', 'Anshika Bhardwaj Miss Teen City Winner', '', '', '', '', 'hanshika-bhardwaj-miss-teen-alwar-2025', 'Miss Teen Alwar 2025: Hanshika Bhardwaj Crowned', 'Miss Teen City Finale 2025, Miss Teen India, Miss Teen Beauty Pageant, Miss Teen Pageant News', 'Hanshika Bhardwaj crowned Miss Teen Alwar 2025, inspiring teens with her talent, poise, and dedication in academics, sports, and pageantry.', 'miss teen city finale 2025', 'miss teen india', 'miss teen beauty pageant', 'miss teen pageant news', 'forever miss teen india', '', 'https://newsforever.in/hanshika-bhardwaj-miss-teen-alwar-2025', 'Hanshika Bhardwaj crowned Miss Teen Alwar 2025, inspiring teens with her talent, poise, and dedication in academics, sports, and pageantry.', 'assets/img/blog/1762852806.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In a party of knowledge, poise, and younger ambition, Hanshika Bhardwaj from Alwar has been crowned Miss Teen Alwar 2025 at the prestigious Miss Teen India City Finale 2025, organized through Forever Star India. The glittering event witnessed individuals from across the area competing in numerous segments, which include talent showcases, conventional apparel, and confidence-constructing rounds. Hanshika&rsquo;s great performance, allure, and multifaceted skills made her stand out from many of the contestants, earning her the distinguished crown.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">At a younger age, Hanshika has displayed incredible willpower to lecturers, sports, and extracurricular sports. Apart from excelling in modeling and beauty pageants, she has trained in conventional Indian martial arts and actively participates in sports activities along with badminton, desk tennis, cricket, and fitness center schooling. Her potential for stability research, fitness, and private development displays a strong and galvanizing character, making her a function model for different teenagers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\">Miss Teen India City Finale 2025</a>, carried out by Forever Star India, aims to offer a platform for younger women to show off their competencies, self assurance, and management talents. According to the organizers, the occasion emphasizes no longer handiest outside beauty however, additionally personal boom, discipline, and youth empowerment. Hanshika expressed her gratitude after prevailing the name, acknowledging the guide of her own family, mentors, and the occasion organizers. She additionally highlighted the importance of such structures in building self-confidence and inspiring teenagers to discover their passions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With this success, Hanshika Bhardwaj now represents Alwar at the country wide degree, aiming to take her talent, dedication, and galvanizing spirit to greater heights. Her win, celebrated thru Forever Star India, serves as a notion for teens across the area, proving that determination, ability, and a nicely-rounded personality can open doorways to awesome possibilities</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-11-10 : 11:11:16'),
(549, 25, 'Behind the Indian Achiever Awards 2025: The Selection and Nomination Journey', 55, 56, 0, '87,97,102,103', 'assets/img/blog/1762853739.png', 'Indian Achiever Award 2025', '', '', '', '', 'indian-achiever-award-nomination-2025', 'Behind the Indian Achiever Awards 2025: The Selection and Nomination Journey', 'Star India Award, October 2025 Nominations, International Level Honor, Forever Indian Achiever Award, Global Infinity Achiever Award', 'Forever Star India honored achievers at the national level in Oct 2025, celebrating excellence across education, health, business, arts, and social service.', 'star india award', 'october 2025 nomination', 'indian achiever award 2025', 'super woman award 2025', 'super hero award 2025', 'Behind the Indian Achiever Awards 2025: The Selection and Nomination Journey', 'https://newsforever.in/indian-achiever-award-nomination-2025', 'Forever Star India honored achievers at the national level in Oct 2025, celebrating excellence across education, health, business, arts, and social service.', 'assets/img/blog/1762854436.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Jaipur / A Grand award show was organized by Forever Star India. In this ceremony, distinguished personalities from across the country were honored at the national level for their outstanding work in the fields of education, health, commerce, technology, law, social service, and art as part of the October 2025 nominations. It is noteworthy that Forever Star India nominates talented individuals for awards every month in more than 70 categories. Those who are nominated by Forever Star India receive a unique ID and are listed on Google, enabling their achievements to gain international recognition and preserving their success as a record for the future. Men and women who achieve success without formal higher education are honored with the titles of Super Woman and Super Hero, respectively. On the other hand, individuals who continue their struggle and achieve success after earning academic degrees are conferred with the <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-achievers\">Forever Indian Achiever Award</a>. Similarly, those who attain success while pursuing degrees in various fields are honored with the Global Infinity Achiever Award by Forever Star India. In the past years, award winners from all categories organized by Forever Star India have stated that this award provides global recognition through a unique ID, which can be regarded as a personal legacy even years later. Rajesh Agrawal, the Founder and CEO of Forever Star India, said that the main objective of these awards is to honor success with dignity and provide global recognition, while motivating people to contribute to the nation&rsquo;s progress. He further stated that Forever Star India is sincerely carrying forward the mission of listing and preserving the outstanding achievements of Indians on Google, thereby recording them in history with integrity.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Among the distinguished winners of the Forever Star India Super women award were :- Dr. Pratyanshi Dwivedi Teacher (Prayagraj) Chetna Vora Makeup Artist (Mumbai) Riya Rupani</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Makeup Artist (Ahmedabad) Richa Mishra Human Resources (Faridabad) Alavelu M Makeup Artist (Vijayanagara) Sromona Roy Human Resources (Kolkata) Komal Poddar NGO (Durgapur) Dr. R.Vijayalakshmi Selfmade (Chennai) Ramya Devarajan Teacher (Bengaluru) Dr. Ruchika Debraj De Doctor (Kolkata) Aishwarya Bhattacharya Singer (Kolkata) Sanchita Thorve Fitness Coach (Ulhasnagar) Sonia Chhabra Social Activist (Ludhiana) Eng. Diptirekha Pattnaik Social Activist (Bhubaneswar) Sumera Bhardwaj Occult Practitioner (Noida) Dr. Pallvi Rathee Spiritual Healer (Rohtak) Dr. Ragitha V M Entrepreneur (Ernakulam) Chandralekha Bangla Fashion Designer (Hyderabad) Maheswari Bhadri Yoga Trainer (Secunderabad) Major Geeta Adhikari (Retd) Army (Bengaluru) Nisha Mohariya Nurse (Gwalior) Dr.Veena Vandna Researcher (Pune) Preeti Dubey Social Activist (Faridabad) Shubhanshi Shukla Writer (Balrampur) Anupa Nidhi Homemaker (Burdwan) Priya Bharti Writer (Sahibganj) Gayatri Singh Astrologer (Bilaspur) Swati Verma Teacher (New Delhi) Minal Kiran Bakshi Art &amp; Culture (Pune) Anjali Goyal Art &amp; Craft (Gwalior) Nikita Kaushik Businesswoman (Rohtak) Dr. Rajkumari Suresh Jain Social Worker (Jalgaon) Namrata Jena Businesswoman (Mumbai) Poonam Sharma Dancer (Bhopal) Meera Shrivastav Social Worker (Gwalior) Sunita Rohit Yadav Teacher (Mumbai) Palapala Bharti Influencer (Raipur) Acharya Amritaa Anchit, Bhandari Vastu Consultant (Bilaspur) Karruna T. Bhushan Tarot Card Reader (Kharagpur) Vibha Tripathi Social Worker (Gorakhpur) Dr. Heena Moolpani Reiki Healer (Ulhasnagar) Prerna Malhotra Astrologer (Bengaluru) Dr. Alaka Godbole Doctor (Thane) Rashmi Gupta Author (Ghaziabad) Madhavi Shawrikar Artist (Bhopal) Ankita Verma Makeup Artist (Delhi) Jyoti Bajaj Educationalist (Mirzapur) Brahmakumari Dr. Suvarna Krishna Tate Social Worker (Satara) Reema Jayawant Tarot Card Reader (Mumbai) Runal Sakla Nadgauda Businesswoman (Pune) and Nikita Aswaani Vastu Consultant (Ajmer) Ramya Devarajan Educationist and Coordinator (Bengaluru) Dr. Ruchika Debraj De (Kolkata) These names stood out among the awardees for their exceptional achievements across various fields.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/TPHfF0fy/Whats-App-Image-2025-11-11-at-3-24-43-PM.jpg\" /></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Among the distinguished winners of the Forever Star India Super Hero award were :-&nbsp; Gaurav Saxena CEO &amp; Founder (Kanpur) Dr. Pankaj Paliwal Astrologer (Aligarh) Dr. Mukesh Pancholi CEO &amp; Founder (Jaipur) T Seetha Rama Sastry Astrologer (Hyderabad) Karthik Raja Karnan Entrepreneur (Salem East) Dr. Chitta Ranjan Boruah Author (Guwahati) Hari Balaji V R Researcher (Chennai) Ram Dua Chef (Ludhiana) and Mohit Mittal Astrologer (Sirsa).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">These names stood out among the awardees for their exceptional achievements across various fields. The Winners of the Forever Indian Achiever Award include Harshil Pravinbhai Rampariya Social Worker (Surat) Lopa Mullick Entrepreneur (Mumbai) Mrs. Shilpa Guruprasanna Women Entrepreneurs (Bengaluru) and Uma Rani Vishnoi Educationalist (Ghaziabad).</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-11-10 : 11:11:29'),
(550, 25, 'Nominee List for Super Woman Award 2025 | Indian Achiever Award', 43, 44, 1, '87,94,102,119', 'assets/img/blog/1762855119.png', 'Super Woman Award Nominee 2025', '', '', '', '', 'super-woman-award-october-list', 'Nominee List for Super Woman Award 2025 | Indian Achiever Award', 'Nominee List for Super Woman Award 2025 | Indian Achiever Award', 'Nominee List for Super Woman Award 2025 | Indian Achiever Award', 'super woman award 2025', 'woman achievement awards', 'india achievers award show', 'forever star indian achievers', 'forever achiever award news', 'Nominee List for Super Woman Award 2025 | Indian Achiever Award', 'https://newsforever.in/super-woman-award-october-list', 'Forever Star India honored outstanding women at the national level for achievements in education, arts, social service, and professional excellence.', 'assets/img/blog/1762855574.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Jaipur / A Grand award show was organized by Forever Star India. In this ceremony, distinguished personalities from across the country were honored at the national level for their outstanding work in the fields of education, health, commerce, technology, law, social service, and art as part of the October 2025 nominations. It is noteworthy that Forever Star India nominates talented individuals for awards every month in more than 70 categories. Those who are nominated by Forever Star India receive a unique ID and are listed on Google, enabling their achievements to gain international recognition and preserving their success as a record for the future. Woman who achieve success without formal higher education are honored with the titles of Super Woman respectively. On the other hand, individuals who continue their struggle and achieve success after earning academic degrees are conferred with the Forever Indian Achiever Award. Similarly, those who attain success while pursuing degrees in various fields are honored with the Global Infinity Achiever Award by Forever Star India. In the past years, award winners from all categories organized by Forever Star India have stated that this award provides global recognition through a unique ID, which can be regarded as a personal legacy even years later. Rajesh Agrawal, the Founder and CEO of Forever Star India, said that the main objective of these awards is to honor success with dignity and provide global recognition, while motivating people to contribute to the nation&rsquo;s progress. He further stated that Forever Star India is sincerely carrying forward the mission of listing and preserving the outstanding achievements of Indians on Google, thereby recording them in history with integrity.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Among the distinguished winners of the Forever Star India <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Award</a> were :- Dr. Pratyanshi Dwivedi Teacher (Prayagraj) Chetna Vora Makeup Artist (Mumbai) Riya Rupani Makeup Artist (Ahmedabad) Richa Mishra Human Resources (Faridabad) Alavelu M Makeup Artist (Vijayanagara) Sromona Roy Human Resources (Kolkata) Komal Poddar NGO (Durgapur) Dr. R.Vijayalakshmi Selfmade (Chennai) Ramya Devarajan Teacher (Bengaluru) Dr. Ruchika Debraj De Doctor (Kolkata) Aishwarya Bhattacharya Singer (Kolkata) Sanchita Thorve Fitness Coach (Ulhasnagar) Sonia Chhabra Social Activist (Ludhiana) Eng. Diptirekha Pattnaik Social Activist (Bhubaneswar) Sumera Bhardwaj Occult Practitioner (Noida) Dr. Pallvi Rathee Spiritual Healer (Rohtak) Dr. Ragitha V M Entrepreneur (Ernakulam) Chandralekha Bangla Fashion Designer (Hyderabad) Maheswari Bhadri Yoga Trainer (Secunderabad) Major Geeta Adhikari (Retd) Army (Bengaluru) Nisha Mohariya Nurse (Gwalior) Dr.Veena Vandna Researcher (Pune) Preeti Dubey Social Activist (Faridabad) Shubhanshi Shukla Writer (B