e event reflected Forever Star India&rsquo;s vision of blending culture, fashion, and global exposure on one platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The cultural round successfully set the tone for the upcoming Forever Miss Universe and <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\">Forever Miss India</a> Grand Finale, reinforcing Forever Star India&rsquo;s commitment to celebrating talent, tradition, and transformation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-22 : 10:12:53'),
