(641, 25, 'Visakhapatnam’s Dr. Srujana Wins Prestigious Miss Forever Universe India Title', 21, 45, 1, '8,18,21,27,88,230', 'assets/img/blog/1767337876.png', 'Forever Miss Universe India', '', '', '', '', 'dr-srujana-miss-forever-universe-india', 'Visakhapatnam’s Dr. Srujana Wins Prestigious Miss Forever Universe India Title', 'dr. srujana devi, visakhapatnam dr. srujana, miss forever universe india, miss forever universe india winner, indian beauty pageant winner, forever star india', 'Dr. Srujana Devi from Visakhapatnam was crowned Miss Forever Universe India at the Forever Star India grand finale held in Jaipur.', 'Dr. Srujana Devi', 'Miss Forever Universe India', 'Indian Beauty Pageant Winner', 'International Beauty Pageant', 'Forever Star India', 'Visakhapatnam’s Dr. Srujana Wins Prestigious Miss Forever Universe India Title', 'https://newsforever.in/dr-srujana-miss-forever-universe-india', 'Dr. Srujana Devi from Visakhapatnam was crowned Miss Forever Universe India at the Forever Star India grand finale held in Jaipur.', 'assets/img/blog/1767337889.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Glamorous Finale in Jaipur</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The glamour and fashion world lit up at Zee Studio as Dr. Srujana Devi from Visakhapatnam was crowned <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/miss-universe-beauty-pageant.php\">Miss Forever Universe</a> India at the grand finale organized by Forever Star India. The event showcased talent from across the country, celebrating beauty, grace, and cultural diversity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Recognition and Awards</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder of Forever Star India, Rajesh Agarwal, along with Director Jaya Chauhan, shared that in addition to the main title of Miss Forever Universe India, winners from diverse states were additionally identified with special Forever Universe and Forever India titles. The competition included categories based on age-Mrs., Miss, and Teen-ensuring fair recognition for all contestants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Expert Choreography and Fashion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The choreography and direction of the grand finale were expertly managed by internationally acclaimed choreographer Shy Lobo, supported by team members Uttam Bhagat, Veenu Mishra, and supermodel Parul Mishra. The stage came alive with creations by renowned international designers including Sadiq Raza, Prashant Majumdar, Vishnu, Ashfaq Khan, Arif Khan, and Ranu Beniwal, who styled the models in stunning outfits that highlighted elegance and poise.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Nationwide Participation and Vision</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Rajesh Agarwal noted that participants from nearly all states of India took part in this mega-event, reflecting Forever Star India&rsquo;s vision of providing a global platform for individuals aspiring to achieve excellence in the glamour and fashion industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Celebrating Talent and Culture</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With its focus on subculture, talent, and international exposure, the Forever Universe India grand finale successfully blended fashion, culture, and glamour, inspiring contestants and audiences alike while highlighting Forever Star India&rsquo;s commitment to nurturing future stars of India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-23 : 02:12:12'),
(642, 25, 'Mumbai’s Saartha Shines as Miss Forever Universe at Star India Grand Finale', 21, 45, 1, '8,18,21,27,88,230', 'assets/img/blog/1767161263.png', 'Miss Forever Universe 2025', '', '', '', '', 'mumbai-saartha-miss-forever-universe', 'Mumbai’s Saartha Shines as Miss Forever Universe at Star India Grand Finale', 'saartha sameer gore, miss forever universe, forever star india grand finale, beauty pageant winner mumbai, indian beauty pageant, forever star india', 'Mumbai’s Saartha Sameer Gore was crowned Miss Forever Universe at Forever Star India’s grand finale in Jaipur, celebrating talent, confidence, and grace.', 'Saartha Sameer Gore', 'Miss Forever Universe', 'Forever Star India Grand Finale', 'Indian Beauty Pageant', 'Forever Star India', 'Mumbai’s Saartha Shines as Miss Forever Universe at Forever Star India Grand Finale', 'https://newsforever.in/mumbai-saartha-miss-forever-universe', 'Mumbai’s Saartha Sameer Gore was crowned Miss Forever Universe at Forever Star India’s grand finale in Jaipur, celebrating talent, confidence, and grace.', 'assets/img/blog/1767161280.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Glamorous Win in Jaipur</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The glittering stage of Zee Studio witnessed a memorable moment as Saartha Sameer Gore from Mumbai was crowned Miss Forever Universe at the grand finale organized by Forever Star India. Her confidence, beauty, and powerful stage presence set her apart, earning her one of the most prestigious titles of the evening.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Celebration of Talent and Grace</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The grand finale introduced collectively proficient contestants from throughout India, celebrating beauty, individuality, and cultural diversity. Saartha impressed the jury with her poise, conversation abilities, and usual performance, emerging as a true symbol of modern Indian womanhood on a national platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Fair Competition and Expert Evaluation</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder of Forever Star India, Rajesh Agarwal, along with Director Jaya Chauhan, stated that the competition was designed to ensure equal opportunity for all participants. The event featured multiple categories including Mrs., Miss, and Teen, allowing contestants from different age groups to shine. Winners from various states were also honored with unique Forever Universe and Forever India titles.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">World-Class Choreography and Fashion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The grand finale was choreographed and directed by famed international choreographer Shie Lobo, supported by Uttam Bhagat, Veenu Mishra, and supermodel Parul Mishra. Renowned designers together with Sadiq Raza, Prashant Majumdar, Vishnu, Ashfaq Khan, Arif Khan, and Ranu Beniwal styled the contestants in breathtaking ensembles, including grandeur to the event.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Platform for Global Aspirations</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Rajesh Agarwal highlighted that participants from almost every Indian state took part in the mega-event, reinforcing Forever Star India&rsquo;s vision of offering a global platform to aspiring talents in the glamour and fashion industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Sartha&rsquo;s victory as <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/miss-universe-beauty-pageant.php\">Miss Forever Universe</a> stands as an inspiration for young aspirants, reflecting Forever Star India&rsquo;s commitment to nurturing confidence, talent, and international opportunities for India&rsquo;s rising stars.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-23 : 02:12:36'),
