\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Participants from almost every Indian state took part in the competition, reinforcing Forever Star India&rsquo;s vision of imparting a global platform to rising expertise. Neeharika Bethanapalli&rsquo;s success as <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\">Forever Miss India</a> 2025 stands as an inspiration for young aspirants dreaming of a future in the fashion and glamour industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-23 : 09:12:44'),
