ont-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Tanvi impressed the jury with her poise, communication skills, and graceful stage presence at some point of the competition. Her dedication and consistent performance made her stand out among strong contenders, earning her the coveted Forever Miss Teen India title. The competition emphasised personality development, cultural awareness, and self-confidence alongside physical presentation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Transparent Judging and Fair Competition</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder of Forever Star India, Rajesh Agarwal, along with Director Jaya Chauhan, stated that the event was conducted with complete transparency and professionalism. Contestants were evaluated throughout multiple rounds based on confidence, presentation, and overall performance, ensuring the same possibilities for all participants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">World-Class Choreography and Fashion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The grand finale was choreographed and directed by internationally acclaimed choreographer Shie Lobo, supported by his experienced team. Renowned designers presented stunning collections that added glamour, beauty, and youth charm to the event, improving the visual attraction of the stage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Inspiring the Next Generation</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With participation from nearly every Indian state, the competition reflected Forever Star India&rsquo;s vision of providing a global platform for young talent. Tanvi Yatin K.hairnar&rsquo;s victory as <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\">Forever Miss Teen India</a> 2025 serves as a powerful inspiration for teenagers aspiring to make their mark in the fashion, glamour, and pageantry world</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-24 : 12:12:31'),
(645, 25, 'Gloria Kotwal Crowned Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025', 21, 66, 1, '8,17,18,21,22,230', 'assets/img/blog/1767167741.png', 'Miss Teen Forever Universe 2025', '', '', '', '', 'gloria-kotwal-miss-teen-universe-2025', 'Gloria Kotwal Crowned Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025', ' gloria kotwal, miss teen forever universe india 2025, teen beauty pageant india, forever star india grand finale, teen pageant winner india, forever star india', 'Gloria Kotwal from Siliguri was crowned Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025 at Forever Star India grand finale, celebrating talent, confidence, and youth.', 'Gloria Kotwal', 'Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025', 'Teen Beauty Pageant India', 'Teen Pageant Winner India', 'Forever Star India', '', 'https://newsforever.in/gloria-kotwal-miss-teen-universe-2025', 'Gloria Kotwal from Siliguri was crowned Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025 at Forever Star India grand finale, celebrating talent, confidence, and youth.', 'assets/img/blog/1767167753.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Glittering Moment at the Grand Finale</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Jaipur: The stage at Zee Studio shone with glamour as Gloria Kotwal from Siliguri, West Bengal, changed into crowned Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025 at the grand finale organized by Forever Star India. The event celebrated youthful talent, confidence, and charm, bringing together wonderful teenage contestants from across India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Journey of Determination and Ambition</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Gloria, currently a Class 10 student, inspired the judges with her beauty, stage presence, and communication skills throughout the competition. Her dedication, poise, and consistent performance set her apart, earning her the prestigious Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025 title. She aspires to become an exceptional actress, using storytelling and creativity to make a significant effect on her age group.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Commitment to Social Responsibility</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from her creative desires, Gloria aims to work with UNICEF to improve communities and children&rsquo;s lives, demonstrating that social responsibility and art can coexist harmoniously. Her journey highlights a perfect blend of ambition, humility, and purpose, inspiring young people nationwide.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Extracurricular Excellence</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Gloria is an all-around achiever beyond academics. She is an avid athlete, excelling in kickboxing, badminton, throwball, and swimming. Through sports activities, she has developed power, subject, and resilience, qualities that decorate her standard performance and presence on stage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Transparent Judging and Professional Excellence</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder of Forever Star India, Rajesh Agarwal, along with Director Jaya Chauhan, emphasized that the competition was conducted with complete equity and professionalism. Multiple rounds evaluated participants on confidence, presentation, and overall performance, ensuring a transparent process for all contestants competing for the <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\">Miss Teen Forever Universe India</a> crown.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">World-Class Choreography and Fashion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The grand finale was choreographed and directed by internationally acclaimed choreographer Shie Lobo, supported through his experienced team. Renowned designers presented beautiful ensembles that introduced glamour, sophistication, and youthfulness to the stage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Inspiring Young Talent Nationwide</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With participation from nearly each Indian state, Forever Star India efficiently provided an international platform for aspiring young talent. Gloria Kotwal&rsquo;s victory as Miss Teen Forever Universe India 2025 exemplifies confidence, talent, and leadership, inspiring teenagers to comply with their goals in style, glamour, and social impact.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-24 : 12:12:05'),
(646, 25, 'Anjali Sinha Crowned Forever Mrs India 2025 (G-1) at Grand Finale', 21, 42, 1, '8,16,18,22,23,230', 'assets/img/blog/1767335770.png', 'Mrs India 2025 ', '', '', '', '', 'anjali-sinha-crowned-mrs-india-2025', 'Anjali Sinha Crowned Forever Mrs India 2025 (G-1) at Grand Finale', 'anjali sinha forever mrs india 2025, anjali sinha mrs jamshedpur 2025, forever mrs india winner 2025, mrs india 2025 winner anjali sinha, forever star india', 'Anjali Sinha, Mrs Jamshedpur 2025, was crowned Forever Mrs India 2025 (G-1), inspiring women with her journey of empowerment, leadership, and resilience.', 'Anjali Sinha', 'Mrs Jamshedpur 2025', 'Mrs India 2025 Winner', 'Mrs India Beauty Pageant', 'Forever Star India', 'Anjali Sinha Crowned Forever Mrs India 2025 (G-1) at Grand Finale', 'https://newsforever.in/anjali-sinha-crowned-mrs-india-2025', 'Anjali Sinha, Mrs Jamshedpur 2025, was crowned Forever Mrs India 2025 (G-1), inspiring women with her journey of empowerment, leadership, and resilience.', 'assets/img/blog/1767335789.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Proud Moment at the Forever Star India Platform</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Jaipur: The grand finale of Forever Mrs India 2025, organized by Forever Star India, witnessed an inspiring moment as Anjali Sinha, winner of Mrs Jamshedpur 2025, was crowned Forever Mrs India 2025 (G-1). The prestigious event celebrated confident, accomplished, and resilient married women from across the nation.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Roots, Passion, and Early Journey</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Born and raised in Patna, Anjali Sinha developed into a graceful and confident personality through her deep passion for dance, creativity, and community involvement. Her natural ability to connect with people led her to pursue a successful career in Human Resources, where she excelled in talent management, leadership development, and organizational growth.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Balancing Career, Motherhood, and New Beginnings</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Marriage and relocation to Jamshedpur marked a transformative phase in Anjali&rsquo;s life. Embracing motherhood brought both joy and challenges. She courageously took a career break to focus on her child, emerging stronger with renewed purpose. Transitioning into entrepreneurship, Anjali began training young professionals, using her expertise in HR, communication, and leadership to prepare them for the corporate world.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Platform for Purpose and Advocacy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Through the Forever Star India (FSIA) platform, Anjali found a powerful voice to expand her advocacy for women&rsquo;s mental health, postpartum empowerment, and youth development. Her journey reflects resilience, adaptability, and a commitment to uplifting others.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Excellence, Transparency, and Glamour</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The competition was conducted with complete transparency under the leadership of Rajesh Agarwal, Founder, and Jaya Chauhan, Director of Forever Star India. The grand finale featured world-class choreography by Shie Lobo and stunning fashion presentations by renowned designers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Redefining the Modern Indian Woman</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Anjali Sinha&rsquo;s crowning as <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-mrs-india-new.php\">Forever Mrs India</a> 2025 (G-1) is not just a personal achievement but a symbol of transforming challenges into strength. Her story redefines the image of the modern Indian woman&mdash;confident, compassionate, and empowered.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2025-12-24 : 02:12:31');
