(657, 25, 'Star India Kids 2026 Audition: Kids Talent Recognition in Seven Major Contests', 103, 104, 1, '29,94,236,237,238', 'assets/img/blog/1768905442.png', 'Forever Star India Kids Contest 2026', '', '', '', '', 'star-india-kids-auditions-2026', 'Star India Kids 2026 Audition: Kids Talent Recognition in Seven Major Contests', 'star india kids contest 2026, kids talent contest, kids fashion show india, kids modeling contest india, kids talent contest india, national kids contest india, forever star india awards', 'Star India Kids 2026 auditions begin under Forever Star India, offering a national platform for young talent across seven contests with junior and pre-teen categories.', 'Star India Kids Contest 2026', 'Kids Talent Contest', 'Kids Fashion Show India', 'Kids Modeling Contest India', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Star India Kids 2026 Audition: Kids Talent Recognition in Seven Major Contests', 'https://newsforever.in/star-india-kids-auditions-2026', 'Star India Kids 2026 auditions begin under Forever Star India, offering a national platform for young talent across seven contests with junior and pre-teen categories.', 'assets/img/blog/1768905459.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Prestigious Platform for Young Talent Across India</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Jaipur: The auditions for the&nbsp; much-anticipated Star India Kids Contest have formally commenced under the esteemed banner of Forever Star India, marking a large step towards nurturing younger talent on a global platform. Known for organizing prestigious award ceremonies and beauty pageants, Forever Star India continues its legacy by offering children a meaningful stage to showcase their abilities, confidence, and creativity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Two Age Categories for Inclusive Participation</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Forever Star India Kids Contest has been thoughtfully designed to ensure age-appropriate participation and fair selection. Children will be selected across categories: Junior (3 to 7 years) and Pre-Teen (8 to 12 years). This structure allows young contributors to specify themselves quite simply at the same time as being evaluated primarily based on confidence, personality, expertise, and stage presence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Empowering Children Through Talent and Confidence</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Speaking about the initiative, Forever Star India Founder Rajesh Agarwal emphasised that the contest ambitions to provide kids the right direction, popularity, and encouragement at an early age. The platform has continually performed a pioneering position in building self-notion among children and helping them find out their unique strengths. The event stands proud as a real Kids Confidence Contest, focusing no longer best on performance however also on personal growth.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kXxszVCD/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-19-at-3-53-06-PM.jpg\" /></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A National Contest with Global Vision</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/star-india-kids-contest.php\"><strong>Star India Kids Contest</strong></a> is more than a competition-it is a movement to empower the next generation. By participating in this Kids Contest India, children gain exposure, confidence, and an understanding of healthy competition. The auditions are the first step toward a bigger journey that prepares younger abilities for country wide and international opportunities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Building Future Stars with Purpose</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With its transparent choice process and child-friendly approach, the Forever Star India Kids Contest continues to set benchmarks in the kids&rsquo; skills ecosystem. As auditions begin across regions, excitement is building among parents and children alike, making this initiative one of the most awaited platforms for young achievers in India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-19 : 09:01:13'),
(658, 25, 'From Home Kitchen to National Honor: Udaipur Chef Becomes Super Woman Awardee 2025', 23, 41, 1, '29,31,86,87,94', 'assets/img/blog/1768907114.png', 'Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala', '', '', '', '', 'udaipur-chef-achieves-national-acclaim', 'From Home Kitchen to National Honor: Udaipur Chef Becomes Super Woman Awardee 2025', 'shirin zakiuddin gorakhpurwala, super woman award 2025, forever star india, udaipur chef, homemade professional chef, indian culinary expert, female chef award india', 'Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala’s inspiring journey from home kitchen to national fame as a Super Woman Awardee 2025 celebrates culinary excellence and innovation.', 'Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala', 'Homemade Professional Chef', 'Udaipur Chef', 'Indian Culinary Expert', 'Forever Star India', 'From Home Kitchen to National Honor: Udaipur Chef Becomes Super Woman Awardee 2025', 'https://newsforever.in/udaipur-chef-achieves-national-acclaim', 'Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala’s inspiring journey from home kitchen to national fame as a Super Woman Awardee 2025 celebrates culinary excellence and innovation.', 'assets/img/blog/1768907131.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Journey from Home Kitchen to National Acclaim</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Udaipur: Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala, a celebrated culinary achiever in the beginning from Banswara and now based in Nashik, has been recognized as one of the best home made professional chefs in the country. Known for her proper flavours, culinary innovation, and mastery over homemade cuisine - specifically Dawoodi Bohra delicacies and Indian fusion dishes - Shirin&rsquo;s upward push from cooking for small gatherings to winning national accolades is truly inspiring. She has been honored with the distinguished Super Woman Award 2025 on the Forever Star India Awards, recognizing her excellence in the culinary world and her influence on aspiring chefs nationwide.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Early Beginnings: Passion Meets Purpose</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Kj0y7mNW/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-20-at-4-34-17-PM.jpg\" style=\"height:763px; width:1280px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Born into a traditional Dawoodi Bohra family in Banswara, Rajasthan, Shirin balanced early responsibilities as a&nbsp; young wife and mother of two while nurturing her deep passion for cooking. Her culinary career took shape after she moved to Udaipur and began honing her talents, to begin with cooking homemade food for social gatherings, events, and small celebrations. Her commitment to quality soon led her to undergo professional training under acclaimed chefs such as Chef Vimal Dhar and Chef Sangeeta Dhar, sharpening her skills and broadening her culinary perspective.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Career Milestones and National Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shirin&rsquo;s skills shone through when she reached the Semi-Finals of the MasterChef India auditions in New Delhi in each 2016 and 2019 - a remarkable achievement reflecting her culinary prowess. She went on to win the Star Chef Competition Udaipur (Season 1, 2016), presented by Celebrity Chef Harpal Singh Sokhi. Her success opened doors to new opportunities, including collaborations with Wonderchef (Chef Sanjeev Kapoor) and serving dishes for noted chefs like Varun Inamdar.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In 2019, she realized her entrepreneurial dream by opening Tastebuds Restaurant in Banswara. She later expanded into frozen foods, ready-to-eat meals, and released a Cloud Kitchen in Udaipur in 2024 alongside her daughter Arwa. Today, Shirin is progressing towards establishing a fine-dine restaurant and building a PAN-India food franchise network.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Empowering Through Excellence</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/BnJ9tLBc/IMG-20260120-164607.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala&rsquo;s success story is a testament to resilience, expertise, and entrepreneurial spirit. By blending traditional cuisine with modern innovation, she has inspired other homemakers to pursue culinary goals professionally. Her popularity with the <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Award</a> 2025 by using Forever Star India not only highlights her culinary achievements but also celebrates her role as a source of inspiration for aspiring chefs and food entrepreneurs across India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-20 : 01:01:07'),
(659, 25, 'Nominations Open for Forever Star India Awards Season 8', 23, 82, 1, '29,31,141,182,194', 'assets/img/blog/1769081416.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'nominations-open-awards-season-8', 'Nominations Open for Forever Star India Awards Season 8', 'forever star india awards, forever star india awards season 8, super woman award, business award india, global infinity achiever, indian achiever award, national & international awards, achievers recognition india', 'Nominations for Forever Star India Awards Season 8 are now open, honoring achievers in Super Woman, Business, and Global Infinity categories across India.', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Forever Star India Awards Season 8', 'Super Woman Award', 'Business Award India', 'Achievers Recognition India', 'Nominations Open for Forever Star India Awards Season 8', 'https://newsforever.in/nominations-open-awards-season-8', 'Nominations for Forever Star India Awards Season 8 are now open, honoring achievers in Super Woman, Business, and Global Infinity categories across India.', 'assets/img/blog/1769081477.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Jaipur:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> The nomination process for the highly prestigious </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards Season 8</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has officially begun. Recognized nationally and internationally, the Forever Star India Awards have honored over 100,000 individuals for their outstanding contributions across various fields. The awards continue to celebrate excellence, perseverance, and innovation, providing a platform for achievers to gain well-deserved recognition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Diverse Award Categories</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/0QCfQDhq/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-22-at-5-12-20-PM.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The awards include multiple categories such as </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Hero</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Indian Achiever</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Global Infinity Achiever</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Business Awards</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, ensuring that achievers from every domain get the recognition they deserve. According to Rajesh Agarwal, Founder of Forever Star India, the awards are unique because each awardee receives a dedicated Google ID, which is continuously optimized by the digital experts of Forever Star India to enhance visibility and credibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Transparent and Exclusive Nominations</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">To maintain transparency and authenticity, only one nomination per category is accepted from each city. This approach ensures that the selection process is fair and honors genuine talent. Individuals who overcome challenges and achieve success are recognized with the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> or </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Hero Awards</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, while business achievers receive the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Business Award</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Nationally successful personalities are honored with the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Indian Infinity Achiever Award</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and those achieving international acclaim are awarded the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Global Infinity Award</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Purpose and Vision of Forever Star India Awards</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> aim to inspire talented individuals across India, including entrepreneurs, scientists, social workers, artists, and professionals in technology, justice, and other fields. By highlighting their achievements, the awards encourage recipients to continue excelling in their respective areas and motivate others to pursue their goals with dedication. Through this initiative, Forever Star India Awards seeks to shine a spotlight on individuals who bring pride to the nation while setting benchmarks of excellence for others to follow.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-22 : 01:01:20'),
(660, 25, 'Forever Achiever Award 2026: Nominations Open Across 70+ Categories in India', 23, 82, 1, '29,31,94,119,122', 'assets/img/blog/1769419114.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'achiever-awards-2026-nominations', 'Forever Achiever Award 2026: Nominations Open Across 70+ Categories in India', ' forever achiever award 2026, forever achiever award india, achiever awards 2026, national achievement awards india, 70+ category awards india, business awards india, social achievement awards, entrepreneur awards india, excellence awards india, forever a', 'Forever Achiever Award 2026 opens nominations across 70+ categories in India, honoring excellence, innovation, leadership, and impactful achievers nationwide.', 'Forever Achiever Award 2026', 'Forever Achiever Award India', ' Forever Achiever Nominations', 'Entrepreneur Awards India', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Forever Achiever Award 2026: Nominations Open Across 70+ Categories in India', 'https://newsforever.in/achiever-awards-2026-nominations', 'Forever Achiever Award 2026 opens nominations across 70+ categories in India, honoring excellence, innovation, leadership, and impactful achievers nationwide.', 'assets/img/blog/1769419125.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Prestigious Platform to Celebrate Excellence</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Achiever Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has officially opened its nomination process across India, offering an expansive platform that recognizes talent, dedication, and impact across more than 70 diverse categories. Known for honoring individuals who create meaningful change in their respective fields, the award continues its legacy of celebrating excellence at national and international levels.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>70+ Categories Covering Every Field</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YSvCJWG6/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-26-at-2-13-51-PM.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">One of the key highlights of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Achiever Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is its wide range of categories. From business leaders, entrepreneurs, and professionals to social workers, educators, artists, innovators, healthcare professionals, and youth achievers, the awards ensure representation across industries and social sectors. This inclusive approach allows individuals from varied backgrounds to gain recognition for their achievements and contributions to society.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Transparent and Structured Nomination Process</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination process for the Forever Achiever Award 2026 is designed to be transparent, systematic, and credible. Each nomination undergoes a structured evaluation based on merit, impact, innovation, and consistency of work. This ensures that the award truly honors deserving achievers who have demonstrated excellence and perseverance in their journeys.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Empowering Achievers Across India</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The vision behind the </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-achievers\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Achiever Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-achievers\"> </a>is not only to recognize success but also to inspire future leaders and changemakers. By highlighting real-life success stories, the award motivates individuals to pursue their goals with confidence and determination. Awardees gain increased visibility, professional recognition, and a platform to inspire others through their achievements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Step Towards National Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With nominations now open across 70+ categories, the Forever Achiever Award 2026 invites achievers from all corners of India to step forward and showcase their work. The initiative stands as a symbol of recognition, credibility, and encouragement for those who strive to make a positive difference, setting new benchmarks of excellence for the nation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-25 : 09:01:48'),
(661, 25, 'Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 created a sensation at Zee Studio', 21, 66, 1, '8,18,22,27,98,111', 'assets/img/blog/1769416600.png', 'Miss Teen India Grand Finale 2025', '', '', '', '', 'miss-teen-india-grand-finale-2025', 'Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 created a sensation at Zee Studio', 'forever star india, forever miss teen india 2025, indian teen beauty pageant, shie lobo, zee studio miss teen india, indian fashion designers show, zee studio events jaipur, teen talent platform india, miss teen india 2025 winners, miss teen india state w', 'Forever Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 dazzled Zee Studio Jaipur with glamour, innovation, top designers, Shie Lobo choreography, and national winners.', 'Forever Miss Teen India 2025', 'India Teen Beauty Pageant', 'Shie Lobo', 'Miss Teen India State Winners 2025', 'Forever Star India ', 'Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 created a sensation at Zee Studio', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-teen-india-grand-finale-2025', 'Forever Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 dazzled Zee Studio Jaipur with glamour, innovation, top designers, Shie Lobo choreography, and national winners.', 'assets/img/blog/1769416619.png', '<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 Dazzles Jaipur with Glamour and Innovation</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">When participants from every state of India walked the ramp in stunning ensembles, the evening of the Forever Miss Teen India Grand Finale Season 5 transformed into a vibrant celebration of glamour, fashion, and confidence. Organized with a fresh and innovative concept, the event received widespread appreciation at both national and international levels, setting a new benchmark in the beauty and fashion industry.</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Unique Concept That Redefined the Fashion Pageant Experience</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">From modern costume designs to sequence-based catwalk performances, the pageant showcased creativity, precision, and elegance. The thoughtfully curated concept distinguished the finale from traditional pageants, making it a visually spectacular and professionally executed event held at Zee Studio, Jaipur, under the banner of Forever Star India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>National Title Winners Crowned at the Grand Finale</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VkGyQZn9/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-26-at-1-11-26-PM.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">At the grand event, Tanvi Yatin Khairnar from Maharashtra was crowned Forever Miss Teen India 2025, while Tanishka Mahendra Jain, also from Maharashtra, secured the title of Forever Miss Teen India 2025 Runner-Up, earning thunderous applause from the audience.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>State and City Title Holders Shine Across India</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\">Forever Miss Teen India</a> State 2025 titles were proudly claimed by talented participants from across the country, including Anshi Vedak from Maharashtra, Aishwarya B A from Karnataka, Prashansa Panigrahi from Odisha, Paritala Divya from Andhra Pradesh, Jayani Maitreyi from Gujarat, Grace Prognya Biswas from West Bengal, Preeti Yadav from Telangana, Anna Elizabeth from Kerala, and Akshara Chauhan from Punjab. Adding to the celebrations, Geetanjali was crowned Forever Miss Teen India Chandigarh 2025. The Runner-Up titles were awarded to Thaneesha Shankar Warjurkar from Maharashtra, Chahana Shri from Karnataka, and Arunima Sahu from Odisha. At the city level, Supriya Chaubey from Gorakhpur and Akanksha Kadam from Buldhana also emerged as winners, showcasing the diverse talent represented at the national platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Empowering Participants Beyond the Ramp</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder Rajesh Agarwal and Director Jaya Chauhan of Forever Star India emphasized that the organization provides comprehensive and in-depth training to participants. This preparation enables them to confidently pursue careers not only in glamour and fashion but also across various professional fields.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Rajesh Agarwal further highlighted that Forever Star India is the only platform in the beauty pageant industry that creates a unique digital ID for every participant even before registration, with dedicated digital experts continuously working to maintain top Google rankings for these profiles.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Renowned Creative Team and Designers Elevate the Grand Finale</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The choreography and direction were led by acclaimed choreographer Shie Lobo, along with team members Uttam Bhagat, Veenu Mishra, and supermodel Parul Mishra. The contestants were styled by internationally renowned designers Sadiq Raza, Prashant Majumdar, Vishnu, Ashfaq Khan, Arif Khan, and Ranu Beniwal, whose creations added grandeur to the show.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Expert Makeup and Styling Partners</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Makeup and makeovers were expertly handled by Yugal Dubey, Badal, Meenakshi Sharma, Mandakini, and Atithi Kesharwani from Lakm&eacute; Academy Jaipur. Special appearances by Zinat Bano (Zinnatiya) and Saniya Ali (Makeup by Saniya Ali) further enhanced the glamour of the evening.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Continues Its Rise as an Industry Leader</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With its consistent success in organizing grand-scale events and its growing global recognition, Forever Star India has firmly established itself as a leading name in the beauty pageant industry. The organization&rsquo;s commitment to innovation, participant empowerment, and digital excellence continues to drive its remarkable progress and industry dominance.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-25 : 10:01:13'),
(662, 25, 'Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5 Dazzles at Zee Studio, Jaipur', 21, 53, 1, '8,15,18,22,104,230', 'assets/img/blog/1769509117.png', 'Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5', '', '', '', '', 'miss-india-grand-finale-2025', 'Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5 Dazzles at Zee Studio, Jaipur', 'forever star india, forever miss india winners 2025, forever miss india 2025, zee studio events jaipur, state winners miss india 2025, city winners miss india 2025, beauty pageant india, glamour and fashion event, shie lobo, forever miss india grand final', 'Forever Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5 at Zee Studio Jaipur showcased talent from across India. Niharika Betanpalli won the crown, with state and city winners celebrated, under Forever Star India’s guidance.', 'Forever Star India ', 'Forever Miss India Winners 2025', 'Glamour and Fashion Event', ' Shie Lobo', ' Forever Miss India Grand Finale Season 5 ', 'Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5 Dazzles at Zee Studio, Jaipur', 'https://newsforever.in/miss-india-grand-finale-2025', 'Forever Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5 at Zee Studio Jaipur showcased talent from across India. Niharika Betanpalli won the crown, with state and city winners celebrated, under Forever Star India’s guidance.', 'assets/img/blog/1769509138.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Night of Glamour and Fashion</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">When contestants from every state of India walked the ramp in stunning outfits, the evening at Zee Studio became a spectacular celebration of glamour, talent, and confidence. The event marked the Forever Miss India 2025 Grand Finale Season 5, organized by Forever Star India, showcasing exceptional creativity and poise. Niharika Betanpalli from Karnataka was crowned <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\">Forever Miss India 2025</a>, while Triya Singh from Uttar Pradesh earned the title of First Runner-Up, and Priyanshi Raj Singh from Uttarakhand was declared Second Runner-Up.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>State Title Winners Shine Nationwide</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Forever Miss India State 2025 winners represented talent from across the country, including Vaibhavi Rai (Uttar Pradesh), Shineka Manivannan (Tamil Nadu), Pallavi Kumari (Bihar), Poonam Mahra (Jharkhand), Ayushi Dhengula (Telangana), Pratiksha Naskar (Maharashtra), Sutariya Nivedi Jitendrabhai (Gujarat), Archana Prasad (Kerala), Harleen Kaur Bagga (Madhya Pradesh), Simran Tomar (Delhi), Gamana Sathwika (Andhra Pradesh), Sunita Bai (Odisha), Prastuti Baruah (Assam), Natasha Middha (Rajasthan), and Sandhya Linga (Karnataka). Runner-Up titles included Jayanti Kumari (Jharkhand), Shivani Rambhau Suryavanshi (Maharashtra), Deepika Nandini (Andhra Pradesh), Rashmi Arya (Uttar Pradesh Second Runner-Up), Anshika Gupta (Uttar Pradesh First Runner-Up), and Nikita Ambilpur (Telangana Runner-Up).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>City-Level Winners Highlight Local Talent</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MHYQNfkd/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-27-at-11-00-06-AM-(2).jpg\" style=\"height:725px; width:1280px\" /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">At the city level, winners included Shilpa Bhagania (Pathankot), Kuyasha Mukherjee (Durgapur), Simran Sahota (Amritsar), Muskan Indora (Panchkula), Annu Kumari (Ghaziabad), Rajeshree R. Netalkar (Karwar), and Mansi Rana (North East Delhi), emphasizing the depth of talent emerging from across India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Professional Training and Digital Excellence</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder Rajesh Agarwal stated that Forever Star India is unique in providing participants with comprehensive training, enabling them to excel not only in fashion and glamour but also in professional pursuits. Each contestant receives a unique digital ID, promoted by digital experts to secure top Google rankings, enhancing visibility and credibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Creative Direction and Styling</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The choreography and direction were led by renowned choreographer Shie Lobo, supported by Uttam Bhagat, Veenu Mishra, and supermodel Parul Mishra. International designers such as Sadiq Raza, Prashant Majumdar, Vishnu, Ashfaq Khan, Arif Khan, and Ranu Beniwal styled the models in breathtaking ensembles. Makeup and makeovers were expertly handled by Yugal Dubey, Badal, Meenakshi Sharma, Mandakini, and Atithi Kesharwani from Lakm&eacute; Academy Jaipur, with special appearances by Zinat Bano (Zinnatiya) and Saniya Ali (Makeup by Saniya Ali).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India&rsquo;s Continued Global Recognition</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With consistent success in organizing grand-scale events, Forever Star India has grown to occupy a leading position in the beauty pageant industry. Its commitment to innovation, training, and digital excellence has made it a top platform for grooming confident, talented participants while achieving global recognition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-26 : 11:01:39'),
(663, 25, 'Silver Prices Poised for a Massive Rally from March: Astro Raj\'s Prediction', 40, 105, 1, '47,51,67,239,240,241,242', 'assets/img/blog/1769586288.png', 'Astro Raj\'s Prediction ', '', '', '', '', 'silver-prices-rally-march-astro-raj-prediction', 'Silver Prices Poised for a Massive Rally from March: Astro Raj\'s Prediction ', 'silver price prediction, silver price forecast march, astro raj silver prediction, rajesh agarwal astrology, silver market outlook, precious metals astrology, silver rally forecast, silver resistance level 3.75 lakh, astrology silver prices, commodity ast', 'Silver prices may see a strong rally from March as Astro Raj predicts bullish momentum. Astrology and technical indicators point to a potential breakout above ₹3.75 lakh.', 'Silver Price Prediction', 'Silver Price Forecast March', 'Astro Raj Silver Prediction', 'Astrology Silver Prices,', 'Astro Raj Rajesh Agarwal', 'Silver Prices Poised for a Massive Rally from March: Astro Raj\'s Prediction ', 'https://newsforever.in/silver-prices-rally-march-astro-raj-prediction', 'Silver prices may see a strong rally from March as Astro Raj predicts bullish momentum. Astrology and technical indicators point to a potential breakout above ₹3.75 lakh.', 'assets/img/blog/1769586303.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Silver Shows Renewed Momentum After Recent Surge</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">After exhibiting strong upward momentum in recent weeks, silver has once again captured the attention of investors. The precious metal has already shown a remarkable rally, signaling renewed strength in the commodities market. Market participants are closely monitoring silver&#39;s trajectory as it consolidates near a crucial resistance level after its recent surge.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Key Resistance Level in Focus</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">According to market observations, silver is approaching a significant technical zone. The ₹3.75 lakh level (per kilogram) is emerging as a critical resistance, and a decisive breakout above this mark could pave the way for a rapid upward movement. Analysts believe that sustained buying interest and favorable global cues are supporting silver&#39;s bullish structure.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astro Raj&#39;s Astrological Forecast: A Major Rally Ahead</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/tgQVY3H3/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-27-at-5-21-46-PM.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Renowned astrologer Astro Raj (Rajesh Agarwal) has made a significant prediction regarding silver&#39;s future trajectory using astrology-based market analysis. According to Astro Raj, silver is expected to witness a massive rally from March due to favorable planetary positions. He predicts that silver will soon surpass the ₹3.75 lakh level and move towards new all-time highs in the coming period.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astrology Indicates Strong Support for Precious Metals</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Astro Raj explains that the upcoming planetary transits are highly supportive of precious metals, especially silver. From an astrological perspective, the positions of key planets indicate sustained demand, increased volatility, and a sharp rise in prices. He suggests that this period could benefit long-term investors and traders who position themselves strategically.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>What this means for investors</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With technical indicators aligning with astrological predictions, silver appears well-positioned for a strong rally. Investors are advised to closely monitor prices around the ₹3.75 level, as a breakout could confirm the start of a new bullish cycle. As always, experts recommend combining market analysis with risk management for better decision-making.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-27 : 08:01:35');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(664, 25, 'Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5 Celebrates Fashion and Confidence at Zee Studio', 21, 42, 1, '8,18,20,22,85,230,234', 'assets/img/blog/1769595184.png', 'Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5', '', '', '', '', 'mrs-india-grand-finale-zee-studio', 'Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5 Celebrates Fashion and Confidence at Zee Studio', ' mrs. india grand finale 2025, forever star india, zee studio jaipur,  mrs. india winners 2025, beauty pageant india, mrs. india grand finale season 5, fashion designers at forever mrs. india, choreographer shie lobo, mrs. india beauty pageant, forever mr', 'Forever Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5 at Zee Studio, Jaipur, showcased talent, glamour, and elegance. Winners from G1, G2, and state titles were honored, highlighting Forever Star India’s excellence in training and pageantry.', 'Mrs. India Grand Finale 2025', 'Mrs. India Winners 2025', 'Zee Studio Mrs. India Event', 'Forever Mrs. India City Title', 'Forever Star India', 'Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5 Celebrates Fashion and Confidence at Zee Studio', 'https://newsforever.in/mrs-india-grand-finale-zee-studio', 'Forever Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5 at Zee Studio, Jaipur, showcased talent, glamour, and elegance. Winners from G1, G2, and state titles were honored, highlighting Forever Star India’s excellence in training and pageantry.', 'assets/img/blog/1769595199.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5 Shines at Zee Studio, Jaipur</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The grand finale of Forever Mrs. India Grand Finale Season 5, organized by Forever Star India, illuminated the stage of Zee Studio with glamour, elegance, and remarkable talent. Participants from across India represented their respective states, showcasing confidence, grace, and excellence while competing for the prestigious Forever Mrs. India crown.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Winners Announced Across G1 and G2 Categories</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">From Jharkhand, Anjali Sinha emerged victorious as Forever Mrs. India 2025 (G1 Category), while Bhumika Songra from Madhya Pradesh clinched the Forever Mrs. India 2025 title in the G2 Category.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In the runner-up positions, Priya Yogesh Chaudhary from Maharashtra secured the Runner-Up title in G1, whereas Anupama Sharma from Chandigarh was crowned First Runner-Up in G2. Additionally, Khushboo Singh from Maharashtra earned the title of Second Runner-Up in the G2 category.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>State Title Winners Honored Across India</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cLsVKy6r/34ea52d0-f690-4151-b585-6a7432e0df56.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder Rajesh Agarwal and Director Jaya Chauhan of Forever Star India shared that participants from different states were honored with <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-mrs-india-new.php\">Forever Mrs. India</a> State Titles, celebrating regional talent and cultural diversity across the country. In the G1 category, the state title winners included Janhvi Jasmine from Jharkhand, Shweta Vishwakarma as First Runner-Up and Shubhoshree Roy as Second Runner-Up from Jharkhand, Leena Aswani from Rajasthan, Jaya Chauhan as Runner-Up from Rajasthan, Swati Bhatt from Uttarakhand, Mansi Ranjit Pawar from Maharashtra, Kanchana M from Tamil Nadu, Nidhi from Haryana, and Anuradha</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Roy from Bihar. In addition to these honors, special regional titles were awarded to Sadhana Kumari, who was crowned Forever Mrs. Bokaro 2025, and Joshna Tamang, who received the title of Forever Mrs. Kalimpong, further highlighting the platform&rsquo;s commitment to recognizing talent from every corner of India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In the G2 Category, the Forever Mrs. India State Winners showcased remarkable talent from across the country. The winners included Kavita Adangle from Maharashtra, Neetu Bagare from Uttarakhand, Chandralekha from Telangana, Shilpa Gadre from Karnataka, Suparna Saha from West Bengal, Runi Singh from Jharkhand, and Meenakshi from Rajasthan, reflecting the diverse representation and nationwide reach of the Forever Mrs. India platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Platform Beyond Glamour: Vision of Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Founder Rajesh Agarwal emphasized that Forever Star India stands apart as the only beauty pageant platform offering in-depth, professional training. He stated that participants are groomed not only for glamour and fashion but also to excel confidently in diverse professional fields.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Each contestant is provided with a unique digital ID, which is strategically promoted by digital experts to achieve strong visibility and top rankings on Google, ensuring long-term personal branding.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Renowned Choreography, Designers, and Makeup Excellence</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The choreography and direction of the Forever Universe and India Grand Finale were led by renowned choreographer Shie Lobo, supported by his talented team including Uttam Bhagat,</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Veenu Mishra, and Supermodel Parul Mishra.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Internationally acclaimed designers Sadiq Raza, Prashant Majumdar, Vishnu, Ashfaq Khan, Arif Khan, and Ranu Beniwal showcased breathtaking collections that elevated the glamour quotient of the event.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The stunning makeovers were executed by makeup experts Yugal Dubey, Badal, Meenakshi Sharma, Mandakini, and Atithi Kesharwani from Lakm&eacute; Academy Jaipur, along with notable contributions from Zinat Bano (Zinnatiya) and Saniya Ali (Makeup by Saniya Ali).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India: A Trusted Global Name</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With its consistent success in organizing award ceremonies and beauty pageants and its growing global recognition, Forever Star India has firmly established itself as a trusted and respected name in the beauty and fashion industry, setting new benchmarks year after year.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-28 : 12:01:12'),
(665, 25, 'National Achievers Honored for Excellence, Leadership, and Social Impact', 23, 0, 1, '30,31,94,100,102,193', 'assets/img/blog/1769663824.png', 'Forever Star National Achievers ', '', '', '', '', 'prestigious-national-achievers-award-india', 'National Achievers Honored for Excellence, Leadership, and Social Impact', 'national achievers award, excellence and leadership awards, social impact awards india, prestigious award ceremony, indian achievers, leadership recognition india, women achievers india, social impact leaders, national recognition awards, inspiring indian', 'National achievers from across India were honored at a prestigious award ceremony for excellence, leadership, and social impact across diverse fields.', 'National Achievers Award', 'Excellence and Leadership Awards', 'Social Impact Awards India', 'National Recognition Awards', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'National Achievers Honored for Excellence, Leadership, and Social Impact', 'https://newsforever.in/prestigious-national-achievers-award-india', 'National achievers from across India were honored at a prestigious award ceremony for excellence, leadership, and social impact across diverse fields.', 'assets/img/blog/1769663996.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Distinguished Personalities from Across India Recognized at a Prestigious Award Ceremony</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A prestigious award ceremony was held to recognize outstanding individuals from across India for their remarkable achievements, leadership, and contributions to society. The event celebrated excellence across diverse fields, honoring individuals whose dedication, innovation, and service have made a lasting impact in their respective domains.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The ceremony brought together achievers from professions such as entrepreneurship, law, healthcare, spirituality, education, social service, arts, and national service, reflecting the true spirit of inspiration and empowerment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Honoring India&rsquo;s Most Influential Achievers</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/GhJNQrp3/0a3b2071-7f1f-4292-a974-8e804a65ffca.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The honored awardees included Palapala Bharti, Neetu Rudrakshi Jharotia, Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala, Meghana Tarawade, Kunjal Vira, Vishakha Mule, Deepti, Rohit Pitambar Wallujwar, Sanwar Singh Rawat, Sabitha Sriram, Sudeepthi Somireddy, Mehul Sinh, Ishwari, Adv. Veebha Singh, Astrologer Sandeep Shastri, Anamika Gupta, Amrita Singh, Dr. Sona Valecha, Rajni Jain, Usha Malviya, Major Priti, and Annisha D. Poria.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Each awardee was recognized for their exceptional journey, professional excellence, and unwavering commitment to creating positive change within society. Their achievements stand as inspiring examples of perseverance, integrity, leadership, and dedication, reflecting the spirit of excellence and social responsibility celebrated at the prestigious ceremony.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Celebration of Purpose, Passion, and Progress</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The award ceremony served as a platform to acknowledge individuals who have gone beyond personal success to uplift communities and inspire future generations. Their work continues to influence lives, drive innovation, and strengthen social values across the nation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">By honoring achievers from varied backgrounds on a single platform, the event highlighted unity in diversity and celebrated the collective strength of individuals working toward national progress.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring the Future Through Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The event concluded with a strong message of inspiration, emphasizing the importance of recognizing real-life role models who lead with purpose and compassion. The ceremony not only celebrated achievements but also reinforced the belief that dedication and integrity can create meaningful and lasting change.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-28 : 01:01:55'),
(666, 25, 'Astro Raj\'s Prediction Through Astrology: Gold Set to Reach New Record Highs', 40, 105, 0, '47,51,73,76,243,244,245,246,247', 'assets/img/blog/1769841566.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'astro-raj-gold-prediction-new-record-highs', 'Astro Raj\'s Prediction Through Astrology: Gold Set to Reach New Record Highs', 'astro raj gold prediction, gold price forecast, gold astrology prediction, gold new highs, gold market analysis, gold price today, astrology market prediction, gold rally forecast, precious metals astrology, rajesh agarwal astrologer', 'Astro Raj predicts gold prices may break ₹1.75 lakh and hit new record highs, with a short-term correction expected between Jan 29 and 5 Feb.', 'Astro Raj Gold Prediction ', 'Gold Price Forecast', 'Gold Rally Forecast', 'Precious Metals Astrology', 'Rajesh Agarwal Astrologer', 'Astro Raj\'s Prediction Through Astrology: Gold Set to Reach New Record Highs', 'https://newsforever.in/astro-raj-gold-prediction-new-record-highs', 'Astro Raj predicts gold prices may break ₹1.75 lakh and hit new record highs, with a short-term correction expected between Jan 29 and 5 Feb.', 'assets/img/blog/1769841577.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Gold Poised for A&nbsp;Breakout Above Key Levels</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">According to renowned astrologer Astro Raj (Rajesh Agarwal), gold prices are expected to witness a strong rally in the coming weeks. Based on his astrological market analysis, Astro Raj predicts that gold will soon surpass the crucial ₹1.75 lakh level, paving the way for new all-time highs in the precious metals market.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astrological Indicators Signal Strength in Gold</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Hxy5jjFw/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-28-at-12-54-14-PM.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Astro Raj explains that favorable planetary positions are supporting the long-term bullish trend in gold. According to astrological predictions, the movement of key planets associated with wealth and commodities indicates increasing momentum and sustained investor confidence in gold. These cosmic signals point towards a fresh rally after a decisive break above major resistance levels.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Short-Term Correction Expected Between </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">January 29th and February 5th</span></span></span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">While the broader outlook remains positive, Astro Raj also highlights a potential short-term price correction. According to his astrological calculations, gold prices may experience a temporary dip or profit-taking between January 29th and February 5th. This phase could present strategic buying opportunities for investors before the next leg of the rally begins.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>What Investors Should Watch Closely</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Experts suggest that investors should closely monitor the price behavior of gold around the ₹1.75 lakh level, as a decisive breakout could confirm the start of a strong rally. By combining Astro Raj&#39;s astrology-based insights with technical and fundamental analysis, investors can make informed decisions in the volatile market environment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-28 : 07:01:31'),
(667, 25, 'West Bengal Election Prediction 2026: Astrologer Astro Raj Foresees Major Political Change', 40, 105, 1, '47,248,249,250,251,252', 'assets/img/blog/1769685046.png', 'West Bengal Election Prediction 2026', '', '', '', '', 'astro-raj-west-bengal-election-2026-prediction', 'West Bengal Election Prediction 2026: Astrologer Astro Raj Foresees Major Political Change', 'west bengal election 2026, west bengal election prediction, astro raj prediction, bjp government west bengal, west bengal politics, astrology election prediction, political astrology India, bengal assembly election 2026, bjp victory prediction, astro raj ', 'Astrologer Astro Raj predicts a major political shift in West Bengal Election 2026, indicating BJP’s rise to power based on astrological analysis.', 'West Bengal Election 2026', 'West Bengal Election Prediction', 'BJP Government West Bengal', 'Bengal Assembly Election 2026', 'Astro Raj Rajesh Agarwal', 'West Bengal Election Prediction 2026: Astrologer Astro Raj Foresees Major Political Change', 'https://newsforever.in/astro-raj-west-bengal-election-2026-prediction', 'Astrologer Astro Raj predicts a major political shift in West Bengal Election 2026, indicating BJP’s rise to power based on astrological analysis.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1769685131.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astrological Prediction Hints at Major Change in West Bengal Politics</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">According to renowned astrologer Astro Raj, a major political upheaval is expected in the upcoming West Bengal assembly elections. Based on a detailed astrological analysis, he has predicted a significant shift in the state&#39;s political landscape that could surprise many observers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>BJP Likely to Form the Next Government</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Astro Raj has predicted that the Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) is likely to emerge victorious and form the next government in West Bengal. His prediction suggests that the planetary positions indicate a change in power, pointing towards strong public support for the BJP during the elections.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astro Raj&#39;s Analysis Based on Planetary Movements</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/sxDVVk5w/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-28-at-1-07-43-PM.jpg\" /></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Sharing insights from his astrological analysis, Astro Raj stated that the current planetary positions and upcoming transits are highly favorable for a political change in the state. He believes these celestial signs indicate growing momentum for the BJP and a weakening phase for the ruling party.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prediction Creates Buzz in Political Circles</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Astro Raj&#39;s prediction has sparked discussions in political and public circles, especially as the West Bengal elections are being closely watched across the country. While election results ultimately depend on the voters, such astrological predictions often garner attention during significant political moments.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-29 : 01:01:51'),
(668, 25, 'National Awardee 2025: India’s Super Heroes and Super Women Felicitated', 23, 82, 1, '30,31,138,139,140,141', 'assets/img/blog/1770374661.png', 'National Awardee 2025', '', '', '', '', 'national-awardee-2025', 'National Awardee 2025: India’s Super Heroes and Super Women Felicitated', ' national awardee 2025, super heroes of india, super women of india, national awards india, social impact awards, leadership excellence, women achievers india, infinity achiever award, super hero award, super woman award, indian achievers, excellence and ', 'National Awardee 2025 honors India’s Super Heroes and Super Women for excellence, leadership, innovation, and impactful contributions to society.', 'National Awardee 2025', 'National Awards India', 'Indian Achievers', 'Excellence and Innovation Awards', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'National Awardee 2025: India’s Super Heroes and Super Women Felicitated', 'https://newsforever.in/national-awardee-2025', 'National Awardee 2025 honors India’s Super Heroes and Super Women for excellence, leadership, innovation, and impactful contributions to society.', 'assets/img/blog/1770374677.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">India witnessed a proud and inspiring moment as the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>National Awardee 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> ceremony honored exceptional individuals recognized as the nation&rsquo;s real </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Heroes and Super Women</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. The prestigious recognition celebrated achievers from diverse backgrounds who have demonstrated excellence, leadership, and a strong commitment to social impact.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Palapala Bharti</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was honored for her remarkable contribution to society through her dedication, perseverance, and inspiring journey. Her work reflects resilience and purpose, making her a true role model for aspiring individuals across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Neetu Rudrakshi Jharotia</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> received the National Award for her outstanding leadership and professional excellence. Her consistent efforts and impactful initiatives have set new benchmarks in her field, earning her national recognition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Meghana Tarawade</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was felicitated for her commitment to empowerment and positive change. Her journey stands as an example of how passion combined with discipline can create meaningful social influence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Kunjal Vira</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was recognized as a Super Woman Awardee for her dedication, innovation, and contribution toward uplifting communities. Her work continues to inspire confidence and progress among many.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Vishakha Mule</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> earned the honor for her unwavering determination and impactful presence in her professional domain. Her achievements highlight the importance of integrity, hard work, and vision.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Rohit Pitambar Wallujwar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was awarded as a Super Hero for his leadership qualities and consistent efforts toward societal betterment. His journey reflects courage, responsibility, and commitment to excellence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Sona Valecha</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was felicitated for her exceptional service and professional achievements. Her contribution stands as a symbol of dedication, compassion, and excellence in her respective field.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Annisha D. Poria</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was honored as an </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Infinity Achiever</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> at the National Awardee 2025 ceremony, recognizing her limitless vision, exceptional dedication, and impactful contribution that continues to inspire growth, excellence, and positive change.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/CKsmCDTK/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-31-at-12-52-54-PM.jpg\" style=\"height:209px; width:350px\" /></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Amrita Singh</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was honored for her remarkable contribution and leadership qualities. Her consistent efforts toward progress and empowerment have earned her a place among India&rsquo;s distinguished achievers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sudeepthi Somireddy</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was recognized for her excellence, innovation, and dedication to social responsibility. Her work continues to motivate and influence the next generation of leaders.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> received the prestigious award for her impactful journey and professional accomplishments. Her dedication and vision have made a significant difference in her domain.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Adv. Veebha Singh</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was honored for her outstanding contribution, legal excellence, and commitment to justice and social awareness. Her recognition highlights the role of strong leadership and ethical responsibility in nation-building.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>National Awardee 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> ceremony not only celebrated individual achievements but also reinforced the importance of recognizing real-life heroes who contribute selflessly to society. The event stood as a powerful reminder that dedication, integrity, and passion are the true foundations of national progress.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-01-30 : 12:01:19'),
(669, 25, 'Infinity Achievers Award 2025 Goes to Rajahmundry-Based Artist Sudeepthi Somireddy', 23, 106, 1, '29,30,31,93,94,183', 'assets/img/blog/1770371937.png', 'Infinity Achiever Award ', '', '', '', '', 'rajahmundry-artist-sudeepthi-somireddy-award-2025', 'Infinity Achievers Award 2025 Goes to Rajahmundry-Based Artist Sudeepthi Somireddy', 'infinity achievers award 2025, sudeepthi somireddy, rajahmundry artist, aysa arts, indian contemporary artist, scribble art, conceptual artwork, women artists in india, forever star india award, artist from andhra pradesh', 'Rajahmundry-based artist Sudeepthi Somireddy receives the Infinity Achievers Award 2025 for her outstanding contribution to art, creativity, and visual expression.', 'Sudeepthi Somireddy', 'Rajahmundry Artist', 'Aysa Arts', 'Conceptual Artwork', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Infinity Achievers Award 2025 Goes to Rajahmundry-Based Artist Sudeepthi Somireddy', 'https://newsforever.in/rajahmundry-artist-sudeepthi-somireddy-award-2025', 'Rajahmundry-based artist Sudeepthi Somireddy receives the Infinity Achievers Award 2025 for her outstanding contribution to art, creativity, and visual expression.', 'assets/img/blog/1770372557.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Rajahmundry, Andhra Pradesh &ndash; A Proud Moment for the Local Art Community</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Rajahmundry-based artist and IT professional Sudeepthi Somireddy has been honored with the celebrated </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Infinity Achievers Award 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India, recognizing her outstanding contribution to art and creative expression. The award celebrates her dedication, originality, and ability to translate emotions into compelling visual narratives, earning her popularity on a national platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Blending Technology and Creativity with Purpose</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With a B.Tech degree and over 16 years of experience in the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>IT industry</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Sudeepthi&rsquo;s journey is a powerful instance of balancing professional excellence with artistic passion. For more than a decade, she has consistently pursued artwork alongside her corporate career, developing a completely unique style that consists of conceptual artwork, expressive themes, and detailed scribble work that resonates deeply with viewers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Aysa Arts &ndash; A Creative Identity with Global Reach</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Through her creative brand </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Aysa Arts</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Sudeepthi has set up a robust artistic identity. Her artworks have been showcased in private collections, restaurants, and professional spaces across multiple countries, reflecting her developing worldwide presence. In addition to growing art, she actively contributes to art education by undertaking workshops and guest lectures at colleges and international schools, inspiring aspiring artists to explore creativity fearlessly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Early Recognition and Continued Artistic Growth</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Born and raised in Rajahmundry, Sudeepthi&rsquo;s ardour for art turned into glaring from a young age and nurtured by her family. Her early achievement as a finalist in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&ldquo;The Hindu&rdquo; All India Painting Competition</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> marked a widespread milestone in her journey. The</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong> <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/infinity-achievers\">Infinity Achievers Award</a> 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> stands as a testament to her perseverance, skills, and commitment to artistic excellence, celebrating her ongoing impact inside the creative world.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-02-06 : 12:02:20'),
(670, 25, 'National Awardee : Celebrating Super Women, Super Heroes & Nominee Leaders', 23, 82, 1, '29,31,94,102,185,196', 'assets/img/blog/1770634318.png', 'National Achiever Award ', '', '', '', '', 'national-award-achievers', 'National Awardee : Celebrating Super Women, Super Heroes & Nominee Leaders', 'national awardee 2025, national awardee 2026, super woman awardee 2025, super woman awardee 2026, super hero awardee 2025, super hero awardee 2026, infinity achiever awardee 2025, forever star india award nominee 2026, national achievers India, leadership', 'National Awardee 2025 & 2026 honors Super Women, Super Heroes, and nominee leaders for excellence, courage, leadership, and social impact across India.', 'National Awardee 2025', 'National Awardee 2026', 'Leadership Awards India', 'Women Empowerment Awards', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'National Awardee : Celebrating Super Women, Super Heroes & Nominee Leaders', 'https://newsforever.in/national-award-achievers', 'National Awardee 2025 & 2026 honors Super Women, Super Heroes, and nominee leaders for excellence, courage, leadership, and social impact across India.', 'assets/img/blog/1770634803.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>City, India &ndash; Honoring Inspiration, Courage and Impact</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>National Awardee 2025 &amp; 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> initiative has honoured an exceptional group of people in a remarkable display of talent, service, and societal contribution. This prestigious platform celebrates achievers from diverse fields whose work has made a meaningful impact on communities and inspired others to strive for excellence.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Major Priti, a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Award Nominee 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> who embodies commitment, leadership, and self-motivated success, is one of this year&#39;s esteemed honourees. Her nomination highlights a journey marked by resilience and service, motivating others to pursue personal growth and societal contribution.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Women Awardees 2025 &amp; 2026</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A number of inspiring women have been recognized for their exceptional accomplishments and leadership:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Deepti Anand</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Woman Awardee 2026, celebrated for her impactful work and dedication to empowering others.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Ishwari Gopal Shah</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Woman Awardee 2026, honored for her resilience and influential journey.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Rajni Jain</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Woman Awardee 2026, recognized for her remarkable contribution to community upliftment.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Usha Malviya</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Woman Awardee 2026, applauded for her commitment to leadership and positive change.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Anamika Gupta</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Woman Awardee 2025, noted for her creative excellence and inspiring initiatives.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/9FSJBVGF/Whats-App-Image-2026-02-09-at-5-21-41-PM.jpg\" style=\"height:203px; width:340px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Hero Awardees 2025 &amp; 2026</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The initiative also celebrates individuals whose courage and service mirror heroic determination:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sanwar Singh Rawat</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Hero Awardee 2025, acknowledged for his outstanding service and impactful leadership.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astrologer Sandeep Shastri</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Hero Awardee 2025, recognized for his guidance and support to individuals across life challenges.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Mehul Sinh</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> &ndash; Super Hero Awardee 2026, honored for his unwavering dedication and positive community influence.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Outstanding Achievement Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In addition to these honors, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sabitha Sriram</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has been bestowed with the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/infinity-achievers\">Infinity Achiever</a> Awardee 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, celebrating her exemplary achievements and enduring impact in her field. This year&rsquo;s awardees reflect a blend of empowerment, courage, innovation, and leadership - inspiring stories of triumph that resonate across India and beyond.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-02-09 : 01:02:55');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(671, 25, 'Sanwar Singh Rawat Honored with Super Hero Award 2025 for Leadership & Tourism Excellence', 23, 102, 1, '29,31,93,94,97', 'assets/img/blog/1770710930.png', 'Super Hero Award 2025', '', '', '', '', 'sanwar-singh-rawat-tourism-leadership', 'Sanwar Singh Rawat Honored with Super Hero Award 2025 for Leadership & Tourism Excellence', 'sanwar singh rawat, super hero award 2025, ssr hospitalities, tourism leader in pushkar, hospitality excellence rajasthan, best tour operator pushkar, cultural tourism india, tourism awards 2025', 'Sanwar Singh Rawat, Founder of SSR Hospitalities, receives the Super Hero Award 2025 for excellence in tourism, hospitality leadership, and destination promotion in Pushkar, Rajasthan.', 'Super Hero Award 2025', 'Tourism Leader in Pushkar', 'SSR Hospitalities', 'Best Tur Operator Pushkar', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Sanwar Singh Rawat Honored with Super Hero Award 2025 for Leadership & Tourism Excellence', 'https://newsforever.in/sanwar-singh-rawat-tourism-leadership', 'Sanwar Singh Rawat, Founder of SSR Hospitalities, receives the Super Hero Award 2025 for excellence in tourism, hospitality leadership, and destination promotion in Pushkar, Rajasthan.', 'assets/img/blog/1770716427.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Pushkar, Rajasthan &ndash; Celebrating Visionary Leadership in Tourism &amp; Hospitality</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Sanwar Singh Rawat, a distinguished name in the Indian tourism and hospitality ecosystem, has been conferred with the prestigious </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Hero Award 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, honoring his superb contributions to cultural tourism, destination promotion, and carrier excellence in Pushkar, Rajasthan. Recognized as a visionary leader, he&#39;s the Founder and Owner of SSR Hospitalities, one of the most respected tours and tour manufacturers inside the vicinity, recognized for turning in first-class carriers and unforgettable reviews to travelers from across India and abroad.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Sanwar Singh Rawat&rsquo;s journey reflects a deep commitment to promoting Pushkar as a premium cultural, spiritual, and tour destination. His professional approach blends Indian tradition with modern tourism requirements, creating meaningful experiences that go beyond simple travel. His work in tourism operations, guest relations, and destination branding has significantly strengthened Pushkar&rsquo;s reputation on both national and international platforms.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/6qGwRc5m/Whats-App-Image-2026-02-10-at-12-31-56-PM.jpg\" style=\"height:187px; width:350px\" /></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Excellence in Tourism &amp; Hospitality Management</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Under his leadership, SSR Hospitalities has earned recognition for excellence in hospitality management, tourism operations, and cultural outreach. Sanwar Singh Rawat has actively participated in prestigious events such as the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">India International Travel Mart (IITM)</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Bengal Tourism Fest</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> (2024 &amp; 2025), showcasing the rich cultural heritage and tourism potential of Pushkar to wider audiences. His award of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\">Super Hero Award</a> 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> celebrates not only his business acumen but also his dedication to uplifting the travel community and enhancing visitor experiences in Rajasthan.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Beyond professional success, Sanwar Singh Rawat&rsquo;s contributions include advocacy for sustainable tourism practices and ethical service standards. His recognition as a Super Hero Award 2025 recipient highlights his influence as a leader whose work inspires peers and young professionals in the industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Future Changemakers</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Sanwar Singh Rawat&rsquo;s award reinforces his position as a role model in the tourism sector - a professional who bridges cultural heritage with modern hospitality excellence. His story underscores the importance of passion, vision, and dedication in shaping thriving tourism destinations like Pushkar, where tradition and innovation coexist to create lasting memories for visitors.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-02-09 : 10:02:19'),
(672, 25, 'AI Risk and Cybersecurity Leader Sabitha Sriram Receives Prestigious Infinity Achiever Award', 23, 106, 1, '29,31,93,180,183', 'assets/img/blog/1771071527.png', 'Indian Achiever Award 2025', '', '', '', '', 'ai-service-provider-chennai-2025', 'AI Risk and Cybersecurity Leader Sabitha Sriram Receives Prestigious Infinity Achiever Award', 'sabitha sriram, ai expert risk department in chennai, infinity achiever award 2025, artificial intelligence services in chennai, ai risk management chennai, cybersecurity consultant chennai, ai service providers in chennai, best ai services in chennai, et', 'Sabitha Sriram receives the Infinity Achiever Award 2025 as Best AI Expert Risk Department in Chennai for excellence in AI Risk Management and Cybersecurity.', 'AI Expert Risk Department in Chennai', 'Infinity Achiever Award 2025', 'Technology Risk Consultant Chennai', 'AI and Cybersecurity Leader Chennai', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'AI Risk and Cybersecurity Leader Sabitha Sriram Receives Prestigious Infinity Achiever Award', 'https://newsforever.in/ai-service-provider-chennai-2025', 'Sabitha Sriram receives the Infinity Achiever Award 2025 as Best AI Expert Risk Department in Chennai for excellence in AI Risk Management and Cybersecurity.', 'assets/img/blog/1771071550.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>National Recognition for AI Excellence</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Chennai, Tamil Nadu &ndash; Sabitha Sriram, renowned AI expert in the Risk Department in Chennai, has been honored with the prestigious </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Infinity Achiever Award</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> 2025 by Forever Star India. Recognized for delivering the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>best AI services in Chennai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Sabita&#39;s decade-long contribution to AI risk management, cyber security management and ethical AI innovation has made her one of the leading AI service providers in Chennai.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Decade of Leadership in Artificial Intelligence Services in Chennai</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With over 10 years of excellence, Sabita specializes in AI services in Chennai, focusing on technology risk assessment, AI ethics, cyber security frameworks and sustainable digital transformation. Her strategic advisory work spans sectors such as agriculture, renewable energy and environmental monitoring, where she integrates AI-driven solutions with responsible governance practices.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Strengthening Cybersecurity and Ethical AI Governance</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Infinity Achiever Award 2025 recognizes their continued efforts to connect innovation with ethics. As a security and technology risk consultant, Sabita emphasizes transparency, human-centered AI design, and compliance-driven cybersecurity solutions. Their recognition as the best risk department for AI experts in Chennai reflects their commitment to helping organizations adopt secure and sustainable AI systems.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>From Technology Leader to National Icon</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Beyond generation, Sabitha is also celebrated as Ms India 2025 and Ms Digital Eco Queen 2025, using her influence to promote environmental attention and virtual empowerment. The <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/infinity-achievers\">Infinity Achiever Award</a> 2025 similarly strengthens her position as a visionary leader in Artificial Intelligence Services in Chennai and amongst top </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>AI Service Providers in Chennai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Driving the Future of Responsible AI in Chennai</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Industry experts note that the Infinity Achiever Award 2025 not only honors her technical excellence however additionally her commitment to ethical AI implementation and sustainability. Sabitha Sriram keeps redefining requirements in AI Risk Management and Artificial Intelligence Services in Chennai, inspiring agencies and young specialists to pursue innovation with integrity and lengthy-term impact.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-02-14 : 01:02:26'),
(673, 25, 'Rajni Jain’s 25-Year Leadership Strengthens Siliguri’s Growing IT Ecosystem', 23, 41, 1, '29,31,84,93,94', 'assets/img/blog/1771237047.png', 'Super woman Awardee 2026', '', '', '', '', 'rajni-jain-siliguri-it-ecosystem-growth', 'Rajni Jain’s 25-Year Leadership Strengthens Siliguri’s Growing IT Ecosystem', 'rajni jain, dream computer siliguri, super woman award 2025, siliguri it entrepreneur, women entrepreneur in siliguri, it services in siliguri, cctv solutions siliguri, biometric system provider siliguri, it infrastructure company west bengal, security so', 'Rajni Jain strengthens Siliguri’s IT ecosystem with 25 years of leadership at Dream Computer and is honored with the Super Woman Award 2025.', 'Dream Computer Siliguri', 'Siliguri IT Entrepreneur', 'IT Infrastructure Company West Bengal', 'Super Woman Award', 'Forever Star India Award', 'Rajni Jain’s 25-Year Leadership Strengthens Siliguri’s Growing IT Ecosystem', 'https://newsforever.in/rajni-jain-siliguri-it-ecosystem-growth', 'Rajni Jain strengthens Siliguri’s IT ecosystem with 25 years of leadership at Dream Computer and is honored with the Super Woman Award 2025.', 'assets/img/blog/1771237093.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Visionary Entrepreneur Recognized for Excellence</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Siliguri, West Bengal - Rajni Jain, founder of Dream Computer, has been honored with the distinguished Super Woman Award 2025 for her notable contribution to the region&rsquo;s technology and security sector. As one of the earliest women entrepreneurs to establish an IT business in Siliguri, she has played a pivotal role in building and sustaining the city&rsquo;s digital infrastructure. The Super Woman Award recognizes her 25+&nbsp; years of determination, resilience, and management in a traditionally male-dominated industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Building Siliguri&rsquo;s Digital and Security Infrastructure</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">When Rajni Jain founded Dream Computer, Siliguri was still in the early stages of technological development. With determination and clarity of vision, she expanded her company into an extensive IT and protection answers provider. From IT infrastructure planning to CCTV surveillance systems, biometric attendance answers, and integrated access control systems, her organization has added dependable and scalable offerings. Her commitment to high-quality and moral practices has helped Dream Computer earn long-term trust across businesses, educational institutions, and residential sectors.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Journey of Perseverance and Leadership</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Rajni Jain&rsquo;s journey reflects quiet strength and consistent efforts. In the early years, she personally managed installations, client coordination, and device making plans, gradually constructing her presence inside the neighborhood IT ecosystem. Over time, as digital awareness and security demands grew, Dream Computer evolved into a trusted name. Her recognition through the Super Woman Award highlights not just her business success but also her role as a pioneer woman entrepreneur in Siliguri.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring the Next Generation of Women Entrepreneurs</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Beyond business, Rajni Jain remains passionate about emerging technologies and continuous learning. Her inspiring success story, celebrated with the <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Award</a> 2025, encourages aspiring women entrepreneurs to pursue their ambitions confidently. Through dedication, ethics, and innovation, she continues to shape Siliguri&rsquo;s IT landscape while setting a benchmark for leadership and perseverance.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-02-15 : 10:02:37'),
(674, 25, 'National Achievers Recognition 2026: Super Women and Super Heroes of India', 23, 82, 1, '29,31,84,140,195,208', 'assets/img/blog/1772178236.png', 'National Achiever Awards', '', '', '', '', 'national-achievers-recognition-2026', 'National Achievers Recognition 2026: Super Women and Super Heroes of India', 'national achievers recognition 2026, super woman award, super hero awards, super women and super heroes of india, national civilian awards 2026, india achievers awards, forever star india awards', 'National Achievers Recognition 2026 honors India’s Super Women and Super Heroes for excellence, leadership, innovation, and social impact.', 'National Achievers Recognition 2026', 'Super Woman Award', 'Super Hero Award', 'Indian Achievers Awards', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'National Achievers Recognition 2026: Super Women and Super Heroes of India', 'https://newsforever.in/national-achievers-recognition-2026', 'National Achievers Recognition 2026 honors India’s Super Women and Super Heroes for excellence, leadership, innovation, and social impact.', 'assets/img/blog/1772178247.png', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Grand Celebration of Excellence and Leadership</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The National Achievers Recognition 2026 proudly honored 30 exceptional personalities from across the nation under the distinguished super woman award and <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-hero-award.php\">super hero awards</a> categories. The ceremony celebrated people who have demonstrated excellence, innovation, leadership, and strong social commitment in their respective fields. From entrepreneurship and generation to social provider, spirituality, arts, and governance, the awardees represent the real spirit of modern India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Honoring Excellence Across Diverse Fields</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Among the distinguished honorees, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Neetu Rudrakshi Jharotia (Ajmer)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was recognized for her outstanding contribution as a fiction writer, while </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala (Udaipur)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> earned appreciation as a homemade professional chef. Pune showcased talent through </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Meghana Tarawade</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, numerologist and healer, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Adv. Veebha Singh</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, advocate and legal advisor. Mumbai added pride with </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Kunjal Vira</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, astrologer; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Vishakha Mule</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, model; and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Farzana Sajid</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, chef.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In the spiritual and guidance domain, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Rohit Pitambar Wallujwar (Chandrapur)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Pandit Sandeep Kumar Shastry (Noida)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> were honored for astrology, alongside </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Ishwari Gopal Shah (Bharuch)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for tarot reading and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Sona Valecha (Ahmedabad)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> as an Akashic Record Reader. Tourism and technology were represented by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sanwar Singh Rawat (Pushkar)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> in tour and travel services, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sabitha Sriram (Chennai)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> in AI risk management, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma (Jabalpur)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> as a global visionary in AI defense logistics.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/6qM3fCHb/Whats-App-Image-2026-02-27-at-1-25-47-PM.jpg\" style=\"height:417px; width:700px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Entrepreneurship, Creativity, and Public Service</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Entrepreneurial excellence was celebrated through achievers like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Annisha D Poria (Hyderabad)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Rajni Jain (Siliguri)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Preeti Chauhan (Raipur)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, while </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Mehulsinh Thakore (Vadodara)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> was acknowledged for leading the No.1 EPC solar company. Creativity flourished with </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sudeepthi Somireddy (Rajahmundry)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> as an artist and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Usha Malviya (Pali)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> as a fashion designer.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Public service and community leadership were equally recognized. </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Amrita Singh (Indore)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Sampati Mishra (Sikar)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Gaurav Agarwal (Hojai)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> were honored for impactful social work. </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Pushpa Kukreti (Raipur)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> contributed through financial consultancy, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Hiral Mane (Vadodara)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> empowered lives as a life coach. Government leadership and legal excellence were represented by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Shailja Sharma (Mandi)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Assistant GST Commissioner; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Adv. Uma Anil Bhattad (Nagpur)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">; and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Parmod Mann (Delhi)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for his role in physical education and sexual harassment prevention in Kho-Kho.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring a Nation Through Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The super hero awards and <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">super woman awards</a> categories recognize not only professional achievements but also dedication to nation-building and societal growth. These awardees stand as role models, proving that success can emerge from creativity, service, leadership, innovation, and entrepreneurship.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Through such national recognitions, India continues to celebrate changemakers who inspire communities and shape the future with courage, integrity, and visionary leadership.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-02-26 : 09:02:54'),
(675, 25, 'How to Start Your Journey in the Pageant Industry: A Complete Beginner’s Guide', 21, 20, 1, '8,12,15,16,17,18,22', 'assets/img/blog/1772428753.png', 'Beauty Pageant', '', '', '', '', 'pageant-industry-beginners-guide', 'How to Start Your Journey in the Pageant Industry: A Complete Beginner’s Guide', 'how to start pageant journey, pageant industry beginner guide, miss india preparation guide, mrs india entry process, miss teen india registration, beauty pageant entry tips, how to prepare for beauty pageant', 'Learn how to start your journey in the pageant industry with expert tips on grooming, profile building, and preparation for Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India.', 'How to Start Pageant Journey', 'Pageant Industry Beginner Guide', 'Miss India Preparation Guide', 'Beauty Pageant Entry Tips', 'Forever Star India', 'How to Start Your Journey in the Pageant Industry: A Complete Beginner’s Guide', 'https://newsforever.in/pageant-industry-beginners-guide', 'Learn how to start your journey in the pageant industry with expert tips on grooming, profile building, and preparation for Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India.', 'assets/img/blog/1772430226.png', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Understanding the Pageant Industry</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The pageant industry is more than crowns and glamour-it&#39;s a platform for confidence, leadership, and personal growth. From prestigious competitions like Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India, pageants provide opportunities for ladies and young girls to showcase talent, intelligence, and social awareness. Before entering, it is important to understand eligibility standards, age categories, and the purpose of each competition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Preparing Yourself for the Stage</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Preparation is the foundation of pageant success. Focus on personality development, communication skills, stage presence, and grooming. Regular practice of ramp walk, interview sessions, and public speaking can increase confidence. Fitness, skincare, and wardrobe planning also play a vital role. Many aspirants join grooming academies or take professional mentorship to prepare for competitions like Miss India or Miss Teen India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Building Your Profile and Applying</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Create a strong portfolio with professional photographs and a well-written bio highlighting achievements, hobbies, and social initiatives. Research official websites for registration details and deadlines. Whether you aim for Miss India, Mrs India, or Miss Teen India, consistency, dedication, and a positive mindset are key. With right training and self-belief, your journey within the pageant industry can virtually start with confidence and purpose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Contact Us -&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<strong>Phone number :&nbsp;+91-9983286999</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Email address: care@fsia.in</strong></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-01 : 07:03:30'),
(676, 25, 'Your First Step to the Crown: How to Apply for a Pageant', 21, 20, 1, '8,18,20,21,22,127', 'assets/img/blog/1772445886.png', 'Beauty Pageant', '', '', '', '', 'pageant-entry-tips-for-beginners-india', 'Your First Step to the Crown: How to Apply for a Pageant', 'how to apply for pageant, Miss India application process, Mrs India registration, Miss Teen India entry guide, pageant eligibility criteria, beauty pageant auditions, pageant portfolio tips, how to enter Miss India, beginner pageant guide', 'Learn how to apply for Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India with this beginner-friendly guide covering eligibility, portfolio, and auditions.', 'How to Apply for Pageant', 'Miss India Application Process', 'Miss India Registration', 'Pageant Eligibility Criteria', 'Forever Star India', 'Your First Step to the Crown: How to Apply for a Pageant', 'https://newsforever.in/pageant-entry-tips-for-beginners-india', 'Learn how to apply for Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India with this beginner-friendly guide covering eligibility, portfolio, and auditions.', 'assets/img/blog/1772446431.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Stepping into the pageant global is extra than chasing a crown-it&rsquo;s confidence, purpose, and personal growth Whether your dream stage is Miss India, Mrs India, or Miss Teen India, the journey starts with understanding how to apply correctly and confidently.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Choose the Right Pageant</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The first step is selecting a pageant that fits your age, marital status, and dreams. Miss India is typically for young unmarried women, Mrs India is designed for married women who want to exhibit skills and management, and Miss Teen India is good for teenage aspirants starting their competition journey.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Research official websites and set up social media pages to understand eligibility criteria, audition dates, and required documentation. Each opposition has its own values and expectations, so aligning your profile accordingly increases your chances of selection.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Check Eligibility and Guidelines</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Make sure you meet all of the requirements before proceeding. Prestigious competitions like Miss India and Miss Teen India have structured screening techniques, so accuracy is important.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Before filling out the software program form, carefully verify the eligibility criteria. This generally consists of age limits, top requirements, nationality, and marital popularity. Missing or incorrect facts can cause disqualification.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Build a Strong Portfolio</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Your portfolio creates the first impression. Include expert headshots, full-duration images, and a well-written bio highlighting achievements, hobbies, and social initiatives.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">If you are applying for Mrs India or Miss India, showcasing leadership roles, community work, or particular capabilities could make your profile stand out. Investing in an expert photoshoot and grooming consultation can upload prices for your application.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Submit Your Application Carefully</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Most pageants now accept online registrations. Fill in the application form with the correct personal and professional details. Upload clear photographs and required documents such as ID proof.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Before submitting, double-take everything. A complete and polished application displays seriousness and professionalism.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Prepare for Auditions</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Once shortlisted, you may face creation rounds, ramp walk sessions, or interview questions. Practice public speaking, posture, and stage presence. Confidence, clarity, and authenticity matter more than perfection.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Contact Us -&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Phone number : +91-9983286999<br />\r\nEmail address: care@fsia.in<br />\r\nWebsite:&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in\">https://www.fsia.in</a></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-02 : 12:03:41'),
(677, 25, 'Women Who Inspire the Nation: Celebrating India’s Super Women Achievers on International Women’s Day', 23, 107, 1, '29,30,86,94,140,253', 'assets/img/blog/1772795152.png', 'Celebrates Super Woman Achievers of Women\'s Day', '', '', '', '', 'women-achievers-india-womens-day', 'Women Who Inspire the Nation: Celebrating India’s Super Women Achievers on International Women’s Day', 'international women’s day, super woman awardees, women achievers india, meghana tarwade, dr sona valecha, dr radha rani srivastava, major priti sharma, rajni jain, dr sampati mishra, amrita singh, anamika gupta, uma anil bhattad, ishwari gopal shah, anish', 'Celebrate International Women’s Day honoring Super Woman Awardees Meghana Tarwade, Dr Sona Valecha and others inspiring women achievers of India.', 'International Women’s Day', 'Super Woman Awards', 'Woman Achievers India', 'Inspiring Women Leaders', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Women Who Inspire the Nation: Celebrating India’s Super Women Achievers on International Women’s Day', 'https://newsforever.in/women-achievers-india-womens-day', 'Celebrate International Women’s Day honoring Super Woman Awardees Meghana Tarwade, Dr Sona Valecha and others inspiring women achievers of India.', 'assets/img/blog/1772795168.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Celebrating International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">On the occasion of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, the nation comes together to honor the strength, resilience, and achievements of women who continue to inspire society with their dedication and passion. This special day recognizes the invaluable contributions women make across various fields, including business, education, social service, leadership, and healthcare. It is a moment to appreciate women who break barriers, challenge stereotypes, and create opportunities not only for themselves but also for future generations. The celebration highlights the importance of empowering women and encouraging their leadership in shaping a stronger and more inclusive nation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Honoring the Super Woman Awardees</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As part of the celebrations, several remarkable women have been recognized as </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Awards</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for their outstanding achievements and inspiring journeys. These women have demonstrated exceptional dedication and commitment in their respective fields, making a positive impact on society. The distinguished awardees include <strong>Meghana Tarwade, Dr Sona Valecha, Dr Radha Rani Srivastava, Major Priti Sharma, Rajni Jain, Dr Sampati Mishra, Amrita Singh, Anamika Gupta, Adv. Uma Anil Bhattad, Ishwari Gopal Shah, Anisha D Poria, Shirin Zakiuddin Gorakhpurwala, and&nbsp;Dr. Triveni Jitendra Singh</strong>. Their achievements stand as a testament to the power of determination, leadership, and perseverance.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Stories of Leadership and Determination</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Each of these </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Awardees</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has carved a unique path through hard work and determination. From medical professionals and legal experts to entrepreneurs and social contributors, these women represent excellence in diverse professions. Their journeys are filled with dedication, passion, and a strong commitment to making a difference in society. Through their work, they inspire many aspiring women to believe in their potential and pursue their goals with confidence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Empowerment and National Progress</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Awardees</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects the growing importance of women&rsquo;s leadership and participation in every sector. Women today are not only excelling in their careers but are also playing a crucial role in community development and nation-building. Celebrating their achievements sends a powerful message about equality, empowerment, and the importance of acknowledging the contributions of women who are shaping the future of the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring the Next Generation of Women Leaders</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The stories of these remarkable women serve as a source of motivation for countless young girls and aspiring professionals across India. By celebrating </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and honoring inspiring </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Awardees</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, society encourages the next generation to dream big and work toward their ambitions. Their success reminds us that with determination, confidence, and support, women can achieve extraordinary milestones and continue to inspire the nation for years to come.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-06 : 01:03:42');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(678, 25, 'Celebrating India\'s Super Women Achievers On International Women’s Day', 23, 107, 0, '27,29,30,31,86,94', 'assets/img/blog/1772876541.png', 'Celebrating Super Woman Awardee Women\'s Day', '', '', '', '', 'celebrating-india-super-women-achievers-international-womens-day', 'Celebrating India\'s Super Women Achievers On International Women’s Day', 'international women’s day, super women achievers india, women achievers india, vishakha mule, hiral mane, sabitha sriram, usha malviya, shailja sharma, pushpa kukreti, sudeepthi somireddy, kunjal vira, farzana sajid, dr parmod mann, adv deepa joseph delhi', 'Celebrating International Women’s Day by honoring India’s Super Women Achievers including Vishakha Mule, Hiral Mane, Sabitha Sriram and others', 'International Women\'s Day', 'Super Women Achievers India', 'Women Achievers India', 'Women Awards India', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Celebrating India\'s Super Women Achievers On International Women’s Day', 'https://newsforever.in/celebrating-india-super-women-achievers-international-womens-day', 'Celebrating International Women’s Day by honoring India’s Super Women Achievers including Vishakha Mule, Hiral Mane, Sabitha Sriram and others.', 'assets/img/blog/1772876558.png', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Celebrating International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The spirit of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is celebrated across the country by recognizing the extraordinary contributions of women who inspire society through their dedication, leadership, and achievements. This special occasion is not only a celebration of progress but also a reminder of the strength and resilience that women demonstrate every day in their professional and personal lives. Across different industries and communities, women are breaking barriers, building successful careers, and creating positive change for future generations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Honoring India&rsquo;s Super Women Achievers</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As part of this meaningful celebration, several inspiring personalities have been recognized as </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Women Achievers</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for their exceptional work and commitment to excellence. Among the remarkable women honored this year are </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Vishakha Mule, Hiral Mane, Sabitha Sriram, Usha Malviya, Shailja Sharma, Pushpa Kukreti, Sudeepthi Somireddy, Kunjal Vira, and Farzana Sajid</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Their achievements reflect determination, passion, and a strong sense of purpose, making them role models for aspiring women across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Contributions Across Diverse Fields</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">These </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Women Achievers</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> come from diverse professional backgrounds, including entrepreneurship, education, social service, and leadership. Their journeys demonstrate how dedication and perseverance can transform challenges into opportunities. Along with these inspiring women, distinguished professionals such as </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr. Parmod Mann</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Adv. Deepa Joseph from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> have also been recognized for their contributions to their respective fields. Their commitment to excellence and service has earned them respect and recognition from their communities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Empowerment and Social Impact</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of these inspiring individuals on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights the growing importance of women&rsquo;s empowerment in modern society. Today, women are playing a significant role in shaping industries, strengthening communities, and driving social progress. By celebrating </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Women Achievers</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, society acknowledges the efforts of those who continue to inspire others through their achievements, leadership, and dedication.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring the Next Generation</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The stories of these inspiring personalities serve as powerful motivation for young women and aspiring professionals across India. Celebrating their achievements on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> encourages the next generation to dream bigger, work harder, and believe in their abilities. Their journeys prove that with determination, confidence, and passion, women can achieve extraordinary milestones and continue to inspire the nation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-06 : 10:03:29'),
(679, 25, 'International Women’s Day: Dr Sampati Mishra Honored as a Super Women Achiever in India', 23, 107, 1, '27,29,31,86,94,142', 'assets/img/blog/1772885821.png', 'Dr Sampati Mishra Super Woman Awardee', '', '', '', '', 'dr-sampati-mishra-womens-day-honor', 'International Women’s Day: Dr Sampati Mishra Honored as a Super Women Achiever in India', 'dr sampati mishra, super woman award 2026, best social worker from sikar, international women’s day achievers, women achievers india, social worker sikar rajasthan, women empowerment india, inspiring women leaders, super woman awards india, dr sampati mis', 'Dr Sampati Mishra from Sikar honored with Super Woman Award 2026 as Best Social Worker on International Women’s Day for her inspiring social work.', 'Dr Sampati Mishra', 'Super Woman Award 2026', ' International Women’s Day Achievers', 'Inspiring Women Leaders', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'International Women’s Day: Dr Sampati Mishra Honored as a Super Women Achiever in India', 'https://newsforever.in/dr-sampati-mishra-womens-day-honor', 'Dr Sampati Mishra from Sikar honored with Super Woman Award 2026 as Best Social Worker on International Women’s Day for her inspiring social work.', 'assets/img/blog/1772885839.png', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Celebrating International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">On the occasion of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, women achievers across India are being recognized for their dedication, leadership, and inspiring contributions to society. This day celebrates the strength, determination, and achievements of women who are creating a positive impact in their communities. Among the remarkable personalities honored this year is </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Dr Sampati Mishra</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> from Sikar, whose work in social service has earned her recognition and appreciation on a national platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Honoring Dr Sampati Mishra with the Super Woman Award</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr Sampati Mishra has been selected as the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Social Worker from Sikar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> under the prestigious </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. This recognition celebrates her commitment to social welfare and her dedication to supporting people in need. The </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is given to women who demonstrate outstanding service, leadership, and positive impact in their communities. Dr Mishra&rsquo;s achievement highlights her passion for helping others and her continuous efforts toward social development.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Proud Representative from Sikar</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Hailing from the vibrant city of Sikar, Dr Sampati Mishra has been actively involved in social initiatives that focus on uplifting communities and supporting individuals through meaningful work. Her recognition as </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Social Worker from Sikar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects the respect and trust she has earned through her dedication and compassionate efforts. Her work continues to inspire many people who wish to contribute to society and make a difference in the lives of others.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition on the National Platform</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> provides a national platform that celebrates women achievers who are making a difference in different sectors. Being recognized through this prestigious platform highlights the importance of social work and community leadership. Dr Sampati Mishra&rsquo;s profile and achievements have been featured on the official platform where people can learn more about her inspiring journey and contributions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring the Next Generation</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of Dr Sampati Mishra on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Women&rsquo;s Day</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> serves as a powerful inspiration for many aspiring social workers and community leaders. Her journey reflects dedication, compassion, and a strong commitment to helping others. Through her work and recognition through the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she continues to inspire others to contribute positively to society and create meaningful change in their communities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-07 : 02:03:48'),
(680, 25, 'Radha Rani Shrivastava – Inspiring Woman Educator and Super Woman Awardee', 23, 107, 1, '27,29,84,94,141,253', 'assets/img/blog/1773039462.png', 'Super Woman Awardee 2026', '', '', '', '', 'radha-rani-inspiring-woman-educator', 'Radha Rani Shrivastava – Inspiring Woman Educator and Super Woman Awardee', 'dr radha rani shrivastava, super woman award, best educationalist in jalaun, international women’s day achievers, women achievers india, education leader jalaun, inspiring women educators, women empowerment india, super woman awards india, dr radha rani s', 'Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava inspires on International Women’s Day as Super Woman Awardee and Best Educationalist in Jalaun.', 'Dr Radha Rani Shirvastava', 'Super Woman Award', 'Best Educationalist in Jalaun', 'International Women’s Day Achievers', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Radha Rani Shrivastava – Inspiring Woman Educator and Super Woman Awardee', 'https://newsforever.in/radha-rani-inspiring-woman-educator', 'Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava inspires on International Women’s Day as Super Woman Awardee and Best Educationalist in Jalaun.', 'assets/img/blog/1773039491.png', '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Celebrating Women&rsquo;s Excellence and Leadership</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Across India, women are making remarkable contributions in various fields, inspiring society through their dedication, knowledge, and leadership. Among these inspiring personalities is Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava, whose commitment to education and social development has earned her recognition on a national platform. Her work reflects the spirit of empowerment and the positive impact that passionate educators can create within communities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Honoring Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava with the Super Woman Award</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava has been honored with the prestigious <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Award</a>, recognizing her exceptional contribution to the field of education. This award celebrates women who demonstrate excellence, leadership, and dedication in their professions while making a meaningful difference in society. Through her continuous efforts and commitment to educational development, Dr Shrivastava has inspired countless students and educators, establishing herself as a respected educationalist.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Recognized as the Best Educationalist in Jalaun</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava has been acknowledged as the Best Educationalist in Jalaun, a recognition that highlights her valuable contribution to academic excellence and learning initiatives. Her dedication to guiding students and promoting quality education has helped shape the future of many young learners. Her profile and achievements have been featured on the official platform where her inspiring journey can be explored.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A Journey Dedicated to Education and Empowerment</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The professional journey of Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava reflects a strong commitment to empowering students through knowledge and mentorship. Her passion for education has enabled her to create opportunities for learning and personal growth among students in her region. By focusing on quality education and holistic development, she continues to contribute significantly to academic advancement.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Inspiring the Next Generation</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of Dr Radha Rani Shrivastava through the Super Woman Award serves as an inspiration for educators and aspiring professionals across the country. Her achievements highlight the importance of dedication, perseverance, and passion in creating a positive impact. Through her work in education and her commitment to empowering young minds, she continues to inspire the next generation to pursue knowledge and success with confidence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-08 : 09:03:55'),
(681, 25, 'International Women’s Day: Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma Leads the Way as a Global Visionary in AI Defence Logistics', 23, 82, 0, '29,31,94,100,253', 'assets/img/blog/1773059586.png', 'Maj Dr Priti Sharma women leader in AI defence logistics innovation', '', '', '', '', 'international-womens-day-priti-sharma-ai-defence-logistic', 'International Women’s Day: Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma Leads the Way as a Global Visionary in AI Defence Logistics', 'maj dr priti sharma, forever star india award nominee, ai defence logistics expert india, women in defence technology india, global visionary in ai defence logistics, indian army officer ai logistics, women leaders in defence innovation, defence logistics', 'Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma, Global Visionary in AI Defence Logistics and Forever Star India Award Nominee, is transforming defence technology through innovation, leadership, and AI-driven logistics systems.', 'Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma', 'Forever Star India Award Nominee', 'AI Defence Logistics Expert India', 'Indian Army Officer AI Logistics', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'International Women’s Day: Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma Leads the Way as a Global Visionary in AI Defence Logistics', 'https://newsforever.in/international-womens-day-priti-sharma-ai-defence-logistic', 'Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma, Global Visionary in AI Defence Logistics and Forever Star India Award Nominee, is transforming defence technology through innovation, leadership, and AI-driven logistics systems.', 'assets/img/blog/1773059598.png', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Leadership in Defence Technology</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">On the occasion of International Women&rsquo;s Day, the inspiring journey of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights the growing influence of women in defence technology and innovation. A distinguished officer in the Indian Army, she has gained recognition as a Global Visionary in AI-Driven Defence Logistics for her work in integrating advanced technologies into military operations. Her achievements have also earned her recognition as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Award Nominee</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, celebrating her dedication to leadership, innovation, and service. Based in Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma represents the modern generation of professionals who combine military excellence with technological expertise.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Transforming Defence Logistics Through AI</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With nearly 12 years of leadership experience, Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma has played an important role in transforming defence logistics through artificial intelligence and digital governance systems. Her professional work focuses on AI-enabled logistics networks, ERP-driven governance, and intelligent inventory management designed to improve efficiency and operational readiness within defence supply chains. By implementing modern enterprise systems such as SAP ERP and data-driven logistics frameworks, she has contributed to strengthening strategic logistics management in defence environments.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Academic Excellence and Technological Expertise</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma&rsquo;s academic achievements further reflect her commitment to technological advancement and continuous learning. She holds an Honorary Doctorate in Artificial Intelligence and Global Supply Chain Management, an MBA in Information Technology and Systems Management, and a postgraduate certification in Data Science and Machine Learning from IIT Madras. Her diverse academic background also includes studies in digital marketing and law, allowing her to approach leadership from a multidisciplinary perspective that combines technology, governance, and strategic planning.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Achievements and Inspiration for Women Leaders</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from her professional achievements, Maj (Dr) Priti Sharma is also known for her discipline, resilience, and adventurous spirit. She has completed advanced mountaineering courses within the Indian Army and proudly participated in the 2015 Republic Day Parade at Rajpath. These accomplishments demonstrate her dedication to excellence both in service and personal development. As a </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/nominate-yourself\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Award Nominee</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she continues to inspire women across India, proving that determination, innovation, and leadership can create meaningful impact in defence, technology, and national progress.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-09 : 03:03:30'),
(682, 25, 'From Dream to Crown: How to Enter the World of Beauty Pageants', 21, 20, 1, '8,15,16,17,18,22,27', 'assets/img/blog/1773298077.png', 'Forever Star India Beauty Pageant', '', '', '', '', 'how-to-enter-beauty-pageants-india', 'From Dream to Crown: How to Enter the World of Beauty Pageants', 'forever miss india, forever mrs india, forever miss teen india, beauty pageant entry guide, how to enter beauty pageants, how to participate in miss india pageant, pageant journey for beginners, beauty pageant registration india, national beauty pageants ', 'Learn how to start your pageant journey with Forever Miss India, Forever Mrs India, and Forever Miss Teen India. A beginner’s guide to entering the beauty pageant world.', 'Forever Miss India', 'Beauty Pageant Entry Guide', 'Pageant Journey for Beginners', 'Beauty Pageant Registration India', 'Forever Star India', 'From Dream to Crown: How to Enter the World of Beauty Pageants', 'https://newsforever.in/how-to-enter-beauty-pageants-india', 'Learn how to start your pageant journey with Forever Miss India, Forever Mrs India, and Forever Miss Teen India. A beginner’s guide to entering the beauty pageant world.', 'assets/img/blog/1773298089.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Understanding the World of Beauty Pageants</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Beauty pageants today are much more than glamour and crowns. They are powerful platforms that celebrate confidence, intelligence, personality, and social awareness. Many aspiring contestants start their journey through national platforms along with </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Miss India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Mrs India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Miss Teen India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, which provide possibilities for ladies and younger women to showcase their talent and individuality. These pageants encourage participants to build leadership qualities, communication skills, and a strong personal identity while representing their communities on a larger stage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Choosing the Right Pageant for Your Journey</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The first step toward entering the competition globally is selecting the right competition that suits your age and life stage. For the younger unmarried women, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Miss India</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> offers a national platform to compete and grow in the pageant industry. Married women who want to rediscover their confidence and achievements can participate in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Mrs India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, at the same time as teenagers with big dreams can start their journey with Forever Miss Teen India. Each pageant category focuses on empowering participants and helping them develop their personality, stage presence, and public speaking skills.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Preparing for the Pageant Stage</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Preparation plays a crucial role in succeeding in any pageant competition. Contestants should focus on grooming, personality development, fitness, and communication skills. Practicing ramp walk, interview rounds, and public speaking can help build confidence and stage presence. Many participants of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Miss India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Forever Mrs India, and Forever Miss Teen India also engage in social tasks or community work, which strengthens their profiles and demonstrates their commitment to making a positive impact.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Taking the First Step Toward the Crown</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Entering the world of beauty pageants begins with registration and auditions. Once selected, participants go through various rounds including grooming sessions, talent showcases, and final competitions. Platforms like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Miss India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Mrs India</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-teen-india-new.php\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Forever Miss Teen India</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> offer national recognition, media exposure, and personal branding opportunities. For many contestants, the pageant journey becomes a life-changing experience that opens doors to modeling, public speaking, entrepreneurship, and leadership roles.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-11 : 09:03:33'),
(683, 25, 'How Pageants Help in Personal and Professional Development', 21, 29, 1, '8,12,18,19,21,27,111', 'assets/img/blog/1773309398.png', 'Forever Star India Beauty Pageant', '', '', '', '', 'how-pageants-help-personal-professional-development', 'How Pageants Help in Personal and Professional Development', 'how pageants help personal development, miss india pageant benefits, mrs india pageant journey, miss teen india opportunities, miss universe career opportunities, mrs universe pageant platform, benefits of beauty pageants, personal growth through pageants', 'Discover how beauty pageants like Miss India, Mrs India, Miss Teen India, Miss Universe, and Mrs Universe help build confidence, leadership, and career opportunities.', 'How Pageant Help Personal Development', 'Miss India Pageant Benefits', 'Leadership Skills in Beauty Pageants', 'Modeling and Pageant Industry', 'Forever Star India ', 'How Pageants Help in Personal and Professional Development', 'https://newsforever.in/how-pageants-help-personal-professional-development', 'Discover how beauty pageants like Miss India, Mrs India, Miss Teen India, Miss Universe, and Mrs Universe help build confidence, leadership, and career opportunities.', 'assets/img/blog/1773309412.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Transformative Power of Beauty Pageants</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Beauty pageants have evolved far beyond traditional ideas of glamour and fashion. Today, they serve as powerful platforms that promote personal growth, leadership, and social awareness. Competitions such as Miss India, Mrs India, and Miss Teen India provide opportunities for participants to showcase their intelligence, confidence, and unique personalities. These platforms encourage individuals to develop strong communication skills and a positive mindset whilst representing their values and aspirations on a national stage. For many contestants, participating in a pageant becomes a life-changing experience that helps them discover their true potential.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Building Confidence and Communication Skills</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">One of the most significant benefits of participating in pageants is the boost in confidence and communication ability. Contestants prepare together grooming sessions, public speaking practice, and personality development training. Whether competing in Miss India, Mrs India, or Miss Teen India, members discover ways to give themselves confidence in interviews, stage performances, and social interactions. These experiences not only improve level presence but also help individuals become extra articulate and self-assured in both personal and professional environments.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Expanding Career Opportunities</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Pageantry often opens doors to a wide range of professional possibilities. Many winners and finalists from competitions like Miss India go on to build successful careers in modeling, acting, entrepreneurship, and social advocacy. International platforms such as Miss Universe and Mrs Universe additionally provide worldwide publicity, allowing contestants to represent their country on an international stage. Through networking, media exposure, and mentorship, members gain valuable connections that can support their long-term career goals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Encouraging Leadership and Social Impact</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Another important aspect of pageantry is its focus on social responsibility and leadership. Contestants from Miss Teen India, Miss India, and Mrs India are often encouraged to participate in social projects and community development activities. These experiences help them to increase empathy, leadership skills, and a sense of responsibility toward society. As a result, pageants not only create confident individuals but also empower participants to grow to be role models who inspire positive change in their communities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-11 : 10:03:27'),
(684, 25, 'Education Leader Dr. Parmod Mann Nominated for  Star India Award', 108, 109, 1, '29,31,94,142,185', 'assets/img/blog/1773312735.png', 'Forever Star India Award Nominee', '', '', '', '', 'education-leader-dr-parmod-mann-award-nominee', 'Education Leader Dr. Parmod Mann Nominated for  Star India Award', 'Dr Parmod Mann,  forever star india award nominee, physical lecturer Parmod Mann, education leader Dr Parmod Mann, harassment prevention committee member, education award nominee India, physical education lecturer India, student welfare and campus safety,', 'Dr. Parmod Mann, a dedicated physical lecturer and harassment prevention committee member, receives recognition as a Forever Star India Award nominee for his contributions to education and student welfare.', 'Forever Star India Award Nominee', 'Physical Lecturer Parmod Mann', 'Education Award Nominee India', 'Educator Recognition India', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Education Leader Dr. Parmod Mann Nominated for  Star India Award', 'https://newsforever.in/education-leader-dr-parmod-mann-award-nominee', 'Dr. Parmod Mann, a dedicated physical lecturer and harassment prevention committee member, receives recognition as a Forever Star India Award nominee for his contributions to education and student welfare.', 'assets/img/blog/1773312759.png', '<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Educator and Social Advocate</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Parmod Mann, a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Physical Lecturer and Harassment Prevention Committee Member</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, has been recognized for his dedication to education, student welfare, and social awareness. His work in promoting safe and disciplined academic environments has earned him recognition as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">forever star india award nominee</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Through his contributions to physical education and student guidance, he has inspired many young individuals to pursue both academic and personal excellence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Commitment to Education and Student Development</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a dedicated physical lecturer, Dr. Parmod Mann focuses on developing students&rsquo; physical fitness, discipline, and teamwork. His teaching approach goes beyond the classroom, encouraging students to adopt healthy lifestyles and strong moral values. Alongside his teaching responsibilities, he actively contributes to institutional initiatives aimed at improving student well-being and creating a positive learning environment. His commitment to education and mentorship has strengthened his reputation as a respected academic professional and a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>forever star india award nominee</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Role in Harassment Prevention and Student Safety</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from his academic contributions, Dr. Parmod Mann also serves as a member of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Harassment Prevention Committee</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, where he works to ensure a safe and respectful environment for students and staff. Such committees play an important role in preventing and addressing workplace or campus harassment and promoting awareness about respectful conduct. Their goal is to maintain a safe academic environment where individuals can learn and work freely without fear or intimidation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition and National Appreciation</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Being acknowledged as a </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/nominate-yourself\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>forever star india award nominee</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights Dr. Parmod Mann&rsquo;s dedication to education, social responsibility, and ethical leadership. His efforts in promoting sports education, student discipline, and campus safety demonstrate his commitment to holistic development. Through his work as an educator and committee member, Dr. Parmod Mann continues to contribute positively to society, inspiring students and fellow educators alike.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With such impactful contributions, Dr. Parmod Mann stands as a remarkable example of how educators can shape the future by nurturing both knowledge and character in the next generation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-03-12 : 01:03:48');
