\"> spotlight. This award demonstrates her role in enhancing alternative medicine in India and facilitating safe health practices nationwide.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Professional Profile Homoeopathy Doctor in Hajipur bihar</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Being a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Homoeopathy Doctor in Hajipur Bihar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Dr Ritu Roy still serves patients with a benevolent demeanor and according to the scientific principles of homeopathy. The focus of her practice is precise diagnosis and customized treatment planning to achieve improved health outcomes.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Approach of Holistic treatment by homeopathy doctor in Hajipur</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her method of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Holistic treatment by a homeopathy doctor in Hajipur</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> integrates physical, emotional, and lifestyle factors.This is a balanced solution to help patients to attain a long-term wellness without being addicted to heavy medications.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Patient Care Homeopathy consultation in hajipur</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Homeopathy consultation in hajipur</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Dr Ritu Roy offers comprehensive patient diagnoses and treatment plans. Through her consultations, she believes in the deep understanding of patient history in order to achieve effective and sustainable solutions to patient problems.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-07 : 10:05:18'),
(720, 25, 'Jameela Nishat from Hyderabad Achieves  Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '30,31,102,140,141,177,179,184,186,196,208', 'assets/img/blog/1778587182.png', 'Top Social Reformer in Hyderabad Jameela Nishat ', '', '', '', '', 'top-social-reformer-hyderabad-jameela-nishat ', 'Jameela Nishat awarded in Social Reformer Category from Hyderabad', 'jameela nishat social worker, top social reformer in hyderabad, fsia super woman award 2026, women empowerment leader hyderabad, women rights activist hyderabad, best social worker in hyderabad, social reformer working for women empowerment hyderabad, wom', 'Jameela Nishat, FSIA Super Woman 2026 Awardee, is a leading social reformer in Hyderabad working for women empowerment, rights and NGO support. \r\n', 'best social worker in Hyderabad', 'women support NGO Hyderabad', 'Leading social reformer in Hyderabad', 'women rights activist Hyderabad', '', 'Social Reformer Jameela Nishat from Hyderabad Achieves  Super Woman Award 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/top-social-reformer-hyderabad-jameela-nishat ', 'Jameela Nishat is a leading social reformer in Hyderabad and Super Woman 2026 Awardee, recognized for women empowerment, rights advocacy and NGO support initiatives.', 'assets/img/blog/1778587083.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Jameela Nishat Social Worker</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has made her voice heard, as one of the most influential agents of change and equality in the city of Hyderabad in Hyderabad. A social worker in Hyderabad, she has been honoured as a super woman 2026 awardee socially due to her relentless efforts towards uplifting women and marginalised communities. Renowned as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social reformer working for women empowerment Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, her efforts relate to social challenges of significant concern such as education, safety, and dignity of women. Being one of the renowned women rights activists in Hyderabad Hyderabad, she has created powerful platforms that enable and empower communities as well as feature immensely in the vision of a Women Empowerment Leader Hyderabad.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Championing Women&rsquo;s Empowerment in Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social reformer working for women empowerment Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Jameela Nishat has dedicated her life to uplifting women from underprivileged backgrounds. Through her work the access to education, self reliance, and equal opportunities are enabled. Her initiatives have changed the lives of countless people, and she has become one of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>top social workers in Hyderabad Telangana</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Building Strong Support Systems Through NGOs</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Active participation of Jameela Nishat has been in establishing a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women support NGO Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> that will provide women in need with the essential resources, counseling and legal assistance. Her organization is one of the trusted NGOs operating in the women help Hyderabad sector and as such, women facing problems and difficulties are able to obtain timely and guidance assistance to restore their life back with honor.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Advocacy for Women&rsquo;s Rights and Equality</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Being credited as an apolitical </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women rights activist in Hyderabad Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she has always stood up to speak out against injustice and inequality. Her efforts as an advocate work on gender discrimination, domestic violence, and inability to access education, have made her a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Empowerment Leader Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition at the National Level</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The impacts of her contributions have earned her the prestigious </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>FSIA Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> thus portraying her as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>super woman 2026 awardee social worker Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. This award is done to acknowledge her hard work, leadership and influence as one of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>best social worker in hyderabad Hyderabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Future Changemakers</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In addition to the work she does in organizing, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Jameela Nishat Social Worker</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is still inspiring the young generation. Through mentoring young leaders and social responsibility, she makes sure that the mission of empowerment is carried on. Her story is an inspiration to others in the world to youth&nbsp; join the society and become part of the change making process.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Jameela Nishat is an icon of the strong, caring, and forward-moving. As a social reformer employer of women Hyderabad and a preeminent Women Empowerment Leader in Hyderabad, her work goes on to build a more inclusive and equitable society. She has successfully established herself as a leading social worker in Hyderabad Telangana through her role in a women support NGO Hyderabad and her being a recipient of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>FSIA Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her uncompromising devotion makes sure that there are a thousand women having hope, strength and a way to a brighter future.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-08 : 10:05:25'),
(721, 25, 'National Award Platforms Opening New Opportunities for Emerging Talent in India 2026', 23, 82, 1, '29,30,31,86,94,100,119,122,142,193', 'assets/img/blog/1778675915.png', 'Best National Award Platforms in India', '', '', '', '', 'best-national-award-platforms-in-india', 'Best National Award Platforms in India 2026', 'Best National Award Platforms in India, National award platform, Top National Award Platform in India 2026, Recognition Platforms in India, Talent Recognition Platform in India, Digital Recognition Platforms India, National Award 2026, Business Award Plat', 'If you are looking for the best national award platforms in India 2026 for recognition, visibility, and career growth, Forever Star India Awards is one of the leading choices in India.', 'What Forever Star India Offers to Participants', 'Events and Past Editions of Forever Star India Awards', 'Focus on Digital Visibility and Public Recognition', 'How It Differs From Traditional Award Platforms', 'Increasing Participation From Across India', 'Best National Award Platforms in India 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/best-national-award-platforms-in-india', 'If you are looking for the best national award platforms in India 2026 for recognition, visibility, and career growth, Forever Star India Awards is one of the leading choices in India.', 'assets/img/blog/1778675925.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">In India&rsquo;s growing recognition industry, award platforms are becoming more active across different sectors including business, fashion, education, healthcare, entertainment, and social work. These platforms are increasingly being used by professionals and emerging talents to gain visibility and build their public identity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Among these platforms, Forever Star India Awards (FSIA) is gaining attention for offering multiple services beyond traditional award ceremonies.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Unlike conventional award events that are limited to stage functions and trophy distribution, Forever Star India is working as a broader recognition platform that combines awards, digital visibility, and promotional support for participants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">What Forever Star India Offers to Participants</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Forever Star India provides participation opportunities across multiple categories such as:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Business achievements </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Education and academics </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Healthcare professionals </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Social work contributions </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Entrepreneurship and startups </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Entertainment industry </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Digital creators and influencers </span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The platform allows individuals to register online and apply for relevant categories based on their professional background and achievements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">After selection, participants are featured through award recognition programs along with media visibility and online promotion activities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><strong>Events and Past Editions of Forever Star India Awards</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">In the past few years, Forever Star India Awards has organized multiple recognition events across different categories in India. These events have included award ceremonies, talent showcases, fashion and pageant programs, and recognition functions for professionals from various fields.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">The events have brought together participants from different cities and states, where individuals were recognized for their work in business, fashion, education, healthcare, social service, and entertainment industries.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Each edition of the event has seen participation from both emerging talent and experienced professionals. The programs have also included stage appearances, award distributions, and introduction of new categories based on industry trends.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Along with award functions, the platform has also conducted pageant-style events and talent-based showcases where participants presented their skills, confidence, and professional achievements.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">These events have contributed to expanding the platform&rsquo;s reach and increasing participation from different parts of the country over the years.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">Focus on Digital Visibility and Public Recognition</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Professionals are not only looking for awards but also for visibility across online platforms. Recognition platforms that offer media coverage, interviews, and online features are gaining more attention compared to traditional award systems.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Forever Star India is also focusing on digital exposure by highlighting participants through online publications, social media features, and public recognition campaigns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">This approach is helping awardees gain wider visibility beyond the event itself.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">How It Differs From Traditional Award Platforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Compared to many traditional recognition events, which mainly focus on limited participation and physical ceremonies, Forever Star India is operating with a wider and more digital-focused model.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The platform provides:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Online registration system </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Multiple category participation </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Nationwide access for applicants </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Digital promotion and visibility </span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Recognition across different professional fields </span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Because of this structure, participation is not limited to metro cities or specific industries, but is open to individuals from different regions of India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">Increasing Participation From Across India</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The platform is also seeing participation from professionals, entrepreneurs, students, creators, and independent workers from both metro cities and smaller towns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">This wider reach has contributed to its growing presence in the recognition and branding space, where individuals are actively seeking platforms that offer both recognition and visibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">So, with the rising demand for digital visibility and personal branding in India, recognition platforms are evolving beyond traditional award formats. Forever Star India is gradually positioning itself as a multi-service recognition platform that combines awards, online visibility, and participation opportunities across various industries, making it one of the emerging names in India&rsquo;s award ecosystem.</span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-13 : 03:05:29');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(722, 25, 'Anjali Saxena from Mumbai Honoured with Super Woman Award 2026 for Being the Best Tarot Card Reader', 23, 107, 1, '29,84,94,100,119,141,142,193,208', 'assets/img/blog/1778842182.png', 'Best Tarot Card Specialist  in Mumbai', '', '', '', '', 'anjali-saxena-nominated-as-tarot-specialist-in-mumbai', 'Anjali Saxena Achieves Super Woman Award 2026 for Tarot Excellence', 'best tarot card reader in Mumbai, Top Tarot Card Reading Services in Mumbai, expert tarot card reader, tarot card specialist in Mumbai, super women award 2026, Top Tarot Card Reading Services in Mumbai, expert tarot card reader in Mumbai, FSIA Super Woman', 'Meet Anjali Saxena, one of the best tarot card readers in Mumbai, honoured with the Super Woman Award 2026 for excellence in tarot reading and spiritual guidance.', 'FSIA Awards Continue to Build Recognition and Professional Credibility', 'best tarot card reader in Mumbai', 'Top Tarot Card Reading Services in Mumbai', 'expert tarot card reader in Mumbai', 'tarot card reader near me', 'Anjali Saxena Achieves Super Woman Award 2026 for Tarot Excellence', 'https://newsforever.in/anjali-saxena-nominated-as-tarot-specialist-in-mumbai', 'Meet Anjali Saxena, one of the best tarot card readers in Mumbai, honoured with the Super Woman Award 2026 for excellence in tarot reading and spiritual guidance.', 'assets/img/blog/1778842724.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Forever Star India (FSIA) has nominated Mumbai-based tarot reader and spiritual guide Anjali Saxena with the <strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong> for her consistent contribution to tarot reading and spiritual guidance. The organization stated that she was selected for this honour due to her strong reputation in providing accurate, simple, and practical tarot consultations that help individuals gain clarity in different areas of life.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">According to Forever Star India, Anjali Saxena was chosen for the award because of her ability to guide people through emotional, professional, and personal challenges with a calm and solution-oriented approach. Her tarot readings are known for focusing on clarity, confidence, and self-understanding rather than confusion or fear, which has made her a trusted name among individuals seeking guidance.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The selection committee also highlighted her growing recognition as one of the most <strong>reliable tarot readers in Mumbai</strong>. Over the years, she has built a strong client base through her consistent work and ability to understand human emotions in a practical way. Her consultations are widely appreciated for being easy to understand and helpful in real-life decision-making.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Forever Star India further noted that her approach to tarot reading reflects this belief, as she focuses on helping individuals understand their situations better and make informed decisions in life. Her work emphasizes emotional strength, self-awareness, and personal growth.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">FSIA Awards Continue to Build Recognition and Professional Credibility</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The <strong>FSIA Super Woman Award 2026</strong> is given to women who have made a meaningful impact in their respective fields through dedication and consistent contribution. Over the years, Forever Star India has become a growing national platform known for recognizing professionals, entrepreneurs, artists, wellness experts, and independent achievers from across India.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The FSIA Super Woman Award 2026 is also aimed at helping individuals gain professional credibility, branding opportunities, media exposure, and nationwide visibility. Through its award initiatives, Forever Star India continues to support talented individuals by providing them with a platform where their work and achievements receive wider recognition and appreciation.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">In Anjali Saxena&rsquo;s case, the recognition highlights her growing influence in the field of spiritual guidance and her efforts to support individuals through tarot-based counseling.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Today, Anjali Saxena continues to establish herself as a <strong>respected tarot card specialist in Mumbai</strong>, with increasing recognition for her work in spiritual wellness and personal guidance.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">In a world full of uncertainty and constant change, Anjali Saxena&rsquo;s work serves as a &ldquo;guiding voice of clarity.&rdquo; Through her tarot insights, she continues to empower individuals to move from doubt to direction and from confusion to confidence.</span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-15 : 02:05:19'),
(723, 25, 'Women Empowerment through Modern Beauty Pageant Training Platforms in India 2026', 21, 71, 1, '18,19,124,131,161,166,172,189,197,200,230', 'assets/img/blog/1778934324.png', 'Beauty Pageant Training Platforms in India', '', '', '', '', 'best-modern-beauty-pageant-training-platform-in-india', 'India’s Best Modern Beauty Pageant Training Platform for All Age Women', 'Beauty Pageant Platforms in India, beauty contest platform in india , beauty pageant platforms for all women , Beauty pageant in India, Best model grooming platform in india, runway training for pageant contestants, public speaking for pageant preparation', 'A fast-growing beauty pageant training platform in India for all age women, helping build confidence, grooming skills, and public identity in 2026.', 'Best Pageant Training Platform for Women Empowerment', 'Inclusive Platform for Women of Every Age', 'Women Empowerment through Exposure and Career Growth', 'Beauty Pageant Platforms in India', 'beauty pageant training platform in india', 'India’s Best Modern Beauty Pageant Training Platform for All Age Women', 'https://newsforever.in/best-modern-beauty-pageant-training-platform-in-india', 'A fast-growing beauty pageant training platform in India for all age women, helping build confidence, grooming skills, and public identity in 2026.', 'assets/img/blog/1778933046.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">India&rsquo;s beauty pageant industry in 2026 is witnessing a major shift. Pageants are no longer seen only as glamour-based competitions. Today, they are becoming platforms where women build confidence, improve communication skills, and explore real career opportunities. From Gen-Z girls to working professionals and married women, participation is rapidly increasing as more women search for spaces that support growth, identity, and self-expression.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">At the center of this transformation is <strong>FSIA (Forever Star India Awards)</strong>, which is becoming one of the most trusted names in modern pageantry. While many platforms exist today, FSIA is increasingly preferred because of its practical approach toward grooming, confidence-building, and personality development. The platform focuses on helping women discover their strengths and present themselves with confidence in both personal and professional life.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Best Pageant Training Platform for Women Empowerment</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">FSIA works as a structured <strong>beauty pageant training platform in india</strong> where participants are guided step by step through training and preparation. The platform focuses on more than just stage appearance. Women are trained in confidence-building, communication skills, grooming, and personality development so they can grow both personally and professionally.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">With over 5,000 crowns already given to women across India, FSIA is becoming more than just a pageant platform. It is creating a space where women feel confident, recognized, and ready to chase bigger opportunities.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">One of the major highlights of FSIA training is <strong>runway training for pageant contestants</strong>, where participants learn stage presence, walking techniques, and presentation skills. Along with this, <strong>public speaking for pageant preparation</strong> has also become an important part of the training process, helping women improve confidence and communication for real-life opportunities.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Many contestants share that after FSIA training, they feel more confident, expressive, and ready to face new opportunities. Women who once struggled with stage fear and self-doubt are now participating confidently in events, interviews, and public interactions.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Inclusive Platform for Women of Every Age</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">One of the biggest reasons behind FSIA&rsquo;s growing popularity is its inclusive structure. The platform includes Teen, Miss, and Mrs. Categories, allowing participation from girls aged 13 years to women up to 50 years of age. This reflects the growing demand for <strong>beauty pageant platforms for all women</strong>, where every participant gets equal opportunities to learn, grow, and build confidence.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Students, homemakers, entrepreneurs, and working women are all becoming part of this changing industry. This shift is also helping reshape <strong>Beauty Pageant Platforms in India</strong> into spaces that focus more on empowerment and development rather than traditional beauty standards alone.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Women Empowerment through Exposure and Career Growth</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Industry observations show that women today are joining pageants not just for titles but also for recognition, confidence, and self-growth. FSIA supports this change by providing structured exposure through grooming sessions, personality development training, and media visibility.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The platform is also creating <strong>pageant career opportunities India for women</strong> who want to explore modeling, influencing, communication, and public-facing careers. This practical exposure is one of the reasons FSIA is increasingly recognized as a <strong>Best model grooming platform in india</strong> among aspiring contestants.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">As the <strong>Beauty pageant in India</strong> industry continues to evolve, FSIA is emerging as a trusted <strong>beauty contest platform in india</strong> that focuses on women empowerment, confidence, and personal growth. Overall, FSIA reflects how modern pageants are becoming meaningful platforms where women can build identity, confidence, and new opportunities in 2026.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\">Register Now -</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php</a></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-16 : 02:05:17'),
(724, 25, 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata Achieves Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '29,31,84,94,102,119,141,175,183,208', 'assets/img/blog/1779862340.png', 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata Achieves Super Woman Award 2026', '', '', '', '', 'advocate-mita-banerjee-kolkata-achieve-award', 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata Achieves Super Woman Award 2026', 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata Achieves Super Woman Award 2026', 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata receives Super Woman Award 2026 for her inspiring contribution as a High Court Advocate in Kolkata and her dedication toward social awareness and professional excellence.', 'High Court Advocate in Kolkata', 'best advocate in kolkata', 'Women Empowerment', 'Inspiring Woman Advocate', 'top advocate in kolkata ', 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata Achieves Super Woman Award 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/advocate-mita-banerjee-kolkata-achieve-award', 'Advocate Mita Banerjee from Kolkata receives Super Woman Award 2026 for her inspiring contribution as a High Court Advocate in Kolkata and her dedication toward social awareness and professional excellence.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1779862392.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Advocate Mita Banerjee, recognized by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, is widely admired as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> known for her dedication, ethical values, and contribution toward justice and social awareness. As a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>High Court Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she has created a strong identity through her disciplined professional journey and inspiring personality. Her growing recognition within the legal community reflects her commitment toward integrity, confidence, and positive social impact.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of Advocate Mita Banerjee by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights her inspiring contribution as a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Kolkata Advocate</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and socially responsible professional. Her journey continues to motivate aspiring advocates, women professionals, and individuals aiming to build meaningful careers with strong values and determination.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Growing Identity as Best Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Widely recognized as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Mita Banerjee has earned admiration for her fearless personality, ethical work culture, and commitment toward professional excellence. Her dedication and positive influence have helped her establish a respected identity among notable </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Legal Professionals in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Journey of High Court Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a reputed </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>High Court Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Mita Banerjee&rsquo;s journey reflects perseverance, confidence, and continuous growth. Through years of dedication and self-belief, she has become an inspiring example for women professionals and aspiring advocates across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Contribution Beyond the Legal Profession</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from her professional identity, Advocate Mita Banerjee actively supports social awareness initiatives, women empowerment activities, and humanitarian causes. Her commitment toward creating awareness and encouraging positive social change reflects her role as an </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Woman Advocate</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and socially responsible personality.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition in Legal Community and Social Sector</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The growing recognition received through </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>FSIA Recognition</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Recognition</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects her contribution toward society and professional excellence. Her inspiring presence continues to influence individuals who admire dedication, discipline, and ethical leadership within the legal field.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Personality with Positive Influence</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Known for her balanced personality and strong mindset, Mita Banerjee continues to inspire many individuals through her professional discipline and social contribution. Her story represents the journey of a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Female Advocate in Kolkata</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> whose dedication and values continue to create meaningful impact within society.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-26 : 09:05:43'),
(725, 25, 'Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi Achieves Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '29,31,177,179,180,187,193,208,230', 'assets/img/blog/1779881881.png', ' Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi Achieves Super Woman Award 2026 ', '', '', '', '', 'mahima-raikwaar-business-woman-achieve-award', ' Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi Achieves Super Woman Award 2026 ', 'mahima raikwaar, business woman in varanasi, best entrepreneur in varanasi, super woman award 2026, forever star india, women entrepreneur in varanasi, business woman india, handmade jewellery business in india, handmade jewellery in varanasi, vrinda arti', ' Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi achieves Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her inspiring journey as a Business Woman in Varanasi and contribution to the handmade jewellery business in India.\r\n', 'business woman in varanasi', ' handmade jewellery business in Varanasi', 'entrepreneur from varanasi', 'best entrepreneur in varanasi', 'vrinda artificial jewellery and crafting', ' Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi Achieves Super Woman Award 2026 ', 'https://newsforever.in/mahima-raikwaar-business-woman-achieve-award', ' Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi achieves Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her inspiring journey as a Business Woman in Varanasi and contribution to the handmade jewellery business in India.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1779881907.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Mahima Raikwaar from Varanasi has achieved the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for her inspiring journey as a successful entrepreneur and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Business Woman in Varanasi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Widely recognized as the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Entrepreneur in Varanasi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she has built a strong identity through her growing brand </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Vrinda Artificial Jewellery and Crafting</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and her contribution to the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>handmade jewellery business in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her journey reflects creativity, determination, and entrepreneurial excellence, making her an inspiring example among </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Entrepreneurs in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and emerging business leaders.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of Mahima Raikwaar through the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights her inspiring contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Business Woman in Varanasi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and successful </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Entrepreneur in Varanasi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her dedication toward creativity, handcrafted artistry, and business growth continues to inspire aspiring entrepreneurs and women professionals across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Growing Identity in Handmade Jewellery Business in India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Mahima Raikwaar has earned admiration for her unique presence in the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>handmade jewellery business in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> through her brand </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Vrinda Artificial Jewellery and Crafting</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Known for creativity, elegance, and artistic craftsmanship, her work reflects individuality and passion, helping her establish recognition as a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Business Woman in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Journey of Mahima Raikwaar Entrepreneur</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The journey of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Mahima Raikwaar entrepreneur</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects passion, consistency, and self-belief. Starting with creativity and handcrafted designs, she gradually transformed her vision into a recognized identity. Her success story continues to inspire women aiming to create independent careers through talent, confidence, and dedication.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition as Best Handmade Jewellery Entrepreneur in Varanasi</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Widely appreciated as the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Handmade Jewellery Entrepreneur in Varanasi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Mahima Raikwaar continues to gain recognition for her artistic work and entrepreneurial mindset. Her handcrafted jewellery creations have helped her build a growing identity within the fashion and creative industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Creative and Spiritual Influence</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from entrepreneurship, Mahima Raikwaar is also recognized as </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Tarot Reader Mahima Raikwaar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Numerology Expert Mahima Raikwaar</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her interest in creativity, intuition, tarot reading, numerology, and spiritual practices reflects her versatile personality and positive influence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026 Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Receiving the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects Mahima Raikwaar&rsquo;s inspiring journey, entrepreneurial dedication, and creative excellence. Her story continues to motivate aspiring </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Business Women in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, women entrepreneurs, and creative professionals who dream of building meaningful identities through passion and hard work.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-27 : 02:05:03'),
(726, 25, 'Beauty Pageant Scams in India: Why Contestants Are Demanding Transparency & Trust', 21, 0, 1, '18,21,22,23,124,127,150,189,197', 'assets/img/blog/1780055294.png', 'Beauty Pageant Scams in India: Why Contestants Are Demanding Transparency & Trust ', '', '', '', '', 'beauty-pageant-scams-in-india', 'Beauty Pageant Scams in India: Why Contestants Are Demanding Transparency & Trust ', 'beauty pageant scams india, fake beauty pageant platforms, trusted beauty pageant platforms india, gst registered beauty pageants, genuine modeling organizations india, online modeling scams india, beauty contest fraud, miss india pageant platforms', 'Beauty Pageant scams in India are increasing as contestants demand trusted, GST registered & genuine beauty pageant platforms. Learn how to identify authentic modeling & pageant organizations.\r\n', 'trusted beauty pageant platforms india', 'authentic beauty pageant organizations', 'professional modeling platforms india', 'trusted fashion platforms india', 'fashion and modeling industry india', 'Beauty Pageant Scams in India: Why Contestants Are Demanding Transparency & Trust ', 'https://newsforever.in/beauty-pageant-scams-in-india', 'Beauty Pageant scams in India are increasing as contestants demand trusted, GST registered & genuine beauty pageant platforms. Learn how to identify authentic modeling & pageant organizations.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1780055303.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">India&rsquo;s beauty and fashion industry is expanding at a remarkable pace. From Rajasthan, Delhi, Punjab, Gujarat, Maharashtra, and Karnataka to several other regions, thousands of aspiring models, talented women, and future beauty queens are actively participating in beauty pageants, modeling competitions, fashion shows, and online auditions to build successful careers in the glamour and fashion industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With the rapid rise of social media influence and digital audition platforms, opportunities in the beauty pageant industry have increased significantly. Contestants are continuously searching for trusted beauty pageant platforms, Miss India opportunities, Mrs India competitions, national-level talent shows, and professional modeling organizations that can offer genuine exposure, recognition, and career growth.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">However, alongside this rapid expansion, concerns regarding fake beauty pageant platforms and online modeling scams are also increasing across India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Fake Beauty Pageant Platforms &amp; Online Modeling Scams Increasing Across India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Many contestants across the country have reported concerning experiences involving fake beauty pageant organizations and unverified modeling platforms operating without proper transparency or legal authorization.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">During research conducted across Rajasthan, Delhi, Punjab, Karnataka, Gujarat, Maharashtra, and several other states, it was observed that multiple beauty pageant and modeling platforms were functioning without GST registration, verified business identity, or professional operational systems.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">According to participants, several organizations were collecting registration fees, audition charges, portfolio payments, and participation fees while offering misleading promises regarding titles, selection, and career opportunities. In many cases, contestants later discovered that these platforms lacked official credibility, structured event management, and genuine industry presence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">This situation has created confusion, financial concerns, and trust issues among aspiring participants who genuinely wish to build careers in fashion, glamour, modeling, and beauty competitions. Parents and guardians are also becoming increasingly cautious before allowing participation in any online audition or beauty pageant platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Why Contestants Prefer Trusted &amp; GST Registered Beauty Pageant Platforms</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Due to rising awareness about fake pageant scams and online modeling frauds, contestants are now actively choosing verified and professionally managed beauty pageant organizations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Today, aspiring participants prefer platforms that are:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">GST Registered</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Professionally Managed</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Legally Verified</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Transparent &amp; Authentic</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Industry Recognized</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Experts from the beauty and fashion industry strongly recommend that contestants verify essential details before making any payments or joining any beauty contest, modeling competition, fashion event, or national-level pageant.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Key verification points include:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">GST Registration and Legal Identity</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Official Website Authenticity</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Social Media Credibility and Engagement</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Past Events, Winners, and Track Record</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Organizer Transparency and Communication</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Business Legitimacy and Industry Presence</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">These checks help contestants differentiate between genuine opportunities and misleading or fraudulent platforms in the beauty pageant industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Transparency and Trust Becoming Essential in the Pageant Industry</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Transparency has become a key factor in India&rsquo;s evolving beauty pageant ecosystem. Today&rsquo;s contestants are not only focused on winning titles but also on safety, professionalism, credibility, and long-term career development.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Trusted beauty pageant platforms provide structured guidance, personality development, confidence building, and professional exposure in the fashion and modeling industry. Such organizations create a safe and empowering environment where women from different states can grow, learn, and showcase their talent.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Gaining Trust Among Contestants Across India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Among the few platforms receiving positive recognition from participants, Forever Star India is emerging as a trusted beauty pageant platform in India. Contestants appreciated the organization for its transparent process, GST registered operations, professional management, and genuine opportunities for women from different states.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Participants stated that trusted platforms help women feel more confident, secure, and motivated while participating in beauty pageants, fashion events, and national modeling competitions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Awareness About Fake Pageant Scams Is More Important Than Ever</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As India&rsquo;s beauty, fashion, and modeling industry continues to grow rapidly, awareness regarding fake beauty pageant scams, online modeling frauds, and unregistered beauty pageant organizations is becoming increasingly important.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Contestants and families are now encouraging aspiring participants to choose only verified and trusted beauty pageant platforms that genuinely support women empowerment, talent development, confidence building, beauty with purpose, and career growth in fashion and modeling.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The demand for authentic, transparent, and professionally managed beauty pageant organizations in India continues to rise, as aspiring contestants seek safe and genuine platforms to achieve their dreams with confidence and security.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-29 : 02:05:55');
