(727, 25, 'Healthcare Administration Smita Bharat Darji Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 110, 1, '30,31,84,86,94,100,138,208', 'assets/img/blog/1780134105.png', ' Smita Bharat Darji from Ahmedabad Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India', '', '', '', '', 'smita-bharat-darji-ahmedabad-healthcare-management-award', 'Healthcare Administration Professional Smita Bharat Darji Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', ' Smita Bharat Darji from Ahmedabad Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Smita Bharat Darji from Ahmedabad is nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her role in hospital administration in Ahmedabad, healthcare management career in India, and patient care coordination.\r\n', 'hospital administration in Ahmedabad', 'hospital operations management Ahmedabad', 'healthcare administration services Ahmedabad', 'women professionals in healthcare management in Ahmedabad', 'healthcare management career path in Ahmedabad', 'Healthcare Management Professional Smita Bharat Darji from Ahmedabad ', 'https://newsforever.in/smita-bharat-darji-ahmedabad-healthcare-management-award', 'Smita Bharat Darji from Ahmedabad is nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her role in hospital administration in Ahmedabad, healthcare management career in Ahmedabad, and patient care coordination.', 'assets/img/blog/1780134130.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Smita Bharat Darji from Ahmedabad has been nominated for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for her inspiring journey as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Healthcare Management Professional in Ahmedabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. She is widely recognized for her contribution in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>hospital administration in Ahmedabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>healthcare operations management</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>patient care coordination in hospitals</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her career reflects strong dedication in the <strong>healthcare industry in Ahmedabad</strong>, making her a notable name among <strong>women professionals in healthcare management in&nbsp;Ahmedabad</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights her growing presence as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>healthcare manager in the Ahmedabad hospital sector</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her work in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>hospital operations, healthcare administration services, and patient management systems</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has contributed to improving efficiency in healthcare services.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Journey in Healthcare Management</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Smita Bharat Darji is known as a <strong>healthcare management professional in Ahmedabad</strong>&nbsp;who has built her career in the <strong>hospital and healthcare sector in Ahmedabad</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Starting her journey in 2019, she gained experience in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>hospital executive role, healthcare coordination, and medical administration work</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, leading to her current position in healthcare leadership.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Professional Role in Healthcare Sector</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Currently working as an Associate Manager at KD Hospital Ahmedabad, she is involved in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>hospital management system operations, patient admission process handling, and healthcare service improvement in private hospitals</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her work reflects growing demand for <strong>hospital administration professionals in Ahmedabad</strong>.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Work-Life Balance in Healthcare Profession</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her journey also represents many <strong>working women in the healthcare sector Ahmedabad&nbsp;</strong>who manage both career and family responsibilities. She is an example of strong <strong>work-life balance in hospital careers for women in Ahmedabad</strong>, showing how women are excelling in healthcare management careers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Career Growth in Healthcare Industry</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Smita Bharat Darji&rsquo;s growth from executive roles to management highlights opportunities in the healthcare<strong> sector in Ahmedabad, hospital administration career growth, and healthcare management career path in Ahmedabad.</strong>&nbsp;Her dedication has made her a respected name in <strong>healthcare leadership roles in Ahmedabad hospitals</strong>.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Through Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her nomination for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> recognizes her contribution to the <strong>healthcare industry in Ahmedabad</strong>, especially in <strong>hospital management and healthcare administration</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-30 : 12:05:24'),
(728, 25, 'Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 110, 1, '29,30,31,177,184,194,195,208', 'assets/img/blog/1780310485.png', 'dvocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', '', '', '', '', 'advocate-deepa-joseph-delhi-nominated-award', 'Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi is nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 for her inspiring contribution as a Supreme Court Advocate, human rights advocate, and legal activist dedicated to justice, women empowerment, and social awareness in India. ', 'Supreme Court Advocate from Delhi', ' Human Rights Advocate Delhi', 'Women Empowerment Advocate in delhi', 'best advocate from delhi', 'Supreme Court Advocate from Delhi', 'Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/ advocate-deepa-joseph-delhi-nominated-award ', 'Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi is nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 for her inspiring contribution as a Supreme Court Advocate, human rights advocate, and legal activist dedicated to justice, women empowerment, and social awareness in India. ', 'assets/img/blog/1780310497.png', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Advocate Deepa Joseph from Delhi has achieved the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for her inspiring contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Supreme Court Advocate from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, legal activist, and humanitarian leader. Widely recognized for her dedication toward justice, constitutional values, and social awareness, she has established a strong identity within the legal community through her commitment toward equality, human rights, and public welfare.</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The recognition of Advocate Deepa Joseph through the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> highlights her inspiring journey as a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Advocate in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and socially responsible legal professional. Her dedication toward justice and humanitarian values continues to inspire aspiring advocates, women professionals, and social leaders across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Journey as Supreme Court Advocate from Delhi</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Known as a prominent </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Supreme Court Advocate from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Advocate Deepa Joseph has earned admiration for her disciplined professional journey, fearless mindset, and commitment toward constitutional principles. Her growing recognition reflects years of perseverance, dedication, and strong professional ethics.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Voice for Women Empowerment and Human Rights</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Advocate Deepa Joseph is also recognized as a leading </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Empowerment Advocate in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Human Rights Advocate in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Through her awareness initiatives and social contribution, she continues to support dignity, equality, and justice for vulnerable communities and individuals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Contribution Toward Social Justice and Migrant Protection</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her work as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Legal Activist in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;reflects her commitment toward social justice and humanitarian service. She has actively supported awareness related to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Migrant Protection Law in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;and has consistently emphasized the importance of legal rights, equality, and social responsibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Academic Excellence and Thought Leadership</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from her legal profession, Advocate Deepa Joseph is also recognized for her academic dedication and research journey. Her intellectual contribution and global perspective continue to strengthen her identity as an inspiring legal professional and thought leader.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Author and Global Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Advocate Deepa Joseph has also earned appreciation as an author and humanitarian voice through her published works focused on justice, resilience, and peace. Her writings and social contribution have gained recognition on national and international platforms, reflecting her influence beyond the courtroom.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026 Recognition</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Receiving the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects Advocate Deepa Joseph&rsquo;s inspiring contribution toward law, social awareness, and humanitarian values. Her journey as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Supreme Court Advocate from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Advocate in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Legal Activist in delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;continues to inspire individuals striving to create meaningful impact through dedication and purpose.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-05-31 : 10:05:15'),
(729, 25, 'Who Can Become a Part of Forever Star India Awards? | Eligibility & Criteria 2026', 23, 0, 1, '29,30,31,86,102,141,182,185,208,215,265', 'assets/img/blog/1780401907.png', 'Who Can Become a Part of Forever Star India Awards?', '', '', '', '', 'who-can-become-part-forever-star-india-awards-eligibility-criteria', 'Who Can Become a Part of Forever Star India Awards? | Eligibility & Criteria 2026', 'Who Can Become a Part of Forever Star India Awards? | Eligibility & Criteria 2026', 'Discover who can become a part of Forever Star India Awards (FSIA). Explore eligibility criteria, nomination process, and opportunities for professionals, artists, students, and inspiring individuals in India. Learn how FSIA recognizes real talent and suc', ' national recognition awards india,', 'talent and achievement awards india', 'personal branding awards india', 'women empowerment awards india', 'award nomination platform in india', 'Who Can Become a Part of Forever Star India Awards? | Eligibility & Criteria 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/who-can-become-part-forever-star-india-awards-eligibility-criteria', 'Discover who can become a part of Forever Star India Awards (FSIA). Explore eligibility criteria, nomination process, and opportunities for professionals, artists, students, and inspiring individuals in India. Learn how FSIA recognizes real talent and suc', 'assets/img/blog/1780401915.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In today&rsquo;s competitive world, recognition plays a key role in building confidence, credibility, and personal branding. The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards (FSIA)</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has become one of the emerging platforms in India that highlights talent, achievements, and inspiring journeys across multiple fields. But the most frequently asked question is&mdash;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>who can become a part of Forever Star India Awards?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The answer is simple: </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>any individual with talent, achievement, or an inspiring journey can apply for the Forever Star India Awards.</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards &ndash; A National Recognition Platform</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is a recognition platform in India designed to honor individuals from different professions and backgrounds. It focuses on celebrating </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>real achievements, hidden talent, and inspirational success stories</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> rather than just fame or popularity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Whether you are a professional, entrepreneur, artist, or social contributor, FSIA provides a stage where your work can gain visibility and recognition at a wider level.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Who Is Eligible for Forever Star India Awards?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The eligibility for </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards nomination</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is broad and inclusive. Individuals from multiple sectors can become part of FSIA, including:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;Professionals and Experts</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Doctors, lawyers, teachers, consultants, engineers, and business professionals who have contributed significantly in their respective fields can apply for FSIA awards. Their expertise, dedication, and professional achievements make them strong candidates for recognition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Social Workers and Changemakers</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">People involved in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social work, women empowerment, education, healthcare awareness, and community development</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> are also eligible. FSIA recognizes individuals who are making a positive impact on society through their efforts.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Artists, Influencers &amp; Creators</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Content creators, digital influencers, performers, writers, photographers, and artists can become a part of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards nomination process</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Their creativity, engagement, and influence make them important contributors in today&rsquo;s digital era.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;Inspiring Personalities &amp; Transformation Stories</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Individuals who have overcome challenges such as financial struggles, health issues, or personal setbacks and turned their lives into success stories are highly valued at FSIA. These inspiring journeys reflect strength, motivation, and resilience.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;Students and Emerging Talent</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Young achievers, students, and beginners showing excellence in academics, sports, creativity, or entrepreneurship can also apply. FSIA encourages </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>emerging talent recognition platform in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and helps them build early visibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>What Makes You Eligible for FSIA Awards?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards eligibility criteria</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is not based on fame or followers. Instead, it focuses on:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Your </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>journey and story</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Your </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>achievements and contribution</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Your </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>skills and dedication</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Your </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>impact on society or industry</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Your </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>growth and transformation</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">This makes FSIA a platform where even lesser-known individuals can gain national-level recognition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Why Join Forever Star India Awards?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Becoming a part of the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards India platform</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> offers multiple benefits:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">National recognition and visibility</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Digital presence and branding</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Professional credibility enhancement</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Opportunity to showcase your journey</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Inclusion in award nominee listings and features</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">It helps individuals strengthen their </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>personal branding and keyword reach online</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, making their achievements more discoverable in search engines.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">So, who can become a part of Forever Star India Awards?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Anyone with a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>talent, achievement, inspirational journey, or social contribution</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> can apply for FSIA recognition. The platform is built to honor real people and real success stories across India.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Awards 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> continues to provide a powerful stage where individuals are not judged by fame but by their </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>impact, dedication, and journey</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">In simple words </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>if your story inspires, you are eligible for FSIA recognition.</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-02 : 02:06:21');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(730, 25, 'Social Worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '29,30,31,86,94,140,141,177,186,195', 'assets/img/blog/1780570634.png', 'Social Worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', '', '', '', '', 'social-worker-delhi-tara-devi-sharma-awardee', 'Social Worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Social Worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Social worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi is nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 for her contribution to women empowerment, community welfare, disaster relief, humanitarian service, and social development in India.\r\n', 'child welfare advocate', 'Social Worker in delhi', 'ommunity service leader Delhi', 'civil defence volunteer Delhi', 'women empowerment', 'Social Worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 ', 'https://newsforever.in/social-worker-delhi-tara-devi-sharma-awardee', 'Social worker Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi is nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 for her contribution to women empowerment, community welfare, disaster relief, humanitarian service, and social development in India.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1780570793.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Tara Devi Sharma from Delhi has been nominated for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> in recognition of her longstanding contribution to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social work in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community welfare</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>humanitarian service in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Known as a dedicated </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social worker from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she has spent decades supporting underprivileged communities, promoting social awareness, and contributing to various community development initiatives.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition for Community Service and Social Welfare</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination highlights Tara Devi Sharma&#39;s role as a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community welfare leader in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her work in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social service</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>grassroots development</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>public welfare initiatives</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has positively impacted numerous individuals and families. Through her consistent efforts, she has become a recognized name in the field of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social development in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Contribution to Women Empowerment and Child Welfare</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A significant part of her social work focuses on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment programs</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>girl child education support</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community awareness initiatives</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her efforts toward promoting self-reliance, education, and social inclusion have established her as a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment advocate in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and a dedicated supporter of social progress.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Humanitarian Service and Disaster Relief Work</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Tara Devi Sharma has actively participated in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>disaster relief operations</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>emergency response programs</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>humanitarian aid initiatives</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her involvement in supporting affected families during crises, coordinating relief efforts, and assisting vulnerable communities reflects her commitment to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>humanitarian service in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community support programs</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Social Awareness and Community Development</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Throughout her journey, she has worked toward strengthening </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community development</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social harmony</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>public awareness campaigns</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her contribution to social responsibility initiatives and welfare programs has made her a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social activist from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> dedicated to creating positive change at the grassroots level.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>COVID-19 Relief and Public Support Initiatives</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">During the COVID-19 pandemic, Tara Devi Sharma actively supported </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>COVID relief efforts</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, helping families access essential services, healthcare support, and food assistance. Her contribution during challenging times reinforced her reputation as a compassionate </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community service leader in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Civil Defence and Community Leadership</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With decades of involvement in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Civil Defence services</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, disaster management, and community safety programs, she has contributed significantly to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>public welfare and community protection initiatives</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her experience in emergency response and social security awareness has further strengthened her role as a trusted social leader.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Through Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> recognizes Tara Devi Sharma&#39;s dedication to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social work</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>humanitarian activities</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>community welfare</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>grassroots social development in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her inspiring journey continues to motivate individuals committed to serving society and creating meaningful social impact.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-04 : 02:06:10'),
(731, 25, 'Influencer and Model  Neha Lucky khara from Mumbai Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '29,30,31,86,94,119,141,179,180,181,194', 'assets/img/blog/1780658031.png', 'Influencer and Model  Neha Lucky khara from Mumbai Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', '', '', '', '', 'influencer-model-neha-lucky-khara-mumbai ', 'Influencer and Model  Neha Lucky khara from Mumbai Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 ', 'neha lucky khara, influencer in mumbai, model in mumbai, fashion model mumbai, social media influencer mumbai, women influencer india, fashion influencer india, beauty pageant contestant india, women empowerment advocate india, digital creator mumbai, lif', 'Influencer and model from Mumbai nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her contribution to fashion, social media influencing, digital content creation, and women empowerment in India.\r\n', 'influencer in mumbai', 'model from mumbai', 'influencer and model from mumbai', 'digital creator  from mumbai', 'social media influencer in  mumbai', 'Influencer and Model  Neha Lucky khara from Mumbai Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 ', 'https://newsforever.in/influencer-model-neha-lucky-khara-mumbai ', 'Influencer and model from Mumbai nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her contribution to fashion, social media influencing, digital content creation, and women empowerment in Mumbai.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1780658045.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A prominent </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Influencer and Model from Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has been nominated for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India for her inspiring journey in the fashion and digital industry. Known as a rising </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>fashion model in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social media influencer in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she has gained recognition for her confidence, determination, and ability to inspire women through her personal and professional growth.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition in the Fashion and Influencer Industry</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination highlights her growing presence as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Mumbai fashion influencer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, <strong>women influencer in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;, and emerging personality in the <strong>Indian modeling industry</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Through her participation in fashion events, public appearances, and digital platforms, she has built a strong identity among aspiring models and content creators.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Journey as a Fashion Model in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a recognized </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>model from Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, her journey reflects perseverance, self-belief, and dedication. She continues to inspire aspiring talents who dream of building a career in the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>fashion industry in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and the growing world of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social media influencing in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her story demonstrates how determination and consistency can help transform ambitions into achievements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Growing Identity as a Social Media Influencer</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her presence as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social media influencer in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has enabled her to connect with audiences through positive content, lifestyle inspiration, and motivational messaging. As a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>digital creator from Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she represents the new generation of women who are using online platforms to create impact and build meaningful communities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Empowerment and Positive Influence</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from her work in fashion and influencing, she is admired as a supporter of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her journey encourages women to pursue their goals, build confidence, and embrace opportunities for personal and professional growth. Her story resonates with many aspiring </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women influencers in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;who seek to create a strong identity through talent and hard work.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Through Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India recognizes her contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>fashion model in Mumbai</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>social media influencer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>digital creator</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and inspiring woman personality. Her journey continues to motivate aspiring models, influencers, and women entrepreneurs across India who are working toward achieving their dreams while creating a positive impact in society.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-05 : 01:06:30'),
(732, 25, 'Once Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up Now a Doctor: Success Journey of Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi', 21, 8, 1, '18,21,26,161,189,230,235', 'assets/img/blog/1781181934.png', '', '', '', '', '', 'miss-maharashtra-runner-up-to-doctor-shivani-suryawanshi', 'Miss Maharashtra 2025 to Doctor | Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi Journey ', 'miss maharashtra 2025 runner up, shivani rambhau suryawanshi, pageant winner becomes doctor, miss latur 2025, forever star india pageant, inspiring success story, doctor from pageant, beauty pageant india, mbbs doctor india, women empowerment story, india', 'Inspiring journey of Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi, Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up, who balanced pageantry and medicine to become a doctor. A story of determination and success. \r\n', 'Pageant Winner Becomes Doctor', 'Inspiring Journey of Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi', 'From Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up to Doctor', 'Inspiring Journey of Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi', 'Becoming a Doctor After Pageant Success', 'Miss Maharashtra 2025 to Doctor | Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi Journey ', 'https://newsforever.in/ miss-maharashtra-runner-up-to-doctor-shivani-suryawanshi', 'Inspiring journey of Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi, Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up, who balanced pageantry and medicine to become a doctor. A story of determination and success. \r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1781181858.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">When Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi was crowned Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up, she captured attention with her confidence, grace, and inspiring personality. However, for Shivani, the title was never the final destination; it was one milestone in a much larger journey. Today, she proudly adds another remarkable achievement to her name: Doctor.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Hailing from Latur, Maharashtra, Shivani&#39;s story is a powerful example of how determination, hard work, and self-belief can turn multiple dreams into reality.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>How did the motivation provided by Forever Miss India help in becoming a doctor?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Behind every crown lies a story of dedication, and Shivani&#39;s journey is no exception. While making her mark in the pageant world, she was simultaneously pursuing one of the most challenging professional paths: medicine.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Balancing academic responsibilities with personal growth and public appearances required discipline, resilience, and an unwavering commitment to her goals. Despite the challenges, she remained focused on her vision and continued moving forward with determination.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Stepped into the Beauty Pageant Industry with Forever Miss India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shivani&#39;s pageant journey began with her victory as Miss Latur 2025 under Forever Star India. Her authenticity, confidence, intelligence, and strong sense of purpose helped her stand out among contestants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her impressive performance at the state level earned her the prestigious title of Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up, making her one of the most admired participants of the competition. Through her journey, she demonstrated that pageants are not just about beauty, they are platforms that empower women to build confidence, leadership, and self-belief.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>How was Shivani Rambhau&#39;s dream of becoming a doctor fulfilled?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">While her pageant success brought her recognition, Shivani never lost sight of her ultimate goal. After years of dedication, rigorous training, and academic commitment, she successfully completed her medical education and became a doctor.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">This achievement marks the fulfillment of a dream she worked tirelessly toward for years. Her journey from the pageant stage to the medical profession showcases the power of perseverance and the importance of staying committed to one&#39;s aspirations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>How did Shivani Rambhau become a guiding light for the women of India?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shivani&#39;s story resonates with countless young women who aspire to pursue multiple dreams. She proves that success is not about choosing one path over another but about having the courage and determination to pursue every goal with passion.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her journey encourages aspiring pageant contestants, students, and young professionals to believe in themselves and continue striving for excellence, regardless of the challenges they face.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>The story of Shivani&#39;s dreams and her determination regarding the &#39;Crown&#39;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Today, Dr. Shivani Rambhau Suryawanshi stands as an inspiring symbol of ambition, dedication, and achievement. From earning the title of Miss Maharashtra 2025 Runner Up to achieving her dream of becoming a doctor, she has shown that confidence gained through one journey can help create success in another.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her story is a reminder that a crown can be a milestone, but true success lies in continuing to grow, achieve, and make a meaningful impact on the world.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-11 : 03:06:45'),
(733, 25, 'Fashion Designer  ispita nayak from Balasore Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '30,31,86,102,119,141,177,181,184', 'assets/img/blog/1781251585.png', 'Fashion Designer  ispita nayak from Balasore Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', '', '', '', '', 'fashion-designer-ipsita-nayak-balasore-awardee', 'Fashion Designer  ispita nayak from Balasore Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Fashion Designer  ispita nayak from Balasore Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'Fashion Designer from Balasore nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her contribution to fashion design, creative entrepreneurship, cultural representation, and artistic excellence.\r\n', 'Fashion Designer Ipsita Nayak', 'Fashion Designer from Balasore', 'Women Entrepreneur Award 2026', 'ipsita Nayak Balasore', 'Forever Star India Awards', 'Fashion Designer  ispita nayak from Balasore Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/fashion-designer-ipsita-nayak-balasore-awardee', 'Fashion Designer from Balasore nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 by Forever Star India for her contribution to fashion design, creative entrepreneurship, cultural representation, and artistic excellence.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1781251753.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A talented </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Fashion Designer from Balasore</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has been nominated for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India for her contribution to fashion, creativity, and cultural representation. Known for her work as a <strong>fashion designer from Balasore</strong>, she has gained recognition for blending traditional artistry with contemporary fashion while representing Indian creativity on national and international platforms.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition by Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination recognizes her growing influence as a <strong>women fashion entrepreneur from Balasore</strong> and a creative professional dedicated to promoting fashion, culture, and artistic excellence. Her journey reflects passion, innovation, and commitment to preserving cultural heritage through design.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Rising Identity in the Fashion Industry</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Widely recognized as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>fashion designer from Balasore</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she has built a strong presence in the fashion world through creativity, craftsmanship, and unique design concepts. Her work reflects a combination of traditional Indian aesthetics and modern fashion trends, helping establish her identity among emerging </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Indian fashion designers</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>International Fashion Exposure</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her participation in globally recognized fashion platforms has strengthened her position as an emerging <strong>international fashion designer from Balasore. Ex</strong>posure to international fashion events has allowed her to showcase creative talent while highlighting Indian craftsmanship and cultural elegance before a wider audience.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Art, Culture and Creative Expression</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Beyond fashion, she is also known for her association with Indian classical arts. Her background in cultural and artistic expression contributes significantly to her creative vision, making her a respected personality in both the <strong>fashion and culture industry in Balasore</strong>. This unique blend of fashion and art continues to define her professional identity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Women Entrepreneurship and Creative Leadership</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a growing </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women fashion entrepreneur</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she represents the new generation of creative women who are building successful careers through talent, innovation, and dedication. Her journey inspires aspiring designers, artists, and entrepreneurs who wish to create a meaningful impact through creativity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Through Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India recognizes her contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>fashion designer from Balasore</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, <strong>fashion designer from Balasore</strong>, and creative entrepreneur. Her journey continues to inspire young designers and women professionals across India who aspire to transform creativity into achievement.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-11 : 11:06:24');
INSERT INTO `ci_blog` (`id`, `user_created_by`, `title`, `cat_id`, `sub_cat_id`, `type`, `tag_id`, `image`, `alt_tag`, `video_type`, `video_name`, `youtube_video_link`, `amazon_webserver_video_link`, `url`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `h2_tag`, `h3_tag`, `h4_tag`, `h5_tag`, `h6_tag`, `og_title`, `og_url`, `og_description`, `og_image`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(734, 25, 'India\'s Fastest Growing Pageant Platform | Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants', 21, 20, 1, '8,18,21,22,124,127,131,150,161,172,198,235', 'assets/img/blog/1781265541.png', ' India\'s Fastest Growing Pageant Platform | Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants', '', '', '', '', 'indias-fastest-growing-pageant-platform', ' India\'s Fastest Growing Pageant Platform | Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants', ' India\'s Fastest Growing Pageant Platform | Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants', 'Forever Star India Pageants is India\'s fastest growing pageant platform for Miss India beauty contest aspirants. Get professional grooming, personality development, national exposure, and opportunities beyond the crown.\r\n', 'miss india beauty contest', 'beauty pageant in india', 'modeling opportunities in  india', 'ramp walk training', 'personality development for women', ' India\'s Fastest Growing Pageant Platform | Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants', 'https://newsforever.in/indias-fastest-growing-pageant-platform', 'Forever Star India Pageants is India\'s fastest growing pageant platform for Miss India beauty contest aspirants. Get professional grooming, personality development, national exposure, and opportunities beyond the crown.\r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1781265549.png', '<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A New Era of Beauty Pageants in India</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Indian pageant industry is evolving rapidly, and today&#39;s contestants are looking for more than just a crown. They seek opportunities for personal growth, confidence building, skill development, and national recognition. </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, recognized as one of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>India&#39;s fastest growing pageant platforms</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, provides aspiring </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Miss India beauty contest aspirants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> with the perfect stage to showcase their talent, personality, and ambition.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Empowering Women Beyond Beauty</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> believes that true beauty lies in confidence, determination, and individuality. The platform welcomes participants from all walks of life, including students, professionals, entrepreneurs, artists, and homemakers. By focusing on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, self-development, and leadership, it helps </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Miss India beauty contest aspirants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> discover their strengths and unlock their full potential.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Unlike traditional beauty competitions, the platform encourages women to share their stories, achievements, and aspirations while building the confidence needed to succeed both on and off the stage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Professional Grooming for Miss India Aspirants</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">One of the biggest reasons behind the platform&#39;s growing popularity is its emphasis on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>professional pageant grooming</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and training. Participants receive guidance in essential areas that contribute to pageant success and personal growth.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">These include:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ramp walk training</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Personality development</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Public speaking skills</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Interview preparation</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Stage confidence building</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Fashion and styling guidance</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Personal branding</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Communication skills</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">This structured approach helps </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Miss India aspirants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> develop the confidence and skills required to excel in a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>national beauty pageant</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and various professional fields.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Opportunities Beyond the Crown</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is more than a beauty contest. It is a platform that opens doors to new opportunities and experiences. Contestants gain valuable exposure through media coverage, social media visibility, networking opportunities, and talent showcases.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Many participants use the platform as a stepping stone toward careers in modeling, acting, content creation, entrepreneurship, public speaking, and brand collaborations. The focus is not only on winning titles but also on creating long-term growth opportunities for every contestant participating in a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>beauty pageant in India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>A Platform for Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Forever Star India Pageants is a leading platform for <strong>Miss India beauty contest aspirants</strong>, offering <strong>professional pageant grooming</strong>, <strong>personality development</strong>, and <strong>national exposure</strong>. As one of <strong>India&#39;s fastest growing pageant platforms</strong>, it helps aspiring contestants build confidence, enhance their skills, and prepare for success in a <strong>national beauty pageant</strong> while supporting their journey toward achieving their pageant dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Building Future Leaders</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Modern pageants play an important role in developing leadership and communication skills. Through mentorship, competitions, and grooming sessions, contestants learn valuable qualities such as leadership, teamwork, decision-making, professional etiquette, and self-confidence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">These skills help participants become stronger individuals and prepare them for success in various aspects of life and career. This commitment to development is one reason why </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> continues to be regarded as one of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>India&#39;s fastest growing pageant platforms</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Why Miss India Beauty Contest Aspirants Choose Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">With its focus on </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women empowerment</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>pageant grooming</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>personality development</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>national recognition</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has become a preferred destination for </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Miss India beauty contest aspirants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">For contestants seeking a meaningful pageant experience that goes beyond beauty and focuses on growth, confidence, and achievement, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India Pageants</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> offers the perfect opportunity to shine, grow, and succeed on a national stage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-12 : 02:06:48'),
(735, 25, 'Veterinary Doctor Dr. Anjali Verma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 23, 107, 1, '29,30,31,179,183,184,194,195,208', 'assets/img/blog/1781344741.png', 'Veterinary Doctor Dr. Anjali Verma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', '', '', '', '', 'best-veterinary-doctor-award-goes-to-anjali-verma', 'Veterinary Doctor Dr. Anjali Verma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'healthcare doctor delhi, veterinary researcher delhi, veterinary neurosurgery expert delhi, veterinary phd scholar delhi, women veterinary doctor india, veterinary surgery specialist delhi, animal welfare specialist delhi, veterinary radiology expert delh', ' Veterinary doctor Dr. Anjali Verma from Delhi nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 for her contribution to animal healthcare, veterinary research, veterinary surgery, and animal welfare. \r\n', 'veterinary doctor in delhi', 'veterinary surgery specialist delhi', 'pet healthcare doctor delhi', 'veterinary specialist delhi', 'animal hospital doctor delhi', 'Veterinary Doctor Dr. Anjali Verma from Delhi Nominated for Super Woman Award 2026', 'https://newsforever.in/best-veterinary-doctor-award-goes-to-anjali-verma', 'Veterinary doctor Dr. Anjali Verma from Delhi nominated for Super Woman Award 2026 for her contribution to animal healthcare, veterinary research, veterinary surgery, and animal welfare. \r\n', 'assets/img/blog/1781344762.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Anjali Verma, a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary doctor in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and emerging </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary researcher from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, has been nominated for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India. The nomination recognizes her contribution to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>animal healthcare</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, veterinary research, and her growing impact in the field of advanced veterinary medicine. Known as a dedicated </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary surgeon in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she continues to contribute to both clinical excellence and veterinary science research.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition for Contribution to Animal Healthcare</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination highlights Dr. Anjali Verma&#39;s dedication as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary surgeon in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and her commitment to advancing </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>animal healthcare services</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> through research, education, and professional development. Her work reflects the increasing importance of specialized veterinary care and innovation in modern veterinary medicine.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Academic Journey in Veterinary Science</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Anjali Verma has built a strong academic foundation in veterinary medicine and research. Her ongoing work as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>PhD scholar in veterinary science</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> has positioned her among promising professionals contributing to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary neurosurgery research</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and advanced veterinary studies. Her academic achievements reflect dedication to continuous learning and scientific advancement within the veterinary field.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Growing Presence in Veterinary Research and Clinical Practice</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Known as a dedicated </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>animal healthcare doctor in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Dr. Anjali Verma has developed expertise in veterinary surgery, diagnostic imaging, and clinical research. Her work as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary surgery specialist in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and researcher highlights the important role veterinarians play in supporting animal welfare, healthcare innovation, and scientific progress.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Advocate for Animal Welfare and Veterinary Advancement</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from her academic and professional contributions, Dr. Anjali Verma is recognized for promoting </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>animal welfare awareness</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, ethical veterinary practices, and research-based healthcare approaches. Her efforts support the broader goal of strengthening veterinary healthcare systems and encouraging responsible animal care.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring the Next Generation of Veterinary Professionals</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a young </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>women veterinary doctor in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Dr. Anjali Verma&#39;s journey serves as an inspiration for aspiring veterinary students, researchers, and healthcare professionals. Her commitment to veterinary education, scientific research, and animal healthcare reflects the growing contribution of women in veterinary science and medical research.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:13pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Through Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India acknowledges Dr. Anjali Verma&#39;s growing contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary doctor in Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>veterinary researcher from Delhi</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>animal healthcare doctor</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and advocate for animal welfare. Her journey reflects dedication, knowledge, and a commitment to advancing veterinary science while making a meaningful impact in the field of animal healthcare and veterinary research.</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-13 : 01:06:41'),
(736, 25, 'Montessori Teacher and Abacus Trainer from Pune Nominated for Award', 23, 107, 1, '29,30,31,84,94,102,119,138,177,179,182,185,208', 'assets/img/blog/1781611451.png', 'Montessori Teacher and Abacus Trainer from Pune Nominated for Award ', '', '', '', '', 'montessori-teacher-shobha-kittur-receives-award', 'Montessori Teacher and Abacus Trainer from Pune Nominated for Award ', 'Montessori Teacher and Abacus Trainer from Pune Nominated for Award ', 'Montessori teacher and abacus trainer from Pune, Shobha Kittur, has been nominated for the Super Woman Award 2026. Recognized for her contribution to preschool education, child development, student learning, and educational excellence. \r\n', 'montessori teacher in pune', 'abacus trainer in pune', 'brain development trainer pune', 'Preschool Education Specialist', 'Montessori Education Expert Shobha Kittur', 'Montessori Teacher and Abacus Trainer from Pune Nominated for Award ', 'https://newsforever.in/montessori-teacher-shobha-kittur-receives-award', 'Montessori teacher and abacus trainer from Pune, Shobha Kittur, has been nominated for the Super Woman Award 2026. Recognized for her contribution to preschool education, child development, student learning, and educational excellence. ', 'assets/img/blog/1781611473.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shobha Kittur, a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Montessori teacher in Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>abacus trainer in Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and dedicated </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>child development expert</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, has been nominated for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India. The nomination recognizes her contribution to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>preschool education</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Montessori learning</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>student development</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and educational excellence. Through her commitment to nurturing young learners, she has established herself as a recognized </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>educationist from Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> known for her innovative teaching approach and dedication to quality education.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition for Contribution to Preschool Education</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination highlights Shobha Kittur&#39;s growing impact in the field of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Montessori education in Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>preschool learning</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her teaching approach focuses on helping children build confidence, creativity, communication skills, and independent thinking abilities. Through structured learning methods and activity-based education, she continues to contribute to strong academic foundations for young learners.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Promoting Montessori Learning and Child Development</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As a trained </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Montessori teacher</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Shobha Kittur believes in child-centered learning that encourages curiosity, creativity, and self-confidence. Her contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>child development mentor</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> supports cognitive growth, social development, and classroom readiness. Her teaching methods are designed to create positive learning experiences that help children develop essential life skills.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Expertise in Abacus Training and Brain Development</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Apart from Montessori education, she is also recognized as an experienced </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>abacus teacher in Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>mental math trainer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">. Her involvement in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>brain development programs</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, skill enhancement activities, and learning workshops helps students improve concentration, memory, analytical thinking, and problem-solving skills. These programs play an important role in strengthening academic performance and confidence among learners.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Supporting Holistic Education and Student Growth</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shobha Kittur believes that education should focus on overall personality development alongside academics. As a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>certified yoga teacher</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, she promotes a balanced approach to learning that integrates discipline, wellness, creativity, and emotional growth. Her educational philosophy supports holistic student development and lifelong learning.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Inspiring Women Through Education</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Her journey from a professional background to becoming a respected </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>teacher in Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> reflects dedication, adaptability, and a passion for education. As an educator, mentor, and mother, she inspires women to pursue meaningful careers while contributing positively to society through teaching, learning, and community development.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Through Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The nomination for the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Super Woman Award 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by Forever Star India acknowledges Shobha Kittur&#39;s contribution as a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Montessori teacher in Pune</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>abacus trainer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>child development expert</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, and advocate for quality education. Her journey continues to inspire educators, parents, and aspiring teachers who believe in the power of learning, skill development, and student success.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 0, '2026-06-16 : 03:06:49');
