(737, 25, 'May Awardee List - 26 Achievers Selected for the Prestigious Star India Platform', 23, 0, 1, '29,30,30,31,31,84,86,94,94,102,138,140,142', 'assets/img/blog/1782123491.png', 'May Awardee List 2026: 26 Achievers Selected for Prestigious Recognition', '', '', '', '', 'prestigious-may-awardee-list-2026', 'May Awardee List - 26 Achievers Selected for the Prestigious Star India Platform', 'may awardee list 2026, may awardees 2026, star india may awardees, forever star india, 26 achievers, india\'s outstanding achievers, awardees list 2026, professional excellence, leadership recognition, national recognition india, excellence awards 2026, in', 'Explore the May Awardee List 2026 featuring 26 outstanding achievers recognized for excellence, leadership, innovation, and professional success.', 'leadership recognition', 'prestigious recognition awards', 'recognition platform india', 'top professionals in india', 'national achievers awards', 'May Awardee List 2026: 26 Achievers Selected for Prestigious Recognition', 'https://newsforever.in/prestigious-may-awardee-list-2026', 'Explore the May Awardee List 2026 featuring 26 outstanding achievers recognized for excellence, leadership, innovation, and professional success.', 'assets/img/blog/1782123512.png', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Recognition serves as a powerful reminder that dedication, perseverance, and excellence never go unnoticed. Across India, talented individuals from diverse professional backgrounds continue to create meaningful impact through their work, leadership, and commitment to growth. From entrepreneurship and education to healthcare, arts, fashion, public service, and research, these achievers are contributing significantly to society while inspiring countless others to pursue their dreams.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"colo