the courage to make a difference within their respective fields.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As one of India&#39;s leading </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Recognition Platforms</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> continues its mission of celebrating </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Achievers, Entrepreneurs, Professionals, Artists, Educators, Healthcare Experts, and Change-Makers</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> who are creating a positive impact through their work. These recognitions not only honor individual accomplishments but also encourage others to pursue excellence and contribute meaningfully to society.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:17pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>May Awardees 2026 - Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Manisha Dahiya &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Baker</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Rohtak</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shreya Gattani &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Art &amp; Culture Artist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Siliguri</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Pradhiksha S &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Educationist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Ooty</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Adv. Dr. Deepa Joseph &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Supreme Court Advocate</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Delhi</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Mini M &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Senior Administration and Operations Professional</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Thrissur</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ipsita Nayak &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Fashion Designer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Balasore</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Anjali Verma &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Veterinary Doctor</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Delhi</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Rekha &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Ayurvedic Specialist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Port Blair</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Neha Lucky Khara &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Influencer and Model</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Mumbai</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shobha Kittur &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Montessori Teacher</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Pune</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Vinay Sharma Kanungo &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astrologer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Indore</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Sayanti Banerjee &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Diabetologist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Asansol</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Shivani Modi &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Architect</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-s