necologist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Darbhanga</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Asha Nanda Baapni &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Cake Artist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Chennai</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ankita Singh &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Researcher</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Lucknow</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. S. Prabha Wati &ndash; Badminton and Archery Player, Port Blair&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Meenu Sharma &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Poet</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, New Delhi</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Dr. Naveen Chaturvedi &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Astrologer</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Bulandshahr</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Neetu Verma &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Head Constable [Delhi Police]</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Delhi</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Zeenath Salman &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Entrepreneur</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, SHABZ CLOSET, Bengaluru</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Rajni Singh &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Model</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Lucknow</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Bhavika Tailor &ndash; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Tarot Card Reader</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Vapi</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">These distinguished </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Awardees of May 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> exemplify how passion, hard work, and perseverance can transform aspirations into achievements. Their success stories highlight the incredible talent present across India and reinforce the belief that excellence can be achieved in every profession.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> congratulates all </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Awardees of May 2026</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> for their remarkable accomplishments and applauds their dedication to creating positive change. Their journeys serve as an inspiration for aspiring professionals, entrepreneurs, artists, educators, healthcare experts, and future leaders across the nation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">As they continue to achieve new milestones and make meaningful contributions within their fields, these awardees stand as shining examples of Professional Excellence, Leadership, Innovation, and National Recognition. Forever Star India is proud to recognize their achievements and celebrate their success on a national platform. Their accomplishments serve as an inspiration for aspiring achievers, and women looking to showcase their success stories can participate through the ongoing <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/super-woman-award.php\">Super Woman Awards registrations.</a></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-06-22 : 01:06:55'),
(738, 25, 'Forensic Science Postgraduate Crowned Forever Miss Deoghar 2025; Nidhi Netra Says, \"Confidence Comes from Believing in Yourself Every Single Day\"', 21, 6, 2, '15,18,20,22,23,27,197', 'assets/img/blog/1785934044.png', 'Miss Deoghar 2025 Winner Nidhi Netra', '', '', '', '', 'nidhi-netra-wins-forever-miss-deoghar-2025', 'Miss Deoghar 2025 Winner Nidhi Netra', 'nidhi netra, miss deoghar 2025, miss india city winner, miss deoghar 2025 winner, who won miss deoghar 2025, pageant winner from deoghar', 'Nidhi Netra, being crowned Forever Miss Deoghar 2025 under the Forever Miss India platform by Forever Star India. If you have the confidenceto represent your city, this is your opportunity to shine on a national platform.', 'Miss Deoghar 2025', 'Nidhi Netra Crowned Forever Miss Deoghar 2025', 'Nidhi Netra won Miss Deoghar 2025', 'Forever Miss Deoghar 2025 Winner Nidhi Netra', '', 'Nidhi Netra Crowned Forever Miss Deoghar 2025', 'https://newsforever.in/nidhi-netra-wins-forever-miss-deoghar-2025', 'Nidhi Netra, being crowned Forever Miss Deoghar 2025 under the Forever Miss India platform by Forever Star India. If you have the confidenceto represent your city, this is your opportunity to shine on a national platform.', 'assets/img/blog/1785934818.png', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Winning a beauty pageant is often seen as the final destination, but for </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Nidhi Netra</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, being crowned </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Miss Deoghar 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is just the beginning of a much bigger journey. A postgraduate in Forensic Science from Chandigarh University and currently working as an IT Project Coordinator in Noida, Nidhi has proved that education, professional success, and creativity can go hand in hand.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">After winning the prestigious </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Miss Deoghar 2025</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> title under the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Miss India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> platform by </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Forever Star India</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Nidhi spoke to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>NewsForever</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> about her journey, balancing a corporate career with her dreams, and the message she wants to share with young women across the country.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&quot;Winning the Crown is a Responsibility, Not Just an Achievement&quot;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Speaking to </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>NewsForever</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Nidhi said that the crown represents much more than a personal milestone.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:40px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&quot;Winning Forever Miss Deoghar 2025 is a dream come true for me. This title is not just an achievement but also a responsibility. I want to inspire young women to believe that education, career, and personal dreams can grow together. Success doesn&#39;t come from choosing one path over another it comes from giving your best to every opportunity that life offers.&quot;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>From Forensic Science to the Fashion Stage</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Q. Your academic background is in Forensic Science, while your profession is in IT. How did the pageant world become part of your journey?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Nidhi:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> My journey has always been about learning and challenging myself. Studying Forensic Science taught me discipline, analytical thinking, and attention to detail. Later, working as an IT Project Coordinator strengthened my leadership, communication, and management skills. Alongside my professional life, I always loved creative activities like classical dance and art. Participating in Forever Miss India gave me the opportunity to bring together every part of my personality on one platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>&quot;Growth Happens Outside Your Comfort Zone&quot;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Q. What motivated you to participate in Forever Miss India?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Nidhi:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> I wanted to step outside my comfort zone and discover my true potential. Forever Star India gave me a platform where personality, confidence, communication, and purpose are valued as much as appearance. Every stage of the competition taught me something new about myself. It wasn&#39;t only about winning a title it was about becoming a more confident and stronger individual.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Balancing Career and Passion</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Q. Managing a corporate career while preparing for a pageant must have been challenging. How did you do it?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Nidhi:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> It certainly required discipline and proper time management. My work responsibilities remained my priority, so I planned my schedule carefully to make time for fitness, grooming, and personal preparation. I also continued pursuing activities like classical dance, squash, and mandala art because they helped me stay creative and mentally balanced throughout the journey.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>A Message for Every Young Woman</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Q. What message would you like to share with girls who dream of participating in beauty pageants?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Nidhi:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Never underestimate yourself because of your background or profession. Whether you&#39;re a student, a working professional, or someone just beginning your journey, your dreams are valid. Believe in yourself, work consistently, and never stop learning. Confidence is built through preparation, perseverance, and self-belief. Every woman has the potential to create her own identity if she is willing to take the first step.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>What&#39;s Next for Nidhi Netra?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Following her victory as </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/miss-deoghar-2025-winner-nidhi-netra\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><strong><u>Miss Deoghar 2025</u></strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">, Nidhi aims to continue growing both professionally and personally while representing Deoghar on larger platforms. She hopes to inspire more young women to pursue higher education, build successful careers, and confidently follow their passions without compromising their individuality.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Lora,serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Want to Begin Your Own Journey?</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Inspired by Nidhi Netra&#39;s story? </span><strong>Forever Miss India</strong><span style=\"color:#000000\"> by </span><strong>Forever Star India</strong><span style=\"color:#000000\"> is inviting aspiring women from across India to participate in its upcoming editions. If you have the confidence, talent, and determination to represent your city, this is your opportunity to shine on a national platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Apply Now: <a href=\"https://www.fsia.in/forever-miss-india-new.php\">Miss India 2026 Registration Form</a></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 1, '2026-08-05 : 03:08:33');
